window.FWN_HERO_SUMMONING_PEACE_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_HERO_SUMMONING_PEACE_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":1301,"title":"Chapter 1301 - Founding Festival 3","paragraphs":["On the day of the Founding Festival, we moved through the bustling city to the location of our stall. Thanks to my magic box, it’s very easy to set up a stall without having to make preparations early in the morning when there are few people around or the day before.","Installation was quick and easy, as all we had to do was take it out of my magic box. The time was just before 9:00 am...... All preparations were ready, but since it had been decided in the prior meeting that the stall would open at 9:00 am, we decided to wait until that time.","As expected, as the place we’re setting up our stall is off the main street, people are sparse and there aren’t many stalls. There was a certain amount of space between the stalls, which made it easy for amateurs to set up their own stalls.","Looking at the surrounding stalls, I can see that there is a wide variety. Personally, I’m interested in those takoyaki stalls.","[Kaito, we still have time, right?]","[Eh? Yeah, about 20 minutes or so.]","[Well then, I’m going to have a little inspection in this hostile environment! Shalltear-sama also said it after all, that information is important!]","Leaving these words, Tre-san went to inspect the competition with her wallet in her hand...... No, she was completely intent on buying and eating. What an enviable dynamism she had.","There was indeed still time for us, and gathering information certainly is the right choice, but I think it’s incredible that she could take immediate action without worrying about the delicate 20-minute time window.","She should be back before the appointed time. With that in mind, I looked over to see Tre-san at the takoyaki stall I had spotted earlier.","[Houu, the scent of this sauce is quite great...... However, I wonder if it will be able to make me, who has eaten lots of takoyaki, hum in delight?]","[Hahaha, now you’ve said it. Prepare yourself or it’ll surprise you.]","[Unnn, unnn, I’m looking forward to it then...... Ahh, by the way, don’t you think I’m quite the beauty?]","[Unnn? Ahhh, well, I suppose you’re quite beautiful?]","[Right!? And I’ve thought of this just now. I think that many cool and skillful artisans are generous...... and have a big heart. I think that’s a good thing...... By the waaaaay, it was usually 5R for 6 pieces, riiiiight? How about nooooow?]","[Kuh, hahaha! So that’s how it is huh, you’ve got me! Well then, 2 extra takoyakis for the beautiful lady!]","[Yay~~!]","Has she ascended to a communi-oni? In an instant, they were having a pleasant conversation, she even got a freebie. Tre-san happily accepted the takoyaki, and this time went to another stall...... where they were baking something that looked like baked cabbages.","[Whoa~~ Those look delicious.]","[......What’s up, missy? You gonna negotiate with me like you did at that store over there?]","The elderly owner of the store called out to Tre, who was waiting happily, swaying her body from side to side, for the completion of the product. Thereupon, Tre-san smiled at his words and spoke......","[Hmmm, unlike the guy at that stall, it seems like Owner-san is a rather austere artisan. I heard otherworlders call such mannerisms chic...... However, I won’t talk too much about those things to such a cool and austere person, as I have expectations of your sneaky disposition.]","[Haahh, you’re really skilled at this...... Fine, here, I’ll give you some extras.]","[Yay! Thanks!]","As Tre-san accepted the gift with great joy, I noticed the slightly concerned look on the faces of the owners of surrounding stalls. How should I say this...... It feels like they wanted her to come to their place or something like that.","I could understand how they felt. Tre-san, who was given extra freebies, had a really happy smile on her face, and you could tell straight away that she was overjoyed...... Seeing her like that makes you want to give her some extra freebies. Her communipower really is great......","In an instant, Tre-san, who became like an idol of the surrounding stalls, came back with her hands full of food.","[I’m back~~ Let’s eat this together. I don’t think we’ll have customers all the time, so let’s eat these in between.]","[That sounds good. We can take turns taking short breaks. We have a large space in the back of our stall, so I’ll put some chairs out there.]","Just as Tre-san said, there certainly won’t be an endless stream of customers. Let’s take it easy and enjoy the food while taking a break in the back.","Incidentally, as for the division of roles, Cento-san and Cien-san, who are great at cooking, will make the baby castellas, while Tre-san and I will sell them...... Well, we plan to take turns in this aspect along the way.","While I’m thinking about this, the time to open our stall finally arrived. A stuffed costume, which I don’t think would draw customers at all, stands in front of our stall holding a sign, and we are finally ready to open our stall.","[Kaito-kun, everyone’s here~~!]","[......Yeah.]","And the moment our stall opened, the baby castella demon descended. Her arrival was too early. This guy is definitely somewhere nearby earlier, waiting for the opening......","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Tre’s communipower is really high. Also, it seems like the first customer is the baby castella demon...... I don’t know how I should feel upon thinking about her eating that baby castella though. Should I look forward to it, or perhaps be scared......]"]},{"number":1302,"title":"Chapter 1302 - Founding Festival 4","paragraphs":["The first one to arrive after we opened our stall was Kuro. At any rate, thanks to the soundproofing magic tool recommended by Elise-san and the Recognition Inhibition Magic that Kuro uses, she doesn’t seem to have been noticed by everyone around us.","[Tre, Cento and Cien too, good work. Do your best today.]","[Yeeees.]","[ [ Yes. ] ]","After greeting her three family members, Kuro looked at me and gave me a cute smile. The fact that she was really looking forward to this was evident even without using my Sympathy Magic.","[I’m looking forward to the baby castella Kaito-kun and the others made, so I hurried over here.]","[No, you’re really early...... You’re definitely nearby earlier, aren’t you.]","[Ahaha, that’s a secret.]","[Well, anyway, Kuro is our first customer, but we have regular baby castellas and chocolate-filled baby castellas......]","[Unnn. I’ll have “100 bags” of both.]","......The heck is this guy talking about now? Did she just say 100? That’s a total of 200 bags, how much time would it take to bake all of them.","It would take too much time to bake them all, and I don’t think it would be good if we’re unable to serve other customers in the meantime...... but just as I was thinking that, Kuro spoke with a bright smile.","[Ahh, it’s alright. I’m not in a hurry, so for now, I’ll just buy one bag of each. I’ll come back around closing time later and you can give them then.]","[Ahh, that is, well...... I guess we could start baking them while we’re open.]","I thought she had suddenly made an unreasonable request, but if she wanted to have it before closing time, I think we could just bake them in moderation and toss those we’ve cooked in my magic box.","I had already baked some baby castellas and put them in my magic box, so I guess it really would be alright.","For the time being, we decided to make the bag of baby castellas that we’re going to give to Kuro right now, and since it’s for Kuro, Tre-san and I decided to bake it together.","Tre-san baked the plain ones while I baked the chocolate-filled ones, while Cento-san and Cien-san packaged them in a bag and handed them to Kuro.","[Thanks~~ Hmmm, it has a good scent. They seemed delicious. Well then, let’s immediately try it out————!?]","Kuro has a happy smile on her face as he brought one of the baby castellas in her mouth, but at that moment, her smile faded and her eyes became as sharp as a bird of prey.","[......It’s different. Of all the baby castellas I’ve eaten...... The ingredients used here are different. As far as I can tell, every combination of every ingredient can’t produce a baby castella of this flavor...... Is this made from new ingredients created by Shiro!? This flavor is definitely raising the perspective of baby castellas up a notch. Moreover, it’s so much more than just a push up of a foundation...... This indeed marks the beginning of a new era for baby castellas.]","Somehow, looking at her like this...... makes me think that she really is Ein-san’s master. Just like when Ein-san talks about anything related to maids, Kuro seriously talks about incomprehensible things when it comes to baby castellas.","[However, the taste of the ingredients is too strong. Even if something is added or kneaded to it, the taste of the other ingredients would probably be overpowered. Even this chocolate-filled one would probably be———- What!? The taste didn’t get overpowered? Even though the taste of the ingredients is of this level...... This is......]","[...................]","What should I do? She’s been mumbling with a serious face for the past hour or so and continuing her musings about baby castellas...... With her giving off such a bizarre atmosphere, the other customers don’t look like they want to approach......","How should I say this...... Rather than her becoming unapproachable, it feels more like Kuro has this aura that makes people hesitant to talk to her, as even we were also at a loss as to what to do with her.","[......Yes, yes. Can you please go back and do all that nonsensical thinking when you get back? You’re being a hindrance by standing still there.]","[Shalltear, wait, I’m now studying the infinite possibilities of baby castellas......]","[This ain’t the place to think about possibilities and all that. You’re just being a hindrance...... Alright, out with you.]","[Ahhh, wait a moment! I changed my mind! I’ll order 10,000 more bags......]","[Are you trying to crush Kaito-san and the others from overwork!? Rejected, your order’s rejected!]","......It may sound like I’m quickly changing my attitude, but I’m really glad she’s here as our mascot. She isn’t as effective when it comes to attracting customers, but she’s great as a bouncer for our stall.","I hope she will continue to do her best for the rest of the day, because I would really rely on her ability to remove Kuro while she’s in that condition.","Well, at any rate, I’m relieved that the problem has gone away. However, as the saying goes, “one problem goes away and in comes another”.","I hope that this won’t turn out to be a series of troubles as soon as we open.....","[Don’t act so distant, my sworn friend....... Why have you not summoned me from the depths of the abyss?]","......And here comes the next problem. Isn’t it too early for me to recover the flag that I raised?","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Here comes Amel huh...... She seemed really downhearted though.]","? ? ? : [She’s a bird, but she really feels more like a puppy......]","T/N: I’m translating a new novel, please check it out.","Hello, it’s Mary-san. I’m in Another World now......"]},{"number":1303,"title":"Chapter 1303 - Founding Festival 5","paragraphs":["Amel-san appeared with a somber atmosphere around her...... I’ll just say this now so that we aren’t misunderstanding things here, but I did tell her that I was going to open a stall.","In that exchange I had with her through hummingbird, she responded with “Alright. I’m looking forward to it.”...... But why does she look like a puppy drenched in the rain?","[......My sworn friend. I’m well aware of the greatness of your existence. I also think that you are a true warrior who holds the courage to face challenges alone. However, I believe that sometimes, such courage can end up hurting others. Being unable to help my sworn friend as he challenged the abyssal banquet...... Waiting for the letter asking for reinforcements...... Having the illusions of the abyssal banquet within my mind’s eye, refining my mind in the battle against such illusion......]","In short, it seemed that Amel-san was hurt. And the reason for that...... seems to be that she wanted us to open a stall together.","From what I heard, it seemed like she was having image training while waiting for me to invite her, but in the end, as the appointed day arrived without my invitation arriving, she came here downhearted.","[E- Errr...... When I contacted Amel-san, the members of our stall had already been decided, and the scale of our stall isn’t that big so......]","[......I also...... wanted to open a stall with my sworn friend.]","She looked like she was about to cry. It seemed like she really wanted to do it together with me. W- What should I do? I could certainly say let’s do it together now...... but is a pity-like invitation really alright?","Though I say that, it’s not like I can just leave her like that...... Alright!","[T- Then, let’s do it together next time, Amel-san!]","[......Eh?]","[You see, there are still other festivals out there, so the next opportunity we have, how about we open a stall together, Amel-san?]","[......Really? You’ll do it together with me?]","[Of course! I also think opening a stall together with Amel-san will be fun...... so let’s think about what kind of stall we’ll do next time.]","[My sworn friend!]","Amel-san’s face lit up when she heard my words. The expression she had earlier, looking as if the world had ended, drastically changed, and she was now filled with joy.","I think Amel-san hasn’t had much experience hanging out with friends, so I guess she’s longing to open a stall with friends. I understood that feeling, so I would like to help.","However, since all the preparations for this event have already been completed and the size of the stall makes it difficult to add another person, I would have to ask her to be patient and wait for the next opportunity we have.","[I’ll hold you to that, okay!? It’s a promise!!!]","[Yes, it’s a promise.]","[Opening a stall with my sworn friend, I’m looking forward to it...... I wonder what stall we could———- Wha!? Erhem...... Umu, a new contract is hereby made. With this contract, I shall disregard this matter. I will bask in this abyssal banquet not as a presenter, but as a spectator. Anyhow, I would like to partake in the bags of forbidden eclipse.]","[Yeees...... One bag each for regular and chocolate-filled, yes?]","It seemed like Amel-san completely cheered up, as she purchased baby castellas with a smile.","Thereupon, Tre-san, who had been watching the exchange between me and Amel-san, nodded her head for some reason and spoke.","[I see...... The bond between you two is quite definite.]","[Mhmm, have you seen through our bond? Was it perhaps that you read it between my words?]","[......No, I don’t know! However, that’s what I felt from how the atmosphere between you two feels!]","It wasn’t that she could clearly understand Amel-san’s way of speaking, but it was just something she guessed from the atmosphere around us huh? The way she said that so confidently sounded like it was actually pretty clear to her though.","[In other words, you two are like that, right? The two of you are bound by the bond of love!!!]","[Love!?]","I take back what I said before. As she just declared now, she really didn’t understand at all. She’s really just going along with her hunch.","[M- M- M- Me and m- m- m- m- my sworn friend don’t have such a relationship, as the bond we pledged is a sacred one that transcends time......]","[Transcends time?]","[Y- Yes, a pact made in our previous life......]","[You mean you were married to Kaito in your previous life?]","[Noooooo! L- Like I said, me and my sworn friend aren’t like that...... Ahhh...... I- I sense disturbance in the air! I shall be excusing myself!!! M- My sworn friend, I will see you later!!!]","In response to Tre-san’s words that were completely off the mark, the reasonably innocent Amel-san turned her blushing face away and left, seemingly trying to escape from the embarrassment.","U- Unnn, how should I say this...... Well, I have lots of things I wanna say...... but won’t a normal customer come anytime soon?","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [......Stop right there, Tre...... Seriously, stop...... Don’t raise flags with those strange assists......]"]},{"number":1304,"title":"Chapter 1304 - Founding Festival 6","paragraphs":["After Amel-san’s arrival, customers began arriving sporadically, and the event was moderately enjoyable as originally planned.","Baby castellas are basically standard items in this world, and there are probably plenty of other baby castella stalls at this festival, so we didn’t have a large number of customers.","However, the customers who ate our baby castellas at the storefront gave us very positive feedback, and those who ate them there almost always bought some more.","While the customers were away, I spent my time in harmony with Tre-san and the twins, chatting with them and eating the street food that Tre-san had bought, when I suddenly felt the presence of someone I knew.","Turning toward the presence I felt through my Sympathy Magic, I saw Agni-san walking toward our direction with her hair swinging like a scorpion’s tail.","[Miyama-sama, it’s been a while. Tre-dono, I’ve come as I promised.]","[Ahh, it’s Agni~~ Yahho~~]","[Hello, Agni-san.]","After bowing politely to me in front of the store, Agni-san spoke to Tre-san with a wry smile on her face. Come to think of it, Tre-san mentioned how they were friends, so I guess the two of them were actually quite close.","No, well, it feels like Tre-san gets along with everyone considerably well......","[I’ve actually been asked to buy for Megiddo-sama as well...... I know it’s a lot of work, but I’d like to have 20 bags.]","[It’s alright~~ There are also lots of other customers who have ordered as much, so we made sure to cook plenty in advance. I mean, is 20 bags even enough for Megiddo-sama’s size?]","[No, as expected, he would eat them while in Humanized form...... No, he originally told me to order at least 1000 bags, but when Kuromueina-sama said “Even though I was only able to ask for 100 bags, there’s no way Megiddo would order more than me, right? Or perhaps, you’re doing that to trouble Kaito-kun?”, he changed it to 20 bags.]","Agni-san’s explanation was spoken calmly...... I think Kuro may have said that while emitting a very intimidating tone.","I mean, Kuro had said she wanted to buy 10,000 bags before she was pulled away and had her request rejected by Alice......","[Speaking of which, Agni-san. How is the ceremony going?]","[This year is considerably more lively than usual. There are indeed all of the Six Kings participating in this ceremony, but there’s also the Chief of the Wingeds Amel-dono, who happened to be in the neighborhood and joined in the middle of the ceremony, so there are quite a few famous people that gathered.]","Ahh, Amel-san headed toward the ceremony after coming here...... Well, considering her position, it certainly wouldn’t be surprising that she participated.","[I mean, it’s possible to attend the ceremony midway?]","[Yes, it would be a different case for the party that will later take place in the royal castle, but the ceremony itself has a lot of space, so there’s no problem to join the ceremony midway. As expected, if the venue ends up having too many people, they will probably start refusing people......]","[Heehhh~~ I have never attended one of those before, so I didn’t know that. By the way, Agni. Have you spotted other unusual participants?]","As I was conversing with Agni-san while preparing her bags of baby castellas, Tre-san also got interested in the ceremony participants and asked.","[All the Six Kings being in attendance is unusual, but when it comes to people I’m acquainted with, I might have seen Frea-dono there as well. Meanwhile, Death King-sama was accompanied by an unknown strong being. She has considerable magic power...... but as for the others, there’s the God of Fertility. It was unusual seeing a God from a temple in another country coming...... but I think that’s about it.]","[Fumu, I see...... As for the Six Kings, I think their aim would be Kaito...... This stall we had set up. They won’t come here all at once, right?]","[Ahh, that’s something we ourselves obviously understand, but No Face-sama is managing the order of their visit. It would be troubling if everyone visits at the same time...... That’s why I came at this time, a little after the opening of your stall.]","Alice...... You’re seriously too excellent. As I had such thoughts in mind, I looked at the cat costume standing in front of the stall holding a sign, and she looked back at me and gave me a thumbs up.","Casually expressing her thoughtfulness behind the scenes, this really is an amazing aspect of Alice, and I’m sincerely grateful for her help.","[In any case, the order has been decided so that after I return, Death King-sama’s subordinate will be on their way here. Even so, seriously, I wonder who that woman is...... She seems to be a Spirit, but how could I not know of a Spirit with that much power......]","[Ahh, that would be Spica-san, and it seems she’s the Spirit of the Blue Crystal Flower. She had never manifested in a Spirit Body before, so that’s why even Lillywood-san didn’t know about her.]","[Oh my, so that’s how it is. As expected of Miyama-sama, you’re a very knowledgeable person.]","[No, I only heard about this from Isis-san...... Ah, here are your 20 bags.]","[Thank you very much.]","It seems that Spica-san and Eul would be coming after Agni-san. It’s nice to know in advance.","Considering the people they told me would be coming beforehand, after Spica-san and Eul...... I guess it would be Magnawell-san? I’m not sure if she would be acting as Lillywood-san’s proxy, but I had also talked to Camellia-san about our stall and she told me she would come to buy some.","As for the people whose actions I wouldn’t know about, there are Amaterasu-san and Mana-san...... Well, for the time being, let’s just look forward to my first meeting with Spica-san.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Alice is d*mn excellent. Also, I knew the real concern would be that dangerous God...... Well then, I wonder when she’ll show up?]"]},{"number":1305,"title":"Chapter 1305 - Founding Festival 7","paragraphs":["After Agni-san returned to the ceremony venue, we continued to serve customers in a relaxed manner for a while. With the festive atmosphere, the customers seemed to be very generous and were really able to relax and enjoy themselves.","[Kyuu!]","[Unnn? That way huh~~ You’re really great, Eul.]","Hearing a familiar cry and a carefree voice I was hearing for the first time, I turned around to see a woman with bluish-white hair walking towards our direction with Eul in her arms.","She was about 160cm tall, with long, straight hair and an elegant dress that would have been appropriate for a noble. Her hair was decorated with a Blue Crystal Flower...... and she had the air of a neat and tidy young lady...... I wonder if she’s Spica-san?","[Kyukkyuuu! Kyuuu!]","[Welcome, Eul...... Errr, it’s nice to meet you. You’re Spica-san, right?]","[Yes~~ A new member of Isis-sama’s place. I’m in your care hereafter~~]","[I’m Miyama Kaito. I’m also in your care.]","With a carefree tone, she spoke in a...... Kansai dialect? No, Kyoto dialect? Anyhow, as Spica-san spoke with that unusual tone, I exchanged greetings with her.","She seemed to have a gentle atmosphere and seemed to have a fluffy mood around her, and this may just be me making my own assumptions, but she feels like an easygoing person.","[Errr, we’ll have 7 bags each of the regular and chocolate-filled ones please.]","[Yes, 7 bags each.]","[Errr, the money is...... Hmmm, wait a moment, kay? I haven’t really used money, so how much should I give you again?]","[Kyuu! Kyuu...... Kyuuu!]","[Ohh, I give this one and this one huh. Eul is so smart~~ Thank goodness you’re here with me.]","According to Isis-san, Spica-san had never manifested out in the open in a Spirit Body, so she naturally had no experience shopping.","So, when it comes to money, she didn’t seem to understand the different types of coins, but Eul followed up by pointing with her tail.","[......Rather, Eul can already calculate money huh. Eul really is clever.]","[Kyuuuu!]","I reached out and petted her head, and she happily rubbed her face into my hand...... Hmmm, she’s really cute.","[Speaking of which~~ This may be a frequently asked question, but does Kaito-san like Blue Crystal Flowers?]","[Eh? Yes, it’s a flower in this world that I have strong memories of and sticks the most in my mind. It’s also beautiful, so I like it.]","[I see~~ Fufu, I think asking this question may become a habit~~ I’m glad to see that so many people like Blue Crystal Flowers~~]","In fact, the Blue Crystal Flower is a flower that really reminds me of Isis-san, and it has left a great impression on me as well. Of course, I still keep the Blue Crystal Flower that she gave me when we first met.","It might be a good idea to buy a glass case and display the flower in it.","[By the way....... Spica-san has a rather unusual tone...... I mean, it sounds a lot like the tone of a certain region in the world I was in, so I’m wondering if there’s any cause for this?]","[No~~ No reason in particular. I’ve been talking like this for a long time...... No, I can’t really say I’ve talked to others like this, so I guess this is just how I felt I talked even back then~~ Well, I’ve already gotten used to talking like this, and trivial things like tones aren’t really something I mind~~]","[I see.]","Well, there certainly isn’t anything wrong with her tone. I was simply curious because it was the first time I had heard such a tone from someone other than Akane-san.","However, the fact that there’s someone like Spica-san should mean that there may be other people who speak in a Kansai dialect-like manner.","[......Well then, it won’t be good if we stay too long, so it’s about time we take our leave~~]","[Ah, yes. Thank you very much. Please give my regards to Isis-san.]","[Yes~~]","[Eul too, see you later.]","[Kyuu!]","At my words, Spica-san gave me a small wave of her hand, while Eul waved her tail like a hand as they left. Hmmm, they were a very relaxing duo.","[......Look, look, Kaito, people with unusual outfits are heading this way. Isn’t that that kimono outfit?]","[......Ahh~]","Walking our way is Amaterasu-san and Mana-san...... I would have liked to savor that peaceful moment though......","Unnn? Arehh? Why did I think that Amaterasu-san and Mana-san coming would mean there won’t be peace? Even though Eden-san herself didn’t come...... Hmmm?","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Even though he doesn’t have any memory about her, that slight dangerous impression he has towards Makina seemed to have stuck on Mana......]"]},{"number":1306,"title":"Chapter 1306 - Founding Festival 8","paragraphs":["Amaterasu-san and Mana-san came to my stall, and Amaterasu-san, in her unique outfit, attracted a fair amount of attention, but due to the small number of people around this area, she didn’t cause a big commotion, and came to the front of our stall.","[Hello, as we had told you before, we’re here to make a purchase.]","[Hello, Amaterasu-san, Mana-san. Do you want to have regular baby castellas or ones filled with chocolate?]","[Errr, let’s see. Well then, we’ll have 1...... no, 2 for each kind please.]","I guess that means one for Eden-san and one for hers huh? Just as Amaterasu-san was speaking though, it looked like Mana-san glanced at Amaterasu-san for a moment, making her rephrase it though......","As I had such thoughts in mind, I prepared the bags and filled them with baby castellas. This should make it so that the both of them wouldn’t be a problem now, but I suddenly felt some sort of viscous gaze, and turning my eyes towards that direction...... I saw Mana-san looking at me with some kind of scary smile.","No, Mana-san herself is a lovely person, and her smile isn’t particularly strange in any way, but for some reason, turning my back towards her makes me feel like a frog being gazed at by a snake...... That was supposed to be a normal smile, but her gaze strangely felt like there was something muddy within it. Am I just overthinking it?","[......Haahhh, my bel———– Igyiihh!?]","[Eh?]","The moment Mana-san’s eyes narrowed and she was about to speak, something hit Mana-san’s head, making her bite her own tongue.","[Oops, I’m sorry about that. My signpost accidentally slipped out of my hand. Well~~ I’m sorry, Customer-san.]","Saying this while apologizing to Mana-san is Alice but...... Arehh? Wasn’t our signpost just an ordinary wooden one just now? When did it change into a “giant hammer”-like shape?","[M- Mana-san, are you alright!?]","[Y- Yes. I’m completely alright...... You don’t have to worry about me.]","Lightly rubbing her head, Mana-san wryly smiled as she stood up. As one would expect from Amaterasu-san’s assistant, she must be a lot more powerful than her appearance would suggest, as even though a huge hammer hit her in the head, it didn’t look like she was hurt at all.","[......Alice, what are you even......]","[No, the signpost really just slipped out of my hand. It was a complete accident.]","[Right, right, that was just an accident, so you really don’t have to mind it!]","It looked as if Alice hitting her head was intentional, but putting aside if it was just Alice saying it, since Mana-san herself also said it was an accident, then I can’t say anything more.","[......Is Alice and Mana-san acquainted with each other?]","[Hnn~~ Well, we’ve actually met each other through our connection with Eden-san. I haven’t met Amaterasu-san though.]","[That’s because we had different places in charge after all. Back when I...... Errr, Miyama Kaito-san went to the beach, the one who delivered the ingredients being sponsored by Eden-sama was me. We became close at that time.]","[Ahh~~ I see, come to think of it, that was indeed the case.]","Alice mentioned that Eden-san prepared the ingredients we would be using for our meals at the beach, and Mana-san was the one who delivered them at that time huh...... I thought Eden-san would have just created them on the spot, but with her having various detailed agreements with Shiro-san, I suppose that is why she had someone deliver them instead.","[W- Well, anyhow, I’m glad you aren’t injured.]","[You were worried about me!? Haahh, you really are my cu——–]","[Ahh, this thing really is slippery.]","[———–!?]","[M- Mana-saaaaaan!?]","As Mana-san was about to say something, Alice swung that huge hammer she called a signpost, making a sound that clearly shouldn’t have been made by a person.","That was a pretty strong blow!? Are they sure Alice isn’t seriously trying to break her neck!?","[A- Alice, you!?]","[It can’t be helped, don’t blame me. My hand slipped.]","[No, you still claim your hand slipped? It’s quite obvious that......]","[Her hand slipped! The signpost slipped off her hand from my point of view, so there’s no problem at all!!!]","[E- Eeehhhh......]","No matter how you look at it, it looked like she intentionally hit Mana-san on the head with that hammer, but putting aside if it was just Alice playing dumb, if Mana-san is also doing her best to support Alice’s claim, it makes me confused and unable to say anything.","W- What the heck is this strange scene...... I feel like I’m gonna go crazy. W- Well, if she says she’s alright, I guess I shouldn’t say anything about this anymore......","[......Errr, well then, Amaterasu-san. Here are 2 bags of each kind.]","[Thank you very much. Errr, please pass them to Mana-san.]","[Yes. Mana-san, here you go.]","[Thank you very much! Do your best with your stall.]","[Y- Yes, thank you very much.]","I’m not really sure what’s going on, but I feel that thinking about this any deeper will only tire me out, so I saw off the two of them off, with Mana-san waving her hand with a satisfied look on her face, and Amaterasu-san deeply bowing with an indescribable expression on her face.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [I see, because she created that body weak, so she can be stopped by physical damage......]","? ? ? : [And so, just like usual, Alice-chan holds the role of supporting others. Alice-chan really is excellent, and I think Kaito-san should reward Alice-chan.]","Serious-senpai : [Stop with the one-man play.]"]},{"number":1307,"title":"Chapter 1307 - Founding Festival 9","paragraphs":["Even after Amaterasu-san and Mana-san left, our stall continued to operate smoothly. Compared to when the festival had just started, more people are arriving in the area as noon comes and we are getting more customers, but there’s still plenty of space around and some times when we have no customers.","[Look, look, Kaito. Baby castella skewers!]","[I remember Kuro making something similar back when we had barbeque.]","[W- What did you say...... As expected of Kuromu-sama......]","As Tre-san pierced baby castellas on what looked like bamboo skewers, wondering where she got those, I wryly smiled. Incidentally, the baby castellas that Tre-san had pierced are the ones that were left halfway through packaging in the bag or were slightly misshapen when baked, so they were moved to the side for us to eat.","[Kaito, Kaito, turn here and open your mouth.]","[Mouth? Like this?]","[Here.]","[Mnghh...... What are you suddenly doing?]","I had somewhat expected this, but as I thought, when I opened my mouth, a baby castella was thrown in. Unnn, it tastes good, but how should I say this...... Her actions were sudden just as usual.","[Kaito and I were close after all. I read about this in a book. People in your world do this, right? Wouldn’t this mean we’re almost lovers already?]","[You’re mistaken.]","[I’m mistaken huh~~ Eh? Wait, which part of what I said am I mistaken?]","Seeing Tre-san dexterously tilting her head while happily smiling, I chuckled. How should I say this...... She’s as fun-loving as ever, and her easy going nature makes for good conversation.","Moreover, while we’re operating our stall, I can see that Tre-san has good communication skills, and is very well suited to serving customers.","[Yes, yes. A bag of regular baby castellas, right!? Here you go! We’ve added a little bit of extra just for you. Yes, you gave just the right amount, thanks~~]","The smile she has as she serves the customers makes those who see it happy, making the atmosphere around us great. This is Tre-san’s charm. Her strong point.","While I was serving customers, having such a thought in mind, an elderly gentleman in an elegant suit...... Magnawell-san, arrived with Frea-san.","[I’m glad to see you’re doing well, Miyama Kaito.]","[Welcome, Magnawell-san. Frea-san too.]","[Sorry to bother you, my comrade.]","The tall, calm, elderly Magnawell-san and the short, youthful Frea-san stood side by side, as if a grandfather and his granddaughter had come to buy something together.","[Even so, I thought the same thing back at the White God Festival, but there sure are so many people around. Perhaps, it’s because I haven’t had many opportunities to see it from this height before, but seeing how there are actually this many people is surprising.]","[Ahh~~ I guess looking down at Magnawell-san’s usual size and actually looking at it in the size of a human are quite different, aren’t they?]","[Umu. It’s fresh and quite interesting...... Ohh, we can’t just keep immersing ourselves in the conversation. Give me and Nidzveld a bag of each kind, four bags in total.]","[Yes. Two bags of regular and chocolate-filled baby castellas. Please wait a moment......]","The previous White God Festival was the first time Magnawell-san had participated in a festival from the same perspective as other people.","However, since he was also a guest of honor at the White God Festival, he seemed to have limited himself to a short tour in the middle-level, but the atmosphere is different in the middle-level, where the number of people was limited, and the crowded Founding Festival, where the atmosphere seems to be very enjoyable.","[Working on something close together like this must be nice. If I had been available, I would have liked to participate, but I tend to be a guest of honor at festivals like this, so it’s difficult.]","[Ahh~~ Lilia-san said something similar. People in high positions would have problems like that huh.]","[Indeed...... However, looking at my comrade’s stall, I really feel like wanting to try that out given the opportunity. How about it, Magnawell-sama? How about having something like a Harmonic Symphony in our camp?]","[I see, that sounds interesting. The Dragons are often grouped together in a small circle. It might be a good idea to create an opportunity for them to get to know other races. Let’s hear everyone’s opinions and consider this again.]","Now that he can participate in the festival directly...... Magnawell-san seems to be interested in holding a festival in his own camp, and he seems to be enthusiastic about Frea-san’s proposal.","A festival mainly held by Dragons and Demons huh...... If that comes true, I bet Lilia-san and people like her will be very happy.","Having such thoughts in mind, I enjoyed chatting with Magnawell-san and the others until our next customers arrived.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [How strange. Thinking of a festival in the Dragon King camp, I couldn’t help but think that it would end up being a date with Lilia......]"]},{"number":1308,"title":"Chapter 1308 - Founding Festival 10","paragraphs":["A little after noon, Luna-san, Sieg-san, and Hina-chan arrived as scheduled, and while we were chatting with each other, they took over the shift.","I also remembered to register the coordinates of this area in my Teleportation Magic Tool just in case we need to return.","[With the location of our stall, we’re able to sell baby castellas at a leisurely pace...... How was the ceremony?]","[The ceremony was spectacular. Since all of the Six Kings were participating, it seems that they spent a lot of money this year, and it was more flashy than in the previous years.]","[We only caught a glimpse of it from the audience seats, but the guests of honor were all amazing...... Lili, who was also sitting there, had eyes like a dead fish though.]","From what I’ve heard from Luna-san and Sieg-san, who sent Lilia-san to the venue, it seemed like the situation somehow turned out rough.","H- Hmmm, I wonder how much influence I had in this matter? You wouldn’t be able to say that I was the cause of Lilia-san’s dead fish eyes, right? ......I feel like you could say this happened because of me just as usual.","[Was Lilia-san seated near the Six Kings?]","[Rather, it’s more like she was seated in a position acting as the representative of the Humans.]","[Eh? Is that so?]","I tilted my head slightly at Hina-chan and Aoi-chan’s words, but I immediately thought of the reason why. Lilia-san has interacted with all of the Six Kings, has received the True Blessing of the God of Time and Space, is currently one of the strongest in the Human Realm along with Laguna-san, and is related to Symphonia’s royal family...... Unnn. No matter how you think about it, it’s inevitable that she would become the Human side’s representative.","[......Luna-san, how much of this time do you think is my fault?]","[Let’s see. This time, Miyama-sama just wanted to open an ordinary stall, and you had talked about this with Milady in advance, so it’s not like a big announcement was suddenly made...... Overall, I’d say about “90.5%” your fault?]","[In other words, it’s mostly my fault. Please bring her some baby castellas when you pick her up.]","I knew it. That really would be the case...... No matter how you think about it, I’m the reason why the Six Kings made the decision to participate.","Well, they were originally going to have their subordinates participate as their representative, which is probably why they themselves could easily decide to change their mind, but I was still the motive that brought that change.","Please, I pray that while she’s at the venue, Lilia-san’s stomach remains safe...... I know it may sound like I’m acting like this is another person’s problem, but I hope Chronois-san supports her nicely.","[......F- For the time being, we will go look around the festival.]","[Yes, please leave things here with us and go have fun. If you have time to spare, you might want to go to the ceremony. The initial formal ceremony is over, and now the focus is on entertainment, such as singing and dancing.]","[I see, that sounds like fun. If I have some time, I will do that.]","After responding with words of thanks to Sieg-san, who saw me off with a gentle smile, I moved away from the store with Tre-san and the others, who have also completed handing over their tasks, to enjoy the Founding Festival.","[What should we do first?]","[Hmmm, it’s lunchtime already, so I guess let’s eat something. However, we have been frequently eating while cooking, so let’s get something light.]","[While we’re at it, I’d like to eat something unique to the Founding Festival...... but is there something like that?]","[I don’t know!!!]","What a powerful denial. She was so confident when she said that that I couldn’t help but feel impressed.","As I chuckled at Tre-san’s words spoken with pride, Cento-san thought for a moment before speaking.","[......How about “Symphonia-yaki”?]","[Eh? That sounds like a very typical dish at a festival, but what kind of food is it?]","[If I’m not mistaken, it’s a dish similar to a crepe, with many vegetables and fruits baked and wrapped in an egg batter. It isn’t exactly served only in Symphonia Kingdom’s Founding Festival, but it’s famous as a specialty of the western trading cities. You don’t usually see them being sold in the royal capital though, so I think having that would be a good idea.]","It’s something like a fruit crepe huh? That does sound delicious, so I definitely would like to try it out...... but would we really be able to conveniently find a stall selling that in this crowded festival venue?","[It sounds great and I’d like to try it out...... but will we be able to conveniently find a stall that sells that?]","[In that case, please leave it to me......]","[Cien-san?]","[I’m good at wide-area detection, so I should be able to find such a stall in no time.]","How reliable. That means that if we ask Cien-san, she can find not only Symphonia-yaki, but also other stalls.","......I wonder if she’ll be able to find Elise-san’s stall as well? I would love to go there since she has helped me in many ways but...... Hmmm, no matter how I think about it, I can only see a future where I will be greeted with a blatantly displeased look.","Moreover, even in the end, she didn’t tell me where she was going to open her stall...... so I guess it would be better if I stop trying to search for it.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [There rises a refreshing “coincidental discovery flag”...... This is the power of the Special-Class Flag Architect huh...... ]"]},{"number":1309,"title":"Chapter 1309 - Founding Festival - Noon 1","paragraphs":["<Author’s Notes>","Added an article about the manga’s Volume 7 in the Activity Report.","As one would expect from a festival commemorating the founding of Symphonia Kingdom, the streets of the royal capital were crowded to a degree not normally seen.","With a situation like this, it would take a lot of time to move around, so it was a good decision that I registered the location of our stall in the Teleportation Magic Tool.","It took some time for us to reach a stall selling Symphonia-yaki, but it wasn’t so bad walking leisurely in the bustling atmosphere, so it didn’t feel like we took quite a while.","I also bought several stuff from the stalls I saw along the way while we were walking to the stall selling Symphonia-yaki, and decided to eat them at a place where there weren’t many people.","[......Its shape was different from what I had imagined.]","[Unnn? What kind of shape did you imagine it had, Kaito?]","[I thought it was more like a crepe......]","The Symphonia-yaki is, how should I say this...... It has an omelet-like shape. Well, the egg batter surrounding it was thin, and the fruit was plentiful and very tasty when eaten.","There was no sweet cream like whipped cream, and the natural sweetness could be enjoyed to the fullest, making it quite a tasty dish.","[Kaito, Kaito, ahhhn.]","[Unnn? ......No, we’re having the same one, you know?]","[Ahhhhhhhhhhhhhhhn.]","[......Yes, yes.]","[Unnn! Tasty!]","Wryly smiling at Tre-san, who was appealing to me to feed her with her mouth wide open, I just brought my Symphonia-yaki to her mouth.","Tre-san nodded with a very satisfied expression on her face. I guess she might be thinking something like “with this, the event finally progresses”.","[Speaking of which, what are we going to do after this? Since we’re at it, shall we move toward the ceremony in the Central Area?]","[Unnn, I think that would be good. If there are any good stalls along the way, let’s stop by and check them out.]","Cento-san and Cien-san also agreed with that suggestion, so we decided to go to the ceremony venue.","As we got closer to the main ceremony venue, the more crowded it became and the more difficult it became to get around.","[It’s crowded, isn’t it?]","[Hmmm...... I’m a little tired, so let’s buy something and take a break off the road for a while.]","[I guess let’s do that......]","Agreeing with Tre-san’s suggestion, we bought some drinks and moved to the side to take a short break.","I thought that if we moved off the main street, there would be fewer people...... but for some reason, there were still a lot of people around, or rather, some kind of crowd appeared in the place we were going to.","[What’s happening? Rather than people just congesting on this side, it feels more like people are gathering here.]","[Probably an event?]","Cento-san and Cien-san curiously murmured. One of the reasons it from where we are standing, the crowd is in the way and it was difficult to see what exactly was going on.","[......I’m kinda hearing a bit of music? Are they having a performance? Hmmm...... Alright, Cento, Cien! Carry me and Kaito, fly up to the sky and let’s watch from the air.]","[Aren’t we gonna stand out if we do that?]","[Eh, I think we’ll be fine. Everyone’s attention will be over there anyway.]","It was an outlandish suggestion, but I was also curious about what they were doing, so finally nodded my head in agreement with Tre-san’s suggestion.","And then, we flew up to the skies, with Cento-san carrying Tre-san and Cien-san carrying me.","[I’m sorry for the trouble, Cien-san.]","[No, I’m magically protecting you, but please hold on to me just in case.]","Even though their actual abilities are far superior to mine, I couldn’t help but feel apologetic seeing both Cento-san and Cien-san, who are both small-statured, carrying us.","After slightly smiling at my words, Cien-san leaped with me in her arms. The way she’s carrying me is more courteous than Alice’s, and I didn’t feel nearly as much wind pressure or anything like that.","......Well, this situation of being carried by someone is slightly embarrassing, but it seems that Cento-san and Cien-san will make us invisible with Recognition Inhibition Magic.","Looking from the air, it seems that there’s a little open space at the end of the crowd, and there......","[......Are those...... Ariel-san and Tir-san?]","[Ahh, you’re right. It really is Ariel and Tir. Ahh~~ So that’s why there were so many people there.]","In the area surrounded by the crowd were Ariel-san and Tir-san, with Ariel-san dancing to the tune being played in the flute-like instrument held by Tir-san.","Ariel-san’s dance was full of charm, and Tir-san’s music was wonderful, with a joyous tune that matched the atmosphere of the festival.","As Tre-san said, it really is no wonder that the crowd was so large...... Just as I was thinking that, I suddenly felt them glancing in our direction.","[......They’re more powerful than me and Cento...... so well, of course, they’d notice we’re here.]","[......I see.]","What should we do here? Should I greet them...... by wading through that crowd?","<Afterword>","Manga Volume 7 here.","Serious-senpai : [T- This is!? A surge of seriousness!!!]","? ? ? : [Well, this certainly might be the most serious part of the series.]","Serious-senpai : [.......No, the series does have seriousness in the beginning, but it started getting gradually exterminated.]","? ? ? : [And the reason for that is......]","Serious-senpai : [Because of that d*mned excellent guard that has become a constant presence!!!]","<img 2020=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-93179 size-full\" wp-content=\"\" uploads=\"\" 05=\"\" 9bay6vxxe3bdmewdf2yj4ntlbk4k_tws_jj_rs_2pdw.jpg\"=\"\" alt=\"\" width=\"703\" height=\"1000\" 9bay6vxxe3bdmewdf2yj4ntlbk4k_tws_jj_rs_2pdw.jpg=\"\" 703w,=\"\" 9bay6vxxe3bdmewdf2yj4ntlbk4k_tws_jj_rs_2pdw-211x300.jpg=\"\" 211w,=\"\" 9bay6vxxe3bdmewdf2yj4ntlbk4k_tws_jj_rs_2pdw-75x106.jpg=\"\" 75w\"=\"\" sizes=\"(max-width: 703px) 100vw, 703px\">"]},{"number":1310,"title":"Chapter 1310 - Bonus SS : ’A Little Before the Beginning’","paragraphs":["<Author’s Notes>","I can’t find the time to write anything today, so I’ll post the story of a bonus SS for Volume 10.","This is a story just before Kaito visits Trinia.","A land of extreme cold where it snows all year round and everything is frozen. In this place, feared by those who live in the Demon Realm as the Land of Death, stands the only building in this place, the castle of the Death King Isis.","In a corner of the library filled with books, Isis, the master of this castle, placed the book she had just bought...... titled “The Caged Princess and the Blue Flower” on a small table and turned her gaze to the view from a nearby window.","At that moment, the door to the library opened and a girl carrying a paper bag entered.","[Isis, I’ve come to share my newest creations with you~~]","[......Kuromueina...... Unnn...... Thank you...... You can just...... put it down there.]","To the words of the Underworld King...... Kuromueina, speaking to her with a smile, Isis replied with an indifferent voice, her gaze kept outside the window without looking back. With a slightly forlorn expression on her face at the sight of such an Isis, Kuromueina placed the bag of baby castellas on the table.","She couldn’t help but wonder, since when has she been like this? Since when had the smile on her face completely disappeared, only leaving a cold expression on it...... She herself knows why this happened. But unfortunately, Kuromueina has no way to heal the loneliness that Isis carries.","She was frustrated about this as her family, but as she was unable to say anything more about this, Kuromueina only looked at Isis’ back one more time as she continued to stare at the window, before turning around and murmuring to herself.","[......Speaking of which, I’m looking for Shalltear, but do you know where she is?]","[......I don’t know...... She came here once...... about 2 years ago...... but as for where she is now...... I don’t know.]","[I see, thanks...... I’ll see you later then.]","[......Unnn.]","****","Kuromueina, who walked out of Isis’ residence without exchanging many words, suddenly felt the magic power of someone she knew, teleporting to this place at that moment.","Immediately after, a tree grew on the snow-covered earth and Lillywood, the World King, appeared.","[Lillywood, what a coincidence.]","“Oya? Kuromueina...... You also came to see Isis?”","[Unnn. I came to see her a bit...... Speaking of which, Lillywood, do you know where Shalltear is?]","“No, my apologies. I haven’t seen her since the last Festival of Heroes, so I don’t know where she is right now......”","Shalltear, the Phantasmal King No Face, is the only one among the Six Kings who doesn’t have a fixed residence, moving from place to place around the world. In addition, because of her mastery in Transformation and Recognition Inhibition Magic, she’s difficult to contact, and often doesn’t appear before the other members of the Six Kings even once during the 10 years between one Festival of Heroes and the next one.","[Hmmm, I see...... In that case, I’ll have to ask one of her executives to contact her again. Well then, I’m off then...... I’ll leave Isis to you. She seemed to be a little on edge lately, but I’m sure she’ll feel a little more at ease with Lillywood.]","“I hope that’s indeed the case...... It’s vexing how my presence doesn’t lead to a fundamental solution though.”","[......You’re right, it certainly is difficult. Well, after the next Festival of Heroes, we will have a little more time to spare, so I think it would be nice if everyone could get together at least once before the next Festival of Heroes comes again.]","The everyone that Kuromueina refers to is her family who lives far away from her now...... the people who are now called the Six Kings. The Six Kings’ activities, for better or worse, have expanded since the Treaty of Friendship between the three realms was signed, and they have fewer opportunities to get together than before.","“That certainly sounds great. As usual though, it seemed like the one most difficult to call would be Shalltear.”","[Ahaha, that’s true. If we’re not careful, she may just easily disappear.]","After chuckling at Lillywood’s words, saying such a thing with a wry smile, Kuromueina lightly waved her hand and teleported away.","****","The scene moves to a different place, in the Symphonia Kingdom, Human Realm, the Head of her family, Duchess Albert, was looking at a document with a somewhat nervous expression on her face.","Written on said document are the schedule and procedures for the summoning of the Hero to be held in the near future in great detail.","[Good grief, I understand that they passed an important task to you...... but what are you doing there, being that nervous?]","[Luna...... I understand that in my head, but I just couldn’t help being anxious......]","Even as she responded to Lunamaria’s somewhat astounded look, the tenseness on Lilia’s shoulders could be firmly conveyed.","[Well, Lili is still an inexperienced Duke, so I think this would be a good opportunity to increase your profile.]","[Yes, if I can gain power as a noble little by little, one day...... I would be able to acquire a Fruit of the World Tree......]","[.....................]","Hearing the words Lilia muttered as she stared at the documents, Lunamaria had a complicated expression on her face. However, her face soon changed to a cheerful one and she spoke.","[Though I say that, being too uptight now won’t help. Being too serious is also something to think about.]","[Mhmm, that’s certainly true but......]","[In the meantime, I’ll go make you a cup of tea, so please drink it and take some break. If you’re too nervous, nothing will go well.]","[......I suppose you’re right.]","Seemingly as if talking to Lunamaria has helped release some of her tension, Lilia’s shoulders relaxed just a little bit. After confirming this, Lunamaria bowed and left the room to prepare tea.","Walking down the corridor under the afternoon sunlight, Lunamaria quietly pondered her thoughts.","(His Majesty the King probably had a hand in appointing Lili to be in charge of this year’s Hero Summoning. His Majesty probably knows what Lili’s goal is, and is probably taking into consideration her achievements as a noble, even if only a little.)","In terms of simple name recognition, Lilia could be described as a celebrity in the country, no, even in the whole Human Realm. However, this is only because of her overwhelming fighting ability...... but as a noble, she’s just a newcomer.","At least, at the present time, Lilia doesn’t have the financial resources to purchase a Fruit of the World Tree, nor does she have enough contact to obtain one, so it was imperative that she establish connections.","(......However, that would be difficult, wouldn’t it? It’s true that being in charge of the Hero Summoning is a prestigious position, but with next year being the hundredth time the Festival of Heroes will be held...... it honestly won’t be much of an achievement.)","Yes, the Hero Summoning is done in rotation by the three kingdoms of the Human Realm. In other words, even if one considers only the Symphonia Kingdom, more than 30 summons have been issued since the first Festival of Heroes. Therefore, any noble with the rank of Count or higher has been in charge of Hero Summoning in the past.","(Besides, within the country, she will inevitably be underestimated thanks to the prestige of her elder brother, His Majesty. It would be ideal if Lili’s voice would be strengthened if she could establish connections outside the Symphonia Kingdom, such as with people in the Archlesia Empire, the Hydra Kingdom, or even someone from the Demon Realm or God Realm......)","After thinking about this, Lunamaria arrived at the kitchenette and began to prepare tea in a familiar manner. However, once she started, the thoughts continued to turn without stopping.","(It could be said that her Flying Dragon Flight and stores are on track to some extent. If this state of affairs continues in four years, it would seem like she’s keeping up a good pace instead...... but the Fruit of the World Tree, and her other goal, would take a long time to reach.)","Their situation isn’t bad, but it isn’t good either. The destination is terribly far away, and it may take her a long time to get there.","Lilia and Sieglinde are both burdened with guilt, and their relationship is somewhat strained. For the past four years, Lunamaria has been between the two of them and has done everything she could. But even so, she still couldn’t see the light at the end of this tunnel.","(......I wonder how long this will last? When will the day come when the three of us can laugh together like in the past without any sort of guilt...... Or perhaps, such a day may never again......)","It’s obvious, but by no means is she...... Lunamaria an outsider. She’s one of the related party and one who is just as heartbroken by what once happened.","Perhaps, is that why? When she’s alone, a sudden feeling of weakness springs up in her heart. The fear that they may never be able to return to their once enjoyable relationship again clutches her heart.","[......Someone...... Please help us.]","A small voice, as small as the buzzing of a mosquito, spilled out, and a drop of tea fell on her clenched hand. If she could just cry like a little child, she might have felt a little better. However, that was a choice she couldn’t make.","After a few moments of looking down in silence, Lunamaria shook her head and changed her mindset.","(......I can’t break here. If I break, even the things I’m barely holding on to at the moment may collapse. No matter how hard it is, no matter how painful it is...... I need to keep the smile on my face......)","She...... Lunamaria, too, has been fighting for four years now. She has kept a bright smile on her face, acted like a buffoon, and continued to support her best friends to keep them from becoming even worse off than they are now.","That’s why, even if she can’t see the future, she can’t give up now. As Lunamaria renewed her resolve, she heard a familiar voice.","[Isn’t the water temperatuuuuuuure a little too hot alreadyyyyyy?]","[Illness-sama!? S- Since when have you......]","[I just got heeeeeeeere.]","After answering in her usual tone of voice to Lunamaria, who looked back in surprise, Illness began to inspect the items in the kitchenette.","[......Are you checking the inventory?]","[Yeeees. I’m going to go shoppiiiiiing, so I’m checking to see what I neeeeeeed.]","[I see, errr......]","[Is there anything you need, Lunamariaaaaa?]","She wasn’t sure if Illness had heard her earlier mutterings, but either way, it didn’t seem like she intended to pursue that matter. Feeling somewhat relieved, Lunamaria spoke.","[......Yes. Milady seems to be on edge lately, so if you could get something that can help her relax......]","[I seeeeee. Well theeeeen, shall I get her some aroma candleeeees?]","[Ah, yes. Indeed, that would be great.]","[I understaaaaaand. Well theeeeen, I will take my leeeeeave.]","After checking the inventory, Illness left the kitchenette. Looking at her small back, Lunamari couldn’t help reflexively speaking.","[......Illness-sama.]","[Yeeeees?]","[Do you think Milady can achieve her goals?]","[I wonder about thaaaaat. I won’t say it’s impossibleeeeee, but it seemed liiiiiike it will take her a long tiiiiiiiime.]","[......Yes.]","Illness’ answer was almost the same as what Lunamaria had thought.","[Howeveeeeeer, regarding her first goaaaaaal, I think it depends on a fortuitous encounteeeeer.]","[Fortuitous encounter huh.]","[You never knooooooow what fate may lie in wait for youuuuuu. You can’t say that there’s absoluuuuuuutely no chanceeeeee that one day, you will suddenly meet World King-samaaaaaaa.]","[......I guess so.]","[That’s whyyyyy~~ You shouldn’t brood about this matter too muuuuuuuch.]","[......Yes. Thank you.]","[No, don’t mention iiiiiit. Well theeeeen.]","Perhaps feeling her emotions getting a little lighter after hearing Illness’ words, Lunamaria smiled and watched Illness’ back as she left.","After that, she put the tea she had prepared on a cart and walked towards the office where Lilia was waiting for her.","(Indeed, the situation may not be something I can optimistically think about, but there’s no need to be overly pessimistic either. It’s not absolutely impossible that a savior would suddenly appear one day. I will just do my best to do what I can do “now”.)","Lunamaria, who was walking down the corridor feeling a little lighter than before, suddenly stopped, seemingly having remembered something, and looked out the window.","(......Come to think of it, even with the Blessing of God of Love-sama that Lili was forced to accept in the hope of finding even one good match...... In the end, she never had any good encounters. Well, it’s all just a matter of fate after all...... Arehh? However, if the effect of the blessing works exactly one year after it’s received...... So it should be in effect for a few more days. It’s silly to rely on miracles, but just wishing for one is free.)","After thinking that much, Lunamaria removed her gaze from the window and started walking again, quietly muttering to herself.","[......May my suffering best friends have a miraculous encounter......]","****","Walking along the main street of Symphonia, which was filled with the liveliness of the end of the year, Illness, who was shopping in a familiar manner, suddenly stopped and looked down an alleyway.","Then, she suddenly disappeared as if blending in with the scenery, moving to an unpopular back alley before quietly muttering.","[It’s been a long tiiiiiiiime, Underworld King-samaaaaaa.]","As if in response to her muttering, the scenery ahead of her gaze distorted and Kuromueina appeared.","[Unnn, it’s been a while, Pandemonium-chan. I’m sorry for suddenly calling out to you with magic power.]","[No, noooo, please don’t worry about iiiiiit.]","[However, I’m glad I found you here. This saves me the trouble of asking around in the royal castle.]","[About four years agooooo, I was reassigned and noooooow, I work for the Albert Duchyyyyy.]","[Eh? Is that so!? In that case, I’m really glad that I encountered you nearby by chance.]","[Well theeeeen, how may I be of heeeeelp?]","When Illness asked with a slight tilt of her head, Kuromueina smiled and told her the main issue.","[I’ve been looking for Shalltear, but I can’t find her. I’m sorry, but could you contact her for me?]","[Understoooood.]","After nodding in response to Kuromueina’s request, Illness produced her magic box and took out a stick-shaped magic tool with five holes in it.","It was a communication tool for direct communication to Shalltear, her King, which was given only to the Phantasmal King’s Executives, the Ten Demons.","Thereupon, from inside her magic box, Illness took out a huge bag and opened it. Inside the bag, there were hundreds of colorful magic crystals neatly arranged in a row.","[......Did the number of magic crystals increase again?]","[It did increeeeeease. Shalltear-sama is a very wary person after aaaaaaaall.]","The Communication Magic Tool given to the Ten Demons is used by attaching 5 magic crystals. Yes, communication is connected to Shalltear only when 5 specific magic crystals are attached in a certain order from among the hundreds of magic crystals given to the Executives. Incidentally, the combination and order of the magic crystals also changes “irregularly and frequently”.","With familiar movements, Illness took out five magic crystals, attached them on the magic tool and channeled her magic power into it.","“Yes, yes, what’s up?”","[Shalltear-samaaaa, Underworld King-sama wants to contact youuuuu.]","“Oya, Kuro-san does? Oh my, I wonder what this is all about~~”","Hearing the words coming from the Communication Magic Tool, Kuromueina looked somewhat astounded, and letting out a sigh once, she spoke.","[You’re as mean as always. You already know what I wanted, right?]","“Ah, well...... Yes, I do. I’m going to clean up a few things...... I will be over there in 30 minutes.”","[Alright, I’ll be waiting then.]","After a brief exchange to end the call, Kuromueina let out a loud sigh once more before turning to Illness and speaking.","[......Thank you, Pandemonium-chan. I’m sorry for troubling you.]","[No, please don’t worry about iiiiiiit~~]","[Seriously, that was really mean of her. Even though she already knew I was looking for her, she wouldn’t show up unless I contacted her.]","[In a waaaaay, that’s just like Shalltear-sama, isn’t iiiiiiiit?]","[......Well, you’re right.]","****","After thanking Illness and parting ways with her, Kuromueina took a short stroll around the area. Arriving in one of the royal capital’s plazas, she sits down at the edge of the fountain in the center and pulls out a paper bag.","[......You want some?]","[Well then, I’ll gladly have one.]","As Kuromueina held out the paper bag to her left, the view around that area blurred and Shalltear, dressed in the robes of the Phantasmal King, appeared. Although there are quite a few people in the plaza, no one is aware that the two are there due to Shalltear’s powerful Recognition Inhibition Magic.","Shalltear took off the hood of her robe and putting the baby castellas she had received into her mouth, she sat down next to Kuromueina.","[Rather, Shalltear. Isn’t it about time you properly set up your base of operations? It’s troublesome to look for you every single time......]","[I’ll give it some positive consideration and handle it carefully.]","[That reply means you’re not gonna do it, right?]","[Now, now, can I ask what your business with me is?]","[I have some information I’d like to sell......]","[Fumu.]","The two exchanged some information, and when that exchange was over, Kuromueina looked at the city people and muttered.","[......Hey, Shalltear.]","[What is it?]","[Lately, I feel like a lot of things just don’t quite mesh. Not personally or anything like that, but the world as a whole......]","[Ah~~ It’s been almost a thousand years since the Treaty of Friendship...... but the stagnation that comes after development has shown itself, right?]","[Unnn. It could be seen a few times back in the Demon Realm...... but at best, it would just be the situation turning stable.]","It’s now evening, and Kuromueina looks a little sad as she gazes at the somewhat melancholic scenery dyed with the reddish tint of the skies.","[......Shalltear...... Is the Summoning Magic Circle still in the same place as it was in the past?]","[Unnn? Yes, the location has never changed.]","[......When would the accumulation of magic power for the magic circle end?]","[It has already ended. I say one year for clarity’s sake, but in reality, the magic circle will be available for use again in about 350 days. Asking about that, is something the matter?]","[......No, it’s nothing. I was just...... a little curious.]","[......I see.]","Seeing Kuromueina’s expression, which seemed to be filled with various thoughts, Shalltear seemed to have realized something...... She didn’t speak of it though, but just silently watched the same sunset that Kuromueina was watching.","A few days later, Kuromueina’s hand poured an excessive amount of magic power into the Summoning Magic Circle...... and the “World’s Singularity” appeared.","****","[Twenty-one years old!? Are you sure?]","[Yes. Since the information came from Pandemonium, there should be no mistake......]","Hearing the report from her subordinate, Pandora, Shalltear asked back with an unusual look of genuine astonishment. Of course, her reacting like that isn’t that strange. In the past thousand years, not a single otherworlder in their 20s has been summoned.","The Summoning Magic Circle, regulated by the God of the world, Shallow Vernal herself...... Not only an increase in the number of people summoned, there’s also an Irregularity that should never have appeared. And because she knows exactly what caused this incident to appear, Shalltear is a little troubled. After gathering her thoughts for a few moments, she called Pandora.","[......Pandora, I will take care of this matter.]","Phantasmal King’s Head Subordinate, Pandora...... is the only one whom Shalltear, who has more than a billion subordinates, has allowed to act on her behalf. She has a few personality problems, especially with matters regarding her private life, but other than that...... Especially when it comes to her professional life, she’s a very capable person.","Therefore, she understood exactly what she needed to do with only a few words Shalltear told her.","[Understood. Well then, until instructed otherwise, I will act as the Phantasmal King No Face.]","[Yes, I’m counting on you. Also, this matter is of the utmost importance.]","[Hahh. I will make sure that no more information than necessary is conveyed to the executives.]","Pandora doesn’t need detailed instructions or explanations. Hence, Shalltear told only the bare minimum before disappearing from the scene, and Pandora, clad in the robes of the Phantasmal King, began to act as No Face.","****","Kuromueina was walking down the streets of Symphonia’s royal capital with a slightly guilty look on her face. The reason she’s visiting Symphonia’s royal capital is to get information about the otherworlders who have been additionally summoned this time.","She intends to support the otherworlders to the best of her ability that had been summoned due to her own selfishness. Depending on the situation, she was even thinking of bowing down to Shallow Vernal and making arrangements so that they can return to their original world without having to wait for that one-year period. As soon as the chaos on Symphonia’s side calms down, she intends to meet with the country’s King and ask him about the situation of the otherworlders, so she’s currently walking around the royal capital, waiting to hear from the family that came with her.","In the midst of her walk, Kuromueina...... sensed the presence of “a fragment of her own magic power”. As if guided by it, she moved and arrived at the plaza...... where, by chance, she found a young man sitting in the same place she had been sitting when she had her conversation with Shalltear a few days ago. Her first instinct was to feel guilty about the young man who held a fragment of her magic power...... but that feeling was soon overshadowed by another emotion.","She, Kuromueina once told Shallow Vernal...... that “among her baby birds, a special child to which she would feel that spark will appear”, and that “meeting with him will feel like destiny”......","Yes, she certainly felt it at that moment. She found it difficult to describe...... but she had a feeling that the young man in front of her could be the “special” person for her.","[What’s wrong? You look like you’re in trouble.]","And thus, the world that had been on the verge of stagnation began to move in a big way, gaining a gear known as the Singularity...... “Miyama Kaito”, the Heart of the Story......"]},{"number":1311,"title":"Chapter 1311 - Founding Festival - Noon 2","paragraphs":["Ariel-san and Tir-san, who seemed to have noticed us, continued to dance and play their instrument without doing anything else.","With each of Ariel-san’s significant actions, magic birds resembling hummingbirds manifested, and their numbers steadily increased. Just before Ariel-san disappeared behind the increasing number of birds, Ariel-san struck a decisive pose and the birds simultaneously flapped their wings into the air.","However, one of them flew underneath us......","[......Those are...... World coordinates?]","[Does that mean she wants us to meet up there?]","Cento-san and Cien-san muttered to each other as they looked at the world coordinates displayed after the magical bird changed its shape. It seemed like calling out to each other here would cause a commotion, so they decided to talk to us in a different location.","This was honestly very helpful. I felt uncomfortable ignoring them when I already saw them, so I wanted to say my greetings...... but it would be difficult to do that by breaking through that crowd.","[It looks like the dance is over...... In that case, should we go to those coordinates? Do you mind if I ask you two to help us out again?]","[Yes, please leave it to us.]","Cien-san nodded vigorously at my words, and immediately afterward, a magic circle appeared at my feet and the scenery changed. The place we arrived in was like a little open alleyway, and there were no people other than us.","[There’s a barrier that wards off people here huh.]","[Ahh, I see, so that’s why there are no people around.]","I remember this being used back in that incident with Dr. Vier. It’s a barrier that keeps people out of a certain area. As expected, setting up something like that in a plaza or a park would be a nuisance to others, so they chose this back alley-like location?","As I was thinking about that, after few moments, light shone in front of us and Tir-san and Ariel-san appeared.","[Kaitokun-san~~ Hello!]","[Hello, Tir-san. Ariel-san too, hello. What a coincidence, meeting you there.]","[Greetings...... In other words, hello. Coincidence it may be, but it’s inevitable...... In other words, it may have been a coincidence that we met there, but we were going to go to your stall, so we would have met sooner or later.]","After returning their greetings, Tre-san and the twins also gave their greetings. However, they said something I couldn’t help but be curious about.","[You were going to go to my stall, does that mean you were planning to go there?]","[That’s right. After Kaitokun-san told us about your baby castellas, we were on our way to your stall to buy some.]","[......How did that lead you to dance there though?]","[An inevitable incident...... In other words, there were circumstances that we couldn’t avoid. It would have be difficult for us to make it in time...... In other words, as a result, we weren’t going to make it in time before Kaito takes your break. Plan change...... In other words, we decided to go in the evening.]","[Circumstances that you couldn’t avoid?]","I wonder what that is? Since both of them are famous, is it something like people noticed them and that they couldn’t refuse their requests?","It seems that there are deep circumstances to it, as Tir-san repeatedly nodded with a mysterious expression on her face at Ariel-san’s words.","[Yes. We couldn’t avoid it. Tir and Ariel were on our way to Kaitokun-san’s stall...... when Tir and Ariel’s passion went boom!]","[U- Unnn?]","Arehh? She started saying something out of my expectations?","[An explosion of passion...... In other words, just as Tir said, our passion swelled out so much and exploded. The magic power in the atmosphere...... In other words, the festive atmosphere around us whispered to us to dance. No other choice...... In other words, we had no choice but to dance.]","[Right, right! The festival was so lively that Tir and Ariel wanted to join in. And so, we went to the small plaza over there where people were dancing and playing their instruments as they pleased, and Tir and Ariel joined in. Then, more people showed up than we expected.]","[I- I see......]","There was no deep reason at all!? The only reason they were dancing was simply that the festive atmosphere made them want to dance.","[However, because of that, we unfortunately couldn’t make it in time to visit your stall.]","[Ahh...... I have some left in my magic box, so if you’d like, I can sell these to you.]","[Is that alright? That would be great!]","[Gratitude...... In other words, thanks. Great anticipation...... In other words, I’m really looking forward to eating them.]","[We have regular and chocolate-filled baby castellas, how much do you want to buy?]","[Tir can’t eat much, so I’m going to share with Ariel. That’s why, we’re just going to buy one of each~~.]","[Understood.]","Taking out a regular and chocolate-filled bag of baby castellas from my magic box, I gave the bags to both of them after receiving payment.","[Kaitokun-san, thank you! I’m really looking forward to eating them.]","[Once again, gratitude...... In other words, thank you for your thoughtfulness.]","A little after thanking me with a smile, Tir-san curled up her body to a ball and her body started quivering. I tilted my head, wondering what was going on, but Tir-san then spread out her arms, looking like she was about to fly in the air.","[......Uwooooohhh! The passion of Tir and Ariel, I could still feel it in Tir’s body!]","[Agree...... In other words, I agree, Tir. Unstoppable passion...... In other words, the passion within my body is about to explode. The throbbing of passion...... In other words, let’s dance the day away.]","[Yes!!! Kaitokun-san, Tir and Ariel will go back to the plaza in the Northern Area to dance again!]","[I- I see, do your best.]","[Yes! I’m going to eat baby castellas with Ariel another time. Well then, see you later, Kaitokun-san~~ Let’s go, Ariel!]","[Acknowledged...... In other words, I understand.]","And so, the two cheerfully teleported away. From the way they talked, I guess they went to play their instrument and dance again. W- Well, if they were exploding with passion, then it can’t be helped...... I guess?","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Even they sometimes go out of control huh...... Well, that’s still cute when you compare them to Phantasmal King’s subordinates.]","? ? ? : [If you compare them with people with poor reputation, of course, they would look cute.]","Serious-senpai : [No, we’re talking about your subordinates here, okay!?]"]},{"number":1312,"title":"Chapter 1312 - Founding Festival - Noon 3","paragraphs":["Seeing off Ariel-san and Tir-san went fine and all, but you can say that the situation went a little off our plans.","[......I wonder where this place is?]","[Hmmm, world coordinates and stuff like that’s really difficult, so I don’t really understand them. Cento, where are we?]","[Errr, according to the map, this place is near the Western Area, a little far from the place we were before.]","We had opened our stall in the Southern Area, and since we were heading to the ceremony venue earlier, we would of course be along Southern Main Street.","However, judging from the map Cento-san laid out, this location is closer to the ceremony venue than the place we were just now.","Although we would now instead be walking through Western Main Street instead of the Southern one, it feels like the distance has considerably shortened.","[It’s a coincidence, but the ceremony venue is closer to where we are now, so it’s rather convenient.]","[Right. We could just return with Teleportation Magic, so the route we go through doesn’t really matter. Then, how about we head to the Central Area from this street?]","[I think that’s a good idea. We’ve been able to shorten the distance and have more time in hand, so it looks like we’ll be able to take up our shift at a leisurely pace.]","It seems that the situation with Ariel-san and Tir-san turned out better than I thought, so we just moved along the Western Main Street and started walking.","Until just now, we had been somewhat rushing to the ceremony venue due to the distance, but thanks to the extra time we’ve got, we had more time to see the various stalls than before.","Nevertheless, with how close we are to the ceremony venue, the number of people around certainly increased. There is something like a flowing motion in the traffic though, so it’s not like the place is packed like sardines......","As I had such thoughts in mind, walking while looking at the passing shops......","[......Ah.]","[....................]","[....................]","[....................]","Meeting eyes with a familiar face...... Elise-san, and at the moment we exchanged eye contact at a tremendous speed, with her business smile plastered on her lips, Elise-san shrugged.","Incidentally, if I were to put into words the eye contact exchange we had earlier, the emotions Elise-san conveyed......","“......Oi, Human-san. I’ve told you time and time again to not come here, haven’t I?”","“It’s a misunderstanding. It was seriously a coincidence! In the first place, I didn’t even know where Elise-san’s shop was!?”","“......I certainly haven’t told you that. Haahhh...... I underestimated Human-san’s strange luck too lightly. Rather, it may have been better if I told you where my stall is and told you not to approach...... That aside, it seems like you coincidentally showed up nearby......”","Just like that, it was finally decided that I’m innocent here. However, she really is skillful with throwing out specific emotions. What’s more, it’s terrifying how she kept that bright smile on her face the entire time.","Well, for the time being, I’ll just quietly get myself out of this place so as not to irritate her any further.","[Ahh, Kaito! That’s the fortune teller I saw at the White God Festival!]","[Geh...... Tre-san!?]","[I feel like this is fate! Alright, let’s stop by!]","Here comes an unexpected entry from Tre-san. No, it’s not like Tre-san had any ill intent with that suggestion. She just bought a fortune cookie back in the White God Festival, and she probably just remembered Elise-san.","In response to her words, Elise-san just sweetly smiled...... while throwing an overwhelming amount of complaints at me through my Sympathy Magic.","Seriously, how the heck could she maintain that smile while throwing all those emotions at me?","[Welcome.]","[Hello~~ Do you have something like a Symphonia Founding Festival-limited something here?]","[In that case, how would you like this one? This is a traditional flower amulet in Symphonia Kingdom. It was an item associated with the Founding Festival.]","[Heehh~~ It’s so beautiful.]","Indeed, at a glance, it looks like a corsage of small flowers, but the design and colors are inspired by the flag of Symphonia Kingdom, so it does feel like a commemorative gift for the Kingdom’s founding.","Special items like that can only be purchased on a day like this which stimulates the desire to buy it, so I think she’s really making good business here.","[Well then, since we’re at it, we’ll get four. Ahh, I’ll pay for them.]","[Yaaaay, thanks, Kaito~~]","[Here. Thank you for the purchase.]","Most of all, I made this purchase with the thought that I had to get our shopping here done and get out of here as soon as possible. I mean, seriously, Elise-san, even though she has such a smile on her face...... She’s really emanating that Get Lost Already aura.","I was afraid that if we stayed here too long, she would be very angry the next time I saw her, so I decided to finish our shopping here quickly and move on. Handing over the money and receiving the amulet......","[Here’s a decorative string as a freebie. Please use it to hang the amulet on the wall.]","[T- Thank you very much.]","After giving me beautiful strings as a freebie, I felt gentle emotions from her for a moment, asking me to hang out again, though not today and for another time...... though it immediately went back to that Get Lost Already emotion she had earlier......","Rather, she really is dexterous...... She’s a person who conveys her emotions skillfully and accurately.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Even though Elise-san looks like she’s a little harsh on Kaito, it looks like her Favorability levels are actually high.]","? ? ? : [Truth is that it actually is high.]"]},{"number":1313,"title":"Chapter 1313 - Founding Festival - Noon 4","paragraphs":["Although I happened to discover Elise-san’s store by chance, there was nothing else special that occurred, and we arrived at the ceremony site in the plaza in front of the royal castle.","The plaza in front of the castle was very large, and quite a few people had gathered here. There seemed to be some sort of entertainment going on, and although I couldn’t see much from here, I could see magical lights twinkling in the distance.","[I wonder what they’re doing over there?]","[I think they’re putting on a musical about the history of the country from its founding until now. It’s a standard performance, but it’s a very popular event.]","[Heehhh...... Tre-san sure is knowledgeable.]","[Hmph, you can count on me. I’ve studied this after all...... from a magazine!]","It may seem like she only had very shallow knowledge about this, but she definitely knew more than I did.","[I also saw a formation story performance like that at the White God Festival, so I wonder, are theater performances with this theme popular?]","[I think it’s easy to understand because it’s a unique event to the country, and since it’s about their own country, they have a lot of materials available for their story.]","[There aren’t that many events like this in the Demon Realm, so stories like this are a bit fresh to me.]","I think I understood why when I heard what Cento-san and Cien-san said. The Demon Realm isn’t divided into countries, so stories like this that talk about the origins of a country are probably new to them.","Lillywood-san’s Yggfresis is almost the size of a country, but I guess the natural features of the Demon Realm, or rather, the stance of its people may have been a factor in this.","[As expected, we can’t see the guest seats from here.]","[Hmmm, we’d have to go quite far forward if we want to be able to see that far, and as expected, floating here would be conspicuous, so doing that would be difficult.]","[Well, even if we don’t fuss about the musical, we can still have fun looking around the stalls in the plaza...... Even———– Eh?]","Immediately after, the sound around our surroundings disappeared. Tre-san, and even Cento-san and Cien-san stopped in place for some reason...... as if time itself had stopped......","[Sorry, Miyama.]","[Eh? Chronois-san?]","[There’s something I wanted to check, so I stopped time for everything except for yours.]","[A- Ahhh, I see...... That’s why this scene happened.]","I see, because time had stopped, it suddenly became as quiet as if sound had disappeared, and Tre-san and the twins had stopped in place...... I understand how this happened, but why did she suddenly stop time? She had something she wanted to check?","[......Errr, Chronois-san, what is it that you want to check?]","[No, well, do you want to see the ceremonial events up close, Miyama? If so, how about I bring you near the front row?]","[Ahh, no, it’s alright. In fact, I’m not really that interested in the event, and if I go to the front row, it will be difficult for me to look around the stalls.]","[Fumu, I see...... In that case, there should be no problem.]","[Thank you for your concern.]","[No, if Miyama suffers a disadvantage while I’m here, I’ll have no face to show before Shallow Vernal-sama...... If you yourself have no problem with this, then it’s good. Well then, I’ll take my leave. Sorry for the suddenness of the situation.]","As Chronois-san announced this, her figure disappeared and as sound returned to the surroundings, everything began moving again.","[......Unnn? Kaito, what’s up?]","[Ahh, no, how about we look around the surrounding stalls?]","[I guess so. Sounds like a good idea. However, I think there are too many people around us.]","[There sure are. Shall we go to another street then?]","If we just wanted to see the stalls, we didn’t really have to stick to the plaza. Just as Tre-san said, there certainly were many people around here, so it might be better to go to a more open place.","Well, that’s what I was thinking, but Tre-san shook her head.","[No, that isn’t the case. I don’t think we should do that, just in case we get lost...... You see, I’m quite an expert at that if I may say so myself.]","[......Tre-san saying that somehow has different persuasiveness to it.]","[......If you’re aware of it, we would have liked it if you could restrain yourself a little more......]","At Tre-san’s declaration, Cento-san and Cien-san, who have frequently experienced being strayed away from her on a regular basis, earnestly muttered.","But well, Tre-san being a bundle of positivity, not being bothered by her words, she just spoke with a smile.","[In other words, I think we need measures to prevent us from straying away from each other!]","[......Fumu. Well, I think you have a point, but what exactly are we going to do?]","[That being the case, I think we should hold hands! As expected though, four people holding hands side by side in a row would become a hindrance to other people, so Kaito and I will hold hands, while Cento and Cien will hold hands with each other!]","[......Errr...... What do you think, Cento-san, Cien-san?]","I understood the point Tre-san was trying to make. And Tre-san being Tre-san, I also know that she’s just saying this to go with the momentum. However, the problem is that if we refuse here, there’s a possibility that Tre-san really might get lost.","With that in mind, I asked Cento-san and Cien-san for their opinions as well......","[If possible, we would appreciate it if we could accept Esteemed Sister Tre’s suggestion......]","[In fact, ever since we took a break, we have just been making sure Esteemed Sister Tre doesn’t get separated from us......]","[......I understand.]","I don’t know if I should say that this is to be expected or not, but because of their usual experience, it seemed like they were also worried about the possibility of Tre-san getting separated from the group. In fact, they even got separated from each other back at the White God Festival......","That being the case, if we held hands and in the worst case scenario, if Tre-san gets lost, I will be with her, so it would be easy for me to contact the two of them.","[......You’re right. Well then, Tre-san. Shall we hold hands?]","[That’s strange. That doesn’t sound romantic or sweet at all, sounding more like a suggestion to hold hands with a small child so that they don’t get lost.]","[That’s exactly what it sounds like though......]","[Arehh? This isn’t going as I expected...... Well, it’s fine! Alright, let’s hold hands and go!]","Even with the fact that this was a measure to prevent Tre-san from getting lost, Tre-san is the same always, as without thinking too much about it, she held my hand with a bright smile on her lips and started walking away.","Even though she’s quite a bit older than me and quite tall, she really is like a child...... Well, I suppose that too is part of Tre-san’s charm......","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [She’s the type of person who makes her approach quite aggressively, but has a hard time bringing out that sweet mood...... I guess it’s because of her innocent, childlike personality?]","? ? ? : [Well, if Serious-senpai says that, I guess we can expect a sweet development anytime soon.]","Serious-senpai : [Wha!?]"]},{"number":1314,"title":"Chapter 1314 - Founding Festival - Noon 5","paragraphs":["Holding hands with Tre-san, we headed toward the stalls in the plaza. Seeing Tre-san happily walking next to me with a smile on her face, it made me feel strangely happy as well.","We had just eaten some Symphonia-yaki, and I had also eaten some of the food Tre-san had bought while we were at the stalls, so I wanted to focus on the stalls where we could play.","[Ahh, let’s go do that, Kaito!]","[Target practice huh...... Ahh, come to think of it, Tre-san is good at target practice, aren’t you?]","[Fufufu, you can count on that.]","At the White God Festival, Tre-san showed off her marksmanship skills. It’s just, well, it’s just like Tre-san to give the impression that she’s good at what she does, even though she said at the time that it was her very first time trying out a stall like that.","And so, I went to a target shooting stall with her and found out why she was so good at target shooting.","......Her reach is on a different level. Tre-san was taller and had longer arms and legs, so her gun was obviously closer to the prize than mine. Well, of course I still need to factor in one’s shooting sense, but I think this reach is a powerful weapon.","In fact, Tre-san was hitting the prize just as much as she did at the White God Festival, not quite 100 times out of 100, but she still hits 90% of the time.","[Fufun. You see that, Kaito? Aren’t I great?]","[You really are great at target practice.]","[Ehhen!]","Tre-san put the prizes she got in her magic box with a smug look on her face. The magic box is really convenient for times like this, as it saves us from having to carry our luggage.","After that, we took turns with Cento-san and Cien-san, and as I was watching them play target practice, my hand was suddenly pulled away.","[Look, look, Kaito. Isn’t that a stall from the other world?]","[......Target shooting is also from the other world though...... Heehhh...... Isn’t that Superball scooping? How nostalgic.]","[Oh, you’ve done that before?]","[Back then...... More than a decade ago.]","[Isn’t that pretty recent?]","[......I guess so.]","Speaking of which, even though she looks like that, Tre-san is well over 10,000 years old. Of course, if I talked about 10 years ago, that would be something very recent for someone with Tre-san’s senses.","Well, anyhow, it was a Superball scooping game. Moreover, it was a poi scoop...... I remember doing this when I was in grade school, we had to scoop balls with something like a dried rind poi, but this store uses a regular poi.","[Hey, let’s try it out.]","[I guess so. Let’s try it once then.]","[Alright, then, I’ll go first......]","[Tre-san, isn’t that a little too big? As expected, your scoop would tear......]","[It’s alright, it’s alright————- Ahh.]","[See that!?]","As soon as Tre-san received the poi, she tried to show off and scoop the biggest ball, but a big superball wasn’t going to be scooped by that no matter how you looked, as it certainly tore her poi scoop.","[......I thought I could do it when I’m filled with mysterious power.]","[I don’t think it’s good to rely on some sort of mysterious power.]","[It’s no good huh~~ Well then, go have your turn, Kaito, and let us reflect on our failures together.]","[Please stop assuming I will immediately lose.]","I’m sure I can scoop at least one...... I can, right? Alright, let’s aim for a smaller one. Let’s go about this carefully...... Arehh? There’s something strange about this superball, from the way it feels in my hand, it kinda feels heavier than it looks.","Is it dense, or is it the type with something inside...... Either way, it looks like my poi is going to tear.","[.....................]","[......Kaito, don’t get discouraged. Everyone has times when things around them go wrong, so don’t let defeat get to you.]","[Why the heck does you sound like you’ve won, Tre-san!?]","In the end, both Tre-san and I scooped zero balls, and the person at the stalls gave us one superball each as a consolation prize. Hmmm, because of the fact that Tre-san and I are both the same in terms of ability, I’m feeling quite heated, feeling some sense of rivalry against her.","[Hey, hey, Kaito?]","[Unnn? Did you find another stall?]","[No, Cento and Cien got lost.]","[......Eh?]","Tre-san’s words made me turn around in a hurry, but they really weren’t there...... They were supposed to have been behind us just a little while ago...... How did this happen? Ah, wait, that’s right! The two of them were playing target practice when Tre-san pulled me by the hand and we moved to the Superball scooping stall.","The distance between the stalls was just enough for us to see them, but because there were so many people, they must have lost sight of us and gone looking for us. Even now, I couldn’t see the two of them near the target shooting stall.","I heard that it’s difficult to detect magic power in such a crowded place, and in the first place, they wouldn’t be able to detect my magic power due to the influence of Shiro-san’s blessing.","[Well, it can’t be helped if we got separated! We’ll definitely end up meeting up with them soon, so let’s just go to the next stall.]","[W- Wait a moment. I’ll go contact the two of them...... Let’s go meet up with them first before going.]","Fortunately, Tre-san wasn’t the only one that got lost, and I’m here with her. If it had just been Tre-san, she would have just carefreely gone about and headed to the next stall, but since I was here, I could use a hummingbird to call for the twins and meet up with them.","That was really good. However, this sure is terrifying. We should have been paying attention to this, but we somehow slipped through the cracks of our consciousness and ended up naturally drifting apart.","No wonder the two of them, who were that powerful, lost sight of her so often. In a sense, Tre-san’s ability to slip through the cracks of people’s consciousness may be a talent of hers.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Indeed, a talent for covert actions...... Nah, there’s no way huh. She’s too boisterous.]"]},{"number":1315,"title":"Chapter 1315 - Founding Festival - Noon 6","paragraphs":["Fortunately, I contacted them via hummingbird immediately, so we were able to meet up with Cento-san and Cien-san right away. And now, Tre-san is currently being scolded by Cento-san.","[......Esteemed Sister Tre, I’ve asked you this time and time again, but why did you suppress your magic power when this happens? Being able to slip through mine and Cien’s Magic Detection requires considerable skill in concealment ability.]","[No, it’s not like I meant to suppress it...... I mean, I’m not good at detailed magic power control.]","Looking at the astounded Cento-san and Tre-san, who was curiously tilting her head, I started talking to the nearby Cien-san.","[......She suppresses her magic power when she disappears?]","[Yes, this happens every time for some reason. Moreover, Cento and I were her guards, so we almost never took our eyes off Esteemed Sister Tre. There are many High-ranking Demons who are engaged in such activities, but Cento and I both use magic to expand our field of vision to 360 degrees, so even if we turn our backs...... we should still be able to see Esteemed Sister Tre’s movements.]","[Errr......]","[This was the case for time too, as for some reason, as if she had been aiming at that moment, the moment our gaze leaves her the slightest, like when a passerby crosses between us, she disappears...... Moreover, the stealth ability after disappearing from our sight is dreadful. If it’s just the size of this plaza, Cento and I have the detection ability that even the location of a small bug is clear to us. Because this situation has been repeated lots of times already in the past, we make sure to detect everything around us, but for some reason, she’s still able to slip through all of them.....]","[Any chance she’s doing that on purpose?]","[I’d like to suspect that, but I don’t think she’s even conscious of it.]","Indeed, both Cento-san and Cien-san are Count-rank Demons, and such people normally wouldn’t lose sight of Tre-san, whose ability is almost the same as an average person, and even if they do, they should be able to find her immediately.","However, the fact that she always loses them means that she slips through all of their detection, including the magic power detection that should allow them to not miss a single insect within a 360-degree field of vision...... Is she a natural spy or what?","[It would have been great if she could go and develop that talent of hers in that direction.]","[It seemed like it was difficult for her to consciously do that though.]","[Hmmm, that ability now ended up being a nuisance and isn’t useful at all...... How troubling......]","If you look at the people around us, it would be a problem when she suddenly disappears, but because she couldn’t consciously use it, it’s also difficult to make effective use of it...... Rather than an expert spy, isn’t her ability turning her into an expert stray child?","Both Cento-san and Cien-san also know that Tre-san isn’t doing it maliciously, and with it something that happens unconsciously, it’s difficult to take measures against it.","As I was thinking about these, Alice suddenly appeared and told me with an astounded look.","[......From Alice-chan’s point of view, Tre-san has a talent for Recognition Inhibition Magic. If she can “train it”, her Recognition Inhibition Magic would be able to reach the level of mine.]","[Eh? Is that so?]","[Yes, just like Kaito-san’s Sympathy Magic, it’s an ability that she unconsciously activates. It must have been a coincidence that their gaze was cut off at first, but the fact that Cento-san and Cien-san couldn’t detect Kaito-san and Tre-san even when you were supposed to be at a nearby stall means that Recognition Inhibition has been activated.]","[......It’s amazing if she can use it well...... but that is if she can train it?]","[When she tries to consciously activate it, Tre-san is completely unable to use Recognition Inhibition. She’s at a level where even Kuro-san had given up on having her learn it, so she can seriously only use it while not being conscious about it......]","Recognition Inhibition Magic on the level of Alice’s...... In other words, she can use Recognition Inhibition that can even deceive the Six Kings, but she wasn’t able to use it as she pleases and was only able to use it when she wasn’t conscious of it...... It’s too troublesome.","She really is a professional stray child......","[That’s why Kuro-san had been giving Tre-san special accessories to keep track of her movements. The necklace that Kaito-san got is the same type...... That’s why Kuro-san was able to know Kaito-san’s movements.]","[I see......]","It was because this necklace was originally made for Tre-san huh......","[......Can’t Cento-san and Cien-san find Tre-san with these accessories though?]","[That’s impossible for them. They are made in a way that in exchange for being able to brush aside all Recognition Inhibition abilities, you wouldn’t be able to detect the location of these accessories unless you have magic techniques on the level of Kuro-san. Lowering the performance of these accessories would make it so other people could also detect it, which means that Tre-san may be in danger of being captured by someone.]","Tre-san is only a strong character when it comes to getting lost. I think it would be better if we just physically tie her up with a rope or something, but well, it’s terrifying how even if we do that, she would probably be able to somehow slip away.","[When her Recognition Inhibition activates, it would be on my level, so even with Cento-san and Cien-san’s strengths, it’s impossible for them not to lose sight of her...... Tre-san is a genius at being a lost child.]","[.....A genius at something you wouldn’t want to be.]","[......Indeed, it’s hard to scold Esteemed Sister Tre either since she really had no bad intentions about it.]","At Alice’s mutterings, Cien-san and I agreed and continued to look at Tre-san with astounded eyes as she was being scolded by Cento-san.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Thinking about it again, since she went out of her way to make such an accessory...... even Kuro might lose sight of her if she lets her guard down.]","? ? ? : [She really gets out of her sight as if she suddenly disappeared, so Cento-san and Cien-san are both having a hard time.]"]},{"number":1316,"title":"Chapter 1316 - Founding Festival - Noon 7","paragraphs":["After Cento-san and Tre-san finished talking, or rather, after Tre-san finished getting scolded, we went back to going around the stall in the plaza again, when we came across a strange stall.","It was a stall with red and blue doors, but I have no idea what kind of stall it was.","[Tre-san, do you know what that stall is?]","[Ahh, that’s a maze stall. When that door is opened, it becomes a space created by Space-Time Magic which leads to several doors that were just like that, and it feels like you would pass through them one after another. The prizes in the last room seem to be different depending on which rooms you pass through.]","[Heehhh...... So there are stalls like that huh.]","[Since we’re at it, why don’t we try it out? It can be entered with pairs, so Kaito and I will enter together, while Cento and Cien would be another pair.]","[Indeed. Since there’s an opportunity......]","A stall that was created because Space-Time Magic exists...... It’s a simple one with you just selecting the doors you will go through, but it certainly isn’t strange for an attraction.","Since we’ve come across a stall like this, I would like to try it out, so after we paid the entrance fee, we tried challenging the maze stall.","[......Well then, let’s take turns choosing doors. You go first, Kaito.]","[Hmmm, let’s go with the red door then.]","[Alright, let’s go~~]","Inside, there was a square room with three doors in it, one in front, and two on both sides, and it seems like these would be the doors we will be selecting in. Although it’s somewhat a maze-like in structure, it isn’t really a maze, as if you apparently go through some doors a certain number of times, you will always get to the goal.","[How many doors have we opened now?]","[Hmmm, I think we’ve gone through 5 doors?]","[I see......]","As I watched Tre-san carefully choosing which door to pick, something suddenly came to mind. Since I’m now alone with Tre-san, I’ve got something I wanted to ask her.","[Tre-san.]","[Unnn?]","[I know it’s strange to ask this, but Tre-san often tells me about how it’s fate we met and let’s go out with each other, right?]","[That’s right? You feel like marrying now?]","[Nope.]","[That’s strange? That should have been the perfect moment———-]","Tre-san’s reaction was the same as usual, but for the time being, I’ll ask about that.","[Tre-san, what is it about me that makes you say that?]","[Eh? I wonder? I don’t know.]","[Eeeehhhh......]","[In other words, this is about that, right? It’s about what I like about Kaito. Unnn, I don’t know!]","As I looked at Tre-san, wondering if that is really something she should proudly say, Tre-san’s expression turned slightly serious and she continued.","[Well, I mean, even if I say that, Kaito and I have only known each other for a short time. That being the case, I don’t want to say I like this or that about Kaito when I clearly don’t know what I’m talking about.]","[......Fumu.]","[In the first place, that spark I felt when we first met was something I felt for the first time. I kinda felt that being together with Kaito would be fun. In fact, my hunch was right and I have fun being with you. It’s just, well, if you ask me how and why exactly I like you, I wouldn’t know what to answer.]","Saying this with a fun smile on her lips, Tre-san chose a door and opened it. Holding hands with her and entering the next room, and while I looked at the three doors in front of us, Tre-san continued.","[Emotions are something difficult to understand. Even if you know you like something, wouldn’t it be difficult for you to explain it specifically?]","[Now that you mentioned it, it certainly would be difficult to give a detailed account of the reasons why I like something.]","[Unnn, unnn. That’s why, wouldn’t it be alright to say “I kinda like you”...... At least, for now......]","Nodding to the words Tre-san calmly said, I also chose a door and opened it. An explanation of the emotion called like...... It certainly may be difficult to explain.","I think I can say I like a person because of this and that, but it may be difficult for me to concretely explain it in detail.","[It feels comfortable talking with you, so I kinda like you. It’s fun being together with you, so I kinda like you. I can compete with you on the same level, so I kinda like you...... I think it would be good if I could slowly build up these small likes within my heart. And so, when I think I’ve learned a lot about Kaito by accumulating all of these, I think that would be the time I could say what I like about Kaito.]","[......I see.]","Tre-san seemed to be thinking about me more seriously than I thought, and her words asking me to marry her or go out with her weren’t just practical jokes, and realizing this, how should I say this...... I feel a little ticklish and glad.","[Fuuu, well, I don’t think Kaito should be in a hurry. Even if you don’t rush yourself, you’d soon be madly in love with my overflowing adult charm!]","[Hmmm, even if I do fall madly in love with Tre-san in the future, I don’t think the reason would be that adult charm.]","[Eh~~!? I mean, I’m the neighborhood onee-chan, you know? The good-for-nothing onee-chan with 100,000 Sis Power, you know?]","[What’s with that Sis Power?]","[Look, it’s just like how Sis Ei often describes people with Maid Power, so wouldn’t it be okay if there’s also stuff like Sis Power and Onee-chan Aura?]","Hearing her argument, I couldn’t help chuckling. How should I say this...... She really is a pleasant person...... and just like Tre-san said, being together with her is fun.","[I recommend you make your advance through a different route. Tre-san doesn’t really feel like someone older......]","[W- What did you say...... If you say such things, I’ll eventually awaken my Sis Power and have you regret my words!]","[What will happen when it awakens?]","[No clue!]","[If the person herself doesn’t know, that doesn’t seem like it would be anything good then.]","[No good huh~~ How unfortunate.]","[Ahaha.]","Even though I hardly have any expectations with her Sis Power awakening or even that adult charm of hers...... but I already think that Tre-san was an attractive woman, enough that I feel like I could like her even more than I do now.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Ghaak, a sudden surprise attack...... The destructive power of a normally easy-going character, earnestly conveying her affection is quite strong......]"]},{"number":1317,"title":"Chapter 1317 - Founding Festival - Noon 8","paragraphs":["Leaving the stall, we meet up with Cento-san and Cien-san. At the end of the final door we ended up in was a wooden mask, which I suppose is our prize.","It looks like it’s built well, something that should be reasonably pricey...... Is it a mask of some ethnic group? It does look a little eerie. Well, Tre-san just wore it without hesitation though......","It seems that Cento-san and Cien-san got a bag containing an assortment of sweets. In terms of value, what we got is probably better, but I personally feel that it would have been better if we also got an assortment of sweets...... Well, Tre-san seemed to be happy with the mask, so I should just give it to her.","[We still have some time left, but what do you want to do? Should we go back to check out the stalls, or should we use Teleportation Magic and check out the stalls somewhere else......]","[Hmmm, most of the places we’ve gone to were ones I like, so I think we should go where Kaito, Cento or Cien want to go.]","[I don’t really have any particular places in mind, but what about you, Cento-san, Cien-san?]","Or rather, up to this point, it was either me or Tre-san who decided and Cento-san and Cien-san would follow, so if it’s possible, I would like Cento-san and Cien-san to express their wishes.","Well, it’s not like I would force them to say where they would like to go, so if they don’t have any plan in mind either, we could just go around randomly......","[......If Cien doesn’t have a place in mind, I would like to go to the Eastern Street......]","[Eastern...... Ahh, I see. I couldn’t really think of any place I’d like to go, so if it’s possible, let’s go to the Eastern Street......]","Cento-san somewhat hesitantly said that she wanted to go to the Eastern Street, and Cien-san, seemingly realizing something, recommended where Cento-san wanted to go.","[Alright. Well then, let’s go to the Eastern Street then...... Is that okay with you, Tre-san?]","[Unnn. However, what’s up with the Eastern Street?]","I was also curious about the reason why Cento-san mentioned the Eastern Street, but it seems that Tre-san herself doesn’t know about it, curiously tilting her head.","At this question, the one who answered was Cien-san, not Cento-san.","[I think it’s because there are many shops on the Eastern Street that sell handicrafts.]","[Ahh~~ I see! You’re talking about ceramics huh! Cento likes ceramics after all.]","[Yes...... At events like this, I may be able to find rare articles......]","Seemingly convinced after hearing Cien-san’s words, Tre-san nodded, to which Cento-san nodded a little shyly. I see, pottery huh...... It was a genre I personally have no clue about, so I haven’t thought about that at all.","[Heehhh~~ Cento-san likes pottery huh.]","[Unnn. She has quite a collection. I don’t know much about them...... but is stuff like that also famous here in Symphonia?]","[Symphonia Kingdom is famous for its Five-Colored Pottery. Just as its name suggests, it’s pottery that makes use of five colors, green, yellow, red, purple and blue, and they use it for both their clayware and ceramicware. Its vibrant and bold colors make it hold quite the presence, so not only could they be used as utensils, but they could also be decorations.]","Is that so, I didn’t know about that. I mean, I don’t remember going to the Eastern Area that much. I often go to the Southern Area where there are many shops and the Northern Area where theaters and stuff were, but I don’t really think I have been around the Eastern and Western Area.","This is also the first time I’ve heard of Five-Colored Pottery. The tableware at Lilia-san’s mansion is basically white, so I think Lilia-san probably just doesn’t have much interest in ceramics.","As for anyone else who may seem knowledgeable about ceramics...... Wait?","[......Unnn? Kaito, you’re pondering over there, what’s up?]","[Ahhh, no, when I heard about ceramics, I just remembered how Nebula talked about buying a kiln for pottery.]","[Kiln? That’s quite the orthodox one. I have also visited pottery workshops myself, and made some several times but......]","[She had been looking very carefully at various places. She was apparently looking to buy a special magic kiln.]","I’m not that interested in pottery myself, so I just ignored it...... but I remember Nebula and Illness-san explaining it to me.","It seems that it will take some time from order to completion, so they haven’t set it up yet...... but in the not-too-distant future, a kiln will appear in our backyard.","[Apparently, something about a kiln that can be adjusted in seven stages or something like that.]","[Are you talking about the Seven-Point Special Magic Power-Kneading Kiln!?]","[Errr, it’s probably that...... Is that something expensive?]","[Of course, it’s expensive, but more importantly, it’s a kiln that is famous for being quite difficult to handle. If you can master it, you can certainly make really subtle adjustments to the baking of your pottery, but that kiln isn’t something one can easily use unless they’re very skilled, so there aren’t many pottery workshops that have it installed.]","Cento-san, who loves pottery, seemed to be surprised when she heard what I said, so it must be a really high-level kiln. Normally thinking about it, just casually using that wouldn’t allow you to master it...... but if it’s Illness-san and Nebula, I feel like they can somehow do it.","[......Once their product is complete, I’d like to see it too.]","[Unnn, I’ll tell the two of them about it, so when the opportunity comes, come and visit us again.]","Didn’t they mention something about making teacups? I really feel like if it’s the two of them, they would make something amazing. It may just be seeing the creations of my family very favorably, but the wooden cups they sometimes make are of a fairly high level, so I guess I can expect their ceramic cups to be great?","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [In addition, according to Lilia, who is a noble, those wooden cups were on a level that it wouldn’t be strange if they were displayed at the Royal Art Gallery......]"]},{"number":1318,"title":"Chapter 1318 - Founding Festival - Noon 9","paragraphs":["As we headed towards the place Cento-san wanted to go to, the Eastern Street, I suddenly got curious about something, so I turned to Cento-san and Cien-san, and there I saw the two of them faithfully holding hands just like Tre-san and I, looking somewhat heartwarming.","[Speaking of which, Cento-san likes ceramics, but what about you, Cien-san? Do you have hobbies?]","[Yes. I’m actually a bit like Cento, as I also collect handicrafts.]","[Cien likes glassware.]","[I see.]","Cento-san likes ceramicware, while Cien-san likes glassware. From what I’ve heard, both of them seem to be collecting them, so I guess you can say that collecting handicrafts is their hobby.","[In my case though, I prefer to collect glassware that can be displayed rather than those that can be used as tableware. Although I’m an amateur like Cento, I have made glass work several times.]","[Cien is good with her hands, so her glasswork is also wonderful. Miyama-san, if you have the chance, please check out Cien’s works.]","[I’m looking forward to it. If the opportunity comes, I’d like to do that...... Is there no glassware on the Eastern Street though?]","Since we still have some time to spare, I thought it would be nice if we could also look around for glassware that Cien-san likes, but judging from the expression on Cien-san’s face, she doesn’t seem to be very enthusiastic.","As I was wondering if there weren’t a lot of glassware on the Eastern Street, Cien-san explained.","[......Symphonia Kingdom is famous for their ceramics, but the quality of their glassware is a little lower than in the other countries.]","[Ahh~~ I see, each country has their own characteristics after all.]","[Yes. When it comes to glassware, the one good at them would be the Archlesia Empire. Blacksmithing was originally a prosperous industry in that country, so their glasswork was also quite developed, having a considerably deep history in that industry. Hydra Kingdom has many avant-garde and gorgeous works, which are also quite wonderful. However, Symphonia’s glassworks don’t really have those characteristics...... Of course, there are some good ones that appear sometimes but......]","Archlesia Empire has many mines, so I can certainly picture them having good glass products. Hydra Kingdom is a country that is at the forefront of trends in various fields, so they must have innovated a lot when it comes to glasswares.","[Since the Symphonia Kingdom is rich in greenery, the woodcrafts here are strong. Just as Cento mentioned earlier, it’s also famous for pottery because Symphonia can produce good soil.]","[Well, Kaito, it’s that, you know? That’s just something Cien, who is knowledgeable about this matter says, and if it’s people with knowledge about them on our level look at Symphonia’s glassware, I think they’re good enough.]","[It certainly is difficult to determine the quality of handicrafts. In my world, there were these people called appraisers, but are there any like that in this world?]","[Unnn. There are...... The Appraisal Organization is a large organization that appraises the quality of various items under the jurisdiction of the Phantasmal King’s subordinates, so people who want to appraise things basically consult them.]","Heehhh...... Now that she mentioned it, I think I’ve heard of an organization like that...... As expected, talking about things I don’t normally get to know about is fresh and interesting.","[What about you, Tre-san? Are you also collecting something too?]","[Do you think I’d be able to properly manage something like that?]","[I don’t think so.]","[That’s your answer then.]","[......I see.]","Well, even if it’s simple to collect stuff, managing them and not having any knowledge about them is rough, so collecting stuff really isn’t that easy. I don’t think I can do it either...... Thinking of Lilia-san’s hobby of collecting dragon models though, I think collecting stuff like that would be interesting......","However, I don’t really think I have anything I really want that I can pour my passion into...... Well, I guess that’s just something you can’t force.","[How about you? Do you have a hobby, Kaito?]","[Hmmm, if I had to say one, it would be reading, and then taking care of Bell and Lynn.]","[Ahh~~ That certainly feels like something you’re particular about.]","[......You can tell?]","[Unnn, unnn. Bell-chan’s hair is fluffy, while Lynn-chan’s scales are shiny.]","[That’s right. I recently bought several types of brushes for Bell, but it seems like I would have to swap brushes depending on the weather. It seems like it has something to do with humidity......]","As expected of Tre-san, it seems like she has an eye for the good stuff. Yes, I also think Bell’s hair has become more and more fluffy lately.","Although this might sound like I’m tooting my own horn, I feel that my brushing skills have improved. I used to use 3 types of brushes, but I now make use of 7 different types of brushes, and the feel of Bell’s fur is something I’m really proud of.","I’ve also recently bought a special brush for finely polishing Lynn’s scales. It seems that you would need something different when brushing a Dragon, as you would need something with an appropriate stiffness so that the scales will not be scratched, but will properly remove the dirt, so it’s difficult to choose a brush.","[Fufu, seeing Miyama-san being this talkative about something is unusual.]","[You really must like doing that.]","Seeing me talking about Bell and Lynn to Tre-san, a heartwarming smile, just like what I had earlier, appeared on Cento-san and Cien-san’s lips.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Indeed, when you’re talking about Kaito’s hobby, it has been his hobby of taking care of his pets.]","? ? ? : [He’s pretty particular about their food and other matters related to his pets, so I can feel how much he dotes on them.]","Serious-senpai : [The way he reacts when the subject of pets is being talked about is also different......]"]},{"number":1319,"title":"Chapter 1319 - Founding Festival - Noon 10","paragraphs":["<Author’s Notes>","The manga’s Volume 7 will be released tomorrow, October 25th. Please check the official website in the Activity Report.","After entering the Eastern Street and walking around for a bit, I could feel that the atmosphere of the stalls here was different from that of the Central Area, where there was more food, as the Eastern Street was more lined with stalls related to handicrafts and the like.","It was an area with a unique atmosphere, lined with pottery, woodwork and other such items. According to Cento-san, Symphonia is considerably famous for its Five-Colored Pottery, and I got the impression that this place has a lot of pottery products.","[Is that area famous for its Five-Colored Pottery?]","[I suppose. That area indeed has a lot of Five-Colored Potteries, but that stall over there and a couple of others are from Hydra Kingdom. Some of them are traditional like the Five-Colored Potteries, while some of them are newly created, especially those referred to as Class Blue wares of the Hydra Kingdom.]","[I see...... From your point of view, Cento-san, are there any stalls that catch your eye?]","[As one would expect from a national festival, there’s a lot of good stuff around. I want some small plates...... That stall looked like it would be good.]","The stall that Cento-san indicated had plates of various sizes, all of which were colorful and beautiful. If it had piqued Cento-san’s interest, I wouldn’t have an objection to going there.","As we arrived at the front of the stall, I watched Cento-san looking at the plates with a serious expression on her face from a little distance so as not to disturb the other customers.","[......By the way, can you understand what it is that Cento-san was looking at, Tre-san, Cien-san?]","[No clue. I just think they’re beautiful.]","[I can understand it to some extent...... It seems that the Five-Colored Pottery that Cento mentioned pays particular attention to the vividness and balance of the colors of the pottery. It’s apparently not just about whether the colors are beautiful, but also about the balance with the other shades of colors......]","I see, shades of colors huh...... I guess my thoughts were the same as Tre-san. I think it’s beautiful, but I’m not sure exactly which ones and how are they beautiful.","Having such thoughts in mind, I absentmindedly watched Cento-san as she chose her plates, when I suddenly saw an acquaintance at the edge of my vision.","[Ahh, Tre-san, Cien-san, excuse me. I just saw someone I know, so I’m going to go say hello.]","[Unnn? Alright. Then, we’ll be right here in front of this stall.]","[I understand.]","It seemed like Cento-san would take some time to choose, so I decided to say hello to my acquaintance, and after notifying Tre-san and Cien-san, I started moving.","Even so, meeting her here was quite unexpected...... No, earthenware pottery may not really fit her image, but I suppose woodwork would really fit her.","[......Hello, Camellia-san. What a coincidence, meeting you here.]","[Oya? Kaito-san? Hello...... You really notice me well. It’s not often that someone I know finds me in a place like this......]","Yes, the person who I had noticed was Camellia-san, as she was looking at a stall with wooden cups and other items in it. Turning her head, Camellia-san lightly chuckled before gently smiling.","[However, I’m glad to see you like this. Thank you for your hospitality back at the Harmonic Symphony and the tea party after that.]","[No, it’s my pleasure.]","[......Ahh, we really shouldn’t be chatting around in front of a stall like this. Please wait a bit.]","After telling me this, Camellia-san bought two wooden cups that she had been looking at, and after storing them with Space-Time Magic, she moved with me to a place a short distance away from the stall.","[I had planned to stop by Kaito-san’s stall later, but I didn’t expect to meet you here. Were you here to buy some handicrafts?]","[Ahh, I came here not because of myself, but because Cento-san, who I was touring with, likes ceramics.]","[I see...... Speaking of which, you were running a stall with Tre-san and the twins, weren’t you?]","[Ahh, I see, you obviously would have known Tre-san and the twins. I should have brought them along.]","Camellia-san is also one of the Six Kings’ Executives and has lived quite a long time, so she must have interacted with Tre-san and the twins. Tre-san, in particular, seems to be on good terms with Tir-san, so she may have a lot of interactions with the other Executives.","[I don’t have a lot of interaction with Tre-san and the twins, but I did have the opportunity to meet them often. The ones who have a deep connection with Tre-san and the twins would be Tir-san and Jutia-san.]","[Ahh~~ I can certainly somewhat see how those two were compatible with Tre-san.]","Tir-san and Jutia-san, who are bright and sociable, certainly seemed like they would get along well with Tre-san, and I could imagine the three of them having a lively conversation.","[......Speaking of which, I’m changing the subject, but Eri mentioned how she would like to invite Kaito-san to her “Garden of Myriad Flowers”, so please tell us when you’re free.]","[I understand. Should I tell that directly to Rosemary-san?]","[Yes, she has been saying this for quite some time now, but if I just leave it to Eri, it seems like she won’t bring it up forever......]","[Ahaha, that certainly sounds like Rosemary-san.]","Rosemary-san is a rather reticent person, so I can certainly imagine her finding it difficult to invite me on her own.","After having a pleasant chat with Camellia-san for a while, I went back and met up with Tre-san and the twins again.","<Afterword>","? ? ? : [Speaking of which, Serious-senpai. Seems like you got executed by Shallow Vernal-sama on the manga Volume 7’s back cover.]","Serious-senpai : [......I hate her.]"]},{"number":1320,"title":"Chapter 1320 - Intermission: Otherworlders in the Founding Festival","paragraphs":["The Royal Capital of Symphonia Kingdom is bustling with people celebrating the kingdom’s founding. There were three figures walking along one of its streets. They were Akane, the Chairman of the Mikumo Trading Company, Frau, her maid and escort, and Kaori, the owner of a Set-Meal Restaurant in the Friendship City Hikari.","[Hmmm, this is amazing. The atmosphere here was different from the Festival of Heroes. The city where the Festival of Heroes is held doesn’t hold something like a Founding Festival, and since I was traveling around, I just wasn’t able to get the right timing, so this is the first time I’ve been to the Symphonia Kingdom while it’s celebrating its founding.]","[Hoh, since you mentioned Symphonia Kingdom, does that mean you’ve been to the festivals of other countries?]","[I’ve been to Archlesia Empire’s Imperial Festival. I’m indebted to the current Emperor Chris-san in various ways after all.]","[Oya oya, it seems like Kaori is also someone not to be underestimated. With you having connections with someone in the higher-ups, wouldn’t you someday be like Kaito?]","[That won’t happen, nor do I want that to happen. That will definitely pierce a hole in my stomach in the process......]","Hearing the words Akane happily said, Kaori responded with a wry smile.","[However, I don’t think I would have had the chance to come if Akane-san didn’t bring me. Teleportation costs are high after all.]","[Ahh~~ Now that you mentioned it, I have my own Teleportation Magic, but it does cost a lot to teleport from Friendship City to Symphonia’s Royal Capital. It would also take too much time if you had to ride a Flying Dragon Flight.]","[That’s right~~ I was lucky to make friends with Akane-san this year.]","Kaori was invited by Akane to come along with her to this year’s Founding Festival, and since the time they met through Kaito, they have been close friends due to the fact that they are from the same homeworld.","At that moment, Frau gently interrupted their conversation.","[......Kaori-sama. It’s good that you get along with the Chairman, but I’d like to caution you...... The person you’re talking with is someone way past the marriageable age.]","[Uwehh!?]","[Oi, Frau! Who the heck is way past the marriageable age!? I’m just, that, you know? That...... I’m married to my job.]","[Chairman, do you have a fever? Your job isn’t a living creature.]","[......Don’t take my words literally! It’s just a metaphor! Metaphor!]","Seeing Akane and Frau’s usual two-person comedy-like exchange, Kaori giggled, but seemingly reminded of something, she spoke.","[Speaking of which, Akane-san. Didn’t Kaito mention he’s opening a stall here?]","[Ahh~~ That’s right. I heard he’s selling baby castellas. It looks interesting, so why don’t we go check it out?]","[I agree. Ahh, but if it’s Kaito-kun’s stall, won’t there be a huge line over there or something?]","[Hmmm, I wonder? There’s a limit to the number of items that can be sold at a stall, and since there should be tons of baby castella stalls in this festival, I don’t think people will go out of their way to wait in line there.]","[I see~~ Then, any chance he was having some sort of bigwig manning the stall?]","[If that were the case, that might cause a commotion, but considering Kaito’s personality, I don’t think he would have someone famous pulling in customers.]","As Akane had guessed, Kaito’s stall isn’t that thriving. There certainly is word of mouth gradually spreading about how extremely tasty their baby castellas are, but Alice is manipulating the information so that there isn’t so much of a line and people aren’t crowding the stall.","In terms of bigshots, there is indeed Alice manning the stalls...... but they don’t know about Alice’s stuffed costumes, so even if they found it strange how the stall’s mascot is a strange stuffed animal, they will just think it’s Kaito’s hobby...... It leaves a regrettable impression on Kaito though.","[Akane-san, don’t you have a stall here of your own?]","[Hmmm, our company doesn’t really sell our merchandise like street vendors. That’s why, we aren’t used to opening shops in the form of stalls, and it would be a hurdle for us to make a profit. Even if we were to put up a shop just to enjoy the festival’s atmosphere like Kaito does...... The merchant blood in our people would just be too eager to pursue profits, so we can’t do things casually.]","[Fumu fumu, if you were to open a stall though, what kind of stall would you open?]","[Takoyaki...... is what I’d like to say, but I suppose as some sort of missionary work, I would have liked to open an okonomiyaki stall. I can still find some takoyaki stalls to some extent, but finding an okonomiyaki stall is really difficult.]","[Now that you mentioned it, I don’t think I’ve seen many okonomiyaki stalls. I like okonomiyaki a lot too...... I wonder if they used yakisoba in it? The noodles under the batter look delicious......]","Kaori was happily talking about okonomiyaki...... but when she heard Kaori talking about that part, Akane’s eyebrows twitched.","[......Wait a moment, Kaori.]","[Unnn?]","[Are you talking about Hiroshima-style Okonomiyaki or Modern Okonomiyaki?]","[Aren’t those two the same?]","[The same......? ......It looks like I should enlighten you what okonomiyaki is, Kaori.]","[......This is bad. I definitely must have stepped on a strange landmine...... Frau-san, help me.]","[Please prepare yourself, Kaori-sama. With Chairman like that, she would be talking quite a lot.]","[Uweehhhh......]","By the time Kaori realized her mistake, it’s already too late, as Akane began to explain about okonomiyaki passionately. It goes without saying that they were late to visit Kaito’s stall.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Incidentally, the main difference between Hiroshima-style Okonomiyaki and Modern Okonomiyaki is the cooking method. Hiroshima-style Okonomiyaki is grilled while layering the ingredients. Modern Okonomiyaki is more like Kansai-style Okonomiyaki, where the ingredients are mixed, then noodles are added, and then eggs are added. It’s hard to tell the difference from the outside, but it’s good to remember that the difference is whether or not the ingredients are mixed before they are grilled.]"]},{"number":1321,"title":"Chapter 1321 - Founding Festival - Night 1","paragraphs":["After looking around the festival with Tre-san and the twins, we returned to the place where our stall was set up and swapped shifts with Sieg-san and the others. From what I’ve heard, they had a certain amount of customers, but it didn’t seem like things got crowded and they were able to leisurely sell baby castellas.","After saying our thanks and taking our space back near the stall, our second shift is finally about to start...... but the place sure has more customers than in the morning.","There would probably be something like fireworks at night, so the number of visitors to the festival itself has increased.","However, it isn’t like the place is dizzyingly busy, just moderately busy enough for us to have fun. Customers don’t keep on coming to our stall all the time, and we can take a break from time to time.","In a sense, you could say that it was just the ideal business.","As we continued manning the store like that, familiar people suddenly came to the stall.","[Ohh, this is quite lively.]","[Akane-san, Frau-san, and Kaori-san too. You’ve come.]","[I invited Kaori. We’re here to visit Kaito.]","[I see...... By the way, why does Kaori-san look tired?]","Akane-san, Frau-san and Kaori-san visited our stall. I had heard that they had been on good terms with each other since they met through me, so I could understand them coming to visit together.","Akane-san is also good at Teleportation Magic, so it should be easy for her to bring her to the Royal Capital. That’s fine and all, but I’m curious why Kaori-san looked that tired.","[......Kaito-kun. Be careful...... Even if you don’t care about something, that doesn’t mean it’s the same case for others. Verbal slips happen exactly when you least expect it.]","[......I understand that something must have happened.]","[Some stuff happened. Just a passionate speech about okonomiyaki. A really passionate one......]","[I- I see......]","Kaori-san’s feeling tired, and that okonomiyaki...... I guess Kaori-san made some kind of verbal gaffe about okonomiyaki, and Akane-san, who is quite particular when it comes to okonomiyaki, passionately explained it to her?","It’s true that Akane-san is very particular about takoyakis, but it seems like that was also the case for okonomiyaki huh.","[However, your timing is perfect. There were a lot of customers until a while ago, so we’re rather free for a bit.]","[Heehhh...... Your stall is flourishing. For someone setting up a stall for the first time, that’s quite a big deal. Let’s see, this is———- tasty! Eeehhh, the heck is this, it’s too delicious......]","[Eh? That much? Gimme one———- It tastes so good! This is amazing, it’s like, the ingredients themselves were on a different level.]","The two who bought a bag of baby castella and ate it, and were shocked by the taste...... Well, I can understand how they feel. I was also surprised when I tasted it for the first time......","[......The ingredients used are crazy. It’s really good...... They’re on a level where I want to procure them, but they’re probably something you get somewhere outrageous, making it difficult for me to get them myself......]","[Excuse me, I’d like to have 10 bags of each kind please. Chairman will pay for me......]","[Oi, Frau. Why the heck are you nonchalantly pushing the bill on me!?]","Frau-san, acting the same as usual, seems to have decided to buy 10 bags of each kind at Akane-san’s bill, and orders while taking out her magic box.","Also, Akane-san complained...... but well, due to Akane-san’s personality, she’ll probably buy them for her in the end.","[......Well, putting aside Frau...... But Kaito. Is this cat in the bag your hobby? Isn’t this a bit...... no good?]","[Eh? You think so? I think it’s cute though...... Akane-san, this is what people call creepily cute.]","[I- Is that so? I think you could have picked something a little better than this..... No, the drawing is really great, but for you to even have a costume of this thing, isn’t this a bit too severe?]","[Eeehhh, it’s cute though! I even want to take a photo with it.]","Evaluations of Alice’s cat...... As for me, my evaluation would be the same as Akane-san, but Kaori-san seems to classify it as creepily cute, so it feels like she rates it relatively high.","Different people have different hobbies and tastes after all. As I had such thoughts in mind, the costumed Alice approached Kaori-san and tapped her shoulder.","[Eh? Over there? Look over there...... Peace sign? Errr...... Vee!]","At Alice’s urging, Kaori-san made a cute peace sign. She didn’t know what she meant, but after a few moments...... Alice took out a photo and handed it to Kaori-san.","[......Eh? Arehh? It’s a photo! It came out beautifully. There are photos in this world too huh!]","[Photo!? No, no, wait right there, Kaori. In this world, when it comes to photography, the magic tool for that was just developed recently, so it isn’t something readily available yet...... Ahh, no, well...... If it’s someone Kaito knows...... I guess it wouldn’t be strange for them to have it?]","[Incidentally, that guy’s the Phantasmal King.]","[ [ ! ? ! ? ] ]","I thought it would be rough if they found out about this later, so learning from my past experiences, I decided to tell them early on. Thereupon, Akane-san and Kaori-san opened their eyes wide in surprise, and only Frau-san quickly spoke.","[Phantasmal King-sama! I thought it was a wonderful outfit. The only one who spoke ill of your outfit is the Chairman, so if you’re going to judge someone, please have the Chairman......]","[Oi, Frau......]","She quickly cut off Akane-san in a refreshing way. As to be expected from Frau-san...... Well, Alice probably doesn’t really mind either, as when it comes to opinions, I’m of the same mind as Akane-san.","I think she just got happy that Kaori-san praised her costume, so she took a photo together with her.","<Afterword>","~ ~ Evaluation of Alice’s Costume ~ ~","Kaito: Creepy","Aoi: Somewhat strange","Hina: Adorably ugly","Lilia: I wonder if this kind of thing is popular in the streets?","Lunamaria: I want to have a plush of it","Sieg: I like normal cats, not costumes","Kuromueina: I think it’s nice that it has personality","Isis: ......Cute.","Lillywood: Is there any point in deliberately making it look suspicious?","Megiddo: Not interested","Magnawell: How odd......","Iris: She looks like a joke.","Kaori: It’s creepily cute, so I like it quite a bit","Akane: ......No, doesn’t that just look plain creepy?","Frau: If you can’t beat them, join them.","Makina: I think it’s just normally cute","Serious-senpai: I’m seeing ? ? ? ‘s black cat costume quite a lot, so seeing the normal version just makes me feel a bit strange."]},{"number":1322,"title":"Chapter 1322 - Founding Festival - Night 2","paragraphs":["For Akane-san and Kaori-san, it seemed like Alice...... the Phantasmal King being in a costume was quite a surprising matter, as they looked quite stunned.","Come to think of it, it’s rather well-known among the people I know, including Lilia-san and the others, but for those who don’t really know it, I guess they must have been questioning it quite a bit...... Why is the Phantasmal King wearing a stuffed costume and trying to draw customers in?","At any rate, Akane-san was shaking with a pale expression on her face, so I followed up with her.","[Akane-san, it’s alright. I’m generally in agreement with you after all, thinking that her outfit is more on the creepy side than it being creepily cute.]","[Isn’t that mean, Kaito-san!? I’m your cute lover, you know? Isn’t this the part where you give me a nice follow-up supporting me?]","[......Well, in my case, I’m just giving my evaluation including the person in the costume.]","[Why are you making it worse!?]","Alice started complaining, but I just ignored her.","[That’s why, you don’t have to worry about it at all, Akane-san.]","[E- Errr...... Is it really going to be alright? I’m not going to get killed, am I?]","[......Alice, isn’t society’s evaluation of you too horrible?]","[It’s a mystery, isn’t it? I pride myself on being a peace-loving and compassionate being, but it feels like I’m being feared a lot.]","The world’s opinion of the Phantasmal King is that she’s cool-headed and immediately terminates anyone she deems unnecessary. Having a different vector in the dangerous image compared to the War King and Death King, she is seen as a cold-blooded Guardian of Order.","In fact, from my point view, she seems rather stupid. However, considering the power she actually possesses, I guess such a reputation may be justified.","[......Rather, Kaito, what the heck are you making Phantasmal King-sama do!? This isn’t just on the level of being “bad for the heart”, you know!?]","[Inside the stuffed costume is Phantasmal King-sama? A- Ahaha, I had a photo with Phantasmal King-sama, I’m amazing...... Haha...... My stomach hurts.]","[See what you did!? Kaori now holds her stomach and is crouching down over there!]","[No, you might not believe me, but I’m not making her do that, and she’s just doing it on her own. I mean, she was usually wearing a stuffed costume......]","I had to clear up this particular misunderstanding at all costs. It isn’t that I’m forcing her to wear that costume, she’s just wearing that on her own.","However, as for whether they would believe what I’m telling them...... Considering that they don’t know Alice at all, I guess that would be doubtful.","[T- That’s mean, Kaito-san...... Not only are you forcibly ma————- Ouuuuuuuch!?]","[You, seriously, shut up.]","The idiot saw the opportunity and was about to make the situation complicated, so without hesitation, I smacked her head with Shiro-san’s special piko piko hammer. As for whether it has an effect if I hit her on top of her stuffed costume......","[......It doesn’t seem like Kaito’s lying, so I guess you’re being serious...... I mean, you’re that heated to explain it after all. Moreover, treating Phantasmal King-sama like that, you’re really outrageous......]","[Hmmm, he’s really a stomach-hurting kouhai...... By the way, Kaito-kun. I had been wanting to ask this earlier, but the people you’re with in your stall, aren’t they also amazing people?]","For the time being, I’m relieved that I somehow managed to make them understand, but looking at Tre-san and the others, Kaori-san anxiously asked.","[......Errr, these twins are Cento-san and Cien-san, and they’re Count-rank Demons.]","[......Kaori, this guy just said Count-rank as if it’s something very normal.]","[You become outrageous at the point when Count-ranks become something normal...... Though I guess that’s just like Kaito-kun......]","Now that you mentioned it, since Cento-san and Cien-san are Count-ranks Demons, they certainly would be really amazing people in the eyes of society.","This is bad, it feels like the Six Kings and people who should be big names became the norm for me. Even just holding a Peerage-rank was already quite amazing in the eyes of society, making them really amazing people, so I should really correct my senses here......","[And then, the tall one over there is Tre-san...... Errr......]","[Now. Come on, Kaito. You can always elevate me more with your introduction, you know?]","[......What kind of position does Tre-san have in the public eye? It doesn’t feel like she’s a big shot......]","Tre-san isn’t a Peerage-holder, nor is she a Six King Executive. She can use a special magic and do amazing stuff, but those weren’t really things I can tell others.","In that case, what’s her position in society? A Demon working in the Seditch Magic Tool Trading Company?","[Eh? Me? Hmmm. As for my position, I’m the “Special Advisor” for Seditch Magic Tool Trading Company’s Magic Crystal Department.]","[......Doesn’t that make you quite a big shot!?]","[Ehhen!]","Tre-san has such a position? I had never heard of this either. As I had such thoughts in mind, I spoke to Cento-san and Cien-san in a whisper.","[......Is Tre-san a pretty distinguished person?]","[The top of the company is Kuromu-sama, who is in charge of the entire trading company, followed by the Special Advisors for each department, and then the Chairman...... which is the same position as Esteemed Brother Sechs and the other members of the family working there.]","[The Special Advisor position is a bit special, and I won’t bore you with a detailed explanation, but to put it simply, it’s a position higher than that of the Chairman, Sei Riverstar.]","......Now that’s a rather shocking fact. If anything, that might have surprised me the most today. I- Indeed, Kuro’s family is made up of people like Dr. Vier and Funf-san, so it wouldn’t be strange for Tre-san to be in a high position...... Though perhaps, because of her character, I never really thought she would be in such a high position until now.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Indeed, considering the scarcity and usefulness of her ability, it’s only natural for her to be in a high position...... but as Kaito said, it’s surprising how she really didn’t have that kind of image.]","? ? ? : [Well, Tre-san isn’t actually involved in the management of the company, and her position is largely based on ability. Speaking of which, I’m changing the subject, but there are surprising people who didn’t know that my costume was that of a black cat...... Incidentally, in that Extra Chapter where Serious-senpai first appeared, it was written that I’m wearing a black cat costume. The costume I’m wearing in the manga is the usual one though.]"]},{"number":1323,"title":"Chapter 1323 - Founding Festival - Night 3","paragraphs":["Even after Kaori-san and Akane-san astoundedly left, the stall had a moderate number of customers. Camellia-san, who had said she would be coming earlier, also came and we chatted about various things, and somehow had a very enjoyable time at the stall.","[......I guess it’s almost time for the fireworks?]","[Ahh, I suppose. However, you can’t really see it from this stall, right?]","[Ahh~~ You’re right. It’s being hidden behind the building, so if we move a few distance from here and go to the main street, we should be able to see them......]","The sky was getting dark and it was almost time for the fireworks to start. I thought it would be magnificent, so I was thinking that I would like to see them, but I couldn’t just leave the store unattended.","As I was thinking this, Cento-san and Cien-san spoke.","[Since there’s an opportunity, why don’t Esteemed Sister Tre, Miyama-san and Cien go see it?]","[Since the customer traffic has settled down, I can handle the stall by myself, so why don’t Esteemed Sister Tre, Miyama-san, and Cento go and see the fireworks?]","[ [ .................. ] ]","Almost at the same time, both Cento and Cien suggested going to go see the fireworks while they take care of the stall by themself, and they exchanged looks with each other.","[......No, Cien should go. I have had my request fulfilled at noon after all.","[......Since that is something everyone agreed to, that isn’t worth considering. Cento should go.]","Both of them are good people, so they both seemed to think that they should stay and let the others have fun. Since they’re Tre-san’s escorts, as expected, it’s also not possible for both of them to stay......","Seeing their state, a thought popped into my mind and I called out to the two of them.","[Please wait, you two...... I will be the one staying here, so the three of you can watch the fireworks.]","[Miyama-san!? W- We can’t do that.]","[That’s right, if there’s someone who will stay, I will......]","[Alright! Well then, we’ll leave tending the stall to Kaito while we watch the fireworks~~]","[ [ Esteemed Sister Tre!!! ] ]","When I told them that I would stay behind and look after the stall, the twins hurriedly tried stopping me...... but at that moment, Tre-san carefreely agreed to my words.","As expected, Tre-san knows my thoughts perfectly, or rather, she reads the atmosphere well.","[Well, I know that you two are feeling tactful, but in a situation where either Cento or Cien gets left behind, Kaito would have murky feelings about it. In that case, he would rather just have us three sisters go ourselves...... Well, that’s about it, right?]","[Yes, and this is also somewhat my way of thanking you for going along with my suggestion.....]","[Uuuuu, when you put it like that...... You’re making it hard to decline.]","[Is Miyama-san alright with this?]","[Yes, everyone has gone to see the fireworks, so there will hardly be any customers, and when it gets busy, I’ll have that stuffed costume over there to help me......]","Yes, if I stay behind and it does get busy, Alice can help me out and we can handle things around here without any problems. Well, looking at the number of people around, it doesn’t look like that will be necessary......","I’m not sure if it was just that Cento-san and Cien-san also wanted to see the fireworks or not, but they complied with our persuasion and it was decided that the three of them would head off to watch the fireworks.","When they both agreed, Tre-san winked at me and I calmly gave her a thumbs-up. After all is said and done, Cento-san and Cien-san tended to support me and Tre-san, so I wanted to create an opportunity for them to have fun somewhere, so this opportunity was just right.","With Tre-san there, the two of them could enjoy themselves without any problems. Tre-san is also a person who could read the mood when necessary, so there’s no way she would just get lost at this point in time.","After sending the three of them off, I murmured while baking baby castellas.","[......Well, it does feel rough to do everything by myself......]","[In that caaaaase, until the three of them retuuuuuuurns, how about I help ouuuuuut?]","[Eh?]","Suddenly hearing a voice, when I turned my gaze up the iron plate, I saw a familiar person...... Illness-san in her casual clothes standing in front of the stall.","[Illness-san!?]","[Yeeeees. I came to see Kaito-sama’s staaaaaaall...... but it seeeeeems like I have a really timiiiiiiing. If Kaito-sama doesn’t miiiiiiiiind, would you allow me to help out a biiiiiiiiiit?]","[E- Errr, of course, that would be great but...... Is that alright with you?]","[Yeeeees. As you can seeeee, I’m currently not in the middle of woooooork.]","[......Thank you very much.]","Perhaps it’s because of her overflowing magnanimity that I tend to be spoiled by Illness-san’s kindness. Seeing Illness-san smiling at me so gently, of course, I’m feeling apologetic for having her help me out...... but the feeling of joy I feel at having her by my side exceeds that.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [W- What!? A- At this moment comes...... Illness......]"]},{"number":1324,"title":"Chapter 1324 - Founding Festival - Night 4","paragraphs":["Illness-san, how should I say this...... With familiar movements, she casually ties her hair in a light knot and stands in front of the baby castella cooking apparatus. She then baked baby castellas in such a fluid motion that there wasn’t even any need to check if they were baked well or not.","This was the first time I had seen Illness-san with her hair tied back, so her appearance looked rather refreshing.","[How was it liiiiiiike, running a staaaaaall?]","[It was quite an interesting experience. It was my first time participating in a festival like this, so it was a fresh and fun experience.]","[I see~~ I’m glad if Kaito-sama enjoys yourseeeeeelf.]","[......Have you ever opened a stall or something like this before, Illness-san?]","Fortunately, there were no customers at the moment, so we exchanged words while I’m watching Illness-san’s side profile as she baked baby castellas. Hmmm, how should I say this...... She may be small-statured, but when I see her cooking like this, I feel that she’s very dependable and mature.","It’s strange how Tre-san, who is tall and has the body of a model, doesn’t seem very mature, while Illness-san, who is petite and has the appearance of a young woman, seems more like an adult.","I guess it’s just the difference in their atmosphere, or perhaps, it may be the difference in the mood around them.","[No~~ In the first plaaaaace, I’ve hardly participated in festivals befoooooore.]","[Is that so?]","[Yeeees. I wasn’t very interested in festivaaaaaals, so I haven’t really bothered attendiiiiiiing.]","[I see. If I’m not mistaken, Illness-san doesn’t like boisterous places, so you never really felt like it.]","I have the impression that Illness-san doesn’t like noisy places, so it’s understandable why she hasn’t been to many festivals.","In fact, my parents used to take me to festivals like this when I was a kid, but I don’t remember going much after I grew up. I think I’ve often been going to festivals when I came to this world though......","[......I’ve alwaaaaaaays thought that festivals weren’t really something people needeeeeed.]","[Unnn?]","[I thought something that’s whooooole purpose was just for people’s enjoyment wasn’t necessaryyyyyy.]","[..........................]","With her gaze fixed on the iron plate, she muttered somewhat to herself. I thought that was unusual though. Illness-san doesn’t often talk about her past after all. Although it may be partly because she’s basically acting as a listener when talking to me, she rarely talks about what she was like in the past.","But recently, she has started to talk to me about her past, and it seems that she has undergone some kind of change of heart.","[......Back theeeeen, I used to travel around the Demon Reaaaaalm. I didn’t really have any reason whyyyyy. It’s just, somehooooow, I felt like knowing various things is the right thing to dooooo.]","[I think that’s a good idea......]","[Thaaaaat wasn’t really an action brought by my desiiiiiire. I had a vague idea of what I thought was the right way to liiiiiive, and I was just following iiiiiiit. I never felt anythiiiiiing. Even if I saved someoneeeeeee or accomplished somethiiiiiiing, I didn’t feel any sense of accomplishmeeeeent. It was just thaaaaat I just felt like I had completed some sort of quota.]","I quietly listened to the words Illness-san calmly spoke. The content should be quite heavy depending on how you look at it, but for Illness-san herself, that doesn’t seem to be a problem.","After all, from the beginning, Illness-san had been describing it in the past tense...... As if she’s implying that the present is different......","[I’m sure I had been empty all those tiiiiiimes. I haven’t thought that bad of a thing thouuuuugh......]","[......How about now?]","[I wonder about thaaaat? To be honest, there are still a looooooot of things I don’t understaaaand. However, indeeeeed...... I don’t think I would be able to turn back to the empty me anymooooore.]","[I don’t know what Illness-san was like back then, so I can’t judge how the you back then would compare to how you are now...... But still, I’m sure...... that the current Illness-san is much lovelier now than you were in the past.]","[......Kuhihi, thank you very muuuuuch. Hearing Kaito-sama say thaaaaat makes me especially happyyyyyy.]","The expression on Illness-san’s face as she turned to me and smiled, at least, doesn’t look empty at all. Even if the her in the past was empty, I could feel that the current Illness-san is filled with a lot of emotions.","After that, Illness-san turned her gaze back to the iron plate and her mouth moved a bit.","[......And all of thiiiiiis are things I’ve received from my beloved youuuuu.]","I’m not sure if she didn’t intend to let me hear what she said or not , but I haven’t heard what it is that she said...... but looking at the expression on Illness-san’s face, I could somehow tell that what she said isn’t something bad.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Uguuooooohhhh, t- this is hard...... Somehow, after we’ve reached the afterstory, Illness’ offensive has become amazing...... Or rather, isn’t she getting treated like the afterstory’s main heroine......?]"]},{"number":1325,"title":"Chapter 1325 - Founding Festival - Night 5","paragraphs":["The time spent chatting with Illness-san and tending to the store passed pleasantly. Since it was the middle of the fireworks, there were really few customers, and most of them seemed to be chatting with each other.","And when the sound of fireworks faded away, Tre-san and the others came back.","[We’re back~~ Kaito...... I see Kaito replaced us with another woman already.]","[I could sense malice in the way you say that. She’s helping me in the stall.]","Looking at Illness-san, who was tending the stall with me, I astoundedly responded to Tre-san telling me that with a teasing smile.","Thereupon, after nodding a few times, Tre-san smiled and spoke.","[Well, that aside, thanks for looking after the stall!]","[Did you enjoy the fireworks?]","[Unnn. It was awesome...... Ahh, but the fireworks aren’t over yet.]","[Unnn?]","[It seems like the fireworks are a two-part event. I mean, I heard that there’s going to be another one in 10 minutes. And so, we went back to take care of the stall this time and let Kaito watch them this time.]","Two-part...... It has that kind of format huh. I thought they had been setting off fireworks for quite a while, but it seems like it was a fireworks performance with a considerable scale.","I’m not sure if they put a lot of effort into it because all of the Six Kings are participating...... but in any case, I’m inclined to want to see the fireworks too.","[However, unnn. I guess this was just perfect then!]","[Perfect, for what?]","[We’ll take care of the stall and Kaito will go on a fireworks date with her!]","[......Huh?]","I looked at Tre-san, who was giving me a thumbs-up, and an idiotic response leaked out of my mouth. A date? Me and Illness-san are going on a...... No, no, it would be rude to say stuff like that to Illness-san, wouldn’t it?","Well, as for me, I would be happy to go on a date with Illness-san...... but it’s just, how should I say this...... Wouldn’t Illness-san not like being seen that way?","She’s a calm and mature woman, and from her point of view, I’m no different from a child...... I feel like she only thinks of me as a little brother.","[Kuhihi, well theeeen~~ since you’ve suggested iiiiiiit, if Kaito-sama is alright with iiiiiiit, would you go on a date with meeeee?]","[Hoehh? Y- Yeah, yes...... I would be happy to.]","Arehh? The conversation is proceeding more smoothly than I thought it would? Rather, it seemed like she was somewhat happy...... U- Unnn? I can’t understand Illness-san’s thoughts. Was it that she was simply playing along with Tre-san’s jokes, or that she’s more or less aware of me as a member of the opposite gender...... I- I don’t know.","[......Errr, please take care of the stall.]","[Unnn, unnn. Don’t mind the matters here and enjoy yourselves.]","[Thank you very much.]","I- I feel like I’m being swept away but...... oh well. I’m also looking forward to seeing the fireworks with Illness-san, and considering its merits, being swept away a bit isn’t really something I should be concerned about.","Just when I was thinking of enjoying that opportunity, Tre-san spoke again.","[......Ah, wait!]","[Unnn?]","[The main street is quite crowded, you know? Just walking through that path would be dangerous. You might lose each other...... so “I think it’s better if you hold hands with each other”.]","[......Huh?]","Oi, Tre-san!? What kind of passing remarks are you throwing out now!? ......Also, why are you glancing at me and giving me a little thumbs-up? There’s also that smug look on her face, as if to say “Nice assist, isn’t it?”......","No, no, as expected, that just goes beyond being a joke. No matter how kind Illness-san is, that’s just rude......","[I seeeeee, indeed, I certainly have a small buiiiiiild. I worry that we might get separateeeeed. Kaito-samaaaa, would you kindly escort meeeee?]","Saying this, she held out her hand with a gentle smile. Eh? Seriously? Was Illness-san the type that’s up for anything?","W- What should I do....... No, but since she was already holding out her hand to me like this, it would be rude to refuse.","[......Y- Yes. Well then, ummm...... If you’ll excuse me.]","Realizing that I was feeling quite nervous, I held Illness-san’s hand. Her hand is small and soft, and her skin is smooth...... S- Somehow, even though I’m just holding her hand, I’m feeling quite conscious.","Feeling my face heating up from the blush rising up my cheeks and the apprehension as to whether we would be able to enjoy the fireworks without any problems, I walked out with Illness-san.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [TREEEEEEEEEEEEE! Why do you go assisting people again!? If you had just left things as it is, Illness would have just gone home...... but you just had to turn it into a date!? D*mn it, y- you’ve gotta be kidding me......]"]},{"number":1326,"title":"Chapter 1326 - Founding Festival - Night 6","paragraphs":["Having suddenly decided that I would go see fireworks with Illness-san on what can be called a date, we walked down the street at night, hand in hand, illuminated by the lights of the stalls.","As I felt the warmth of his hand being transmitted, I kept my stride as small as possible because of our height difference.","[Illness-san, am I walking too fast?]","[Noooo. Thank you for minding meeeee. I’m fiiiiiiiine.]","Looking at Illness-san’s face, who responded with a gentle smile, I realized that I was feeling strangely nervous. As expected, being in this situation where I’m walking hand in hand with Illness-san may be a big part of it.","Also, it’s probably because Tre-san just had to strangely describe this as a date that I’m becoming aware of this as one......","[Ahh, Illness-san. We don’t have much time before it starts, but would you like to buy something on the way to the place where we can see the fireworks?]","[Let’s seeeeee, I haven’t really been to festivals befoooooore, so would you choose something for me, Kaito-samaaaaa?]","[Ah, yes. You can count on me.]","......This is troubling. W- What should I do? What? I can choose for her? H- However...... I don’t really know Illness-san’s taste.","N- No, wait. Let’s calm down. Let’s consider our current situation at the moment...... Illness-san and I are currently holding hands. Considering this situation and the fact that we are going through a crowded street, I suppose food that should be eaten with both hands is no good.","If possible, it should be something that can be eaten with one hand. For example, something like a skewer or an apple candy would be good.","My personal opinion is that I don’t think eating a skewer would really fit Illness-san’s image, so I guess what I should choose here would be an apple candy...... I suppose that would be called ripple candy here then?","However, despite the cute atmosphere apple candies have, apple candies have a considerable volume. Considering how Illness-san ate back when I was having dinner-time drinks with her...... I wonder if an apple candy would be too big for her?","As I had such thoughts in mind, I looked at the stalls along the road...... and found one called “Fruit Candy”. Ahh, I see, so there are also non-apple variants here huh.......","[Illness-san, how about we have some of their fruit candy? It seems like they have a variety, so I’m sure you can choose one you would like......]","[Yeeees. Well theeeeen, since we’re at it, let’s buy some.]","[Yes. They seem to have a lot of options, so which one would you like, Illness-san?]","[Let’s seeeeee...... I guess I’ll have a strawberry candyyyyy.]","The one that Illness-san chose was a fruit candy that had about five strawberries on a skewer. Each piece isn’t very big, so it’s certainly easy for her to eat.","As I was thinking that, Illness-san glanced at me and smiled.","[It’s juuuuuust this might be a little too much for meeeee. Kaito-samaaaa, if you don’t miiiiiind, could you please eat about half of iiiiiit?]","[Eh? Ah, yes. I understand. Well then, we’ll just buy only one strawberry candy, and Illness-san can then eat as much as you can. I’ll eat the rest.]","[Yeeeees.]","Thank goodness. I was able to safely choose something that suited Illness-san...... No, wait? The flow of the conversation was so natural that it went so smoothly, but thinking about it again, the two of us eating a single skewer of candy fruit together was quite embarrassing......","N- No, the one we’re getting is fortunately strawberries, and with it being something eaten one by one, it probably won’t turn into something like an indirect kiss...... but it’s hard not to be conscious of it.","No, if I had been doing this with one of my lovers, I wouldn’t be so conscious of it, but Illness-san isn’t my lover, and on top of that...... Errr, she’s kind and mature, a woman whose feelings I had were close to admiration, so there’s a part of me that’s feeling strangely conscious of her.","While feeling indescribably embarrassed, I bought a strawberry candy and handed it to Illness-san. We then started walking again, but my attention was strangely being drawn towards Illness-san as she ate her strawberry candy.","The figure of her eating a single piece of strawberry, which I could eat in one mouthful, in small portions several times somehow gives her a sense of elegance. No, how should I say this...... I’ve been thinking about this for a long time, but perhaps because she’s a maid working for nobility for a long time, Illness-san’s way of eating is so elegant that I’m fascinated by it.","[Kaito-samaaaaa?]","[Eh? Ah, I’m sorry! I- It just looks delicious......]","[Kuhihi, yeeees. It tastes very deliciouuuuuus.]","[I- I’m glad to hear that.]","When Illness-san noticed that I was looking at her, I reflexively tried to deceive her, and after happily smiling at me, Illness-san gently held out the strawberry candy skewer to me.","[Kaito-sama too, try it ouuuuuut.]","[Hoehh? Ah, errr, y- yes...... I’ll have one then.]","I had assumed that Illness-san would eat until she was satisfied and then I would eat the rest...... but us alternately eating each piece of the candy wasn’t something I had expected.","Moreover, this situation where I’m being fed by Illness-san...... Needless to say, it was more embarrassing than I had imagined.","However, I don’t know if I was just imagining it or not...... It’s just my hunch...... but it somehow seemed like Illness-san was enjoying herself more than usual.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [......I- I can’t move...... The excessive sugar content paralyzed me with diabetes...... and I can’t move.]","? ? ? : [What is this glossy thing? ......Isn’t this tortoiseshell candy...... Eh? Are you secreting candies now, Serious-senpai...... The sweetness in Serious-senpai’s body literally turned to sugar and hardened into candy...... Your body is as amusing as usual......]"]},{"number":1327,"title":"Chapter 1327 - Founding Festival - Night 7","paragraphs":["<Author’s Notes>","I got home late, so today’s chapter will be a little short.","As I somehow find myself going with the flow and eating strawberry candies alternately with Illness-san, we went out to the main street while I’m feeling slightly flushed...... I found that there were quite a few people as we expected.","The fireworks will be displayed near the royal castle, which is quite a distance from our location, but there are still quite a few people there.","[Speaking of which, they’re setting off fireworks in the middle of a city...... but did they set up some kind of countermeasure?]","[They had set up Barrier Magiiiiiic, so there’s no danger in the surroundiiiiiiiings. They have many excellent people among the Court Mages after aaaaaaaall.]","[I see...... Come to think of it, Illness-san was a maid at the royal castle before you moved to Lilia-san’s mansion, right?]","[Yeeeees. I didn’t have a special position, just a normal maaaaaaid.]","......From what I’ve heard, for Luna-san, who was an adventurer and became a member of the Knight Order, and clueless about matters related to maids, Illness-san was so excellent that she was the first person that came to her mind when asking for someone to teach her the basics.","In that case, I think she was probably overlooked in the royal castle, but since it’s Illness-san we’re talking about here, she probably continued to peacefully work as a maid just like how she’s doing in Lilia-san’s mansion.","[......Even so, they’re amazing. Making sure those fireworks don’t affect the royal castle must be difficult. Illness-san, are you alright?]","[I’m alriiiiiiight.]","I thought it would be difficult for Illness-san, someone with a small build in a place that has many people around, so I stopped in a way that I could create a space for Illness-san as much as possible.","No, of course, I know that Illness-san, a Count-rank Demon, is far superior to me in terms of physical ability, so there really shouldn’t be any problems...... but well, it’s more about me and my pride as a man...... It’s just, I want to look good around her.","The number of people around makes it difficult for us to go any further, so I guess we’ll have to watch the fireworks from here.","[I wonder if we can watch it from here?]","[The angle may be a littleeeeee bad. Weeeeeeell, it looks like we would still be able to watch them somehooooow......]","Just as Illness-san said, when we look toward the royal castle from our position, the clock tower certainly is just in front of our eyes.","The clock tower isn’t really that big, but it seems to be exquisitely standing in the way. Well, it can’t be helped. It might be difficult to see the small fireworks or those that were made to explode low, but I would still be able to see the big ones.","As I had such thoughts in mind, my hand was pulled back with a jerk, and when I turned to look, I saw Illness-san lightly beckoning me with her mouth...... as if she wanted me to lend her my ears.","[is something the matter?]","Being mindful of our surroundings, I bent down a bit, and when I brought my ear close to her mouth, she whispered.","[......Why don’t we cheat a liiiiiiiiittle bit?]","[Eh? Cheat?]","Rather than her words, her gentle voice whispering in my ear somewhat makes me shudder, giving me a strange sense of comfort. If I let down my guard, I feel like this might turn into a habit.","W- Well, putting that aside...... I wonder what she meant with cheat?","[Please excuse meeeee.]","[Eh? Whoa!?]","As I was leaning down my body, Illness-san suddenly put her hands around my back, seemingly hugging me close, and the view was instantly swept down.","Leaping to a height where we were overlooking the place where we had just been, Illness-san kicked a few times in the air and landed on the roof of the clock tower we had just been looking at earlier.","[If we’re heeeeeere, we can watch the fireworks very weeeeeell.]","[E- Errr, aren’t we gonna be quite conspicuous?]","[It’s alriiiiiiight. Even though it may not seem like iiiiiit, I’m actually good at Recognition Inhibition Magiiiiiiiic.]","When I looked around me after she said that, I found that even though we were in such a conspicuous place, we didn’t seem to be attracting any attention.","[I’ve also casted a fall prevention magiiiiic, so you don’t have to worry about your footiiiiiing. It may be a little unfair to otheeeeeers, but I also wanted to watch the beautiful fireworks with Kaito-samaaaaaaa.]","Illness-san, who said such a thing with a rather mischievous smile, how should I say this...... It felt like there was this gap between the current Illness-san and her usual adult-like self, and she looked really cute.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [........................]","? ? ? : [I wonder if these candies sprouting out of her body edible? I guess I’ll get some fruits and make me something like a fondue......]"]},{"number":1328,"title":"Chapter 1328 - Founding Festival - Night 8","paragraphs":["When Illness-san brought me to the roof of the clock tower, I suddenly heard a sound and looked up at the sky to see a large flower blooming in the sky.","It was a rather large firework, and not only that, it was also very colorful. Magic exists in this world, so there are many more colorful and variously shaped fireworks here than in my former world.","[As expected from the fireworks display at a festival for the founding of a country, it’s very impressive.]","[Indeeeeeeed. They’re very colorfuuuuuuul.]","Strangely, even though Illness-san’s voice wasn’t that loud, I could clearly hear it even in the midst of the sound of fireworks.","Isis-san had also used magic with an effect like this, so it’s possible Illness-san was using the same magic.","As I was thinking about this while watching the fireworks, Illness-san spoke with a smile.","[We can sit down, you knooooow? I’ve used Protection Magic on us, so our clothes won’t get dirty.]","[I see, it certainly will be easier for us to watch the fireworks if we sit down.]","Saying this, I sit down on the roof. The roof of this clock tower isn’t so steep, so it’s easy for me to sit on. It’s nice to be able to watch the fireworks from a seat.","As I was thinking this, I suddenly saw Illness-san move behind me. When I tilted my head, wondering what was going on, her hands were placed on my shoulders and my body was pulled behind me.","[I thiiiiiiink you’d be able to see better this waaaaaay.]","[Hoehh?]","As my body fell back, I felt a soft touch on my back, and saw Illness-san’s face smiling at me and the fireworks in the sky.","Errr, is this what I think it is? I’m now laying on Illness-san’s lap, looking up at the sky...... Ahh, so this is why she moved behind me......","I- It’s true that I can see the fireworks better when I’m lying down and looking up, and I don’t have to worry about getting a stiff neck......","However, this is quite embarrassing...... Errr, I wondered if it’s okay from Illness-san’s point of view, but Illness-san was only quietly looking up at the fireworks, and I hesitated to call out to her.","The multicolored lights of the fireworks illuminated her face, and even though it was still the same face I see everyday, I had this illusion that I was seeing many various expressions on her face.","......Wait, aren’t I supposed to be watching fireworks here? Why is it that my eyes are just looking Illness-san? I should turn my attention back to the fireworks......","Glancing at Kaito, who was concentrating on the fireworks with a slight blush on his face, Illness’ mind wandered.","(I may have been a bit too forcefuuuuul. I should be reflecting on my actioooooons, but this is quiiiiiiite troubling. I can’t suppress the joy bursting in meeeeee~~)","Looking back, this was the case for her from the beginning. At first, she didn’t intend to visit Kaito’s stall. She had already tried making baby castellas with him during their practice, and Illness herself isn’t a big fan of festivals.","She had been to a few festivals in the past. However, she couldn’t understand the situation around her surroundings or the reactions of the people around her.","The feeling of joy and the sight of people laughing with each other didn’t overlap with her in any way, so she felt that she had nothing to do with festivals and wouldn’t need it in the future.","However, this time...... She found herself attending a festival after work...... and made her way to Kaito’s stall. Her heart fluttered with each step closer. Seeing Kaito happily smiling at the stall, Illness felt happy and fulfilled.","When we were tending the store together after that, it was a moment of blessedness that each and every second Illness spent together with Kaito feels precious to her. Even that should have been more than enough for her, but now, she’s watching fireworks together with Kaito.","(......This is happineeeeeess. I would be happieeeeeer if Kaito-sama also feels the same caaaaase.)","As such thoughts wander in her mind, a small smile leaked out of Illness’ lips. While her eyes are looking at the sky, she sees a number of fireworks in the sky.","However, if she were to be asked if she was concentrating on the fireworks, she could only say that that wasn’t the case.","(This is troubliiiiing. I should be watching the firewoooooorks, but all I keep on thinking about is Kaito-samaaaaa and my attention could only focus on hiiiiiim.)","Kaito felt the same thing as her not crossing her mind, Illness gently patted Kaito’s head, who was laying on her lap.","(I must keep my head from turning towards him, riiiiiight?)","The reason she kept her gaze up to the sky...... was that Illness herself was aware that she was making a relaxed face right now, and reflecting upon the happiness of having Kaito in her embrace, she was clearly aware of the enchanted expression she has on her face right now.","Somehow, having such an expression on her face be seen by Kaito...... she was feeling a bit...... just a tiny, little bit...... She was feeling a bit embarrassed.","<Afterword>","? ? ? : [Hoh, Pandemonium got shy...... She certainly changed. By the way, Serious-senpai, just eating all these candies is getting boring, so please go secrete chocolates or something.]","Serious-senpai : [................... (The only response she could muster were the words “Don’t say impossible things” popping above her head.]"]},{"number":1329,"title":"Chapter 1329 - Intermission: Super Maid of Heart","paragraphs":["While Kaito was watching the fireworks with Illness, Lilia, who had just attended the Founding Festival party at the royal castle, was also watching the fireworks from the entrance of the castle with Lunamaria and Sieglinde, looking somewhat tired.","[......Haahhh, I’m really tired. From start to finish, a lot of people kept on greeting me.]","[Lili is now the noble with the most influence in Symphonia after all. There must be many nobles who would want to have connections with you.]","[Seriously, even though not even a glance was spared when Lili first established your Duchy, they’re really self-centered.]","[That’s the nature of nobles after all. If you don’t have a face as thick as that, you aren’t fit to be a noble...... Well, putting them aside, look, Lili, I brought a change of clothes, so let’s rent a room at the royal castle and change.]","When Lilia grumbled about how tired she was, Sieglinde responded with a wry smile to Lilia, then Lunamaria in casual clothes came with a paper bag.","After helping out at the stall, Lunamaria went back to the mansion and after changing into her own clothes, she brought Lilia’s clothes and came back to the castle.","When she heard Lunamaria’s words though, Lilia tilted her head in curiosity.","[Change of clothes?]","[......We’re going to see the festival, right? Are you going to go in a dress?]","[Ah, that’s right! It’s for the Founding Festival! We’ve promised to go around after all, let’s go!!!]","[I understand already, so you should first change your clothes......]","Seemingly as if the fatigue from earlier was blown away, Lilia’s expression suddenly brightened up. Lilia was originally a princess, and although it was natural, she had never shown her face at public festivals.","It’s not that she has never seen such a festival before, but as a member of the Knight Order, she could only participate in the festival as a guard, so she has no experience in actually attending a festival.","The same has been true since the establishment of her dukedom. She would only attend the Founding Festival party at the royal castle, and then, she would return to her residence, not having the opportunity to participate.","This time however, she had promised Lunamaria and Sieglinde in advance that they would visit the stalls together after the party was over.","Receiving her change of clothes with a cheerful expression on her face, Lilia changed into her casual clothes in a borrowed room. Entrusting her dress to a castle maid, she had it delivered to her mansion later.","[......Wait, Head Maid? Is it okay for you to be here?]","[If someone is going to take care of Lilia-sama’s dress, they must be someone of befitting status.]","[Ahaha, errr, thank you for always taking care of my brother.]","[No, he’s a King and husband worthy of my support, so it’s not hard for me.]","The one who came to pick up the changed-out dress was Head Maid Beatrice, royal castle’s current Head Maid and one of Ryze’s wives.","Incidentally, although Lilia and her friends didn’t know it, she’s a strong person known as the Super Maid of Heart in the Maid world, and is one respected by maids all over the world.","[Well then, please take care of my dress.]","[Of course. I will deliver it directly to Lilia-sama’s mansion.]","[Eh? The Head Maid will? Can I ask why......]","[......No, well, I have a personal matter in your area...... I was thinking of meeting Teacher Illness for the first time in a while.]","[Ahh, I see......]","Beatrice learned the basics of being a maid from Illness when she was working at the royal castle, and she had great respect for Illness.","Even at Maid Olympia, when she was introduced as “Symphonia Kingdom’s Number One Maid”, she immediately demanded a correction from the announcer, believing that Symphonia Kingdom’s number 1 maid was Illness.","[Come to think of it, recently, Illness and the Spirit of the World Tree at Kaito-san’s house, Nebula-san, have been getting along very well.]","[Is that so? I couldn’t imagine Teacher Illness being particularly close to anyone in particular......]","[It seems that they have a positive influence on each other. Illness herself also said that she has a lot to learn from Nebula-san.]","[A person described that much by Teacher Illness...... I would love to meet her.]","Lilia and Beatrice were having a peaceful conversation, partly because they hadn’t seen each other in a while, when there was a knock at their room and they heard Sieglinde’s voice.","[Lili, if we don’t get going soon, we’re gonna be late.]","[Ahh, I’m sorry. I’ll be right there. Well then, Head Maid, I will take my leave.]","[Yes, I’m sorry for keeping you.]","[No, let’s chat again when you bring my clothes back to my mansion. Well then, if you’ll excuse me.]","After seeing Lilia off with her head bowed as she hurried left with these words, Beatrice quietly looked up and seemingly having thoughts in her mind, she muttered.","[......A maid so highly praised by Teacher Illness...... For such a powerful person to exist in the Symphonia Kingdom...... I wonder how much Maid Power she has? Fufu, I’m looking forward to seeing how talented she is. Challenging her to a match might be interesting.]","Despite her polite demeanor, Beatrice, who is known as Super Maid of Heart, has a rather stern personality, not hesitating even against her husband, King Ryze, and would sometimes scold him harshly.","She also had a high desire to improve herself and was quite prideful, so hearing that Illness, whom she respects highly, highly evaluated Nebula, she became interested and is quietly blazing with fighting spirit.","However, her opponent isn’t a maid, but the Absolute, so her defeat is a foregone conclusion.","<Afterword>","? ? ? : [If you ask me, she’s on a level that I wouldn’t know if even Ein-san can win against.]","Serious-senpai : [Hahh!? The restraints on my body have melted away...... All because of candies......]","? ? ? : [You asking for a beating?]","Serious-senpai : [I- I’m sorry......]","T/N: Legacy posted a new chapter. Chapter 4"]},{"number":1330,"title":"Chapter 1330 - Founding Festival - Night 9","paragraphs":["The long fireworks display is over, and the silence that follows the fireworks comes to an end. It felt as if the surroundings had become dark all at once, partly due to the effect of the brightly glowing fireworks earlier.","Normally, I would just get up and go home since the fireworks were over...... but Illness-san’s hand was still caressing my head and I’m kinda unable to find the right time to get up......","[The fireworks were beautiful, weren’t they?]","[Yeeeees. Seeing it eeeennnd feels kind of lonely thouuuuugh.]","[Ahh, that’s true. It does feel strangely lonely after the fireworks end.]","Lightly exchanging words with her, I thought this would be a good time to get up...... but Illness-san was looking at me very kindly, and I couldn’t get up carelessly because she was directly looking at me.","If I get up here, my face would end up being suddenly brought near hers, so what should I do...... We aren’t really in a bright street, but on the roof of the clock tower, so it’s dim and I couldn’t tell what kind of expression Illness-san is making.","[Errr...... Illness-san?]","[Kaito-samaaaaa, may I ask you some questioooooons?]","[Eh? Questions? Yes, if it’s something I can answer......]","Do I have to answer while I’m lying on her lap though? H- Hmmm, she sounded kind of serious, so I probably shouldn’t strangely interject here.","As I was thinking about that, Illness-san suddenly lightly held out her hand and closed my eyes with it. Eh? What’s going on? Don’t tell me, she wants to play some sort of guessing game? Well, there’s no way that’s the case......","[What kind of person am I to you, Kaito-samaaaaa?]","[Illness-san? H- Hmmm. That’s a rather embarrassing question...... but Illness-san is very helpful and reliable...... H- How should I say this...... I think you’re like a gentle older lady?]","[I seeeeeee.]","The only thing that echoes gently behind my closed vision is Illness-san’s voice. I don’t know the intent of that question but...... Unnn. If I’m to be asked what kind of person I think Illness-san is, I would say she would be an older woman I can rely on.","As expected, even though I am too embarrassed to say it, I think of her as an adult lady whom I admire. She’s brimming with motherliness, a great amount of receptiveness, just like an adult woman.","[I’m asking juuuuuuust for reference, but would Kaito-sama consider someone like meeeeee an object of romantic intereeeeeest?]","[Eh? Of course.]","[Even with a body as petite as miiiiiiine?]","[If you’re talking about height, my lovers Kuro and Alice are also small-built...... so I’ve never really paid much attention to height.]","[Come to think of iiiiiiit, that was indeed the caaaaaase.]","[I don’t know what Illness-san wants to ask, but at least for me, Illness-san is a very attractive and wonderful woman.]","[Kuhihi, is that soooooo. Those words make me happyyyyy.]","For a moment, from the content of her question...... but perhaps, does Illness-san see me as someone of the opposite gender? Well, I asked that question...... but it didn’t really feel like that, as she responded as calmly as usual.","Just like that, with her hand over my eyes, she asked me a few more questions, but her next questions doesn’t seem to have anything to do with love. Just her first questions were about that.","My heart kinda skipped a beat when she asked that, but well, I guess that’s just the way of the world...... Just asking though, but how long is she gonna close my eyes?","[Thank you very muuuuuuch. That was very usefuuuuuuul.]","[No, no, I’m glad I could be of help.]","The content of the questions was varied and not very regular, but at any rate, I’m glad that Illness-san seemed to be satisfied.","As I had such thoughts in mind, I suddenly felt something soft on my forehead...... something that felt like lips. And right after that, the hand that was covering my eyes was removed.","[Well theeeeeeen, shall we head baaaaaack?]","[Eh? Ah, yes...... Errr, Illness-san. Just now......]","[Is something the matteeeeeer?]","[No, it’s nothing.]","At my words, Illness-san tilted her head curiously...... Arehh? Have I just been imagining it, and it was something else that I felt on my forehead earlier...... I thought for a moment that she kissed me on the forehead, but based on Illness-san’s reaction, it seems like I was mistaken.","Feeling a little embarrassed at what a strange misunderstanding I had made, we returned to the location of our stall with Illness-san using my Teleportation Magic Tool.","[......Thank goodness I’m not wearing lipstiiiiiick......]","Just as we were about to teleport though, I felt like I heard such a small murmur.","<Afterword>","? ? ? : [I see, from Kaito-san’s point of view, the feeling of admiration he has for Pandemonium is so strong that he thinks she wouldn’t consider having such a thought towards a child like him. Well, it’s also partly because Pandemonium is doing a good job of hiding her emotions from being conveyed to Kaito-san through his Sympathy Magic......]","Serious-senpai : [....................]","? ? ? : [So it’s here! My chocolate fondue...... What, it’s just sugar huh. How useless.]","Serious-senpai : [......Aren’t you too cruel?]"]},{"number":1331,"title":"Chapter 1331 - ? ? ? 1","paragraphs":["A day had passed since the Founding Festival, which I attended and participated in as a stallkeeper, and to relieve my fatigue, I’m now leisurely brushing Bell.","Well...... I was supposed to be brushing Bell but......","[Oh, sorry for suddenly calling you here, Kaito.]","[......N- No.]","Rather than calling me here, it was more like I was almost forcibly brought here...... As I had such thoughts in mind, I looked at Megiddo-san in front of me.","I’m currently in Megiddo-san’s house...... castle near that huge arena I’ve visited before, and I suppose this would be the first time I’ve ever visited him here.","It may be due to the size of Megiddo-san’s body, but in any case, various things in the room are big.","[......So, what business do you have with me?]","[Yeah, but wait a bit...... Oi, Shalltear. I know you’re there. Is there anyone around?]","[......There’s no one around.]","When Alice answered Megiddo-san’s question, Megiddo-san nodded once and then, his expression turned serious.","[I called Kaito this time because I wanted to ask you for a favor.]","[A favor?]","[Yeah...... I want you to beat me.]","[Yes?]","U- Unnn? What’s he suddenly saying now...... That doesn’t sound like...... he’s asking for a match. He’s telling me not to “fight him”, but “to beat him”? W- What’s going on? I have no clue what’s going on at all.","Looking at me who was curiously tilting my head at his words, Megiddo-san seemed to have expected my reaction as he began to explain.","[Well, to put it simply...... I guess it would be better if I show you that first.]","As he said this, Megiddo-san’s body lit up and his appearance changed. He...... No, she had long crimson hair and two crimson hair and two large horns along the back of her head. There appeared the figure of a glamorous woman in tattered clothes...... Eh? What is this?","This doesn’t...... seem like Humanization Magic, is it? Megiddo-san’s Humanized form should have been a muscular man......","[Kaito should have already known about this, but regarding this original form of mine......]","[Eh? No, no, please wait! First of all, that’s the first time I’ve seen you in that form!]","[Ahh? Didn’t you see this back in the God Realm?]","[No, even if I see your current form, I would know if it was Megiddo-san or not......]","The matter about the God Realm Megiddo-san is talking about here, she’s probably referring to that time with Shiro-san’s ordeals. Indeed, I may have seen her in that form at that time, but if she didn’t explain that to me, I wouldn’t have recognized her as Megiddo-san at first sight.","[......Well, in any case, that is Megiddo-san’s original form. I understand that.]","[Oh. Then, I’ll continue with my explanation...... Regarding this form though, I honestly can’t say that I’m in a state where I can fully use my power. I had sealed a part of my power.]","[Sealed?]","[Yeah, how should I put it...... There’s this destructive urge inside me that I can’t control. It’s something I was born with...... In fact, until I was beaten up by Kuromueina once, I was rampaging in the Demon Realm with only the urge to destroy everything in mind.]","Seeing the serious expression on Megiddo-san’s face as she explained this, I also listened to her with a serious expression on my face. Thereupon, Alice appeared right at that moment and sat next to me.","[Truth is, I don’t know much about it myself. Those were events that happened before I came to this world...... I did hear about how Megiddo-san destroyed about one-third of old Demon Realm.]","[That was way, way back in the past, but that certainly was the case...... Well, I unfortunately couldn’t really remember what happened back then myself.]","[T- The scale of the story somehow became outrageous......]","Destroying one-third of the vast Demon Realm, that alone is quite the incident...... but since she said Kuro had beaten her up before, I guess that means Kuro had defeated her?","[I was rampaging with my destructive impulses, and Kuromueina defeated me. And at that time, Kuromueina sealed my destructive impulses.]","[No, you’re skipping too much info there...... Why do you think I went out of my way to appear here when a crisis like this was brought up? How about you tell us about it a bit more?]","[No, like I said, I don’t remember much about it myself...... Well, if you’re fine with stuff I heard from Kuromueina......]","In response to Alice’s words, Megiddo-san nodded while lightly scratching her head...... I suppose this is like talking about the past. To be honest, I’m also quite interested in Megiddo-san’s past. I mean, I still don’t know how this will lead to her earlier remark about me defeating her.","However, just as I thought of listening to what she had to say seriously......","[Ah, is this gonna take long? Then, can’t you at least serve us a cup of tea? Ah, serve us some teacakes while———– Ouch!?]","[You...... Can’t you read the mood......]","After dropping my fist on Alice’s head, who just casually demanded some tea, I turned to Megiddo-san and focused on the conversation.","<Afterword>","? ? ? : [Serious-senpai had secreted too much sugar and is now sleeping. How unfortunate, the arc kinda feels serious......]","T/N: The whole title is literally hidden other than the only word “inside/within”, so it’s either I post the whole arc in one go or just go with question marks for the title.","Also, the nsfyuushou got a new chapter, this one written by Solaire, the lewd extraordinaire. Join the discord server and lick him if you can. Chapter 5"]},{"number":1332,"title":"Chapter 1332 - ? ? ? 2","paragraphs":["The monster was born in a volcano in a corner of the Demon Realm. It was born out of the burning lava.","It had long hair, two huge horns...... and red eyes that held no reason. The monster obliterated the volcano in which it was born and its surroundings, and slowly began to walk through the Demon Realm.","The only thing the monster had was the urge to destroy, and everything in its sight was an object of destruction.","Whether it’s the land of the Demon Realm or the creatures living there, it attacked anything and destroyed everything. Of course, it isn’t that the Demons didn’t try to resist the monster.","The Demon Realm of that time was a warring era, and there were many skilled Demons everywhere. Naturally, they thought of defeating this monster.","However...... The monster was overwhelmingly powerful. Neither physical attacks nor magic can penetrate its tough skin. Neither a strong shield nor Defensive Magic could block the monster’s attack.","Not even a single blade of greenery remained after the monster’s steps, and it continued to walk through the Demon Realm, destroying everything in its path.","The damage caused by the monster spread to one-third of the Demon Realm, and when the monster became known and feared as the “Red Demon Beast”, it arrived near the center of the Demon Realm.","In that place stands a small house inhabited by two Demons. Naturally, everything in sight is an object of destruction for the monster, and the house was no exception, and it was supposed to destroy it and move on.","[......Ein. Take your distance, it’s dangerous.]","[Y- Yes.]","That is, if it wasn’t for Kuromueina, who was later called the Strongest in the Demon Realm, who was living there...... The monster was indeed strong. With its excessive power, it attacked Kuromueina and managed to inflict a faint wound on her.","Yes, a faint wound...... That was all it could manage to do.","[......You have great power. Hmmm, I’m sure she had a hand in this. Haahhh, I wonder what she’s planning...... Being pushed around by her like that, you’ve got it rough.]","Seeing the power of the clearly abnormal monster, she could tell that this monster was tampered with by the other half of his body who she had yet to meet...... the God of Creation, Kuromueina let out a sigh and tampered with the being of the monster herself.","She sealed off its powerful destructive impulse and arranged its appearance to be somewhat similar to herself and Ein.","[......Gurururu.]","[Unnn. You certainly are quite lively. Moreover, due to the effect of sealing its destructive impulse, it will not attack...... W- Well, it seems to be a little scared...... but I guess when it comes to matters like that, I could just teach it.]","Since her half-body is involved, Kuromueina decided to take custody of the monster...... and gave it...... gave her the name “Megiddo”.","The monster...... Megiddo was obedient to Kuromueina. She was a strong being who had defeated itself. She learned from Kuromueina’s teachings and acquired knowledge.","In the process, she learned the joy of training herself and competing with others. At the same time...... Even though Kuromueina’s seal was in place, she resented the destructive impulse that still remained in her being. She hated herself for destroying one-third of the Demon Realm.","She came to hate her monstrous self who did not enjoy fighting, didn’t compete with others, didn’t give her opponents a chance to grow, and simply laid waste and destroyed everything.","Somewhere along the way, Megiddo herself put seals on her body to seal away her true form.","However, Megiddo’s destructive impulse still has not disappeared. Even though it’s sealed, that impulse continues to sleep in the depths of her body.","That is why Megiddo hated her true form. For when she returns to her true form, she could also feel the presence of that destructive impulse still exists deep within her......","After some conversation with her, Megiddo-san deeply exhaled, as if to switch her mind off the topic.","[......Well, that’s about it. So, going back to the main topic...... I somehow managed to do something about that destructive impulse, but dealing with it like this still has its troublesome parts to it. It won’t listen to me at all.]","[You can think of it as the gorilla having a rabid dog as a pet on her belly. And now, Megiddo-san wants Kaito-san to train that mad dog......]","[Well, something like that.]","[......I don’t really understand what’s going on though.]","I understand that Megiddo-san hates that destructive impulse and wants to control it somehow. However, I don’t understand the point of having me do that.","How am I supposed to control Megiddo-san’s destructive impulse?","[Long story short, I want you to crush my destructive impulse and have it submit to you.]","[......Explaining it like that wouldn’t make him understand though...... Errr, Kaito-san. There is a special magic called “Mind Competition”. In short, it’s like a mental battle that can be done with mutual consent, and Megiddo-san’s destructive impulse...... You can think of it as a kind of emotion. Megiddo-san wants you to defeat her destructive impulse through that.]","[I kinda get it, but I also kinda don’t.]","[Incidentally, Megiddo-san had also asked me and Kuro-san this and we tried it out...... but that destructive impulse doesn’t admit defeat at all. No matter how many times we beat it up, it seemed to think that it would win next time......]","Looking at Alice, who astoundedly said that with a sigh, I thought that even if it was Megiddo-san’s destructive impulse, in the end, it was still part of Megiddo-san’s emotions. So, I had this impression that this impulse’s personality was similar to Megiddo-san’s.","[......And now, here’s where you come in, Kaito. I’d say Kaito’s mentality is one of the best I’ve ever known. I thought that if it’s you, you could probably do something about it.]","[......I- I see.]","I understand the situation now. I understand but...... I’d like to hear a little more detail about that mental battle.","<Afterword>","? ? ? : [The serious development...... isn’t here just like usual. That person...... and that title...... Oya, this is......]"]},{"number":1333,"title":"Chapter 1333 - Mamo〇〇〇 3","paragraphs":["When I asked Megiddo-san for a detailed explanation of this mental battle...... Megiddo-san’s answer was that I would understand when I experienced it.","[......Eehhh.]","[Well, it certainly is the best to experience it for yourself.]","[Ah~~ Kaito-san, it’s alright. You can leave the Mind Competition at any time you like.]","[Ahh, I see.]","In that case, I feel a little relieved. If I can escape at any time instead of not being able to return until the conclusion is reached, just as Megiddo-san said, it might be better if I just experience it.","However, hmmm. Mental battle huh. I don’t really see myself as strong at all...... but Megiddo-san seems to expect quite a bit from me, and I can feel that emotion from her.","For the time being, I guess I’ll just try my best...... If push comes to shove, I can just escape......","[Alright! Well then, let’s get this started.]","[Well then, Kaito-san, do your best. Incidentally, that thing seriously doesn’t listen to others, so if you think it’s impossible, you might as well give up quickly.]","For the time being, I’ll try it out myself, so Megiddo-san brought forth a complex magic circle at her feet and held her hand over me. Thereupon, a rather dazzling light was emitted, and seemingly as if absorbed within it, my consciousness sank within the light.","When I came to, I found myself standing in an arena. There were no spectators around, just a large arena.","“......Kaito, can you hear me?”","[Megiddo-san? Is this the Mind Competition?]","“Yeah, you’re somewhat in a state where you’re inside my mind. You can move your body without any problems, right?”","[Yes.]","“Then, let me give you a quick explanation. In the space of the Mind Competition, the strength of a person’s mind becomes your physical ability. Of course, at the time you feel weak, your physical ability will also decline, so be careful.”","[.......................]","“Alright then, I’m going to remove a part of the seal in my destructive impulse, so I’m counting on you.]","[Eh? No, wait......]","Wait right there! This is somewhat different from what I was expecting...... I mean, this mental battle...... In the end, isn’t this just using your mental capabilities to beat up your opponent!? Wouldn’t that be no different from a normal battle then......","As I was feeling flustered, thinking that, a black fog appeared in front of me, and it morphed into Megiddo-san’s appearance...... Her true, female form.","The impulse’s appearance is almost the same as Megiddo-san herself, but there are these strange ring-like restraints on her body, and with her eyes glowing red, she’s snarling and threatening me with her bared fangs...... S- Scary......","“Then, let’s start.”","[......Eeehhhh.]","The moment Megiddo-san’s voice resounded, the Megiddo-san in front of me...... The destructive impulse fiercely rushed towards me. This is something obvious, but there’s no way that I, who’s never even gotten into a fight, can react to her actions, and the fist of the destructive impulse struck my face.","Ouch...... Ow...... Arehh? That doesn’t hurt at all, it felt more like a slight impact.","“As expected, your ability greatly exceeds the destructive impulse. Get for it, Kaito!”","[Eh? Ah, yes!]","I see, so with my mental power being converted to my physical power, even the untrained me would receive almost no damage from a punch of the destructive impulse huh...... T- Thank goodness. It didn’t end up being very painful......","Having such a thought in mind, I swing my fist to counterattack. I had punched at a speed that I can’t imagine could be unleashed by the real me...... but the destructive impulse side steps and slams its counterattack fist into my face.","Its attack dealt almost no damage to me, but there was still that slight impact, and while my head was knocked back, I sent out my fist to counterattack again...... but this time, it caught my hand and was sent flying with something that felt like a circular throw.","However, even when I was thrown to the ground, I still didn’t feel any pain. I don’t feel any pain but......","[......Errr, doesn’t it feel like it has good fighting skills?]","[Yeah, it is still one of my emotions after all. It would be on the same level as me when it comes to technique and other stuff like that.”","......I see, even though my physical ability was overwhelmingly better, the destructive impulse apparently possesses the same fighting skills as Megiddo-san...... Isn’t this impossible? No matter how much my physical ability has increased, isn’t it impossible for me to hit an opponent who has the same skill as Megiddo-san, who is a master in martial arts?","In the conversation up until now, we had been talking about making it surrender on the premise that I can win against it...... but in the first place, can I even win against it?","Ahh, I see, the people Megiddo-san had asked so far are Kuro and Alice, and they have exceptional combat skills...... but isn’t that something impossible for me then?","[Ouch!?]","“Kaito!? Don’t loosen up! If your way of thinking weakens, your abilities will decline!”","The strike unleashed by the impulse just now was quite painful. T- That’s right. My mentality is especially important here...... If I become weak-minded, feeling like I’m unable to win or that I think of this as impossible, my ability will decline......","What I should rather do here is to be strong enough that it couldn’t contend against me...... A- Alright, let’s get fired up!","<Afterword>","? ? ? : [Well, I guess this would certainly happen. No matter how much physical ability you have, it’s meaningless if you don’t have the technique to make it hit. That being the case, the key here would be the character in the title huh?]"]},{"number":1334,"title":"Chapter 1334 - 〇〇〇sa 4","paragraphs":["The fistfight called mental power battle with Megiddo-san’s destructive impulse continues...... Unfortunately, time passed without a proper effective blow being given.","Even though there wasn’t much damage dealt, it seemed as if there was really no way for me to get a hold of it. As I was thinking this, rings like the one wrapping around it before suddenly wrapped around the body of the destructive impulse and it stopped moving.","“Kaito, I’m sorry. That’s enough.”","[Megiddo-san?]","Hearing Megiddo-san’s unusually apologetic voice, I tilted my head.","“I’m sorry I got you involved in my situation. I didn’t want to see you being one-sidedly beaten any more than this because of my circumstances...... You did a great job. That’s why, that’s enough......”","[.......................]","In the first place, the reason I agreed to this matter, even though I was being swept away by the suddenness of the situation, was because Megiddo-san’s wish to do something about her destructive impulse was a serious one.","I felt that Megiddo-san’s feelings, which were conveyed through my Sympathy Magic, were even somewhat like a request for salvation.","In fact, as she had asked Kuro and Alice to do in the past, Megiddo-san was probably anxious to do something about this destructive impulse of hers. I don’t know what it feels like to keep such a thing in your body that if you don’t seal it off, it will go on a rampage...... At least, I don’t think that’s something I can’t stand.","[......Megiddo-san, please don’t be ridiculous.","“Kaito?”","[Megiddo-san, you like to compete with others, and you do these battles a lot, don’t you? In that case, did you seriously think it’s exciting to hear from the audience that “that’s enough” or something like that!?]","“......................”","[If you have time to say such pathetic things, please show me your support instead!]","Giving up and stuff like that is out of the window anymore. For the time being, I’m going to do the best that I can for Megiddo-san......","“......You’re right. Sorry, that was a stupid thing to say. Kaito, go for it! Beat that thing up!”","[Yes!]","Well then, let’s not play any more tricks. It’s time for me to get serious and hit it with everything I’ve got!","At Kaito’s words, Megiddo broke the seal she had placed on her destructive impulse. Naturally, the destructive impulse rushed toward Kaito with all its might and swung its fist at him...... but Kaito neither averted his eyes from it nor did he defend himself against it, but instead received it with his face and swung his fist for a counterattack.","The blow catches the face of the destructive impulse and sends its body flying away.","Yes, Kaito had already discarded his superficial defenses. He just takes the destructive impulse’s attack head-on and counterattacks. That is the only simple strategy he has adopted.","The destructive impulse continued to swing its fist at him, but Kaito continued to receive its fists without budging at all, and struck a counterattack when he thought he could get a clear shot. Thereupon, the destructive impulse would be blown away again.","The destructive impulse also has a will of its own. Faced with this situation, it was now a little confused. Kaito’s latest attack on it was much heavier than the previous one.","However, thinking that it may have just been its imagination, it struck again and felt a strange sensation when it launched several attacks.","At first, receiving the destructive impulse’s attacks makes Kaito’s head somewhat recoil. When Kaito’s mind becomes unstable, the damage it inflicts against him also passes through...... but what about now? No matter how many fists it slammed into him, Kaito didn’t even budge an inch. On the contrary, his speed and power of the occasional counterattack is increasing rapidly.","Yes...... Having been filled with determination, Kaito’s mentality was getting stronger and stronger at an accelerated rate.","......The destructive impulse could no longer follow the speed of Kaito’s fists with its own eyes. The frequency of counterattacks he sent began to increase compared to when they first fought. The destructive impulse’s arm that was hitting Kaito began to hurt it instead. At an abnormal speed, Kaito’s mentality is getting stronger.","Thereupon...... The hands of the destructive impulse stops. Even if it attacks Kaito, it would only receive a powerful counterattack, just for it to unleash an attack that wouldn’t deal damage to Kaito at all. As the destructive impulse pondered, thinking what it should do...... It became astonished.","For itself, a personification of a destructive impulse...... to actually be hesitating to attack, such a thing is something it couldn’t believe.","When it comes to strong opponents, this destructive impulse has dealt with them before. Kuromueina and Shalltear...... Both have overpowered it and subdued it with their skills. However, this destructive impulse never gave in, thinking that there would come a day when it could grow even stronger and defeat them.","However, what about the being in front of it now? In the beginning, even though there was some strength difference between them, it was superior to him in terms of skill. However, Kaito is still growing at an accelerated rate. His mentality is getting stronger and stronger, as if his willpower was inexhaustible.","“If I can’t win......”. Such a thought crossed its mind, but as if to shake it off, the destructive impulse ran towards Kaito and swung a fist at him————– only to be blown away by Kaito’s fist swung towards him.","Kaito’s physical ability had already improved to the point where he could see the destructive impulse’s attack, allowing him to slam his fist into it first. A hopeless gap in ability was forming between the two of them.","The destructive impulse was astonished, but immediately afterwards, along with the sound of a snap, one of its horns broke...... and in this battle where one’s mentality is competing with each other, a clear damage to the physical body...... is in other words, proof that its heart is about to break.","As the destructive impulse wondered what in the world it should do...... It saw Kaito suddenly burst into tears.","“Kaito!? What’s the matter!? Are you alright!?”","[Yes, I’m sorry. I was just so happy......]","“Happy?”","At the sound of Megiddo’s voice of curiosity, the destructive impulse is also unable to move because it doesn’t understand the situation well. In such a situation, Kaito calmly spun his words.","[No, it really just awakened so abruptly...... Even when I knew that she would continue to exist in my heart when she disappeared......]","“U- Unnn?”","While the others were confused by his words, Kaito wipes away his tears and staring at the destructive impulse with eyes filled with strength, he spun his words.","[The heart treads upon the definite path——– Smiling together, crying together, accumulating footprints of memories together——– The bonds I weave are the fragments of a miracle——– My heart, burst forth! Together, become one! “Αναμν?σει?”!]","(T/N: Memories)","As his words filled with definite power were spun, Kaito’s body shone strongly...... and then, someone else’s voice, neither Kaito’s nor Megiddo’s, echoed in that space.","[......How should I say this...... I know this is too late already...... but thank you for waiting, Kaito-san! The “Support Character” makes her entrance!]","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Objection!!!]","? ? ? : [Whoa there, what’s up with you?]","Serious-senpai : [Look, I forgot where that thing has been brought up, but isn’t something like awakening stuff like this supposed to happen when Kaito is in a pinch or something!!!?]","? ? ? : [I see. Well then, let’s put the situation in order.]","~~~~~~","Destructive Impulse : (What the heck is this being, my attacks won’t even connect properly. Feeling like without any limits, he’s getting stronger and stronger. The destructive impulse that I am is on the verge of giving in...... It’s frustrating, but it’s also fortunate that I was able to fight such a great opponent......)","Kaito: [Uwrrrooooogggghhhh, Αναμν?σει?!]","Destructive: (Why the heck did you decide to go for an overkill!? Tell me!)","~~~~~~","? ? ? : [—–or something like that?]","Serious-senpai : [......Unnn. I see, it just awakened even when he’s not in a pinch. And so, even when he’s got so much advantage that he’s almost assured victory, that ability decided to awaken and he went for an overkill...... Isn’t that too mean, Protagonist!?]"]},{"number":1335,"title":"Chapter 1335 - Mamonaka Alyssa 5","paragraphs":["When Alice explained to me about the Heart Tools, she said that the timing of awakening can be abrupt, and she was really right. As if by intuition, the name of my Heart Tool, its abilities, and how to use it came to my mind.","The name of my Heart Tool is Αναμν?σει?. It’s an ability that allows me to bestow a powerful buff to the person with whom I have spun a bond with, but besides that, it also allows me to summon a deceased person whom I recognized as having been together with me.","This is probably due to the fact that I have had the deaths of my mother and father drag me on for a long time, which is why it has a long effect time and has the ability to affect the deceased.","(T/N: Αναμν?σει?/Memories)","And there, I realized this the moment I awakened Αναμν?σει?. The members of the study group who fought alongside me during Shiro-san’s ordeal, even though they were only temporary memories, were indeed important people who were with me.","When I realized that the remnants of these women, whom I thought had disappeared, remained in my heart and could be recalled by using Αναμν?σει?, I involuntarily shed tears.","However, due to my skill level...... I could only call up one of them for a short time at the moment.","That’s why, I chose her. My best friend in that world with whom I’ve been together for the longest time, the person that left the strongest impression on me...... Mamonaka Alyssa......","The woman with long blonde hair, wearing sunglasses, who appeared in front of me was without a doubt Alyssa, and I could feel the tears forming from my eyes.","[......It’s been a while, Kaito-san.]","[Yeah.]","[I’m going to give my honest opinion...... Right now, I feel like I wanna die.]","[U- Unnn?]","Arehh? For some reason, she started saying strange things. As I was tilting my head, wondering what was going on, I saw her face behind the sunglasses blushing red.","[After all! I thought that would be the last time I’d be able to see you...... that’s why I said such a d*mn embarrassing line! I didn’t hear that there would be a Continue button around! I’m not at the level where my face feels like it’s on fire, I feel like my face has literally turned into fire!]","[......Pfft, ahaha.]","[No, this isn’t something to be laughing about!!!]","How should I say this...... Seeing Alyssa, who was acting just as I remembered her well, I mean, I know that it was obvious, but feeling convinced that it really was her, I couldn’t help but smile from relief.","“......Who the heck is that? She seems different from Shalltear?”","[Ahhh, errr, it would take a long to explain, so I’ll do it later...... Alyssa, for the time being, I need your help, so do you understand the situation?]","[......Yeah, I get the gist of the situation. We just need to beat that thing up, right? You can count on me. It’s exactly at this moment that I will show you my journalism!]","[You’re saying all that...... but how is this even related to journalism?]","I don’t think that’s the word you use, at least not in this situation. Alyssa has an extraordinary obsession with being a journalist though, so well, I guess I’ll just let that slide.","As I was thinking that, the destructive impulse stood up...... and it lunged at me, looking slightly angrier than before. I’m kinda feeling this protesting emotion from it, as if to tell me how dare I ignore it while doing all sorts of nonsense.","Thereupon, Alyssa stood in front of me, as if to protect me, holding two pistols in her hands.","[Please don’t make light of me. The current me is a personification of Kaito-san’s Heart Tool, and Kaito-san’s strength of heart is my strength. If you hadn’t been a match for Kaito-san, you have no chance of winning against me. Let me show you one of the 88 Journalist Secret Techniques...... “Gun-fu fighting”!!!]","No, why the heck is a journalist fighting with guns? Before such a tsukkomi was thrown out of my mouth though, Alyssa rushed forward, and just as she declared, she engaged the destructive impulse in close combat...... and with this “gun-fu” of hers, she overwhelmed the destructive impulse.","Since Alyssa is from my Heart Tool, her physical abilities in this space are the same as the current me, and on top of that, her sense of battle is completely different from mine, and so, the destructive impulse isn’t even able to strike back with either fists or feet, the damage it received continued to accumulate.","[Unfortunately, your heart had already been broken halfway through your fight with Kaito-san. With this, I bestow upon you a requiem.]","As Alyssa announced this, the two pistols she was holding disappeared, and a rainbow-colored bullet and a revolver-type gun appeared in her hand. I recognized that glow.","The bullet that Erina shot the giant dragon with in that battle in the Mental World.","[......”Wings of Bonds”.]","When Alyssa held up the gun loaded with the rainbow-colored bullet and pulled the trigger, the shining bullet, drawing a trajectory like wings spreading, pierced through the destructive impulse’s body and turned its body into particles of light.","Whether that means it has given in or not is something I don’t know about...... but what I’m sure about is that this settles it.","[......Whoa.]","[It seems that because you’re not accustomed to using it yet, it wore off after prolonged use.]","[I see...... I wanted to talk with you more......]","[It’s alright. Me and everyone else are in Kaito-san’s heart, so you can always talk to us if you call us with Αναμν?σει? again.]","[......I see, you’re right. Thanks. Also, welcome back, Alyssa.]","[......Yes!]","Hearing my words, Alyssa gave me a broad smile as her body turned into particles of light and was absorbed into my body.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [I see. Even though they look alike, she’s a different character from Alice.]","? ? ? : [Hohh, and what part of her is different then......]","Serious-senpai : [Unlike Alice, she hadn’t been twisted by the enormous amount of years, so her personality is somewhat more upfront.]","? ? ? : [......I see you’re seeking death.]","Serious-senpai : [Offu......]"]},{"number":1336,"title":"Chapter 1336 - Mamonaka Alyssa 6","paragraphs":["Feeling the sensation of my consciousness surfacing, I found myself back in the room where Megiddo-san and Alice had been.","[......So, what happened? As expected, as I’m an outsider, I can’t observe how the Mental Competition went.]","[H- Hmmm, for the time being, I did win, but I don’t know if I can say if the destructive impulse has given in...... Also, my Heart Tool has awakened.]","[Eh? Αναμν?σει? awakened huh. Heehhh, well, congratulations.]","(T/N: Memories)","[How did you even know its name...... Ah, come to think of it, you would be able to find out the information of my Heart Tool with your ?κατ?γχειρε? huh.]","(T/N: Hekatonkheires)","For a Heart Tool, ?κατ?γχειρε? is too powerful. Well, it can’t do anything as a stand-alone ability, but it has evolved along with Alice into a cheat-level stress......","As I was thinking about this, I turned toward Megiddo-san, and she seemed to be probing something with her eyes closed. While I’m wondering about this, Megiddo-san’s body emitted a dark reddish light, and when Megiddo-san opened her eyes, her eyes were shining bright red.","However, unlike the eyes of the destructive impulse, I could sense the light of reason in that glow.","[......Fuhahaha...... I can see how much it must have endured from the beating it got from Kaito. I now got complete control. I’m really not mistaken to ask you for help. Good grief, you’re really great.]","[Oh~~ Even that hard headed thing was brought to its knees huh. As expected, when it comes to mental strength, Kaito-san may be the strongest.]","It seems that I had successfully managed to make it yield, as Megiddo-san can now completely control her destructive impulse. Now, even if she exerts her full strength, she will not go into a situation where she suddenly rampages against her will.","Well, at any rate, now that the situation is safely settled, I picked up the tea that Alice brewed before I knew it and drank it. The battle was fought in the mental world, so it didn’t really affect my real body, but I still feel some fatigue......","[Alright, I’ve fallen in love with you! You can come and have sex with me, Kaito!]","[Bfuuhh!?]","The fact that Megiddo-san suddenly started saying incomprehensible things made me unintentionally spit out the tea I was drinking.","[Ahh, but if you’re the kinda guy who likes to be on the receiving end, that’s fine with me too. Well, I guess we can just go through stuff like that while we’re doing the spearing, but for the time being, let’s start with———!?]","Just as Megiddo-san was about to take off her clothes, Alice punched her.","[Keh, oi, the heck is with you now, Shalltear?]","[We’re the ones who should be saying that! Why the heck are you suddenly acting like a d*mned horny gorilla!?]","[Ahh? That’s why, in this case, I fell in love with Kaito from the bottom of my heart, so I said that if it’s Kaito, we can fuck. This is the first time I’ve ever allowed someone to get on top of me, you know? Well, if Kaito’s preferences were more leaning in that direction, I don’t mind being the one on top......]","[I’m not talking about that, I’m saying you’re taking things in stride! Are you just as muscle headed when it comes to matters of love!!!?]","Alice’s tsukkomis are much appreciated. Megiddo-san looked like she was genuinely puzzled by what Alice was saying though, as it seems like she really thinks that “she’s in love with someone, so having sex with them is alright”.","In response to such a Megiddo-san, Alice explained what love should be like in a fiery way.","[......Ahh~~ In other words, you talking about that? If we’re gonna do that, it would be when Kaito falls in love with me first? It’s not like you need to be a stickler with stuff like that. You can just leave that for later.]","[You can’t do that! In the first place, haven’t you ever thought that you’re completely off Kaito-san’s preferences?]","[Ahh? That doesn’t matter though? When it comes to stuff like that, I just have to make him fall in love with me until his preferences and fetishes change, right?]","[......You, aren’t you persisting with that strong style of yours too much?]","I guess it’s to be expected of Megiddo-san, her stance on matters of love is also breaking through everything upfront...... She’s strong.","As I was thinking that, Megiddo-san approached me, brought her face close to mine and peered into my face. Megiddo-san in her true form is quite a beauty, so my heart couldn’t help skipping a beat.","[Well, it certainly seems that’s the case, so I’ll spend some time with Kaito more before we do that.]","[Y- Yes, that would be great......]","With her eyes sparkling, her lips formed to a smile...... a smile of a predator that had set its sights on its prey.","[That’s why, I’ll be patient with just this today.]","[Just th———- Hrnnn!?]","Just like that, with extremely natural movements, Megiddo-san kissed me. Eeeehhh!? Wait, this is just too sudden, and her lips are so soft......","As I was feeling confused under her mercy, immediately right after, Megiddo-san was punched away. Of course, the one who punched her was Alice.","[Like I said, what do you think you’re doing, you sh*tty gorilla!!!?]","[U- Unnn? No, I mean, you said we should take it slowly, one step at a time, so I’ll settle with this in the start......]","[And you start with a kiss!? Haahhh...... Geez, I have to ask Kuro-san’s help with this. You need to properly learn what love is......]","In front of the sighing Alice, Megiddo-san looked really dumbfounded, seemingly as if she had no clue what Alice was talking about. Putting aside her aggressiveness when it comes to love, for the time being, I’m able to confirm again how outrageous of a person she is.","How should I say this...... I’m starting to feel anxious about the future.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Gyaaaaahhhhh, go restrain yourself! You’re acting too fast!!!]","? ? ? : [Seriously, when this gorilla thinks of something, she just freaking decides to do it......]"]},{"number":1337,"title":"Chapter 1337 - Mamonaka Alyssa 7","paragraphs":["I felt tired for all sorts of reasons, but for the time being, Megiddo-san’s case was already resolved, so I returned home. After that, I had to ask Alice and Iris, who could be considered experts on this subject, about my awakened Heart Tool, so I went to Iris-san’s bar.","[How does it feel? Do you have an idea of how much you’d be able to use it?]","[Yes. At the moment, I could use Αναμν?σει? once a day for about 15 minutes...... It’s probably not that long huh?]","(T/N: Memories)","My Heart Tool bearing the name Αναμν?σει? had awakened, and I knew how to use it. And it turns out that the power of my Heart Tool allows me to summon the members of the research group I fought with in Shiro-san’s ordeal back then.","However, even if I wanted to call and talk to them, I would only be able to talk to one person a day for about 15 minutes, and it’s unfortunate that I’m not in a situation where I can leisurely talk to them.","Hearing my words though, Alice and Iris-san looked somewhat nostalgic.","[Ah~~ Kaito-san, that’s just how it is at the beginning.]","[Umu. We too, when our Heart Tools first awakened, could barely manifest them for a short time each day.]","[Is that so?]","[Yes. The performance of a Heart Tool doesn’t depend on the user’s magic power. Heart Tools have something like proficiency in them, and if you train and accumulate enough proficiency, your Heart Tool will grow and the effect time will increase. When I use Kaito-san’s Heart Tool with my ?κατ?γχειρε?, I can summon a large number of people with almost no time limit...... If Kaito-san’s proficiency with the Heart Tool improves, you will be able to summon multiple people for an extended period of time.]","(T/N: Hekatonkheires)","[......I see. Incidentally, how do I improve my proficiency?]","In other words, my Αναμν?σει? have just awakened and is still Lv 1. And so, by increasing my proficiency level, the effect time will be extended and the number of people that I can summon will increase......","It’s nice to know that it doesn’t depend on the amount of magic power the person has. This means that even someone lacking magic power like me can bring out the best of this ability by raising its proficiency.","[Basically, you just repeatedly use it. Once a day, even if it’s just a short period of time, use your Heart Tool. In the world where we are from, those who have awakened their Heart Tools train themselves in this way. By doing so, they gradually increase their proficiency levels, and in some cases, their Heart Tool may even grow further.]","[Ohh, so the Heart Tool could also grow further huh.]","[A simple example of that would be my Ultimate Battle Form. It’s something like a trump card you can use when the proficiency level of your Heart Tool has reached its limit.]","?κατ?γχειρε?’s Ultimate Battle Form, if I’m not mistaken, is a tremendous ability that allows Alice to take in the bonds she formed in her body and gives Alice the ability to evolve infinitely. However, it seems that she can’t casually use it due to its severe activation requirements......","[......Come to think of it, does Iris-san’s ?ποκ?λυψι? have an Ultimate Battle Form?]","(T/N: Apocalypse, a Staff-type Heart Tool.)","[Yeah, it has...... but the Ultimate Battle Form of my Heart Tool is difficult to handle...... In the first place, it’s an ability I can’t use by myself.]","[Iris’ Ultimate Battle Form was awakened when we fought against a monster called Seven-Star Demon Beast, and putting aside how strong we were now, the us who were fighting that beast back then were still weak, so it was a really fierce battle. Well, it would take a long time to explain the events of that time in detail, so I’ll save it for another time. Anyhow, she can activate her Ultimate Battle Form by holding the ?ποκ?λυψι? with me.]","[Heehhh...... That sounds kinda cool.]","It kinda feels like her strongest form becomes awakened by the bond between the two of them, so it sounds cool. Well, since Iris-san said it’s difficult to handle, the activation conditions should be quite limited......","[Incidentally, as an additional effect, I can bestow ?ποκ?λυψι? the other abilities I borrowed with ?κατ?γχειρε?. For example, there’s this Heart Tool I can use that allows me to attack all opponents in sight at the same time, and if I bestow that ability to ?ποκ?λυψι?, it allows me to fire beams at all opponents in sight at the same time. I can also bestow it multiple abilities at the same time, allowing me to do various things depending on the combination.]","[Well, both of us need to hold our ?ποκ?λυψι?, so it’s hard to handle...... but my Ultimate Battle Form is roughly something like that. It’s an ability that gives me tremendous power in exchange for severe conditions...... but well, you’re still a long way off to reach your Ultimate Battle Form, Miyama Kaito.]","[Speaking of which, Kaito-san’s Ultimate Battle Form hasn’t manifested yet, so I don’t know what it would be like even with my ?κατ?γχειρε?.]","Hmmm, something like an evolved power like that feels kinda cool...... but well, there isn’t really any need to rush getting that. What I should focus on first is my goal of being able to call Alyssa and the other members of the study group long enough to leisurely talk to them.","[......Come to think of it, how is my Heart Tool like from Alice and Iris-san’s perspective?]","[It’s totally broken. It’s the strongest among the Buff-type abilities. It’s probably because Kaito-san’s mental strength has always been tremendous, but the ability increase is nasty, and if you increase its proficiency levels, the range should also increase.]","[The fact that it’s an incorporeal-type is also a strong point. If a person’s Heart Tool gets attacked, the user will also receive mental damage, but since your Heart Tool is intangible, you won’t receive feedback like that. It’s a shame that being like that personally doesn’t have an effect on you, but as a support, it’s an extremely powerful Heart Tool.]","[Ohh~~ Now that you described it like that, it kinda makes me happy.]","When it comes to combat-related matters, I felt like I have completely hopeless talent...... but as a support, I was very happy to be evaluated as strong by the two of them.","......For example, I can also give power-ups to Bell and Lynn...... It feels like my abilities are really leaning toward being a Monster Tamer......","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Indeed, the times when Kaito is actually being evaluated as being amazing in something that’s at least related to combat is precious.]"]},{"number":1338,"title":"Chapter 1338 - Mamonaka Alyssa 8","paragraphs":["The next day, Αναμν?σει? became available again. It seems that rather than the ability being available again when the clock hits midnight, it’s more like it has a 24-hour cooldown time. Thereupon, in the sense of improving my proficiency with my Heart Tool, I decided to call Alyssa again.","(T/N: Memories)","Alice also appeared, perhaps interested, and looked intently at Alyssa who had appeared.","[Hmmm. She certainly looks like me, but she isn’t me nor my clone. It feels strange.]","[My original, as to be expected, is a transcendental beauty...... but the current character coverage is terrible. I suppose I’ll change my hairdo......]","Indeed, their faces looked exactly alike...... Well, Alyssa was originally created based on Alice, so it’s inevitable that she would resemble her. The only difference is that one of them is wearing a mask, while the other is wearing sunglasses.","The two of them were also concerned about this, as after Alyssa muttered a few words, her body was enveloped in light and her hair was shortened to about semi-short length.","[Ohh, that feels rather refreshing.]","[I think I’ll go like this from now on. If Eri-chan-sensei also changes her hairdo, it will be possible to distinguish her from the original. Our original seems to be quite famous in this world, so it would be better if people can clearly see how we’re different from them.]","[......Hmmm, how nostalgic.]","[Nostalgic?]","Hearing Alyssa’s words as her hair became semi-short, it was indeed as she says, as Erina looks just like Kuro, and Irys-san also looks like Isis-san, so I agreed that they might need to have their hairstyles changed. At that moment, Alice muttered in a heartfelt tone, so I asked her back.","(T/N: I translated it before as Iris, but I hadn’t really expected they would make a reappearance again, thinking it would just be Alyssa, so I would have to distinguish her from Apocalypse Iris. Therefore, I’m now changing the name of Dream World Isis to Irys.)","[Well, my hair used to be that long. It was that length when I was traveling with Iris for a while. I’m already used to my hair being this long, but seeing myself with hair that short feels nostalgic.]","Come to think of it, I feel like I remember hearing something like that. She used to have semi-short hair for a long time, but since she tried a makeover and tried letting her hair grow longer, she thought that having long hair suits her skin so she kept it that way......","[......Putting that aside, how is it like with you and the others’ memories, Alyssa?]","[Hmmm, what I remember is basically what was in that world. I remember being in the same class as Kaito-san in high school, and I feel like everyone else also remembers the setting of that world. I also remember all the blunders Kaito-san made back in high school perfectly.]","[......That’s strange. A black history that shouldn’t have happened is somehow being generated in my memory......]","In fact, I also have memories of living in the world Shiro-san had created. In other words, I remember being friends with Alyssa since high school.","I don’t know what the principle behind this is, but since I clearly distinguish my memories in that world from my other memories, I don’t confuse it with my original memories...... Somehow, among those memories were relatively embarrassing failures, so I’m kinda feeling like I’m being falsely accused.","[Ahaha, well, that’s basically how we feel. Currently, it’s a problem that I can’t manifest for a long time like this, but if I can manifest for a longer time, I’d like to make a newspaper!]","[You’ve always been wanting to become a journalist, haven’t you?]","[Yes, my journalism is on the verge of exploding!]","[Journalism isn’t something that explodes though.....]","How should I say this...... Seeing Alyssa being the same as ever, I couldn’t help smiling. Although her face is similar to Alice’s, there are some differences between the two of them.","It’s something natural, but compared to Alice, Alyssa’s personality seems a little younger. Well, it’s inevitable that there would be such a difference between Alyssa, who is in her 20s, and Alice, who has lived a vast number of years.","[......I wonder why. It feels like I’m looking at my old self who hasn’t been twisted yet, so looking at her makes me feel somewhat ticklish.]","[Since we have such a similar face...... How about you become my Big Sister?]","[Unfortunately, I already have a little sister in my heart......]","[The heck is with that phrasing.]","Speaking of which, Alice did claim she has the cutest little sister in the world...... No, should I have said “had” there? From what I’ve heard, it sounded like she has quite a deep personality......","[Come to think of it, you had a little sister huh.]","[Yes, I will introduce her to Kaito-san one of these days.]","[Unnn?]","[Ahh, I can call her up with Αναμν?σει?.]","[Ahh, I see.]","It’s just a guess, but up until now, she had probably refrained from using it so that I won’t be spoiled what my Heart Tool is. After all, whenever I asked her about my Heart Tool, she always said “You’ll have to wait until it awakens to find out”.","However, now that I can use Αναμν?σει?, Alice no longer has to hide it from me.","[......Oops, it seems like time’s almost up. Well then, Kaito-san, original me, let’s meet again~~]","At that moment, it seems that Αναμν?σει? has already reached its limit, as waving her hand goodbye with a smile, Alyssa disappeared as particles of light.","How should I say this...... She’s just as bright and cheerful as I remember. With a light chuckle, I’m looking forward to the next opportunity to talk to her again.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Ah, that hardcore siscon imouto huh...... What, are the only people related to you people who won’t shake others up in some way?]","? ? ? : [......It’s hard to deny it.]"]},{"number":1339,"title":"Chapter 1339 - Garden of Myriad Flowers 1","paragraphs":["After my Heart Tool awakened after the incident with Megiddo-san, I’m now trying to use it once a day to improve my proficiency. Well, let’s be patient and let it grow little by little.","Having such a thought in mind, I looked at the large magic kiln in front of me. This is the magic kiln that Illness-san and Nebula purchased, and it was delivered and installed the other day.","The design is quite stylish, and it doesn’t look out of place in the backyard. It doesn’t emit any smoke, and the two seem to be satisfied with its performance.","[Thank you for waitiiiiiiing.]","[Thank you...... So these are the teacups that Nebula and Illness-san made?]","[Yes! This is our first creation!]","Illness-san puts a cup of tea in front of me as I sit down. This cup was made by Nebula and Illness-san, and I was allowed to have their first creation.","However, as to be expected from the two of them, even their first creation is so beautifully made that I would have just agreed if they told me this was store-bought...... and when I pour the tea into it, there’s a flower-like pattern appearing on the rim...... Unnn?","[Arehh? A pattern appeared?]","[Yes! The pattern should emerge based on the temperature of the cup. These are just made for private use, so I added them just for fun.]","[Heehhh...... Interesting......]","Come to think of it, I had certainly heard of cups like that before that were able to react to temperatures. Even so, the pattern on this teacup is amazing. It’s beautiful and colorful, and it’s also interesting how the teacup, which is white at first, is now gorgeously colored when tea is poured into it.","When I actually drink the tea, I found that the cup is easy to hold and drink from. It seems that the functionality of the teacups was also well thought out.","[Incidentally, we also made tea cups with patterns from the start.]","[We only have 3 varieties of teacups at the momeeeeent, but we are still experimentiiiiing. The depth of potteryyyyyy is very deep and interestiiiiiing.]","[Right. After we get more accustomed to it, it will be interesting to add functions such as engraving magic formulas in it to keep the cup warm.]","[With a cup of this size, can you put in a magic crystal of a size that can contain that magic formula?]","[If we combine several super-small magic crystals and make them work together to activate the magic formula, I think it would be possible. For example, like this~~]","[This iiiiiis...... I seeeeee, this certainly was a wonderful ideaaaaaaa.]","Nebula suggested something and wrote it on the paper, to which Illness-san nodded in admiration. Nebula’s creativity has always been highly praised by Illness-san, so she must have come up with another revolutionary method.","[Rather than making use of a Partitioning Techniiiiiiiique, you opted on partitioning the magic formula itself huuuuuuh? If this is possibleeeeee, there will be a revolution in the production of magic tooooooools.]","[Although it requires some verification, I think it can be done.]","[In order for this to work thouuuuuugh, the material for our potteryyyyyyy would need to be something that’s highly conductible with magic power, don’t you thiiiiiiink?]","[I think it can be done by kneading powderized magic crystals into the dough. The purpose of this step isn’t for engraving a magic formula, but to increase the conductivity of magic power.]","[I see, in that caaaaase...... How about we try it ouuuut?]","[Yes! Let’s try it out!!!]","It seemed like they had come to an agreement and decided to give it a try right away. As I watched them discussing the details while drinking my tea, smiling as I thought they really are good friends...... a hummingbird flew in.","Wondering who it was from, I found out that it was from Rosemary-san...... and the subject was about that thing Camellia-san had mentioned to me before. It was a consultation of my schedule, asking me when I would be available to visit her home in the Garden of Myriad Flowers.","I had heard about it before and I also wanted to visit Rosemary-san’s home, so I sent her a reply confirming when she would be free.","At that moment, an idea occurred to me, and I approached Illness-san and Nebula, who were in the middle of their discussion.","[......It’s fine if it’s only possible, but I’m planning to visit Rosemary-san’s home soon, so I’m wondering if I could bring the teacups you both made?]","[By Rosemary-san, you were talking about the flower-loving Spirit who came to visit our home before, right?]","[Unnn, that’s right..]","[In that caaaaase, I think it might be betteeeeeer if we make a new one that suits her preferenceeeeeees.]","[I agree! It seems that she’s a Rose Spirit, so let’s make something with a rose motif!]","It was just an idea I had suddenly come up with, but they were more enthusiastic than expected, as they talked about making a cup exclusively for Rosemary-san.","Ahh~~ But it was certainly true that Rosemary-san seemed to like tea, and since she invited me to her home, it would be nice if we could bring her some cups as a souvenir.","(T/N: I don’t know how many cups Kaito will bring, but you would usually give teacups as a set, right?)","[That sounds like a good idea. If it’s okay with you two, can I ask you to make some for Rosemary-san......]","[Yeeees. Please leave it to uuuuuus.]","[We’ll make something she’ll definitely like~~]","They really seemed to be enjoying making pottery, as they pleasantly smiled at my words. I’m certainly looking forward to visiting Rosemary-san’s home, but I was also looking forward to the souvenir tea cups that I would bring along with me.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Kaito is like an idiotic parent when it comes to Nebula, so he didn’t notice it at all...... but for Illness to describe her suggestion as something on the level of “something that will bring a revolution in the production of magic tools”, wouldn’t that mean Nebula suggested a technique that is new in that world......]"]},{"number":1340,"title":"Chapter 1340 - Garden of Myriad Flowers 2","paragraphs":["The Garden of Myriad Flowers is located near Yggfresis and as its name suggests, it’s said to be a very beautiful garden with many flowers in bloom.","However, although the name is well-known, the location of the Garden of Myriad Flowers is almost unknown to the public, making it known as a Phantom Garden that can’t be reached by ordinary means.","The reason is simple. The Garden of Myriad Flowers, to put it simply, is the home and garden owned by Rosemary-san, who has an extreme case of stranger anxiety, and she has put up extremely strong barriers to prevent strangers from entering.","It is impossible for ordinary people to break through the barrier that Rosemary-san, one of the Six Kings’ executives and a Peak Count-rank, has put up quite seriously, and thus, making the place known as a phantom location.","[......Or so it was written in a gossipy magazine, but is that information true?]","[Unnn. Rosemary-chan is quite good at Barrier Magic. Recognition Inhibition so that people won’t notice the place even if they come close, Visual Obstruction so that people can’t see the place even if they realize what that place is, and Phase Shift so that people can’t enter. It was a place covered with many layers of barriers, so I think only a handful of people can find it on their own.]","[Heehhh......]","When I asked Kuro, who had come to hang out with me as usual, it really seemed like a phantom location. I mean, she’s really going all out just not to meet strangers huh...... Well, with Rosemary-san’s personality, I guess it can’t be helped.","Understanding why those barriers are in place, I ate a baby castella. The ones today are safe and delicious baby castellas, and as usual, it’s served with a cup of coffee from a teapot.","[......Ahh, speaking of which, Nebula made some pottery with Illness-san, don’t you think they’re pretty good?]","[Ohh, it has a beautiful color. The fact that they can produce a white color this beautiful is evidence of their good skill. Nebula-chan is as multi-talented as always.]","[Right, right. They’re even making various plans to make it, like partitioning the magic formula itself or something.]","[......Sorry, what was that?]","[Eh? No, they’re apparently partitioning the magic formula itself......]","[Partitioning the magic formula? Rather than using Partitioning Magic to divide it into multiple magic formulas, they partitioned the magic formula? Did it activate?]","[......I heard it did? Those cups also have a Temperature Preservation Magic engraved into it......]","When I said that, Kuro started to look at the teacups made by Nebula with a very serious expression on her face. After staying silent in that unusual atmosphere for a while, Kuro muttered.","[......Amazing. The idea is not to insert the magic formula, but to knead it in...... There are so many divisions, but the magic formula is still activated without any problem? If they had made even the slightest mistake in the way they partitioned it, it wouldn’t have activated. Even if they did...... It would normally require dozens or hundreds of trials and errors to figure out how to divide a magic formula, which would normally have been impossible...... but it’s perfect. Amazing, even if the materials that can be used are limited to some extent, this makes it possible to make magic tools that couldn’t be made until now due to the size of the magic crystal.]","[......................]","[Kaito-kun, can you call Nebula-chan for a moment? I’d like to ask her some questions.]","[Alright.]","It seems that that technique was more outrageous than I had imagined, as Kuro’s eyes looked really serious. Come to think of it, I think Illness-san had also said that if that technique came true, it would revolutionize the production of magic tools......","Feeling surprised, I called for Nebula, and she immediately came to my room.","[Milord, you wanted to see me?]","[Unnn. Kuro wants to ask you about the technique Nebula used in the cup you made.]","[I’m sorry for calling you suddenly, Nebula-chan. It’s just, the idea of partitioning the magic formula for this cup is revolutionary, so I’d really like it if you could tell me more about it. Of course, you don’t have to tell me if you think it’s unreasonable, and since Nebula-chan has the rights to this technique, I will pay you royalty money for the magic tools we would use this technique on.]","[......I see! It’s no problem, and the money isn’t needed! I am Absolute. Compensation for the use of the knowledge and rights that this Absolute me possesses is unnecessary...... Well, if you insist, please give the money to Milord. I receive money from him every time I need it anyway......]","After saying this while puffing out her chest on her small body, Nebula began to explain to Kuro in detail about partitioning magic formulas.","Frankly speaking, their discussion is already on a level that was too high for me and I ended up finding myself not being able to keep up with the conversation along the way, but Kuro was quite engaged in the topic, so I knew that there was a pretty amazing discussion unfolding between them.","[......I see, it has been very informative. Nebula-chan’s idea is unconventional and amazing. I knew this would be revolutionary when I saw it like this, but the starting point for coming up with ideas is very difficult.]","[Hmmm. I’m still not familiar with the common sense of this world, so that may be the reason why I came up with a novel idea.]","[I see...... Anyhow, thank you for teaching me so much. Thanks to you, I’ve come up with a lot of new ideas for magic tools.]","[I’m glad I could be of help. I’m looking forward to the creation of new magic tools.]","Saying this with a smile, Nebula looks really cute. The fact that I have learned one more thing about Nebula’s amazingness somehow also makes me proud.","No, I know that the amazing one here isn’t me, but Nebula, so it’s strange for me to be proud...... but somehow, I can’t help but be happy when Nebula gets praised.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [“For even Kuro to be amazed by that idea, Nebula really is amazing~~” For Kaito to be reacting like that, he’s really bringing out his all to invoke the idiotic parent in him.]","? ? ? : [He’s the same around Bell and Lynn too, so it’s easy to tell when Kaito-san is demonstrating his parental idiocy.]","Serious-senpai : [And as for the Absolute, as expected, she really is quite a bundle of consideration...... While saying that there’s no need for compensation for providing the technique, she also presented a plan for cases for when the other party feels apologetic instead, and in order for Kaito to not feel aversed by having the money passed to him, she said she will just receive the money from Kaito whenever she needs it, making it look like he was just keeping the money for her......]"]},{"number":1341,"title":"Chapter 1341 - Garden of Myriad Flowers 3","paragraphs":["After arriving at Yggfresis using Teleportation Magic, I moved around looking at the simplified map sent to me by Rosemary-san. The Garden of Myriad Flowers was located very close to Yggfresis, so walking wasn’t a problem.","Even though it’s very close to Yggfresis, the largest city in the Demon Realm, it’s said to be a place known as a Phantom Garden, and the fact that people who aren’t invited can’t get there must be because Rosemary-san’s Barrier Magic was very powerful.","After walking for a while from the entrance to Yggrfresis, the entrance to the Great Forest came into view. If I continue on, I will wander into the largest forest in the Demon Realm...... but at the entrance to the forest, I hold in my hand the invitation letter that was included in Rosemary-san’s letter.","According to the letter, this invitation was made exclusively for me, and when I hold this in my hand, I can see the entrance to the Garden of Myriad Flowers.","Looking around with the invitation in my hand, I found what looked like a gate made of roses. It was a gate that I couldn’t see at all until a few moments ago though.","Feeling somewhat excited by the sense of fantasy it had, I passed through the mysterious gate, which I couldn’t see the other side of...... and the scenery drastically changed.","[Ohhh...... This is amazing.]","There was a flower garden covering the entire place, and colorful flowers were blooming all over my field of view. It was indeed a vast, endless field of flowers, and in the center of the garden was a stylish wooden house.","Just as I was wondering if that was Rosemary-san’s home, rose petals danced in front of my eyes, and Rosemary-san appeared.","Looking around to make sure there was no one here but me, she then spoke with a small smile.","[......Welcome, Kaito-kun.]","[Hello, Rosemary-san. Thank you for inviting me today.]","[No. I’m glad you came. Did you find your way here without any trouble?]","[Yes, thanks to the map you gave me...... ]","If there was no one else in the room, Rosemary-san’s expression doesn’t stiffen, as she spoke to me with a gentle smile.","When her expression stiffens, including her flashy expression, one would get the impression that she looked quite harsh, but when Rosemary-san wasn’t tense, she had a kind older sister-like atmosphere.","[I’m sorry. I wish I could have picked you up at the entrance...... but there are so many people there......]","[It’s alright. Even so, you have an amazing flower garden here. Are all these managed by Rosemary-san?]","[Unnn...... I like flowers, and as I added more and more flowers, the garden became this big.]","[Heehhh......]","I knew that Rosemary-san liked flowers, but it was amazing to actually see them like this. A wonderful flower garden that made you think that this place had all kinds of flowers in the world...... Just looking at it from here made me feel overwhelmed.","[Since we’re at it, before we go to my home, how about we check out the flower garden for a bit?]","[Is that alright? If you’re fine with it, then by all means.]","[Unnn. The flowers over here aren’t common in the Human Realm, so they should be rare.]","I followed Rosemary-san as she guided me through the flower garden. It was quite obvious, but Rosemary-san, who loved flowers so much, was very knowledgeable about them, as she introduced them to me with simple explanations, which was fun to listen to.","I mean, I thought the same when I heard her explanation about art, but Rosemary-san is quite good at explaining, and her teaching method is easy to understand.","[By the way, what is your favorite flower, Rosemary-san? I guess it would be the rose?]","[Hmmm, I guess so. I’m not sure what to answer if I’m asked how much I like each kind of flower, but the type I like the most would have to be roses...... Though perhaps, being a Rose Spirit, I may just have favorable thoughts of my own kind.]","[I like roses a lot too. They look gorgeous and have many different kinds, so they’re fun to look at.]","[Unnn. As Kaito-kun said, their variety is one of the charms of roses. The area over there is where roses are planted, so shall we go there?]","[Yes, by all means. Do you also have rare roses among them?]","[That’s right. I’m raising a variety known as Ord Roses, and other than those, I’m also raising some roses that are no longer seen anywhere else.]","As she spoke, Rosemary-san calmly explained about roses. There are roses in her garden that have beautiful colors but are apparently vulnerable to climate change, and there are also some of them that are almost extinct in the wild.","From what I heard, it seemed that each type of rose had its own small barrier to control the temperature and other factors. I guess her passion for flowers is that extraordinary.","I mean, Rosemary-san looks really happy when she’s talking about flowers, as my attention was also fully drawn by her. Walking around like this is kinda nice.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [A date? Is that a date? Isn’t that a date...... D*mn it!]","? ? ? : [Somehow, I could feel three steps of emotions from those few words......]"]},{"number":1342,"title":"Chapter 1342 - Garden of Myriad Flowers 4","paragraphs":["After walking around the flower garden to some extent, we arrived at a wooden house...... Rosemary-san’s home. Describing it as a small house in the middle of a flower garden fits perfectly, and although it wasn’t that big, I felt that its appearance matched the flower garden.","Once inside, I found it to be another stylish space. The interior was tastefully decorated with furniture of calming wooden colors, and the space inside was nothing short of magnificent, not being gaudily wide, yet not cramped either.","This was a room that one would have to have a very good sense of style to create. Even if I used the same furniture and interior design, I wouldn’t be able to create this stylish atmosphere.","[It’s a stylish and beautiful room.]","[You think so? Hearing you say that makes me happy. Ahh, Kaito-kun, sit there and let me make you some tea.]","[Thank you...... Ah, that’s right!]","[Unnn?]","The timing is just right, so I decided to give her the cup I brought as a souvenir.","[Actually, our Nebula and Illness-san recently took up pottery making, and they made teacups for Rosemary-san for this visit.]","[Eh? Is that so?]","[Yes. And so, if you’re fine with it, here you go.]","[Thanks, it makes me happy...... Ohh, they’re very beautiful. They just started recently and made something this great? They seem to be designed with black tea in mind, and the rose pattern is so beautiful, so it would be no surprise if you said they were made by a skilled craftsman.]","Receiving the teacups with the beautiful rose patterns, Rosemary-san smiled, looking really happy.","If she is this happy, I’m glad I gifted them to her. Well, it was Nebula and Illness who made them......","[......By the way, you mentioned it being designed with black tea in mind?]","[Errr, for cups oriented towards black tea, basically, they should be thin, with a wide mouthpiece and a short height to bring out the flavor and appearance of the tea. On the other hand, coffee cups should be thicker, have a cylindrical mouthpiece, and be taller.]","[I see......]","Heehhh...... That’s the first time I’ve heard about that. Come to think of it, they do use different cups for tea and coffee. I was never really that fussy about drinking tea or coffee back then, and when I was in Japan, I used to drink coffee from a mug.","[......Well then, let’s use these cups right away. It seems just right, as you’ve brought me two.]","[Yes.]","[Kaito-kun, are you okay with rose tea?]","[Errr...... I haven’t drank much of them. I did have an acquaintance who likes herb tea, and they brew them as a blend......]","[I see, then, I guess the pink rose, which doesn’t have too strong an aroma would be better......]","I have many opportunities to drink tea, but not so much herb tea...... most of my experiences with them were when Dr. Vier serves them to me at her place. However, I don’t think I’ve had tea made from roses.","[......I’ve had rose hip tea before, but is that different?]","[That’s right. Rose tea is made from the rose’s petals, while rose hip tea is made from the small red berries that form after the roses bloom.]","[I guess that makes their taste quite different?]","[Rose hip tea is more sour and a little stronger in taste. Rose tea tastes sweeter, but they’re rather light, and its special feature is its strong aroma.]","With these words, Rosemary-san prepared rose tea using dried rose petals with her experienced hands.","The tea was a beautiful shade of red and purple, and combined with the transparent pot, it looked very stylish.","[Thanks for waiting. Well then, I’ll pour them into the cups...... Ahh, that’s amazing. When I pour tea in them...... the rosebud pattern in the cup bloomed beautifully.]","[If I’m not mistaken, they added some sort of mechanism where the pattern changes depending on the temperature.]","[I see, that’s amazing...... Ahh, sorry. Here you go.]","[Thank you.]","[Try drinking it normally, and if you think the taste is weak, add some honey, it will make it sweeter and easier to drink.]","It seemed that the souvenir cup was designed to bloom into a rose when tea was poured into it, and I couldn’t help but notice the vivid change in its appearance.","[......Arehh? Didn’t the color of the rose slightly change?]","[Ahh, it’s true...... Perhaps, it changes not only with temperature, but also with the passage of time? When you pour tea, the flower blooms and you can enjoy the changing color of the rose flower as time goes by. It’s really amazing.]","[How should I say this...... It kinda makes drinking tea fun.]","[Unnn. It’s pleasing to the eye, so it’s really lovely.]","Seeing Rosemary-san’s smile as she said that, my eyes were unintentionally captivated. How should I say this...... When she’s really not nervous, she feels more like a kind and gentle woman, giving me the strong impression that she’s a lovely person.","When she’s nervous and looks sharp though, she feels more like a cool person......","As I had such thoughts in mind, I brought the rose tea Rosemary-san brewed to my mouth. The scent of roses spreading in my mouth somehow felt elegant and pleasant, and drinking it made me feel relaxed.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai: [I wonder why, but it really feels like Rosemary-san is flirting with him here...... Could it be because she has really relaxed her guard around Kaito?]"]},{"number":1343,"title":"Chapter 1343 - Garden of Myriad Flowers 5","paragraphs":["As we were chatting over a cup of rose tea made by Rosemary-san, a question suddenly popped into my mind.","[Come to think of it, Rosemary-san. Is this Garden of Myriad Flowers located at the entrance to the Great Forest and just hidden from view by barriers?]","[No. You’re mistaken...... This place is actually located deep in the Great Forest and is made inaccessible by barriers. To be more specific, for example, if you try to enter from the west side of the Garden of Myriad Flowers, you will just pass through and exit to the east side.]","[So not only is it impossible to notice, but it’s also impossible to enter. However, it isn’t by the entrance of the Great Forest?]","I thought it was just invisible due to the effect of the barriers, hidden with something like a large-scale Recognition Inhibition Magic, but it seems like the Garden of Myriad Flowers isn’t at the entrance of the Great Forest in the first place, but in the inner parts of the forest.","The Great Forest is so vast that it would probably be quite difficult just to find the place.","[Errr, if I explain it in detail, it will devolve the conversation to a technical talk, so I’ll break it down a bit...... Even if a person actually comes to the actual location of the Garden of Myriad Flowers, they can’t enter unless they forcefully break the barriers. The reason for this is that there’s no actual entrance around the barriers. The Garden of Myriad Flowers is located deep in the Great Forest, but the entrance only exists near the entrance to the Great Forest.]","[I see. And that entrance appears when you have an invitation.]","[Unnn. It might be easier to understand if you think of that entrance as something like a Teleportation Gate. That invitation was made for Kaito-kun, so when Kaito-kun comes to the entrance of the Great Forest with it in hand, the entrance leading here will appear.]","[It’s quite complicated, isn’t it?]","[I suppose so. This space itself has also been phase-shifted, so it’s almost like it’s surrounded by a large-scale Spatial Isolation Barrier. Well, I don’t know if you’ve ever met her, but Gluttony, one of Phantasmal King’s subordinates, has created a space on a much larger scale than this.]","In principle, it’s similar to Gluttony-san’s subspace huh...... However, Rosemary-san, who isn’t as good at Space-Time Magic as Gluttony-san, has created something similar by combining several barriers huh?","[I think I somewhat understand now. Thank you.]","[No problem. If there’s anything you’re curious about, you can ask me anything.]","While thanking Rosemary-san, who answered my questions with a gentle smile, another question popped into my mind. Looking around her place for a bit, I found that there were surprisingly few works of art in Rosemary-san’s home.","Rosemary-san is an art lover, with a wide range of knowledge in the subject, and seems to visit art exhibitions, so she must like such things as much as she likes flowers.","That being the case, it wouldn’t have been surprising if her home was decorated with such artworks, but it’s a little surprising that there’s none around.","[......Rosemary-san is very knowledgeable about artworks, so do you also have various stuff like that?]","[Unnn. I have collected a fair amount. However, I have a lot of them, so I don’t keep them out here but in the basement.]","[You have a basement?]","[Unnn. I mean, the basement is much larger than this room. The building above ground is smaller so as not to disturb the flower garden.]","When I asked her about it, it seems that she does possess a lot of artworks. It was just that they aren’t here, but in the basement...... I can’t find anything that looks like an entranceway to that basement in my field of vision, but it would be impolite for me to wander my gaze around to look for it, so I’ll stop here.","[If you want, should we check out the basement?]","[Is that alright?]","[Unnn. Of course.]","[I’m honestly quite interested in it...... so if Rosemary-san is alright with it, I’d be happy to.]","[Fufufu, unnn. I hope there’s something in there that meets your expectations......]","After saying that with a giggle, Rosemary-san moved her gaze to my hand and smiled.","[......Ahh, but maybe after we finish our tea first?]","[You’re right. It’s such good tea, so it would be a shame to waste it.]","[I’m glad you liked it. We have plenty of time, so there’s no need to rush.]]","[Yes...... Even so, the view from here is quite spectacular. I guess you had been quite particular with this aspect of the garden?]","[I had paid a lot of attention to various factors like color schemes and such. For example, basing it on the view from this window......]","After we finished our tea, I was given a tour of the basement. Even when I saw her collection myself though, I probably wouldn’t be able to understand it, but with Rosemary-san around, I think it would probably be alright.","Even so, Rosemary-san, who was explaining this and that to me seemed to be happy, so I somehow naturally feel happy too.","She has a staunch fear of strangers, so inviting someone over for a cup of tea like this is probably not something she does very often.","Camellia-san and the rest of the Seven Princess are also Executives, so they’re usually busy...... Well, whatever the case, it’s great that we’re enjoying each other’s company.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [I understand that her Heroine Power is high. She’s somehow like Isis...... Like, you can feel she’s clearly open to Kaito when she talks to him......]"]},{"number":1344,"title":"Chapter 1344 - Garden of Myriad Flowers 6","paragraphs":["After we finished our tea, Rosemary-san led me to the basement. I was a little surprised that what I thought was an ordinary empty floor transformed into a staircase. No, considering how this was a world where magic exists, I suppose that wouldn’t be strange, but seeing it change has this different sense of fantasy from teleporting.","When I descended the wooden stairs and arrived at the basement, I found it to be a fairly large space. It was quite bright, having an atmosphere somewhat similar to a museum, with jar-like objects openly displayed.","[This is amazing! There’s this much artwork around.]","[This is the room where I keep my pottery.]","[......Potteries? Does that mean you also have other rooms?]","[Unnn. I have other rooms as well, like for example, a room for paintings and another for sculptures, each of which has its own way of displaying my collection. The lighting and brightness are important when looking at artworks after all.]","[I see......]","The rooms are divided according to the artwork huh...... Errr, with that scale, I guess the scale of the basement would be quite extraordinary......","At any rate, this pottery room alone is quite large. With each artwork displayed at a certain distance from each other, it looks like an ordinary art museum.","[......Ahh, could this be Symphonia Kingdom’s Five-Colored Pottery?]","[Being from another world, it’s amazing that you would know about Five-Colored Pottery, Kaito-kun. Are you familiar with potteries?]","[Ahh, no, I learned about this from an acquaintance who likes ceramics before...... I myself have no idea about it.]","When I mentioned it because the color of the ceramics looked familiar to me, Rosemary-san exclaimed in admiration. However, since I was only really lightly taught, I wouldn’t really be able if the topic of conversation turns to a more technical direction, so I just told her early on that I didn’t know much about it.","This doesn’t look good. I don’t think I could match Rosemary-san’s knowledge even if I tried.","[I see...... but I’m sorry. That’s not a Five-Colored Pottery.]","[Eh? Is that so?]","[Unnn. This is Four-Colored Pottery, and it was made in Symphonia about 340 years ago. As Kaito-kun said, Symphonia is famous for their Five-Colored Pottery, but there have been many different styles throughout the country’s long history. This artwork is made by intentionally removing the purple color from the Five-Colored Pottery. Five-Colored Pottery makes use of red and blue colors though, making it difficult to layer colors without showing any purples, so it fell out of fashion.]","[I see, now that you mentioned it, indeed...... There’s no purple anywhere.]","Symphonia’s Five-Colored Pottery is a pottery that uses the five colors of green, yellow, red, purple, and blue, so it’s called Four-Color Pottery because it’s made to avoid showing one of those colors......","[Is this created by a famous person?]","[This is a piece made by that time’s King of Symphonia. He was a King with a deep knowledge of Art, and he’s the one who laid the foundation of the Northern Area of the current Symphonia’s royal capital. This one is a relatively recent piece among the ones I have, but it’s a good piece that is filled with the desire to create something new.]","[Heehhh...... I know this is a weird question, but how much is it in terms of money?]","[When I bought it, it was worth 20000R, but now that its value has increased, I’m guessing it would be around 45000R?]","Its current value would be worth 4.5 million yen huh...... Artworks really are expensive. However, if this piece of pottery were to be found in a regular store with other potteries, I probably wouldn’t be able to recognize it as a 4.5 million yen piece.","[......I think most people wouldn’t know the exact value of this kind of artwork. Even if this pottery had been in my house, I probably wouldn’t have recognized it as a work of art unless someone had told me about it.]","[Art is pretty difficult to understand after all.]","[Yes, but now, thanks to Rosemary-san, I know the value, or rather, the good points of this piece...... I suppose it would be good fortune for the artworks to have an owner like Rosemary-san who understands their value. How should I say it...... It’s amazing to be able to create such words, but discovering them and teaching others their creators’ intentions and their worth is also amazing.]","When I told her that, Rosemary-san looked slightly surprised and moved. Thereupon, smiling gently, she reached out her hand towards me, and stroking my head, she spoke.","[......I really like your way of thinking. You really are a kind child, Kaito-kun.]","[T- Thank you. E- Errr...... Rosemary-san?]","[Eh? Ahh!? S- S- S- Sorry!? I was just so happy that I couldn’t help myself......]","[N- No, it’s alright.]","I don’t really know what exactly I said is alright, but it seems that stroking my head was an unconscious action of hers, as Rosemary-san flusteredly moved her hand away, while I also responded in a way that I didn’t quite understand.","Needless to say, there was an awkward silence between us for a short while after that.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [......Ha- Hahaha.]","? ? ? : [Oh, you unexpectedly look quite composed. As expected, going through your experience allows you to develop resistance to this?]","Serious-senpai : [Yeah, this ain’t no problem. After all, I am the 2000th Mock Battle, and this is quite special...... I’m completely alright.]","? ? ? : [......It doesn’t seem like you’re completely alright at all. You’re generating carbonated steam out of your head, you know......]"]},{"number":1345,"title":"Chapter 1345 - Garden of Myriad Flowers 7","paragraphs":["After seeing the pottery room, we went to the next room, which was a room filled with paintings, which again were beautifully decorated on the walls. I could really tell from it that Rosemary-san is a meticulous person.","To be honest, I think I understand paintings better than pottery. Though I say that, this would be obvious, but I have no clue about difficult stuff, and I’m just going about with my hunch here......","However, the paintings in this room are probably quite expensive, so I’m curious how much it will cost when all of them are added up.","[......How should I say this...... There’s a lot of them here huh.]","[This painting room is the largest room in the basement after all.","[Indeed, this place is so large that it could already be called a museum. The way it’s decorated is also beautiful. Are all the frames also different?]","[Unnn. Each painting has its own frame.]","I looked at the painting absentmindedly, thinking that the attention to detail was amazing. Although it’s only my hunch, I think I can tell which paintings seem to be of great value.","If the frames are clearly of a certain era, holding quite the majesty within them, or if they’re displayed in a conspicuous place in the room, I think they would be expensive.","[......By the way, this might be a strange question to ask, but is that the most expensive painting among these?]","[Hmmm...... It should be the painting over there. It’s one of the seven paintings referred to as “Seven Planets”, a collection of paintings depicting the landscape and the starry sky, painted from seven different places in the Demon Realm 10,000 years ago. What is amazing is that the paints used for this collection of paintings are completely unknown.]","[Unknown paints?]","[Unnn. It’s a paint with a mysterious sheen, which has never been confirmed outside of those seven paintings. There have been anecdotes of many people trying to reproduce this paint in the past, but they have been unable to produce the same thing.]","Listening to Rosemary-san’s story and looking at the paintings, it was clear that they had a unique luster to them. A unique luster that has this mysterious feel to them. It has this strange attractiveness to it, pulling you in with its beauty, yet you could also feel this ominousness from it...... It has an atmosphere that is clearly alien to the other paintings.","Indeed, unlike the other paintings, I could feel that this painting itself possesses intensity.","[It’s true that the painting somehow has this dreadfulness from it.]","[Unnn. The picture has this faint magic power in it, but its wavelength is mysteriously different. There’s a theory that these paintings were done using paints from another world.]","[I see, that would indeed make them very rare.]","[Unnn. After all, it’s one of the only seven paintings in the world. I really happened to pass by when it first went on sale and liked it so much I bought it, but if I were to buy it now...... Errr, I don’t really think I can put a price on it. At least, I would need to waste billions of R to buy it.]","The painting is so valuable that it might cost several hundred billions or even trillions in some cases...... That’s amazing.","[It’s just, the strange thing is that this painting...... It was sold at a stall.]","[Eh? A stall?]","[Unnn. For some reason, it was being sold by a strange stall keeper who was wearing a dog-like costume with a beret. Well, many of the artists are rather strange after all.]","[......I see.]","Isn’t that Alice? Yep, it’s definitely Alice. She probably painted and sold those paintings for pocket money. It wouldn’t be surprising if she had used some kind of strange process or materials to make those mysterious paints.","While I was looking at other paintings...... I suddenly found a painting that caught my attention.","[Ahh, this painting looks great. I really like the colors and the atmosphere, as it has this gentle feel to it.]","It was a painting of a flower garden, with gentle colors and touches that gave it a relaxing atmosphere. Even though I don’t know much about art, I felt that it was a nice painting that I could enjoy looking at.","Although it was displayed at the far end of the room, I still think this painting is my favorite among all the paintings I have seen here.","I looked back at Rosemary-san with these thoughts in mind, only to see her covering up her face that was blushing red.","[Ahh, errr...... I- Is that so...... T- Thank you.]","[......Yes?]","[Ummm, I mean...... that’s a painting I made.]","[Eeeehhhh!? I- Is that so!?]","I never thought it was Rosemary-san who made this painting. Rather, Rosemary-san is really good at painting huh. I don’t think a painting with an atmosphere like this could be painted by an amateur......","[That’s surprising. You’re a good painter huh, Rosemary-san.]","[T- That isn’t the case. It’s just that I put the best one I painted on display, so it’s not very often that I can paint as well as that one......]","[No, no, it’s great that you can paint something this great. At least, I don’t think this is something I can achieve, so I think it’s really great.]","[Auuuu...... I- I’m embarrassed. However, hearing you say that makes me happy. Thank you, Kaito-kun.]","The smile of Rosemary-san, who was smiling shyly with a blush, somehow looked really cute, and I felt like my face was also turning red.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [They’re just freaking flirting...... D*mn it, it hurts......]","? ? ? : [Serious-senpai, my throat is parched here, can’t you spout out something like cola?]","Serious-senpai : [Like hell I can spout stuff like that! What kind of creature do you think I am!!!?]","? ? ? : [A rare animal...... with an amusing ecology?]","Serious-senpai : [Isn’t that too mean?]"]},{"number":1346,"title":"Chapter 1346 - Garden of Myriad Flowers 8","paragraphs":["After the painting area, Rosemary-san showed me the artwork she collected in turn. She owns a wide variety of artworks, and her explanations were easy to understand, which made the tour quite enjoyable.","After visiting all the rooms, we decided to go back, when I suddenly noticed something.","[......Rosemary-san, what about that room over there?]","Yes, we had one last look at the room where the sculptures and other exhibits are displayed, but there was a door different from the one we had passed through on the way here. Since this was the end of the exhibition area, it was most likely not a room where artworks were displayed, but just as the thought that asking such a question may have been rude, Rosemary-san answered without seeming to mind.","[That’s the atelier.]","[Atelier..... Ahh, you mean the room where you painted stuff like the painting earlier?]","[Unnn...... If you’re interested, should we check it out?]","[Eh? Is that alright?]","[I don’t know if you’ll find anything interesting there though......]","When Rosemary-san opened the door with a wry smile on her face, I found that the interior of the room was quite spacious, and there was a set of tools around for not only painting, but also sculpting.","[......Arehh? Why do I see the flower garden from here?]","[Ahh, that’s because the walls here allow the view reflected in the window of the room above to be seen as it is.]","[I see, so it’s for your painting.]","[Unnn. I often paint pictures of the flower garden.]","[Heehhh...... Whoa, you have so many kinds of brushes.]","This may be the first time I’ve taken the time to look closely at a full-scale painting set like this. The reason is that I had music as an elective class back in junior high, so I hadn’t really been involved in the field of arts.","The canvas seemed quite large, and it seemed to be quite difficult to paint on it. At least, it would be difficult for me with my poor sense of aesthetics.","[Kaito-kun, since we’re at it, why don’t you try your hand at painting?]","[Hoehh? Me? I’m interested in it...... but I’ve never painted at all......]","[Don’t worry, I’ll teach you.]","When was the last time I painted again...... I think it would be around junior high? That should mean it’s been at least 10 years since I last painted. The painting I made also wasn’t very good...... No, it should be better to say it looked quite bad.","I mean, I suppose I’d be bad at stuff related to art...... Even that clay work I made before was terrible...... but I don’t really feel comfortable refusing Rosemary-san’s offer.","No, considering the hopeful eyes Rosemary-san was looking towards me with, refusing wasn’t an option.","[......T- Then, I’ll try it out a bit.]","[Unnn! Wait a moment. I’ll get you a new canvas.]","As Rosemary-san, with a bright smile on her face, started setting things up, seemingly happy to share her hobby, I looked around restlessly.","She’s putting up a new canvas...... I really don’t feel like I have the artistic sense for this though......","With an indescribable sense of tension in my heart, I sat down in the chair offered to me by Rosemary-san and faced the canvas. Sitting in front of it though, this canvas was much bigger than I thought it would be. How could I paint on a canvas of this size?","[......Errr, I really don’t have a clue what to do here, so what do you think I should paint?]","[I’m not sure. How about you try painting the landscape then? I think a painting of the flower garden in front of us would be fine.]","[I- I understand.]","[You don’t have to be so nervous. You shouldn’t think about trying to paint well, just enjoy the process of painting the view.]","[Y- Yes...... Errr, what should I do first?]","Nodding my head, I picked up the brush and palette, but not knowing where to start, I looked back at Rosemary-san behind me again. Thereupon, Rosemary-san smiled kindly and took my hand.","[Let’s start by dividing them roughly by color. For example, there’s a concentration of red flowers there, right? So, let’s paint this area red......]","[Eh? Is it alright to just paint it so decisively?]","[Unnn. You can just layer the colors on top of each other. After that, this area......]","Thereupon, with Rosemary-san’s hand on mine, she taught me the way to stroke the brush by guiding my hand holding the brush. As I was listening to her explanation...... I suddenly felt the touch of soft things behind my back.","Let’s ascertain what those are. I’m sitting on a round chair with no backrest. And Rosemary-san is holding my hand from behind, guiding me on how to paint.","In other words, the soft sensation on my back is...... errr...... This is troubling, the explanations on how to paint are suddenly falling on deaf ears.","Just like that, Rosemary-san continued to teach me how to paint without noticing my thoughts, but my awareness was concentrated only on my back. Rosemary-san is pretty big...... No, calm down, stop with those wicked thoughts!","No, but seriously, what am I supposed to do about this? It would take a lot of courage to say something like “I can feel your breasts touching me”...... but not saying it makes me unable to sit still, or rather, it kinda feels like I’m doing something wrong if I don’t say it......","[Unnn? Kaito-kun, what’s wrong?]","[Eh, no, errr...... I- It’s nothing! F- For the time being, now that I have some understanding of what to do, I’m going to try drawing by myself!!!]","[U- Unnn. Alright. If there’s anything you don’t understand, I’ll teach you again.]","In the end, I couldn’t point it out to her, but I didn’t want to keep quiet either, so although it was somewhat forcibly, I somehow succeeded in getting Rosemary-san to leave by choosing to draw by myself.","However, once I became aware of my situation, it became quite difficult to calm down for some reason, and needless to say, I had a lot of thoughts imbued within my painting hand for a while.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [She freaking did it! That thing those big breasts-types do, having them touch him from behind! D*mn it, this sweetness...... Nggghhh, at this rate......]","? ? ? : [What the heck are you even fighting against......]"]},{"number":1347,"title":"Chapter 1347 - Garden of Myriad Flowers 9","paragraphs":["I continued painting for a while, learning from Rosemary-san, and completed my painting. Of course, if I were to be particular with my painting, I would never have been able to complete it in a day or so......","When I looked at the finished painting, I found that it doesn’t look that bad. No, of course, it can’t really be described as something extremely good, but I think I did a better job than I expected.","No, I knew this wasn’t because I may actually have a hidden talent for painting...... but because of Rosemary-san, who gave me accurate advice from time to time, guiding my hand to correct my painting as needed.","All that was left was for me to try my best to concentrate on the painting and not to be conscious of my back, which may have helped me to concentrate better as a result.","[......H- How should I describe it?]","But well, what I, an amateur, think is a good work may be different from what the discerning Rosemary-san feels. Rosemary-san isn’t the kind of person to criticize the painting of an amateur...... but well, errr, let’s quietly turn off Sympathy Magic. It kinda stings when you know what the other person is about to say is just flattering words......","[Unnn. I think it’s very beautifully painted. It’s great that you can paint so well even when this is your first time.]","[Hahaha, but it’s thanks to Rosemary-san’s help.]","[No. Of course, I gave you some advice along the way and lent you a hand on how to paint...... but the way the painting expresses itself, it’s based on Kaito-kun’s personal senses. For example, I think it’s great that you used a slightly lighter shade for the flowers here. It softened the atmosphere around.]","Rosemary-san complimented me with a bright smile. It doesn’t seem like she had no hidden thoughts behind those words, as even when I activated Sympathy Magic again, I could feel that she was genuinely praising me instead of flattering me, which made me feel a little ticklish.","[I think landscape paintings are particularly sensitive to the artist’s feelings at the time of painting. For example, the touch of your brush here is a little strong, which shows your nervousness or impatience. Since it’s your first time painting on canvas, your body seemed to be tense at the beginning, which may be why there were many touches in the painting that expresses your nervousness.]","[......I did feel some nervousness back then.]","[It can’t be helped in the beginning. For example, this area is painted a little small because of your nervousness, but this could have been painted larger.]","[I see......]","[However, the color schemes are great. I think your coloring sense is very good, Kaito-kun.]","Well, if I were to be honest about her comments, I would say that it was because I was putting a lot of effort into trying to forget the feeling of her breasts on my back, and that’s why I may have painted it strongly.","Of course, I did feel some nervousness, and part of me was feeling flustered, but I think I got back to my right frame of mind. Also, I got the impression that Rosemary-san was good at teaching, or rather, she’s the type of person who compliments you, cheering you up as you develop.","While she occasionally offered advice, she basically praised me with a bright smile, which made me feel happy about painting even while I was painting.","If she doesn’t have that extreme fear of strangers, I think she would have been a good teacher...... Seriously, if she didn’t have that extreme fear of strangers......","[Meanwhile, the areas you painted midway had been freed of that nervousness, and you’re starting to paint freely. I really like how you paint the gentle slopes here. I think it’s overflowing with Kaito-kun’s charm.]","[My charm?]","[Unnn. The touch and the coloring really show Kaito-kun’s gentle nature. I really like the soft way you painted this area.]","[T- Thank you very much.]","I’m not sure if I’m getting hyped up or not, but Rosemary-san’s smile was so dazzling that I felt embarrassed when she looked straight at me.","After praising my painting for a while, looking as if she suddenly had an idea, Rosemary-san spoke.","[......Ahh, if Kaito-kun is alright with it, can I display this in my painting room?]","[Eh? My painting?]","[Unnn. It’s not like my house is a museum, and I’m just displaying things I like...... Not many people come to see them too. Is it no good?]","[Ah, yes. If Rosemary-san has no problem with it, I’m alright with it......]","It may seem out of place to be displayed with the multitude of masterpieces she has here, but Rosemary-san seems happy, and it was indeed a fact that only a few people can come to her home, so it’s unlikely that people will see it.","If that’s the case, well, I guess it’s not a problem. It’s not like it’s a blunder like that model back then, and I think I’ve made a well-done painting that I can be proud of......","[Thank you, Kaito-kun!]","[N- No, I used Rosemary-san’s canvas and paints for them anyway...... Errr...... Ummm, Rosemary-san...... Your face is a bit close.]","[Awawawa, I- I- I’m sorry!?]","Rosemary-san was happily holding my hand as she thanked me, but she may have become a bit too excited, as her face was quite close. Rosemary-san is quite the beauty, so when her face becomes that close, my heart throbs wildly.","Well, Rosemary-san didn’t do it on purpose, as when I pointed it out to her, she blushed red and flusteredly apologized, which made me chuckle.","How should I say this...... This may have been a rude comment to make to an older person...... but I felt that each of her reactions was quite cute.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [......That ends it, right? It’s fine to end this arc here, right? There are no more events after this, right!!!?]","? ? ? : [......Why the heck are you setting up such a huge flag? With you saying that, this arc would totally not end now......]"]},{"number":1348,"title":"Chapter 1348 - Garden of Myriad Flowers 10","paragraphs":["After the painting was finished, we returned from the atelier to the house aboveground and were chatting again over a cup of tea that Rosemary-san had brewed for us, when I suddenly remembered something.","[By the way, Rosemary-san, you did musicals at the Harmonic Symphony, didn’t you?]","[Unnn.]","[You sang very well, so I guess you’re also good at music?]","[I’m not sure if you can really say I’m good or not, but for us Spirits, singing is an act of harmonizing with nature. Most of the Spirits usually like to sing.]","Come to think of it, someone had mentioned something like this before. That in fact, music is so closely related to the Spirits that they hold a large-scale music festival, which is the Harmonic Symphony.","Lillywood-san herself is an outstanding singer, and the other members of the Seven Princesses were also amazing.","[Do you play any instruments?]","[I don’t play instruments that much, but I can play the violin a bit.]","[Heehhh...... Do you also habitually sing, Rosemary-san?]","[Unnn. I often sing in the flower garden.]","That would be quite a picturesque scene. Her, singing in the Garden of Myriad Flowers...... Arehh?","[Is there a spot over there where you can sing in?]","[Unnn. The garden is quite vast, so there are some open areas. If you want, should we check it out?]","[I guess so. I have only seen the flower garden around the entrance, so I’m somewhat interested. Is that spot quite large?]","[I think it’s about the size of a small town.]","In that case, the garden is pretty vast. Considering that she said “town” and not “village”, the areas I had seen in the flower garden so far must really be a very small part of the flower garden.","Perhaps the number of flowers is so great that it exceeds tens of thousands. Perhaps, even the variety itself had reached those numbers.","Getting up from our seats, I talked to Rosemary-san as we walked out of her home.","[However, isn’t it hard to manage a place as vast as this?]","[It’s not that difficult. It’s easy if you use magic, and since I’m a Spirit, I could clearly tell the conditions of flowers, so I know how to take care of them and what they need.]","[I see.]","[As for watering them, I can control this space, so I can send rain to designated areas or adjust the temperature in certain areas when needed.]","Now that she mentioned it, Rosemary-san is one of the Six Kings’ executives, and one of the most influential people in the Demon Realm. It wouldn’t be surprising if she can easily do most things.","Speaking of which, Alice mentioned before how when someone reaches Peak Count-rank, they would be at a level that would make people feel like they’re omnipotent beings by human standards.","[Come to think of it, there’s also that spot where the Sanctuary’s flowers that Kaito-kun gave me before are planted, so why don’t we go there too?]","[Ahh, that would be nice. I’d also like to see it.]","[......Also, ummm...... I hope it doesn’t bother Kaito-kun, but I’d be happy if you could tell me about the flower garden in the Sanctuary again. At that time back in the White God Festival, I wasn’t able to calmly listen to it after all.]","[Of course, it’s alright. After you asked me that time, I took a closer look at the flowers there. It seems that Shiro-san had added new flowers recently.]","[Eh? Is that so? I’d like to hear it.]","I was asked a lot of questions during the White God Festival, but it seemed that that wasn’t enough for Rosemary-san, as she badgered me with more questions about the flower garden in the Sanctuary.","Of course, I didn’t really have any reason to refuse to answer her. Thanks to the many questions that Rosemary-san asked me back then, after I visited Shiro-san’s place later, I paid more attention to the various things around, so I think the range of questions I can answer has expanded.","While smiling at Rosemary-san, who was happily listening to my story, I went on as long as I could remember about the flower garden in the Sanctuary.","As we continued chatting while walking, I saw a circular lawn area in the flower garden a little further ahead.","[Ahh, Kaito-kun. That’s where I often sing.]","[Ohh, that’s great. It really feels like we are right in the middle of the flower garden, and no matter which direction you look, you’re overwhelmed by the beautiful flowers.]","[I guess I’m kind of proud of the view from here too......]","Since we’re here, we decided to take in the view here for a bit, so I took out a leisure sheet from my magic box and laid it out before sitting down.","Thereupon, we resumed the conversation I had with Rosemary-san earlier while looking at the flower garden...... but somehow, it felt like the distance between us was very close.","[......I see. There’s such a flower huh. The flower garden in the Sanctuary really is marvelous. You mentioned how it had different areas, but what’s it like?]","[Errr, let’s see. Right after I was teleported by Shiro-san, the first area I came to......]","Rosemary-san is sitting next to me, but we’re so close that our shoulders are touching each other. I mean, I’ve thought of this earlier, but Rosemary-san sometimes suddenly brings herself too close.","I was wondering why this is, when it occurred to me. I see, Rosemary-san is usually afflicted with her extreme fear of strangers, and with her voice so soft, she has to get very close to someone to talk to them, and speak close to their ear.","And so, when she talks to someone she feels comfortable with, I guess she probably tries to talk close to them out of habit?","I see, that solves the mystery...... That solves it but...... Her face really is just too close! For Rosemary-san, who is exceptionally beautiful and brimming with smiles today, to be this close...... my heart couldn’t help beating very fast.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [It has completely turned into a date!!!]"]},{"number":1349,"title":"Chapter 1349 - Garden of Myriad Flowers 11","paragraphs":["As I was sitting alongside Rosemary-san as we looked at the flower garden, Rosemary-san suddenly started to sing calmly. I guessed that she remembered our earlier conversation and decided to sing.","I had thought of this back in the Harmonic Symphony, Rosemary-san is a really good singer. And this time, she wasn’t trying to make her voice as imposing as at the Harmonic Symphony, but in a rather gentle voice brimming with tenderness.","As her clear, beautiful voice echoed through the flower garden, I closed my eyes and listened. It’s a song that has the atmosphere of a folk song, and I feel like it’s suitable for singing in a flower garden.","The gentle sound of the singing voice, the fragrance of the flower garden, the gentle breeze around us, and her song that has a moderately long rhythm gradually make me feel a little a little sleepy.","Since Rosemary-san is singing, I think I should properly listen, but the gentle melody, which sounds like a lullaby, is making my consciousness drift away.","I tried to strain my eyes open, trying to stay awake, but at that moment, my body was suddenly pulled to the side. Unable to resist the force that pulled me, I fell onto my side, and my head exquisitely rested on Rosemary-san’s lap.","Eh? What’s going on!? Our bodies were quite close to each other just a moment ago, but I fell to the side and was suddenly laying my head on her lap?","Moreover, when I looked up to Rosemary-san’s face, wondering what her intentions were, she just smiled slightly as she sang, before putting her hand over my eyes.","As she seemed to tell me it was okay to go to sleep, with the gentle echoes of her singing, her warm hands covering my eyes, and the scent of roses drifting from Rosemary-san...... Once I ascertained it was okay to go to sleep, irresistible drowsiness overtook me.","Eventually, feeling the soft warmth under my head, I went straight to sleep.","After confirming that Kaito was completely asleep, Rosemary-san stopped singing.","[......He had been going along with my selfishness today, so he must have been tired huh? I was so happy that I inadvertently got excited...... I need to reflect on this.]","Originally, she had only planned to leisurely talk with Kaito over a cup of tea and entertain him as thanks for all the help he had given her. However, as she had received some nice tea cups as a gift, things didn’t go quite as she planned right from the start.","The same thing happened when she showed him around the art exhibits in her basement. She was so happy that he was interested in her favorite things that she explained them to him in detail.","[Perhaps, it may have been because I’m not used to talking so much, but I tend to talk too much to people I feel comfortable with.]","Rosemary has an extreme fear of strangers and has few people she can talk to on a regular basis, so the number of people she’s close to is quite small. And thus, around those few people she’s close to...... around Camellia and Kaito, she tended to talk a lot.","Naturally, Camellia and Kaito themselves don’t mind, but for Rosemary herself, there were many things she felt uneasy about, wondering about things like if she was talking too much.","And her behavior was also proof that even though she hadn’t spent much time with him yet, she trusted Kaito.","[I wonder if I was being forceful in having him paint? Kaito-kun was kind and seemed to enjoy it, but he was quite nervous at first...... I suppose my desire to share what I like with my close friends is a bit too much.]","She really enjoyed the time she spent painting with Kaito, as she felt like time flew by so quickly. Perhaps it was because their personalities that made them compatible, or perhaps because of the fact that, unusually for the shy Rosemary, Kaito was someone she finds very easy to talk to, Rosemary felt no stress at all when she was with him.","After gently stroking Kaito’s head as he sleeps on her lap, Rosemary looked at the flower garden spreading out around her.","[The garden somehow looks more beautiful today than usual...... Fufu, I guess that’s thanks to Kaito-kun.]","As she said this with a smile, the expression on Rosemary’s face was truly gentle and joyful.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [......Haahhh...... Haahhhh...... I- It’s finally over...... The sugar season has finally ended!]","? ? ? : (......I guess the sugar season is gonna be prolonged huh?)"]},{"number":1350,"title":"Chapter 1350 - Camping Under the Starry Sky 1","paragraphs":["<Author’s Notes>","I didn’t have the time to write, so today’s chapter is a little short.","One afternoon, I was reading a book. This book was recommended to me by Isis-san, and it was a travel diary-like story about a married couple who traveled to various parts of the Demon Realm.","Although there were few major climaxes, the descriptions of scenery and food are very realistic, and it was a good book that made me want to go on a trip.","......A trip huh...... Come to think of it, I don’t think I’ve ever been on a trip with Isis-san. The range of activities isis-san herself can do is limited due to the influence of her magic power of death, so it would usually be me visiting her home or her coming to visit me.","When we hang out, it would always be for a day trip, and I don’t think we’ve ever taken a long trip.","It’s not like we had to go to tourist attractions. I have that storable cottage in my magic box, so we can go somewhere as if we’re camping.","It would be a lot of fun to spend a relaxing time with Isis-san in a place rich in nature, just like those depicted in books.","I think it will be a pretty good idea...... but I wonder what Isis-san thinks of this? I guess I’ll ask her while returning the book.","Going to Isis-san’s castle to return the book I had finished reading, I talked about my impressions of the book with Isis-san over tea.","[It was a good book. It made me want to go on a trip when I read it......]","[......Unnn...... Their depiction of sceneries...... are quite thorough...... and their compositions are quite lovely.]","The book discussion was lively and the atmosphere was pretty good. Thinking that this would be a good time to broach that subject, I decided to try suggesting to her about going on a trip.","[......So, Isis-san. There’s something I’d like to discuss with you......]","[......Unnn?]","[If it’s okay with you, Isis-san, how about the two of us go on a trip?]","[......A trip? ......Together...... with Kaito?]","[Yes. Instead of going to tourist spots, let’s go somewhere rich in nature, like camping...... Well, it’s just, this book made me want to go on a trip, but I’ve never traveled with Isis...... and so...... that’s what I thought......]","Somehow, I became more and more nervous while talking about this. I mean, although this is quite obvious, this invitation somehow feels like me inviting her to go somewhere for an overnight stay, and being aware of that thought in my mind, I suddenly felt embarrassed.","When I glanced at Isis-san and peeked at her reaction, a smile as bright as blooming flowers appeared on Isis-san’s lips.","[......Trip with Kaito...... I want to go!]","[It’s decided then. In that case, let’s talk about where we should go. I’ve done some research on my side as well, but Isis-san is more knowledgeable when we’re talking about the Demon Realm...... It might also be a good idea to go to some of the places mentioned in the book.]","[......Unnn...... Come to think of it...... The book also talked about them camping...... It didn’t give any specific details about the place...... but from its descriptions...... I think it would be around the Western Demon Realm.]","[Fumu, so we can narrow it down to the Western Demon Realm?]","[......Unnn...... I’ll go get some books...... that we could use as references.]","Even looking at Isis-san from the side, I could feel how excited she was, as she went to pick up books about the Western Demon Realm.","I’m glad she was pleased with the idea. I myself actually thought that I had thought of a good idea, and since I bought fishing equipment before, if there’s a river nearby, we can go fishing.","While we’re at it, it also might be a good idea to buy something like camping equipment, and try to make it feel like we would be genuinely camping. Well, I’ll discuss this with Isis-san and make a decision after that.","Unnn. I’m getting pretty excited about this too. Thinking about the various things I’d really like to discuss with Isis-san, I’m unable to sit still, fidgeting in my seat.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [U- Uwaaaahhhhhhh!? N- No way, a- a sudden...... Isis...... Aaaaaaahhhhhh (Despair).]"]},{"number":1351,"title":"Chapter 1351 - Camping Under the Starry Sky 2","paragraphs":["Having decided to go camping with Isis-san, we finished discussing the location. I heard that the Western Demon Realm is an area with sandy plains, but the Demon Realm itself is quite vast to begin with, so there are places suitable for camping in whichever area of the Demon Realm it is.","This time, we decided on a place near the area mentioned in the book that Isis-san and I read, and considering the influence of Isis-san’s magic power of death, somewhere a little far from civilization. There also seems to be a river nearby, so we can do some fishing.","And so, I’m thinking of buying some camping gear...... but well, I suppose I’ll just go to Alice’s store for that, so I went to her miscellaneous goods store through the basement.","[......That being the case, I need some camping stuff.]","[That’s fine and all, but up to what level do you want?]","[What do you mean by “level”?]","Sitting down on a chair in front of the counter, I consulted with Alice about what to buy. Alice, who used to travel around the world in the past, seemed like she’d have a lot of knowledge about camping and matters like that, so she’s very reliable for a complete amateur like me.","[If you want to do it in an orthodox way, camping can be a lot of work. To put it simply, amateurs would often have trouble setting up tents, cooking, and things not going just as they imagined.]","[Well, it certainly seems like it would take a lot of time and effort if you aren’t used to it.]","[I know this might not sound great, but in the end, Kaito-san, rather than wanting to go camping, it’s okay to think that you just want to enjoy the leisurely experience of camping, right?]","[Of course, if we could easily enjoy the atmosphere, that would be better...... Both me and Isis-san are amateurs at camping after all.]","Nodding to my words, Alice arranged several products on the counter.","[In that case, my recommendations are these magic tools. For example, this one...... is a bonfire-style heater. Kaito-san, you remember that toy you bought a while ago that casts Illusion Magic when thrown, right? Its effect was something close to that. When used, the Illusion Magic in it would manifest a campfire, but since it isn’t actually a fire, it’s safe and only has a heating effect on the surroundings.]","[I see, this is interesting...... It also looks like a real bonfire, so it’s perfect for setting up the atmosphere.]","[In addition, there’s this tent that can be assembled in a few steps...... As it’s a magic tool, it’s expensive, but there are many items like this that allow you leisure while also giving the atmosphere of camping.]","Many of the items that Alice introduced are quite good, even just these items she lined up here on the counter. Like, this small folding chair looked like it would be nice.","[And then, there’s also stuff like this. Stainless steelish mugs.]","[Ahh, I like these ones. It makes me feel like drinking some soup in it.]","[If you want soup, I recommend the instant soup Kuro-san’s company recently released. It saves you the trouble of making it, and it’s easy to bring around.]","Ahh, come to think of it, when Kuro introduced the instant goods her company made, she said they also have various breads, soups and other items.","That sounds great...... Drinking hot soup in a mug under the stars at night...... Yep, that would be great.","[By the way, when it comes to chairs, in addition to the small ones...... I think you should also buy one with a high backrest, as not just for this camping, you could also use it for other occasions. Another thing that isn’t to be sneezed at is this field rack...... Well, think of it as a small folding shelf for camping. Because you can place your ingredients and utensils on it when you’re cooking, it’s very convenient.]","[I see...... If you have nice stuff like this, I’d like you to tell me.]","[Let’s see, when it comes to cookware...... I think this would be good. A simple smoker...... To put it simply, it’s a device that allows you to easily make smoked food. Cheese and wieners were delicious when smoked, you know? My personal recommendation is this burner-type cookware. When you roast your ingredients on the mesh grill, it would also be delicious. Other than that, there’s also this lantern-style Illumination Magic Tool.]","That sounds great, all of them sounded like it would be enjoyable. Having a tool that can brew coffee might also be nice. Although it’s easy to drink freshly brewed coffee by putting it in a magic box, brewing and drinking it in the midst of nature seems like fun.","Isis-san and I have almost no experience in camping itself. When I stayed out with Anima before, it wasn’t for the purpose of camping, but for a fishing trip.","For the time being, I’ll go buy all the things Alice recommended. It might also be a good idea to look for other stores specializing in camping and find something that looks good.","Magic tools exist in this world, so even if they’re expensive, even an amateur like me can enjoy the atmosphere of camping.","[......By the way, I’ll ask just in case, but do you have any of the instant soups that Kuro’s company sells?]","[I’m not selling any of those here.]","[Why is it that every time I go shopping here, you have everything but food......]","[That’s obviously because I’d eat them myself!]","[......It’s amazing how that’s very persuasive.]","After all, Alice eats the most out of all the people I know......","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [This is bad....... Heh...... Hehehe...... My body is shaking...... Since when was the last time I felt this much fear...... Was it back in the Founding Festival, when Illness appeared?]","? ? ? : [Isn’t that quite recent......]"]},{"number":1352,"title":"Chapter 1352 - Camping Under the Starry Sky 3","paragraphs":["After making various preparations, the day of the promised camping with Isis-san arrived. The location was in the Western Demon Realm, a place known as an unexplored region that would normally be difficult to reach due to the many monsters along the way and the topographical problems.","However, for Isis-san, who is one of the most powerful people in the Demon Realm, it was an easy place to reach with the use of Teleportation using World Coordinates.","And the place we arrived at was as good as we had imagined, or even better than I had imagined. It was an open area by a large lake, with no slope and a moderate amount of soil, making it a good place for camping.","[This place is nice.]","[......Unnn...... It’s peaceful...... and relaxing.]","[I’d like to start relaxing myself, but how about we at least put up the tent first?]","[......Unnn.]","For the time being, the first thing we should do is to decide on a location for our tent, so we decided to set it up at some distance from the lake, in an open area with a good view of the surroundings.","I heard that setting up a tent would originally be quite difficult, like setting up stakes and tying ropes...... But well, since this isn’t really that orthodox of a camping trip, but more like a trip with a camping feel to it, the tent is also a magic tool.","[......Installing it in an open place, I should then pour magic power into it...... Ahh, it came out.]","[......These magic crystals at the end of the strings...... should we install them...... on all four sides?]","[Yes. It seems that everything is done after that.]","Four strings stretched out in this cylindrical thing that kinda seemed to be the tent, and a magic crystal was attached to each of its ends. After pulling them to a distance where the strings can be stretched enough, you place them on the ground, pour magic power into it, and something like a stake will appear around the magic crystal and pierce the ground.","When I set it up in four directions with Isis-san, the center cylinder emitted light just when the fourth stake was set up, and after a few seconds, the tent that was deployed from the inside automatically set itself up.","[......It sets itself up in an instant.]","[......How convenient...... However...... this is my first time...... in a tent.]","[I’ve also never been in a tent before. The inside...... is bigger than I thought it would be.]","[......There are also these cot-like things...... I suppose Adventurers...... would be sleeping in those.]","Well, as for this tent, I bought a rather expensive one, so it’s probably more spacious inside than what the average Adventurer’s tent would be, but even so, this tent sure has set itself up quickly.","It also comes with a simple barrier system to protect against monsters, but since Isis-san is here, monsters will not come close to the tent, so we will not really feel the effect of the barrier.","[For the time being, that settles the installation of the tent. Well then, should we take another walk around the neighborhood?]","[......Unnn...... I want to walk...... here and there...... together with Kaito.]","Isis-san, who was shyly smiling when she said that, looked as cute as ever, and just looking at her makes me feel happy.","When I held out my hand, Isis-san happily grasped my hand and just like that, with our fingers crossed with each other, we started walking near the lake.","[It’s a pretty big lake, isn’t it?]","[......Speaking of which...... in the novel...... they went to swim in the lake.]","[As expected, we haven’t really made preparations for swimming, so we can’t exactly do that...... but with a lake of this size, other than that, it feels like we can do a lot of stuff. Ahh, come to think of it, I also brought fishing gear, so let’s do it together later.]","[......Unnn...... I’m looking forward to it.]","The clear blue sky, the lake glistening in the sunlight, my lovely lover next to me, holding hands and laughing together as we walk along.","This is truly a wonderful feeling. Perhaps, this may have been what happiness is all about.","[......Kaito...... How was your stall...... at the Founding Festival?]","[It was fun. I experienced a lot of things...... Speaking of which, Spica-san, who came on behalf of Isis-san, seemed like a calm person.]","[......Spica is...... a little laid back...... but she makes...... everyone around her feel at ease...... She’s a very nice girl.]","[I see, Isis-san’s castle has become quite lively.]","[......Unnn...... Everyday has been...... really fun...... That too...... is thanks to Kaito.]","Isis-san’s castle is now home for Iris-san, Polaris-san, Sirius-san, Rasal-san, Spica-san and Eul-san, and it has become much livelier than when Isis-san lives there on her own.","Isis-san seems to be really happy, and that makes me really happy too.","[That isn’t the case. I think it’s because of your own charm, Isis-san.]","[......You...... think so?]","[Yes, it’s true that I had recommended Iris-san to be your subordinate by Alice’s suggestion, but that’s definitely not the only thing you can factor for this happening. I myself had talked with everyone a little bit, but I soon realized that everyone admired Isis-san. That’s why, please be confident. Up until now, due to the influence of your magic power of death, few people have noticed it, but Isis-san has the charm that attracts people. I guarantee you that.]","[......Fufu....... Unnn...... Since Kaito guarantees it...... there’s no mistaking it then.]","After listening to my words, a happy smile appeared on Isis-san’s lips, and moving herself closer, she tightly held my arm to her embrace.","Her sweet reaction was so lively, and I naturally felt a sense of warmth in my heart.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [..........................................................]","? ? ? : [Senpai, please stay strong. That was still just a jab.]","Serious-senpai : [Are you trying to comfort me or plunge me in despair...... With the way you say it, I’m not really sure......]"]},{"number":1353,"title":"Chapter 1353 - Camping Under the Starry Sky 4","paragraphs":["After a walk around the neighborhood with Isis-san, we decided to fish in the afternoon and cook lunch together. What we’re having for lunch is one of them stylish paellas.","......No, I chose it simply because it felt like something you’d eat when camping while I was browsing a recipe book......","[Errr...... First, devein the shrimp......]","[......Then, I will...... chop the vegetables.]","[Thank you.]","Looking at the recipe book, I proceeded with handling the ingredients. I can cook to some extent as I had been taught by Sieg-san, while Isis-san herself is good at cooking.","However, neither of us was at an extremely good level like Alice, but I think it’s nice to be able to cook while consulting each other like this.","While looking at the nearby Isis-san as she skillfully chopped the vegetables, I prepared the fish and shellfish. Removing the guts and cleaning them, I cut them into pieces that are easy to eat.","Then, putting the squid into the frying pan with the chopped vegetables that Isis-san chopped, I stir-fried them slowly.","[How long do I fry this......]","[......Errr...... It’s best to cook both sides of the squid carefully...... while not touching it too much...... until both sides of the squid are browned.]","[Ohh, Isis-san knows a lot about handling this. Have you made this before?]","[......No...... but I’ve read cookbooks before...... and I remember what was written...... to some extent.]","[I see, Isis-san cooks really well after all.]","[......I practiced...... so that I could feed Kaito.]","Come to think of it, the very first time I went to visit her house, Isis-san was still not that great of a cook. However, she had served me her home cooking several times since then, and I have never felt like she made anything like the one she made the first time.","Thinking that since it was Isis-san, she must have really worked hard and practiced, it warmed my heart.","[Ahh, it looks like it’s about time. Next is......]","[......Here...... Tomatoes.]","[Thank you.]","Adding the tomato paste that Isis-san passed to me, then let it boil down. Removing its moisture apparently softens the sourness, making it mellow.","After waiting for it to boil down, I added the remaining seafood, water, salt and saffron. Once the broth is simmering the seafood is removed to a separate dish, while the rice is added to the remaining broth and cooked.","[......It smells good...... and seems like...... you’ve cooked it well.]","[It does look good. I just have to be careful not to let it burn...... Finally, put the seafood back in and add lemon and parsley...... Okay, it’s done!]","[Well then, shall we start eating?]","[......Unnn...... Ahh...... I also made pot-au-feu...... Let’s eat it together.]","[Eh? When did you cook that?]","[......I was making it...... while Kaito was working hard on your paella.]","Surprisingly, Isis-san seems to have made pot-au-feu while helping me cook, and the pot-au-feu in the small pot looks incredibly delicious.","With the table and chairs for camping already taken out, we placed the pan of paella and pot of pot-au-feu in the center, and lining up the tableware, the preparations are complete.","[Well then, thank you for the food...... Unnn. Delicious.]","[......Thank you for the food...... Delicious...... You’re a good cook, Kaito.]","[No, no, that’s thanks to the recipe I followed. The pot-au-feu Isis-san made is also really delicious.]","[......If you’re pleased with it...... then I’m...... also happy.]","The food was well done and the smiling Isis-san was adorable, but just as I was thinking that it was a really wonderful lunch, Isis-san scooped up the paella with her own spoon and with her other hand underneath, she held out the spoon to me.","[......Kaito...... Ahhhn.]","[Eh? T- Thank you. Ahhhn.]","[......Delicious?]","[Yes, very much.]","As a happy smile appeared on Isis-san’s lips as she fed me the paella, I nodded my head while feeling a little embarrassed. W- Well, it’s just the two of us here, so there’s no problem with this......","Having such thoughts in mind, I also scooped up some paella with my own spoon and held it out to Isis-san in return.","[Isis-san too, here you go.]","[......Ahhhn...... Unnn...... Delicious...... Kaito feeding it to me...... makes it...... much tastier.]","[A- Ahaha...... I feel like it tastes better than usual when Isis-san feeds it to me too.]","[......I see...... That’s great...... Then...... have some more.]","Isis-san happily smiled and held out food with her spoon to me again. Of course, I had no reason to refuse, so I opened my mouth and let her feed me.","In return, I would also feed her with my spoon, and we both ate lunch peacefully.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [I- It hurts...... S- Somebody help me......]","Makina : [You called?]","Serious-senpai : [I didn’t call you. Seriously, I didn’t call you! In the first place, I’m asking for someone to help me! Not to make it worse!!!]"]},{"number":1354,"title":"Chapter 1354 - Camping Under the Starry Sky 5","paragraphs":["After finishing lunch, I decided to go fishing in the lake with Isis-san, but I have a few concerns. The first is that I didn’t know what kind of fish lived in this lake. I hope that the fish here are the kind where even someone with my arm strength can catch them.","The second is Isis-san’s magic power of death...... Though I suppose there’s not much problem with this. Even if the fish escape due to the influence of her magic power of death, since it still has an effective distance, it would be possible for us to catch them without any problems as long as we consciously casted our lines far away.","[......Should I just...... cast it like this?]","[Yes. Though, just strong enough so that the float doesn’t fly too far.]","Me casting my line with all my might isn’t a problem. It’s not like my float would reach the other edge of the lake. However, if a fishing line is casted with Isis-san’s ability, I don’t know how far it will fly, so I made sure to remind her to adjust her strength properly.","And thus, the both of us shook our rod at the same time, casting the tip with the bait...... Well, as expected, Isis-san’s float flew farther than mine even though I casted it with all my might.","[......All we have to do now is wait for the first to bite———- Whoa!?]","[......Kaito...... Are you alright?]","[I- I’m alright. I was just surprised that a bite came earlier than I thought, but the pull wasn’t that strong.]","[......Do your best.]","[Yes!]","I was a little surprised when the rod shook as soon as I casted the line...... but the pull wasn’t that strong, and even I could deal with it.","Carefully winding the reel to attract the fish, when it was close enough to the surface, I pulled it out..... . I caught out a pretty, shiny fish. Rather than sparkling, it was more glaringly shiny, like a mirror ball.","[......This is quite a shiny fish.]","[......That is...... a Diamond Fish...... a considerably...... rare fish.]","[Heehhh. Incidentally, is it edible?]","[......No...... It’s too hard to eat...... but it’s quite popular...... as an ornament.]","It’s this type of fish again!? Why the heck can’t I catch an edible fish...... No, well, I’m not really fishing for edible fish this time, but just to enjoy fishing together with Isis-san, so it isn’t really a problem...... but well, it’s just...... Looking at this fish, I have this inexplicable feeling in my heart.","However, isis-san is looking at my fish happily, so I guess it’s alright...... This fish sure struggles a lot though.","For the time being, after releasing the fish I just caught, I then swung my rod and casted my line again. This time, the fish didn’t suddenly bite my bait like before, and taking out small chairs for us, I enjoyed fishing while sitting alongside Isis-san.","After a little while, Isis-san felt a tug on her rod.","[......Errr...... I should just reel this in, right?]","[Yes. If you reel too vigorously though, the fish may loosen itself from the hook, so reel it in slowly......]","[......Alright...... I’ll do my best.]","As I watched the end of her line being pulled while giving advice to Isis-san, I could see the shadow of the fish little by little...... Arehh? Isn’t that big? No, it’s big, right......?","[......Ummm, Isis-san. Is the pull on the rod strong?]","[......No...... It’s very weak.]","It looked like it was a few meters long though......","[Any chance that the rod might break or the line might snap?]","[......I used State Preservation Magic on it...... so it’s alright.]","[I see......]","For the time being, while I felt convinced, I watched her progress, and when the fish came near the surface of the water, Isis-san held her rod with one hand while she nonchalantly moved her other hand.","Thereupon, a huge fish, which seemed to be nearly 5 meters long, emerged from the water.","[......Caught it.]","[......It’s huge. Is that a monster?]","[......I think...... it’s a Genocide Fish...... A monster that lives in big lakes like this...... but they’re mild-mannered and quiet...... though right now...... it’s frightened by my magic power of death.]","A mild-mannered, quiet fish-type monster...... Why does it have “genocide” in its name though? I don’t think its name and personality match at all......","[Well, it’s too big to eat, so just like the Diamond Fish from earlier, let’s let it go.]","[......Unnn...... I’m sorry...... to surprise you.]","After Isis-san moved her hand again, the hook came off the Genocide Fish’s mouth and it swam back into the lake.","[......I’ve never fished before...... but it’s interesting.]","[I’m glad you enjoyed it. Even so, you caught such a big catch. You may have a talent for fishing, Isis-san.]","[......You think so?]","[Yes, I’m sure of that...... I won’t just lose either, so I’ll catch myself a big one.]","[......Unnn...... Good luck...... Kaito.]","[Yes!]","Isis-san, who said that with a gentle smile, looked like she was really enjoying herself. She herself said that this was her first time fishing, so even if she has the knowledge about them, there must have been many things she had never done before.","I think it would be great if we could take this opportunity to do many things together.","Anyhow, after that, my fishing rod caught many fishes many times, and if it was just the number of catches, it was on a level that could be described as a big catch. It’s just, all I caught were Diamond Fishes...... What the heck is this?","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Watching his fishing not going well because he’s too lucky is kinda amusing...... If the situation continues like this, I guess the arc heads down to a heartwarming route...... right? It heads down to a heartwarming route, right? The sweetness stopped with the last arc, right?]"]},{"number":1355,"title":"Chapter 1355 - Camping Under the Starry Sky 6","paragraphs":["Even after we finished fishing, we played around with each other and before I knew it, the sun went down. For dinner, the two of us enjoyed cooking together using the small fish that Isis-san caught, and before long, I wanted to take a bath.","Though I say that, taking a bath while camping is difficult...... normally, that is. Yes, there’s magic in this world, and in this world where portable lodging houses exist, portable baths naturally also exist.","[Since Isis-san likes onsen, and I myself like onsen too, I bought a rather rare onsen-type bathhouse.]","Onsens are something like a minor culture in this world, and because they are so rare, it was rather difficult to find one of these, but I somehow managed to buy an onsen-type...... or rather, an open-air portable bathhouse.","It’s a high-end product with built-in Barrier Magic, and because the Barrier Magic makes it impossible to see inside or jump in from the open areas of the bath, you can bathe with peace of mind.","Well, it isn’t really an onsen, and more like an onsen-styled bathhouse......","[......The space around this area should be enough, so let’s deploy it...... Whoa, this thing’s huge!]","[......What an unusual building...... Everything is wooden...... resembling Lillywood’s place?]","[Ahh, this was probably modeled after the onsen back in my world. That wooden building is the changing room. That area looks like a porch, so you sit there and take a break after taking a bath.]","[......I see...... So that’s a porch...... I’ve read about it in books...... but this is the first time I’ve seen one.]","Come to think of it, back when I visited Sieg-san’s home, she did mention how porches were unusual, didn’t she? Rei-san apparently made it by copying the house of an acquaintance of his, so I suppose their house wouldn’t be so common.","Well, it’s true that buildings in this world basically have Western-style designs, so stuff like that certainly may have been unusual.","[Errr...... It seems that if you operate the magic tools here, you can get ready for a bath right away. Isis-san, would you like to go in first?]","[......Eh? ......We aren’t...... going in together?]","[Ah~~ Errr......]","[......Does Kaito...... not want...... to take a bath with me?]","[No, I don’t not want! Let’s go in together!]","[......Unnn!]","I had somewhat expected it. With how the development had been like in the past, I had wondered if things would turn out like this...... and when I saw the lonely expression on Isis-san’s face, I knew that refusal wasn’t something I could choose.","It’s just, no matter how many times I’ve experienced this, bathing together with someone still has this own unique sense of embarrassment. W- Well...... Of course, it isn’t like I dislike bathing together with her......","Since I had already expected this in advance, my heart was calm to some extent, so as soon as the bath was ready, I moved to the dressing room.","The changing room in this bathing house isn’t separated for men’s and women’s, but it’s fairly spacious, so there’s no problem for multiple people to use it at the same time.","[I’ll get in first then.]","[......Unnn? ......I can just erase my clothes...... so I can immediately finish my preparations though?]","[......Wait! I’ll get you a towel first.]","[......U- Unnn...... Alright.]","Speaking of which, that was indeed the case. I thought Isis-san would take some time to take off her clothes, but since Isis-san makes her clothes with her magic power, it would only take her a moment to undress.","However, Isis-san suddenly stripping naked in front of me isn’t something I can just prepare myself for, so I made sure to firmly tell her this in advance.","As a result, Isis-san was the first to finish getting ready and I was the one who had to make her wait, but in any case, Isis-san is waiting for me to go in the bath together with her.","Well, it didn’t really take me too long to undress either, so I got ready quickly and we headed to the bath together.","[......Ohh, this place is bigger than I thought.]","[......Unnn...... It’s beautiful.]","The open-air bath inside was so large that it was hard to believe that this was something you can carry on the go. As expected, it wasn’t as big as the large onsen in Isis-san’s castle, but it was large enough for two people.","The stone bathtub was very onsen-like, and the atmosphere around was perfect. The view of the mountains near the lake is also quite nice.","[......Kaito...... I’ll wash...... your body.]","[Ah, yes. I’m in your care.]","[......Unnn.]","I have experienced bathing together with isis-san several times already. At first, I was quite flustered and felt overwhelmed, but now that we’re lovers, I myself have matured mentally and managed to keep my composure.","I won’t be shaken just by her washing my back, so I should be able to keep my calm without any problems.","[......The other day...... Shalltear...... had taught me how to wash the body...... that would make Kaito happy.]","[........................]","And at that moment, I suddenly have a bad feeling from those words. A really bad feeling...... With how upfront with her emotions Isis-san is, she will take whatever that idiot says seriously, so the flow of things doesn’t feel that good at all.","If it’s that idiot we’re talking about here, I at least don’t think she’d teach her some seriously proper method at all. With her hogging all the pranks as if she got the patent for the very concept of pranking, and with how knowledgeable that perverted virgin is, what could she have......","[......Ahh~~ By the way, Isis-san, what kind of washing method did you hear about?]","[......That washing method...... Ein did to Kaito...... back then...... I had her teach me...... in detail.]","Well, that isn’t good. That would seriously be a disaster. The washing method Ein-san did back then, in other words, that method she used back when we bathed together during the Six Kings Festival......","Just as I was thinking about this, I felt an astonishingly smooth and soft touch on my back, and I felt like blood immediately rushed up to my face.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [T- The sweetness, it’s killing me...... My consciousness...... is drif...... ting away......]","Makina : [Don’t you worry! Here, all cured.]","Serious-senpai : [......Huh?]","Makina : [You can be relieved. As long as I’m around, you won’t suddenly pass out in the middle of the story!]","Serious-senpai : [......That basically makes me unable to escape from this situation, so you telling me that kinda feels no different from telling me to go suffer and writhe in agony...... ]"]},{"number":1356,"title":"Chapter 1356 - Camping Under the Starry Sky 7","paragraphs":["Isis-san’s way of washing my back, after she had learned that strange lesson from Alice’s unnecessary advice, was absolutely terrific. The experience made me feel like I had been communicating with the truth of the universe, and I almost blacked out several times during the process.","However, if there’s one thing I’d like to say...... it would be that Alice would definitely get a smack from my piko piko hammer later.","Even before I actually got into the hot waters of the bath, I felt like the big event had already ended, but I somehow managed to get myself motivated...... Or rather, get myself calmed down as I soak my body in the bath.","[......Ahh, that’s right. I have that thing......]","[......Kaito...... What’s that?]","[Errr, it’s a sample of the bath salts Kuro’s company had made. To put it very simply, this is the kind that gives off the scent of flowers when you put it in the bath.]","[......I see...... That’s amazing...... I’m looking forward to it.]","This bath has an onsen-like appearance, but the water is just normal. So, I decided to add some bath salts to make it feel more like an onsen.","The ideal bath salts would have been those that are similar to those found in onsens, but unfortunately, due in part to the minor popularity of onsens in this world, no such bath salts have yet been produced.","This bath salts is one of the first series of bath salts released by Kuro’s company, the Noble’s Bath Series. If this series sells well, a second and third series may be made, and eventually, bath salts that produce the atmosphere of onsens may be created.","Considering the size of the bath, I added several bath salts and mixing them lightly, the color of the bath soon changed and a pleasant floral fragrance wafted out.","[......It smells good.]","[Unnn. It smells nice. Let’s go in.]","[......Unnn.]","After confirming that the bath salts are well mixed, I entered the bath with Isis-san. Although there’s actually a barrier around the place, the open-air bath still feels liberating and comfortable.","The stars are looking quite beautiful today, and when combined with the mountains beyond our field of vision, it was quite a beautiful sight.","[......The stars...... are beautiful.]","[Right. Ahh, but this place might be a little too bright to go watch the stars...... I’m going to dim the lights a little bit.]","After notifying Isis-san, I get out of the hot water once and touch the magic tool near the entrance to adjust the brightness of the area. It’s dangerous to make the whole place pitch black though, so I made sure that I had darkened the place enough for me to see my footing before returning to back under the waters.","The starry sky looks more beautiful than before, and I think this is quite a luxurious sight.","[......Fufu.]","[You seem to be having fun, Isis-san.]","[......Unnn...... When I’m together with Kaito...... even the smallest thing...... feels very fun...... making me feel very blessed.]","[.......Isis-san.]","[......Taking a bath together with Kaito makes me happy...... Watching the beautiful stars together with Kaito makes me happy...... Being together with Kaito is happiness...... Even if I’m not conscious of it...... I just find myself smiling naturally.]","The expression on Isis-san’s face as she said that with a happy smile was much more beautiful and dazzling than the starry sky, making one feel that she was truly brimming with love.","Perhaps, it was because it was just the two of us and the mood was good...... but I found myself gently wrapping my hand around Isis-san’s shoulders, bringing her body to my embrace.","In response to my actions, Isis-san happily entrusted herself to me, and I felt the touch of her bare skin underneath the water.","[......I’m not sure how I could describe it, but I feel the same way as Isis-san. It’s hard to express, but being able to share the feeling of fun and happiness feels really nice......]","[......Unnn...... I feel the same way as Kaito...... and thinking of that...... also makes me feel very happy.]","[Isis-san.]","[Kaito...... Hnn.]","Putting a little strength into the hand holding her shoulder, as I felt like I’m drawn in by Isis-san’s face as she looked at me, I brought my face close and kissed her lips. The feeling of our lips overlapping was so pleasant that it was difficult to describe, but the faint sweetness I could taste lingered in my mind.","After a while, we let go of each other’s lips, and with my hand still wrapped around Isis-san’s shoulders as she leaned her body against mine, I turned my gaze once again to the starry sky.","Looking at the beautiful starry sky in an open-air bath like this feels very luxurious, but being able to enjoy this luxurious scenery together with Isis-san gives me more happiness than that.","Strange it may be, but even when I’m filled with this much happiness, as time goes by, I feel like such happiness only grows greater and greater.","And just as how I’m sure Isis-san feels the same way, I’m sure Isis-san also knows that I feel the same as her.","I’m not sure if you should describe this state we’re in as our feelings being deeply communicated with each other, but even without exchanging words...... I could really feel the feeling of how the two of us are together.","[......Kaito.]","[Yes?]","[......Can we...... do it again?]","[Of course.]","[......Kaito...... I love you.]","[I love you too, Isis-san.]","Feeling deep happiness that seems to permeate from the bottom of my heart, my lips and Isis-san’s overlapped again.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [......Sorry...... I’ll just...... melt for a sec.]","? ? ? : [Melt!? You’ll melt when the sweetness reaches dangerous levels!? Even for beings with amusing ecology, that is just pushing it......]"]},{"number":1357,"title":"Chapter 1357 - Camping Under the Starry Sky 8","paragraphs":["After we finished bathing, Isis-san and I exited the bathhouse and sat down in small chairs in front of the open-air fire-styled heater set up in front of the tent.","Then, I took out a mini stove-like Magic Tool, prepared a small pot and poured the instant soup sold by Kuro’s company into it to heat it up.","......Well, the instant soup had been warm from the beginning, so heating it up was more for the atmosphere......","And then, after a little while, I put some soup in a mug and handed it to Isis-san.","[Here you go.]","[......Thank you...... Kuromueina sure...... thinks of a lot...... of interesting things.]","[That’s right. Coming up with that idea certainly was, but I think it’s also great that she can actually bring that idea to reality.]","Drinking a little bit of soup from my mug, I look up at the starry sky. This is something I wanted to do, or rather, there was this part of me that admired the image of drinking soup from a mug while looking up at the starry sky.","When I glanced next to me, Isis-san was holding her mug with both hands, and when she noticed me, she gave me a lovely smile. Unnn, what a happy sight.","Just like that, we continued to chat over a mug of soup.","[......Heehhh, then Eul is close with Spica-san?]","[......Unnn...... They seem to get along well...... and they’re always together...... just as how Iris is often with Polaris.]","[Fumu. By the way, what about Sirius-san and Rasal-san?]","[......Those two...... fight a lot...... but I think...... they get along.]","[I guess it’s something like the more they fight, the closer they get?]","[......Unnn...... They acknowledge each other’s good points...... but it seems like...... they can’t be honest with themselves.]","[I see.]","I suppose their relationship might be similar to that between Chronois-san and Ein-san. They are rivals and sometimes quarrel, but they know each other better than anyone else and somehow get along with each other.","Even so, Isis-san’s place really became lively in no time. I felt like the time when Iris-san became her subordinate was quite recent, but as if they were drawn to each other, I get this impression that her subordinates have gathered one after another.","In addition, her subordinates seem to have good compatibility with each other, as it seems that everyone is basically getting along well with each other, making Isis-san very happy.","[How should I say this...... It’s just my hunch, but it seems like from here on out, Isis-san’s subordinates will continue to increase and your camp will become quite lively.]","[......I wonder...... I’d be happy...... if that were to happen.]","[Speaking of which, you’ve created a flower garden recently?]","[......Unnn...... It’s a Blue Crystal Flower garden...... It’s so beautiful...... and I’d like Kaito...... to come and see it.]","[I would love to see it. Blue Crystal Flowers have left a deep impression on me too, so I’m looking forward to seeing them.]","Blue Crystal Flowers don’t usually grow in clusters, and it seemed like they don’t have any pattern with where and how they grow, but being the Spirits of the Blue Crystal Flower, it seems like Spica-san is able to make Blue Crystal Flowers bloom at will, and with that, they had created a large flower garden.","The sight of Blue Crystal Flowers blooming all over the place was very beautiful, and looking at it from the public standpoint, wouldn’t you consider that a rare place?","Eventually, that Blue Crystal Flower garden may become a tourist attraction in the Land of Death. No, by the time that happens, that place may not be called the Land of Death anymore, ending up being called by a different name.","[For various reasons, I’m looking forward to the future.]","[......Unnn...... I never thought...... there will come a day...... when I would look forward to the future...... until I met Kaito.]","[I guess that has to be because of your magic power of death?]","[......I’ve never given up hope....... but looking forward to the time...... I gained control of my magic power of death...... haven’t crossed my mind...... I was always anxious about the future...... and only dark thoughts...... came to my mind.]","After speaking that much, Isis-san pauses, turns to me and softly smiles before continuing.","[......However...... I met Kaito...... fell in love with you...... and now...... I’m looking forward to the future...... our future...... Just thinking about it...... naturally brings a smile to my lips...... and all of this...... is thanks to Kaito.]","[It’s because you yourself didn’t give up hope, Isis-san.]","[......Even so...... the one who held the hand...... of the me who didn’t give up hope...... was you, Kaito...... Thank you.]","A past where she had nothing but anxiety about the future in mind. Looking back, when I first met her, she was somewhat downcast and even if there was a glimmer of hope in her heart, she looked as if she had almost given up.","And even after we got to know each other, Isis-san often had this anxious expression on her face, perhaps because of her past, but every time we spent time together, she seemed to smile more and became even brighter than before.","I felt that the way Isis-san stopped looking down and talking about how she was looking forward to the future with a smile on her face...... was the most Isis-san-like of it all.","<Afterword>","? ? ? : [I wonder what Serious-senpai melted into though...... Hmm, it has a cream-like appearance.]","Makina : [......Let’s see? Ahh, it tastes like custard cream.]","? ? ? : [......The heck is with you, putting something like that in your mouth...... Look, even though I’m your best friend, I think you’ve got some screws loose in your head......]"]},{"number":1358,"title":"Chapter 1358 - Camping Under the Starry Sky 9","paragraphs":["<Author’s Notes>","I don’t have a lot of time, so today’s chapter is a little short. My apologies.","After a leisurely rest under the stars with a mug of soup, we decided to set off fireworks at a place with no grass. Though I say that, it wasn’t one of those flashy skyrockets, but just hand-held fireworks.","I had bought several of these for this day, and I also made sure that I had a bucket of water ready.","[As I recall, Isis-san likes sparklers, right?]","[......Unnn...... I like them.]","[I also like sparklers at times like this because they’re more beautiful than flashy fireworks.]","I remember doing fireworks with Kuro and the others the day before the Six Kings Festival. At that time, Isis-san said that she liked sparklers.","It’s true that Isis-san, who was holding a sparkler, is very picturesque, and even though she wasn’t wearing a yukata today, but normal clothes, she still looked fantastic and beautiful.","[......Speaking of which...... Fireworks...... has been something passed down by otherworlders.]","[Ahh, I knew that was the case. It doesn’t have a name unique to this world, having the same name as those back in my world, so I thought that might be the case......]","Well, there were many cases where the name was changed later to the name passed down by those who held the role of Hero, so it isn’t possible to determine if things were passed down by an otherworlder just from its name alone.","Many of the names of foodstuffs and other related things had been changed to the names handed down by those who held the role of Hero. From what I heard, it’s done as much as possible, mainly to avoid confusion or uneasiness among those who have been invited from the other world to play the role of Hero.","However, some names were based on the places they were famous for, like Ripple Town being famed for their ripples, and some names that would cause problems if they were changed are left as they are.","[......Unnn...... A person who played the role of Hero from about 850 years ago...... apparently came from a family who makes fireworks...... and from there, they spread the culture to others.]","[Heehhh...... but in that case...... That may mean fireworks could have an older history here than those in my world, so looking at it that way is kinda interesting.]","I didn’t know when fireworks were created, but if the fireworks here were created 850 years ago, it has a considerably long history. The flow of time between this world and Earth is different, so it’s interesting how even though it was passed down from Earth, the depth of its history here could be reversed.","Thinking about this, I enjoyed the leisurely fireworks with Isis-san.","After the fireworks, there was nothing more for us to do, so we went to sleep. The tent was quite spacious and also had those cots.","At first, I thought we were going to stay in separate tents, but Isis-san wanted us to stay in the same tent.","[......Hey...... Kaito.]","[Yes?]","[......Can I sleep...... on the same bed with you?]","T- The situation turned out like this huh...... No, it’s not that I hadn’t expected this at all. When I stayed at Isis-san’s castle before, and during the Six Kings Festival, we somehow always ended up sleeping together.","That’s why, I had some feeling that it would be the same case this time...... and in fact, I had prepared a double-size cot for replacement.","Still, her actually making the request bewildered me for a moment...... but in the end, there was no way I could refuse Isis-san’s wish. And so, after thinking about what to say for a bit, I nodded with a wry smile.","[......I actually thought that would be the case, so I bought a larger bed as well. I’ll swap them out.]","[......I see...... That’s great...... Kaito.]","[Well, it might still be a little cramped for us though.]","[......It’s alright...... Just being together with Kaito...... makes me happy.]","After I returned Isis-san’s smile with a smile of my own, I put away the readily-prepared cots and prepared the double-sized bed.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Aaaaahhhhh, stooooop, please! Let me escape from here! The next chapter feels bad, it would definitely be dangerous!!!]","? ? ? : [Just as I was wondering you suddenly revived, the heck are you making a fuss now, hahaha.]","Serious-senpai : [Hahaha your face! Let me go! You’re holding me so lightly, so why the heck won’t you budge!? What the heck is with your strength!?]"]},{"number":1359,"title":"Chapter 1359 - Camping Under the Starry Sky 10","paragraphs":["Although it’s a double-sized bed, I lie down on the bed that strangely feels smaller than a normal double-sized bed, probably because of the situation in the tent.","I bought a rather expensive one though, so it’s quite soft and comfortable.","[......Then...... I’ll come in too.]","[Yes, here you go.]","As I felt the outside air drifting in for a moment, I sensed Isis-san entering the futon, and when I turned around, I was surprised to find Isis-san closer than I thought.","After laying herself on the bed, Isis-san looks at my face and happily smiles.","[Errr...... Well then, I’ll put out the lights.]","[......Unnn.]","When I touched the Illumination Magic Tool that was placed at the bedside, the brightness in the tent was suppressed and dimmed, and when the light went out completely, my vision was enveloped in darkness.","[......It’s much darker than I thought. I’m not sure if it’s because the tent was working as intended or not, but well, it’s good for sleeping......]","[......Kaito...... can’t see much when it’s dark?]","[You’re asking me that? Does that mean Isis-san can see?]","[......I can see...... Wait a moment.]","When Isis-san told me this, I felt a hand covering my eyes, and a little later...... I saw Isis-san’s face.","It’s not that the surroundings are bright, but it feels more like my eyes have become accustomed to the night and I can see well even in the dark.","[Ohh, this is amazing. I can see very well.]","[......I enhanced your eyesight with magic...... so that you can see well in the dark...... Is it alright?]","[Yes, I can see Isis-san’s face very well.]","[......Fufu...... I can also...... see Kaito well.]","Thanks to being able to clearly see the cuteness of Isis-san, who was saying that with a smile, I could understand that Isis-san was staring at me, giving me this ticklish feeling that was making me feel a little embarrassed.","It’s strange how, even though our bodies aren’t touching directly, I feel warmer inside the futon than when I’m alone, and somehow, I could strongly feel that Isis-san was nearby.","[......Hey...... Kaito...... Can I...... go closer?]","[Eh? Yes, of course.]","When I nodded, Isis-san approached quite a bit, and her body was in close contact with mine. Isis-san is also wearing thin pajamas, so it feels like our bodies are touching each other.","Of course, I was also wearing pajamas, but I could feel Isis-san’s body so clearly that I had the illusion that our bare skin was touching.","Thereupon, Isis-san put her hands around my back and hugged me tightly. And now, closer than before...... Isis-san, hugging me from the front, our whole body were in close contact with each other.","I felt blood rush to my face. Her soft and warm touch all over my body, her good scent, and her breath brushing my skin......","[I- Isis-san!?]","[......Kaito...... It feels warm...... Cuddling with you like this...... fills me with...... so much happiness.]","Isis-san, saying that with a happy smile, looked so lovely, that I almost unconsciously wrapped my arms around her, holding her in my embrace.","As it seemed like the slender Isis-san completely settled herself on my chest, I felt pleasantness beyond description.","[......Errr, being like this also feels very warm...... Just like Isis-san, it fills me with happiness.]","[......We feel the same then...... I’m happy.]","[That’s right. We’re sharing the same happiness, don’t we?]","[......Unnn...... Kaito...... Can I kiss you?]","[Yes.]","As I felt my heart beating faster upon hearing the sweet words Isis-san whispered in my ears, my lips overlapped with hers. Caught up with the moment, I also involuntarily hugged Isis-san tighter.","I’m not sure if it’s because our whole body was sticking to each other, but I felt as if the smallest gap between us was being filled with a warm and comfortable feeling, and my head felt as if it was floating up in the clouds.","No, it wasn’t that such a feeling feels uncomfortable, as it was a very comfortable and happy feeling. As Isis-san had said, the feeling of being able to share the same happiness together was irresistible.","While I thought that in the midst of our kiss, something I hadn’t expected happened. Isis-san’s tongue was lightly touching my teeth, as if she was knocking on them.","As to what that means, there’s no way I wouldn’t know about it, so opening my mouth a little bit, I felt her tongue slip in and touch my tongue.","I was surprised that our kiss would be deeper...... and for Isis-san to be the one initiating it, but as I felt as if my brain was being fried, I was so absorbed in moving my tongue around that the sound of our kiss could be heard in the quiet tent.","I don’t know how long our deep kiss lasted, but after a while, Isis-san pulled her face away and with a slightly dazed smile, she spoke.","[......Kaito...... You see...... I’ve asked various things...... to Shalltear and Kuromueina...... human love...... how lovers express their love for each other...... However...... I had only heard it from others...... and studied some books...... That’s why...... won’t you teach me...... how it’s actually done...... Kaito?]","[Isis-san...... Do you mean......]","[......Kaito...... I love you.]","With a smile so beautiful that one would think a Goddess had descended, Isis-san hugged me even stronger than beautiful, and our lips overlapped again.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Gahaak...... S- So this is it huh......]","? ? ? : [S- Serious-senpai!? Your body is disappearing! What in the world......","Serious-senpai : [The damage I received has exceeded the critical point. It seems like this is my limit...... I will disappear soon...... The journey up to now...... isn’t that bad...... Thank you......]","? ? ? : [Serious-senpai!!! No way, this can’t be...... Can you not escape in such a strange way? Go, I choose you, Makina!]","Makina : [Yes, yes. Let’s restore her body back.]","Serious-senpai : [......Compassion...... Don’t you...... have it......]"]},{"number":1360,"title":"Chapter 1360 - Camping Under the Starry Sky 11","paragraphs":["Within the clean morning air, I put a small pot on the small magic tool to boil water. It isn’t that the morning air was that cold, but somehow, I was in the mood for a hot drink in the morning.","With that in mind, I took out a few items from my magic box and called out to Isis-san.","[Isis-san, which would you prefer, tea or coffee?]","[......I often drink tea...... but if we’re drinking from a mug...... I think drinking coffee on it...... would suit it better.]","[I guess you’re right. We’ll have coffee then.]","Tea is basically what I drink most often in this world, but I also drink coffee to a certain extent. I mean, the coffee I drank was often matched with Kuro’s baby castellas.","In any case, I prepared coffee mugs for both of us.","[Isis-san, what are you making?]","[......Scrambled eggs...... It’s easy to eat...... by putting it between two pieces of bread.]","[Ahh, that sounds good. I think I also have some ham here......]","Dividing our roles and making preparations, we had a croissant sandwich, with ham and scrambled eggs as filling, and coffee for breakfast.","This is a simple but quite wonderful breakfast. A good cup of coffee in the morning is always great, and the croissant sandwich is very nice.","[......Isis-san, now that we’ve finished our meal, why don’t we look for a souvenir like we usually do? This place does resemble that place mentioned in the novel, so let’s look for something we can take home with us.]","[......Unnn! ......I wonder what we could take back though...... Kaito...... What do you think?]","[Hmmm, I’d like something that isn’t too big. Speaking of which, that novel mentioned how the couple found a small flower by the water.]","[......Unnn...... It’s not a rare flower...... but because the place is special for them...... they see it as special...... or so it was written.]","It’s not supposed to be a special flower, but because the place was special for them, they see it as special. Those were pretty good words, and designating something as special is something I can relate to.","In fact, the impact of a situation as one sees it is huge, so I can understand how the characters felt.","[Well then, shall we look for the flowers blooming near the lake?]","[......Unnn...... Let’s look for them...... together.]","Seeing Isis-san nodding happily, I also ate my breakfast with a smile on my face.","After that, we finished eating our breakfast, cleaned up, packed up our tent and then went to the lake with Isis-san to search for the flower.","This place isn’t a tourist spot, so the things around weren’t just neatly arranged, but as this place was brimming with nature, we easily found a couple of the flowers after looking around for it, and we were able to find some that looked great.","[These ones look nice.]","[......2 flowers snuggling up to each other...... Just like us...... They’re beautiful.]","[Yes, they aren’t that big, but it has this natural beauty to them.]","[......Unnn...... Just as written in that novel...... Even though it isn’t a rare flower...... Even though it’s a flower that blooms anywhere...... Because it’s a flower that I searched for together with Kaito...... It looked...... really special.]","Saying this, Isis-san lightly imbued magic power into her hand, and the flower floated up together with the surrounding soil and settled in a potted plant that Isis-san brought out of nowhere.","Just like that, she applied a powerful State Preservation Magic to keep the flowers from withering, preserving their current state. Incidentally, before she imbued it with magic power, she checked to make sure that there are no Spirits dwelling within it.","Well, since the magic power of such a small flower is so weak, it’s basically impossible for a Spirit to dwell in it. As for when magic power has been gathered in it though, it seems that there’s a possibility that a Fairy would be born instead of a Spirit.","[......You’re right. I probably wouldn’t have found this flower today if I hadn’t been here with Isis-san. Since it blooms everywhere, I wouldn’t have thought a flower I could come across anywhere as special.]","[......Unnn...... Fufu...... But since I’m here...... together with Kaito...... Something usual...... becomes special...... and brings us so much happiness.]","[Isis-san...... Yes, when I’m with Isis-san, even the most trivial things feel fun, making me happy.]","Those are words that came from the bottom of our hearts. The two of us making breakfast together, looking for small flowers that can be found anywhere, none of those were anything special.","However, just thinking of doing something together with my beloved lover, a lovely smile visible on her lips, it’s strange how it feels very special and worthwhile.","Perhaps, having such thoughts in mind, smiling together with someone by my side, as if such a thing is the most obvious thing in the world...... may have been the greatest happiness one could ever wish for.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [.....................]","? ? ? : [I’m not sure if it’s because she had received too much damage, but I kinda feel like that’s her spirit flying over there. What cruelty could have possibly happened to her......]","Makina : [For someone to have cornered Serious-senpai this much......]","Serious-senpai : [......It’s because you two won’t let me go......]"]},{"number":1361,"title":"Chapter 1361 - The Festival Proposed by the Black Wing","paragraphs":["It happened one morning. I went out into the yard to brush Bell’s fur, but as I looked up at the sky, I saw a black line in the sky.","It was a sight so familiar that once you saw it, you would never forget it, so when I saw the circular black trail it left behind it, I could guess who had come.","[My sworn friend! The time has come! The time to fulfill the pact we made eons ago has finally arrived. In the land of Archlesia, the light of hope shot up and became a shining star in the dark night. The curtain rises to a celebration. The time to mark the calendar is soon...... so you best be prepared.]","[......Hello, Amel-san.]","[Hello, my sworn friend! Sorry for bothering so ear——— Hrnn!? My apologies for the early morning discourtesy. However, I thought I should bring this delightful news to my sworn ally as soon as possible.]","[I see.]","Nodding my head at her words, I recalled Amel-san’s words earlier. The pact we made eons ago...... This is just one of her exaggerations again, so I guess she was talking about what we had promised before.","As for that land of Arclesia and all that...... In other words, there will be a festival in Archlesia Empire, so she had come to consult with me about the stall that we promised to set up together...... I see.","[I understand. We did promise to set up a stall, and I myself have no problem with this...... but I suppose there’s a festival in Archelsia?]","[When seven revolutions of the moon pass, the great feast shall begin.]","[Seven months from now, right? I understand.]","......Isn’t that still a long way off from now!? When you say 7 months, that’s already more than half a year. But well, since it was Amel-san we’re talking about here, she must have inquired about the schedule of festivals and excitedly popped out of her office when she found out.","In fact, she seems to be quite happy even now, so I guess that’s why she wants to have a meeting about the contents of the festival so early.","[......We promised that we would set up Amel-san’s favorite stall, right? Did you have an idea in mind?]","[Fuuu, my sworn friend. Don’t get me wrong, I have set up a stage befitting for us. Our existence isn’t being fitted within such a small framework...... Are we not?]","[Eh? We aren’t just going to open a regular stall?]","[Yeah, the steering wheel of the ship we would be steering is a gorgeous ark known as the festival. The course itself is ours! Now, let’s scatter about our beautiful colors!]","[......Seriously......]","I thought there was no way this would be the case, but it really was an invitation for the management of the festival itself. Or rather, it feels like it has already been decided that this festival will be held, isn’t it? In that case, that 7 months might be lacking instead.","I mean, we’re organizing a festival!? How the heck did our conversation lead to that...... No, Amel-san is the Head of the Wingeds and probably has a lot of power, so it’s not that surprising that she can hold such a festival......","[Ehehe, I wanted to hold a festival with my sworn friend, so I’ve been talking with various people. I got permission. I’m looking forward to it, a festival I created with my sworn friend——— Haahh!? Erhem. Oops, it seems like my impatience made me lose composure. I guess I’m still too young......]","[......However, I’ve never experienced organizing festivals before though.]","[Don’t worry, my sworn friend, for we aren’t creating a new festival. The festival we would be setting up is originally a festival where three different species gathered together, but we were allowed to manage it this time. Our foundation already exists, what we need is to paint the ship with our colors, and we already have the helmsman and the crew in place. In other words, we will just be painting our ship.]","In other words, there are already people who plan and manage the original festival, so there’s no need for us to do all the preparations.","And so, it would just be a matter of thinking up a plan or something like that......","[In short, we’re going to be in charge of thinking of events that would be held at the festival.]","[As expected of my sworn friend, our thoughts were indeed as one. Yes, let me and my sworn friend be the flowers that provide color to this festival!]","[I understand what you’re saying. Let’s discuss about this...... but well, we can’t just talk about it while standing around here, so please come in.]","[Unnn, excuse my intrusion.]","Amell-san seemed very happy as she followed me into the house with a smile. Well, planning an event seems like it would be quite difficult, but Amel-san said that we should be able to solidify it in about 4 months in advance, so we have a grace period of 3 months.","Would we be thinking about various things in this discussion...... Or it would just be me skillfully reprimanding Amel-san, who would likely propose events brimming with chuuniness, and guiding this event to something that could welcome everyone...... Either way, it’s going to be rough.","It’s just, well, looking at the happy expression on Amel-san’s face, I didn’t even feel like refusing her.","<Afterword>","? ? ? : [Fumu, the title doesn’t have that 1 on it, so I guess this discussion won’t end right away...... Ahh, by the way, Serious-senpai is currently sleeping. Well, there’s no sweetness in the current chapter, so I guess it should be fine not to smack her awake......]"]},{"number":1362,"title":"Chapter 1362 - The Maids Challenge 1","paragraphs":["I received a strange call from Lilia-san. She said she had a visitor and asked me to come if possible...... which was quite a strange thing. I mean, if they had come to visit me, then shouldn’t they just come directly to my house? For them to come to Lilia-san’s house and ask her to call for me, was she an acquaintance of Lilia-san that isn’t acquainted with me?","There are probably plenty of people like that among the nobles, but there has never been a case where Lilia-san introduced me to someone.","However, I’m a little concerned about the complicated expression on Luna-san’s face when she went to my house to call me over.","[......Why do you have that subtle apologetic expression on your face, Luna-san?]","[Miyama-sama, if it’s not convenient for you, you can refuse.]","[......Errr, who exactly came to visit?]","[She’s someone Miyama-sama isn’t acquainted with. She isn’t a bad person, but her temperament is a little impulsive...... or perhaps, she’s just being intuitive.......]","[You know, you do realize that the things you have been telling me have been making me uneasy, right?]","Coming here to call for me, suddenly saying it’s okay to refuse, and then, for some reason, she started supporting the other side by bringing up their personality...... What she’s saying is that she’s not a bad person, but she’s got some sort of problem, right?","With how uneasy I feel from the way she phrased it, I feel like I want to refuse, but I think doing that would cause trouble for Lilia-san...... In fact, I unfortunately had no plans at the moment, so I decided to accept.","[So, in the end, who is it?]","[It’s Symphonia Kingdom’s Head Maid, Beatrice-sama.]","[......She really is someone I’m clueless about huh.]","[She’s also one of his Majesty, the King’s wives.]","[Ahh, is that so? Come to think of it, I feel like something like that was mentioned before......]","I remember hearing in a previous conversation with Orchid that one of Ryze-san’s wives was a maid whom Ryze-san had loved like a big sister for a long time.","Could it be that Ryze-san fell in love with Beatrice-san, who had been taking care of his everyday necessities? That sounds like the synopsis of a drama...... but I’m completely unacquainted with her.","I’ve been to the royal castle several times, but I’ve never met anyone who introduced themselves as the one in the position of Head Maid. No, I may have seen her before, but I’m pretty sure we haven’t been introduced to each other.","Furthermore, I have no idea why would that Head Maid come to visit me.","[Beatrice-sama is one of the respected four within the Maid World. She’s one of the Super Maids, known as the Super Maid of Heart.]","[......Whoa there, I suddenly kinda wanna go home now......]","[She’s clad with a fierce Maidric Aura, and due to her nature, she’s a maid so domineering that she sometimes scolds and guides her master severely. I heard that even his Majesty, the King himself couldn’t raise his head against her......]","And the conversation devolves to that Maid World again. An abnormal world that I really don’t wanna know about...... I was rather seriously tempted to say that I just remembered some important business.","I’m begging you, I don’t want those strange knowledge invading my memory anymore. That I had actually come to relatively understand their terminologies recently is something I really hate.","[In any case, she’s a person with a strong passion for Maids, and her devotion is second only to that of the President.]","[......I remembered I had some business I needed to attend to, so I really want to go back...... but why is that person visiting me? It’s not like I’m a Maid, nor do I want anything to do with this Maid World......]","[Surely, you jest. Miyama-sama, who is acknowledged by the Pinnacle of the Maid World, President Ein, is an important existence for the Maid World as well.]","[Please stop that. Seriously, can you please stop that?]","How terrifying it is, the Maid World. Making me an important existence in it without even me knowing, seriously, please excuse me from that. Seriously, from the bottom of my heart, I want to keep my distance from that Maid World......","Well, Luna-san herself should know I don’t like it and is teasing me about it......","[Going back to the subject, Beatrice-sama incredibly respects Illness-san. Well, in fact, she used to be the best maid in the royal castle after all.]","[That’s, well, that makes sense....... but how does that relate to me?]","[No, it’s just...... She seems to have taken an interest in the friend Illness-sama has been close with recently, Nebula-sama.]","[Nebula?]","Well, now, I really want to scram out of here even more. I don’t want our lovely Nebula to get involved in the Maid World or any strange place close to that......","[Since Illness-sama admired her skills, she would like to meet her, but she wanted to ask Miyama-sama’s permission first.]","[ I see...... Well, Nebula is amazing after all. I can understand why she would want to meet her.]","[......I- I suppose so.]","Now this is quite a difficult question. Knowing how great Nebula is and coming to visit her, that raises my opinion of her quite a bit. It does make me proud knowing that Nebula’s greatness is known even to the royal castle’s Head Maid.","However, putting aside how proud I am of Nebula, I also feel that I don’t want her to get involved anywhere near that strange neighborhood...... Hmmm, how troubling.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [For the time being, if you want to increase Kaito’s favorability of you, it seems like a quick way for that would be to talk about his pets or Nebula huh. I mean, you could clearly see the moment his attitude around her turned a 180......]"]},{"number":1363,"title":"Chapter 1363 - The Maids Challenge 2","paragraphs":["In the room I was guided to by Luna-san, Lilia-san and another woman in a maid’s uniform with her brown hair tied up in a knot and neatly kept into place with her headpiece.","How should I say this...... She had this neat and tidy atmosphere around her, really making you know she was the Head Maid, a woman who could do her job well.","[It’s a pleasure to meet you, Miyama Kaito-sama. My name is Beatrice, and I am a Head Maid at the royal castle.]","[I’m Miyama Kaito. It’s nice to meet you.]","The angle of the bow is also very beautiful, and her skill as a maid seems to be quite high...... but I wonder, just like Ein-san and Luna-san, are maids in this world basically always wearing maid uniforms? Well, Luna-san does wear casual clothes when she’s doing something extremely private......","[Errr, you asked to see Nebula?]","[Yes, I would like to ask that if it’s possible. If she is a maid that Teacher Illness commends so much, I would very much like to meet her.]","[......No, Nebula isn’t a maid though?]","[It’s alright. Whatever your actual occupation may be, if you have the Spirit of the Maid within you, you are a Maid.]","......What the heck is this woman talking about? Ahh, this is bad, she’s just like Ein-san. Also, I’ll say this now, but I don’t think Nebula would have whatever that Spirit of the Maid is.","Ahh, I have this strong feeling of not wanting our cute Nebula around these maids who, with a few exceptions, were a gathering of monsters.","[I’ve seen Teacher Illness for the first time in a long time and I’m quite surprised. Illness-sama’s Maid Power, which was already overwhelming, has increased even more. I understand that a maid of my stature couldn’t make these conjectures, but it was clear that her status as a maid had risen compared to when she was in the royal castle.]","[......I- I see?]","[I thought the reason for her becoming a greater maid was Nebula-sama, so I wanted to meet her once. And by all means, I would really like to confirm her ability as a maid to the extent that Teacher Illness praises it.]","Slightly intimidated, I turned my gaze toward Lilia-san, but she just shook her head in sympathy. I suppose she’s saying there’s no persuading her or something like that. I mean, I’ve said this already, but Nebula isn’t a maid......","By the way, Luna-san, for some reason, was nodding her head at Beatrice-san’s words. Well, that person also belongs to the Maid World, so I guess what Beatrice-san said sounded convincing to her ears.","As for me, who has nothing to do with the Maid World, I don’t have any thoughts other than wondering what the heck she’s talking about......]","[H- Hmmm, I understand how you feel, but Nebula might not like it, so I’ll have to check with her first......]","[Understood. I understand that I’m asking something unreasonable, so I’ll wait here.]","[Yes. Then, I’ll go ask Nebula.]","I personally don’t want Nebula to meet her, but I can’t just make that decision on my own.","First of all, I have to get confirmation from Nebula herself...... Thinking that, I left Lilia-san’s room once, walked to the garden under the World Tree and called out to Nebula.","[Nebula, you have a moment?]","[Yes? What is it, Milord?]","[Actually, a visitor has come to meet you......]","[Me?]","She appeared as soon as I called her, and while Nebula was curiously tilting her head, I explained the circumstances to her. Especially regarding what creature maids are and other topics related to them, I conveyed them to her firmly, including my warnings.","After listening to my story, Nebula nodded and spoke.","[......I see, I understand what’s going on. I don’t mind.]","[Errr, you sure?]","[Yes! I am the Absolute. I would never turn away a visitor.]","[......I- I see.]","Nebula is a kind and generous child, so even if it was a sudden visit for an incomprehensible reason like wanting to confirm her ability as a maid, she would readily accept it.","I’m really feeling complicated about all this, but I can’t complain as long as Nebula herself says she’s going to meet her.","[Alright. However, I’m still worried, so I’ll be there with you.]","[Yes. Well then, let’s go meet her together, Milord.]","I think Nebula is a reliable person, so she will be fine, but I’m worried about her, so I decided to sit with her in that meeting. I’m still not sure about Beatrice-san, but if she gets quite passionate like Ein-san and goes out of control, we have to be careful.","Well...... Though I say that, even Ein-san rarely goes out of control. At least, when compared to Eden-san, that’s like a difference between heaven and earth between them, so I think she should basically be fine.","What I’m most worried though, is that just like what Ein-san suggested to Alice back then, the situation might develop into something like a Maid Showdown.","Well, even if a showdown like that happens, I don’t think Nebula would lose anyway......","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Heck, against the Absolute, she has no chance of winning.]","? ? ? : [In a match like that, it would be at a level whether or not I...... Alice-chan or Ein-san can really win against her.]"]},{"number":1364,"title":"Chapter 1364 - The Maids Challenge 3","paragraphs":["Upon Nebula’s gracious agreement, Beatrice-san and Nebula met face-to-face. Beatrice looked surprised for a moment when she saw Nebula, but her expression quickly returned to normal and gave her a bow.","I think she was probably surprised that Nebula was small-statured being only 1m tall, but the fact that her expression immediately returned to normal after only a moment was remarkable.","[It’s a pleasure to meet you, my name is Beatrice. I apologize for calling you so suddenly.]","[It’s a pleasure to meet you, I’m Nebula. Please don’t mind it...... So, you wanted to see me?]","[Yes. I have heard that being around Nebula-sama, you and Teacher Illness have been constantly improving your Maid Power together. Feeling the desire to bear witness to it myself, I have come to visit.]","An information I’ve completely heard for the first time just got brought up? Since when have Nebula and Illness-san been enhancing each other’s Maid Power?","Glancing towards Lilia-san, she too was making a face that seemed to say “Eh? Say what now?”. Well, I guess that’s understandable. I mean, all we’ve heard was that Nebula was getting along well with Illness-san, so it should have been that she was just curious because Illness-san was praising Nebula.","However, in contrast to our bewilderment, Nebula nodded her head calmly.","[I’m not related to that Maid Power and all that, but I do a lot of various things with Illness-san daily. I think it was no exaggeration to say that we’re improving each other because we’re both growing in the process. And as for you bearing witness, what exactly are you looking for?]","[Let’s see...... In that case, would you mind brewing me a cup of tea?]","[I don’t mind. I am the Absolute. I would never reject the wish of those who beg to know.]","Nebula, being the kind and good girl as always, gladly agreed to Beatrice-san’s request and took out a set of tools for brewing tea from her magic box.","Just when she started brewing tea though, Beatrice-san shuddered.","[T- That is...... E- Even when nothing had started yet...... I’m shivering? I, who am called the Super Maid of Heart and should have absolute confidence in my mental strength......]","That’s strange? She’s just making tea, right? Why do I feel as if I’m watching a battle anime, where one guy got instinctively frightened because they could feel on their skin that their opponent is more capable than they imagined?","There’s a huge temperature difference between Beatrice-san and the rest of us in this room...... It seemed like Luna-san was the only one who understood what was going on......","And when it came time for Nebula to start brewing tea, Beatrice-san went down on her knees.","[......That is, w- what beauty...... For it to be to this extent...... Her level as a maid is in another dimension!?]","I kinda feel like something like this had been said before...... Ahh, Frau did say that when she saw Illness-san, didn’t she? I wonder if Akane-san will suddenly appear out of nowhere around here? I want her sharp tsukkomi sometime soon.","[......I can see it. On her back, the figure of the Goddess of Tea...... it was if I’m witnessing an Act of God!]","I can’t see it...... In the first place, what the heck is that Goddess of Tea? Do the people in the Maid World believe in such a God?","While I was thinking about that, Nebula finished brewing the tea and placed it in front of Beatrice-san.","[Thank you for waiting. How was it?]","[......Please accept my apologies! Please forgive my rudeness in testing you. You are a maid of a status I couldn’t reach...... How in the world can I enter the realm you and Teacher Illness were in......]","Beatrice-san has a regretful expression on her face. Lilia-san and I couldn’t keep up with that temperature difference, but for some reason, Nebula nodded, looking as if she understood everything.","[I see, it seems that you have forgotten what is important.]","[......What is important?]","[Your desire to improve is admirable. Even if you don’t reach the realm of this Absolute me, it’s a noble thing that you could look up to the greater heights and keep on moving forward. However, what is the reason for your ambition? If you only want to master your craft, I suppose that is fine as well.]","After saying this, Nebula smiles, looks Beatrice-san straight in her eyes, and speaks.","[However, you are not a seeker of the truth, but a maid. In that case, rather than improve your techniques...... Taking brewing tea as an example, shouldn’t the first thing you think about the face of the person who you serve the tea you brew?]","[ ! ? ! ? ! ? ]","[Your goal shouldn’t have been to improve your technique. As a maid, they who is the most important to you must be the one firmly kept in the center of your heart...... Right?]","[......That was indeed the case, wasn’t it...... Because I was called a Super Maid and became one of the best maids in the world, I had become conscious only of honing my skills as a maid. It seemed like I had been putting the cart before the horse.]","Beatrice-san looked so moved that tears streamed down her face, and after closing her eyes, seemingly digesting the words Nebula told her, she vigorously bowed her head.","[Thank you for reminding me of something so important!]","[Don’t worry about it. I am the Absolute. It’s the role of the Absolute to show the way to those who are lost.]","[......Master.]","Hmm~~ Is it finally time for me to throw out the tsukkomi? The heck is that!? What in the heck is happening!? I’m really feeling like I had just been left behind in that short amount of time...... Also, Beatrice-san just seriously went and called Nebula Master...... Geez, I don’t know what’s going on anymore!","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [All the Maids in that world sure have quite the character, don’t they?]","? ? ? : [And as usual, Nebula-san is quite broad-minded. She didn’t feel repulsed at all...... As expected of the Absolute.]"]},{"number":1365,"title":"Chapter 1365 - The Maids Challenge 4","paragraphs":["At any rate, the battle (?) between Beatrice and Nebula probably hasn’t really turned into an actual battle, but the story of determining competence seemed to have been won by Nebula..","Although there were some unfamiliar Maid-related exchanges, the matter is now settled for the moment......","[Thank you very much, Master. Thanks to Master, I remembered what was important before the Maid Olympia.]","[I’m glad you found my advice helpful.]","There, I heard something I didn’t want to hear. The Maid Olympia, the Festival of Maids...... From the way she said it, it sounded like that event was about to take place......","I have a bad feeling about this, so I didn’t really want to know if it was possible......","Just as I was thinking that, Beatrice-san turned to Luna-san and spoke.","[Come to think of it, this would be the first time Lunamaria would participate, right?]","[Yes. My Maid Power had not yet reached the standard 4 years ago, so this would be the first time I’m finally able to participate.]","[I see...... It’s amazing how much you can improve as a maid within 4 years. However, the Maid Olympia isn’t an event you can easily win. Please participate thinking that everyone around you surpasses you.]","[Yes! However, I can’t show my ineptitude in front of “Milady, who will be coming to cheer me on”, so I intend to do my very best.]","Luna-san responds strongly to Beatrice-san’s words, but I wonder if saying that is alright though? I mean, Lilia-san looked as if that was the first time she heard what you just said......","[......Ummm, Luna? That’s the first time about that, errr, Maid Olympia though? Is there such a competition?]","[Yes, the Maid Olympia, held once every 4 years, is a festival for maids, by maids. I can finally participate in it for the first time this year.]","[I- I see...... Good for you but...... Errr, what did you mean I’m cheering for you?]","In response to Luna-san, who vigorously nodded her head, Lilia-san had a bewildered expression on her face, clearly showing that she couldn’t keep up with all the Maid-related conversation.","I understand her feelings very well, and in fact, I myself couldn’t keep up with what was going on very well. Also, I feel like I stay here like this, I’m likely gonna get caught up too, so if it’s possible, I’d like to go home now...... but it seemed like I had missed that timing when I could leave.","[......Eh? I thought Lili, my best friend, would be there to support me on my big day...... Am I mistaken?]","[......I’ll be there.]","[As expected of Milady, I’m happy to have a master who knows what’s up.]","And there, I witnessed Lilia-san’s weakness. No, well, due to Lilia-san’s personality, it seems that when she gets told like that, she can’t even refuse...... No, can you please not look at me like you’re asking for my help? I don’t really want to be a part of that if I can help it.","I feel like if I get involved in the Maid World any further, their craziness would erode my brain as well......","[Ahh, speaking of which, as for Miyama-sama, I heard that President Ein is planning to invite you as a special guest.]","[......That’s the first time I heard that though. Also, I’d like it if you really excuse me from that......]","[As for how you’ll be treated, wouldn’t he be a Special Judge or something along those lines?]","[......................]","Ahh, that’s really bad. I really don’t want to have a role like that. I mean, I’m completely clueless about Maids...... No, even if I did understand normal maids, I don’t think I could keep up with this world’s concept of Maids.","However, even when I thought earlier that Lilia-san was vulnerable to being requested by others...... I’m also as weak as her in most cases. If Ein-san really makes a serious request, there’s a high chance that I won’t be able to refuse and will end up accepting it.","I wonder if there was a way to avoid that somehow...... but then, I heard the devil’s whispers being spoken out of Luna-san’s lips.","[Ahh, but if you have already decided to watch the game as part of the audience, I don’t think President Ein will force you to do that though.]","[..................]","Assuming that I can’t turn down Ein-san’s request, I have two options before me. I would either be a Special Judge under the pressure of Ein-san’s request, or participate in the Maid Olympia myself only as an audience......","Unfortunately, it seems like simply not going isn’t an option. After all, if Ein-san gets visibly sad after my refusal...... Ahh, this is impossible. I can’t refuse her.","[......I suppose so. I feel sorry for refusing Ein-san, but I also want to support Luna-san’s first participation, so I guess I’ll have to refuse to be a judge......]","[Oya, for even Miyama-sama to be supporting me, this unworthy Lunamaria couldn’t help tearing up in gratitude. I really have no choice but to do my very best then.]","It can’t be helped. It can’t be helped...... It’s far better to watch as an audience than to make an appearance as a Special Judge.","As my shoulders drooped down while I convinced myself like that, Lilia-san went to my side and patted my shoulder.","[......Kaito-san, just give up. Let’s go there together.]","[......To be honest, the only saving grace of this event is that Lilia-san would be there with me.]","[I feel the same way.]","What’s really fortunate is that Lilia-san, who isn’t tainted by the Maid Logic, would be there with me, so this will help me feel a little less left behind...... or so...... I’d like to hope. That happening would be nice.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Ahh, that Maid’s Challenge title refers to this huh...... It was an unexpected start for the Maid Olympia Arc huh......]"]},{"number":1366,"title":"Chapter 1366 - The Maids Challenge 5","paragraphs":["Maid Olympia, a festival of maids...... held once every 4 years and was apparently a major event. However, the location of said event is almost unknown, and only maids...... Or perhaps, audiences invited by the participants are informed of the event.","The location of the event seems to be different each time, and when the date is near, the location is announced by Ein-san through a network for maids.","The World Maids Association, another mysterious organization, is apparently the one in charge of the Maid Olympia, and as I had heard before, this Association’s President, Ein-san, seems to be the representative of the association.","The Maid Culture in this world is mostly due to Ein-san.","[......I see, if you want to concentrate on cheering for Lunamaria, I can’t insist on this matter then. If that’s the case, I will withdraw my request of asking you to be our Special Judge this time.]","[Thank you. But in the first place, I’m not qualified to be a judge for the Maid Olympia, right?]","In the first place, I’m not sure what they do in the Maid Olympia...... If it’s about competing in their skills as a maid, does that mean they’re competing with their tea brewing or sweeping skills?","If I think of it that way, I can enjoy it as some sort of competition...... I guess? I’m not really sure. If there’s something like a cooking competition, I think it would be fun to watch.","[No, Kaito-sama is the Maid Advisor certified by the World Maid Association, so your participation as the Judge wouldn’t be any problem.]","[......Maid Advisor? Me? How did that happen?]","When did I get certified for such a mysterious title? I have no clue when that happened, what that is, and I really wish that organization would stop putting that title on my forehead. What the heck is with people and one-sidedly making me part of the Maid World......","To begin with, I wouldn’t have any advice to give to maids......","[Back at the Six Kings Festival, Kaito-sama had reminded me of what it means to be a maid and what the pride of a maid is. The passionate words you told me at that time are still deeply engraved in my heart.]","[........................]","......I did say something like that huh. Certainly, at that time, I, going along with my emotions and acting like a smart-ass, was somehow able to comfort the depressed Ein-san, who was saying she wasn’t a maid.","I had solved the maid-related worries of Ein-san...... The President of the World Maid Association and one of the most distinguished figures in the Maid World. And that’s why, I have now become this Maid Advisor...... I see, this is what they meant when they say people sometimes dig their own graves huh.","[......W- Well, in any case, that’s why I’ll be there as part of the regular audience.]","[Understood. I will do my best as the organizer to make the tournament satisfactory for Kaito-sama to watch.]","[......P- Please do your best.]","I don’t really know what I’m telling her to do her best but...... Well, whatever.","[Come to think of it, has the venue for this time’s event been decided already?]","[Yes, we are holding it in the Southern Demon Realm this time. I had asked for cooperation from Magnawell and Eingana. We have also secured the “prey” for the maids to hunt in the competition. I’ll give you a map later.]","[......Understood.]","It’s a competition to see who has the best skills as a maid, right? Why are words like prey and hunt getting? We shouldn’t be talking about a hunter’s tournament...... What the heck are maids......","[Speaking of which, this time, we actually had the pleasure of having Nebula-sama help us with the prizes.]","[Eh? You got something from Nebula?]","[Yes, when I came for my monthly visit to buy tea, I heard that they were now making their own teacups, so I looked at their creations and found that they were wonderful products.]","[Well, Nebula is amazing after all.]","As expected of Ein-san, being someone who stands at the top of maids, she seems to have a wonderful eye for detail. Yes, the ceramics made by Nebula and Illness-san are really wonderful.","So much so that, even though this may just be my personal favoritism towards my family acting up, I personally think it wouldn’t be strange if their products were to be lined up in a luxury store......","[In addition, they have created a number of wonderful products, such as that ingeniously crafted sugar, and I’m truly impressed.]","[I’m sure Nebula would also be happy to hear you say that, Ein-san.]","Unnn, unnn, thinking about it again makes me proud of her. Nebula is an amazing girl with a wealth of ideas and the dexterity to make them a reality.","Whether it’s sugar, chocolate or ceramics, she would always surprise me, making me look forward to seeing what she’ll do next.","[And so, I asked Nebula to prepare a specially designed tea set with the World Maid Association crest as the prize for the winner of the Maid Olympia. And as prizes for the top winners, we prepared an assortment of crafted sugar.]","[I see, so that’s how it was.]","[Yes, I’m really humbled by Nebula-sama for willingly accepting my request. With such great prizes, the friendly competition among the participants will be even more rewarding.]","[Fumu fumu, I’m looking forward to it.]","Well, I suppose she’s right. With Nebula’s creations as prizes, I think people will be more motivated and it will be a great competition to watch.","This might make me look forward to the Maid Olympia a little more.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [After saying all those complaints about Maid Olympia, that’s a large 180...... Idiot Parent-Mode Activated.]","? ? ? : [Well, Ein-san isn’t really trying to please him and was saying it with sincerity, so that must have put Kaito-san in such a good mood. He would be able to tell if someone’s just trying to flatter him with his Sympathy Magic after all.]"]},{"number":1367,"title":"Chapter 1367 - The Maids Challenge 6","paragraphs":["For some unknown reason, it was decided that Lilia-san and I would be attending the Maid Olympia, a festival for maids, and together with Luna-san, a participant in the event, we arrived at the venue in the Southern Demon Realm.","When we arrived there, there was a splendid stadium, and it was in a bit of a festival state with stalls and so on around it.","However, the line-up of the stalls was strange. The atmosphere around was completely different from that of a normal festival......","[Ahh, look, isn’t this the newest headpiece?]","[It has a nice design. I’ve been thinking that it’s time for me to get a headpiece of better quality.]","[While you’re at it, why don’t you get something branded?]","[As expected, I’m not confident enough in my Maid Power to wear a branded headpiece......]","While overhearing such an exchange between two women who were having a conversation in front of a certain stall, how should I say this...... Yes, whether I look to the left or to the right, all I see are maids.","If it’s a maid who’s shopping, it’s a maid who opened their stall...... Within this place where, no matter where I look, there are only these apron-dressed people, Lilia-san and I bizarrely feel out of place.","[......Lilia-san, we sure came to a most extraordinary place.]","[Yes...... I wonder what is with this place? It’s as if we’ve wandered into another world.]","[You two, the stall over there is a famous meidoyaki, so I recommend buying it during break time.]","While Lilia-san and I were walking under the pressure of being around maids all over the place, Luna-san, who was quite excited, introduced us to various stores, but to be honest, what she was saying didn’t really register in my mind.","Meidoyaki, Official Custom-made Apron Dresses being sold in stalls, in any case, all the shops only sell maid-related items, and just like Lilia-san, it does feel like we’ve wandered into another world.","[Even so, that was unfortunate. Sieg, Aoi-sama and Hina-sama couldn’t come. Well, if they’re going back to her hometown and have work to do, I suppose it can’t be helped......]","[......Kaito-san, Sieg going back to her hometown, did you just accept her words as they were?]","[Aoi-chan and Hina-chan also said that they remembered Adventurer work they had to do later.]","Yes, in short, Sieg-san, Aoi-chan and Hina-chan successfully escaped. Unlike me and Lilia-san, I guess it was easy for them to refuse because they were invited later.","[......To be honest, I wanted to run away too, but I couldn’t just let Lilia-san go here alone......]","[Kaito-san...... Thank you. Let’s give up together and start thinking that the world is actually like this.]","[Yes.]","After whispering with Lilia-san, we followed Luna-san, who was walking in high spirits. Nevertheless, seriously, no matter if I looked to the left or to the right, there were only maids and I really feel like I’m sticking out like a sore thumb.","It would be like, if there was someone other than a maid around, you would easily know......","[ [ ......Ahh. ] ]","At the same time as I found an acquaintance walking a few distance from us, the other side also noticed us and rushed over, looking as if she had seen Buddha within this hell.","[T- Thank Goodness! There’s actually someone decent around. Kaito, you appeared right at a good time...... As expected of a popular guy! Seriously, I’ve been so, so anxious here...... so seeing someone I know saved me a lot.]","[Akane-san, what a coincidence...... What brings you to this haunted place......]","[I didn’t want to come here! Frau forcibly brought me to this place, and apparently seeing some limited edition something, she went off shopping...... Can you feel my horror from being left alone in this place?]","[......I’m sorry to hear that.]","The person we encountered was Akane, whom I didn’t expect to meet here. Come to think of it, Frau-san was also someone neck-deep within the Maid World.","[On? Who is this, Kaito? Some great big shot again?]","[Ah, no, she isn’t really anything like that......]","[Ahh, I see...... Well, I guess that really would be the case. It’s not like the only acquaintances Kaito has been big shots like the Six Kings.]","As Akane-san looked somewhat relieved at my words, Lilia-san took a step forward and greeted her.","[Nice to meet you, I’m Lilia Albert.]","[......Albert?]","[Yes. I’m the Head of Albert Duchy.]","[Aaahhh~~ I see...... I’m the President of Mikumo Company, Mikumo Akane. It’s an honor to meet you...... By the way, Kaito, come here for a sec......]","After returning Lilia-an’s greeting, Akane-san pulled my clothes and making me squat down a bit, she threw a sharp tsukkomi into my chest.","[Like hell that’s not a big shot!]","......Now that she mentioned it, Lilia-san is the Head of a Duchy...... If you exclude the royalty, she would be one of the highest-ranking nobles, so she definitely is a big shot.","I mean, she doesn’t really feel like a big shot at all, so that kinda slipped my mind......","[......And why do you also look shocked at my words, Young Mistress?]","[No, it’s just, now that you put it that way, I’m also a pretty big deal, aren’t I? I’m someone distinguished, right?]","[That’s right. You’re a Duchess after all.]","[......Because I’ve often been meeting Kaito-san’s acquaintances and there were so few opportunities for me to be in a higher position, I had forgotten about it myself.]","Now that she mentioned it, Lilia-san’s acquaintances were people she got to know through me, and as for those with whom Lilia-san would be in a higher position...... I suppose it would just be Acht and Eva? Ahh, but Neun-san was there when she met them......","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Well, seeing not just Kaito, but the person herself reacting like that, you can really see Lilia’s hardships up until now.]","? ? ? : [As far as it goes, when you compare her with the others, there were so many people around Lilia-san who are stronger than her, both in terms of power and authority, but that would certainly be the image you’d get when she had only been meeting those with higher ranking than her.]"]},{"number":1368,"title":"Chapter 1368 - The Maids Challenge 7","paragraphs":["While I was talking with Akane-san for a bit, Frau-san approached us.","[Chairman, so you were here. I understand your excitement, but please try not to stray too far.]","[You left on your own! If I hadn’t met Kaito, I would have been left alone in this lair of maids!]","It was indeed frightening just to think about being left alone in this place. After that, Frau-san lightly greeted me, but when her gaze turned to Luna-san, she stiffened.","From the tense look on her face, one could feel the sharp atmosphere on the verge of battle around them, while Luna-san herself also had a serious expression on her face.","[......Maid Power 52000...... Stronger than me......]","[47000...... I’m numerically superior, but she probably has more experience than me......]","[Are you also going to join the Maid Olympia?]","[Yes, so you too huh...... It seems that you would be a formidable opponent.]","Sparks seemed to be flying through the air. It was as if both being maids, they considered each other rivals and understood each other’s strengths.","[......Why the heck do you look like you met a worthy opponent before a tournament in a battle manga?]","[Their atmosphere does feel different.]","[......Rather, is Maid Power something that you can tell just at a glance?]","Of course, Akane-san, me, and Lilia-san, who couldn’t keep up with the situation, had indescribable expressions on our faces. Both of them are reading each other’s Maid Power as if it’s natural, but I wonder how they could judge that.","I heard they judged it from something they call Maidric Aura, but in the first place, I have never been able to sense that Maidric Aura. Is it something that only maids can sense?","I’m curious about it, but as there’s a high possibility that a conversation that I don’t understand will unfold if I carelessly ask, I have no intention of actually asking it.","Just like that, after we chatted for a while, as we had no intention of looking around the stalls, we decided to head to the audience stands.","When we arrived at the audience area...... I found that there were only maids everywhere I looked.","[As expected, everyone’s enthusiastic.]","[......No, Frau. Why are you here? Lunamaria-san went to the opening ceremony, right?]","[Ahh, going to the opening ceremony is optional...... Since this would be Lunamaria-san’s first time in the Maid Olympia, I recommended that she attend, but since I have appeared many times, I’m here to give an explanation to Chairman and the others...... I’ll head there when it’s my turn to compete.]","[......Hmmm...... I’m not sure if I should be thankful for that or not.]","I understand how Akane-san feels. To be honest, without explanations, it’s impossible for me to understand what was going on, so I’m grateful for Frau-san’s explanations.","However, just thinking about being forced to listen to their incomprehensible maid logic, so I wasn’t really that inclined to be obediently grateful...... I have very mixed feelings about this.","“Well then, the opening ceremony of the 231st Maid Olympia starts.”","[Wait, that’s quite a lot of times! This happened 231 times already!?]","[The Maid Olympia is a venerable event with a history of over 800 years.]","[......You lot have been doing this for 800 years already huh, what the heck is with you maids...... Scary.]","I strongly agree with Akane-san there. Despite being so popular that it has been held more than 200 times, it’s a bizarre tournament that is almost unknown to anyone other than maids, with the audience made up entirely of maids.","[......The feeling of coming to an unexpected place sure is amazing.]","[It’s said that maids have their own networks after all. Even back when I was working in the Knight Order, the Maids were quite special. We had many opportunities to do missions together......]","[Missions...... together? With maids?]","[Yes, many of the maids were equal or superior to the knights in terms of combat power......]","[Speaking of which, I suppose they are huh.]","Perhaps, I need to redo my perception of things. I thought Lilia-san was similar to me and Akane-san, but there seems to be a slight difference between us.","Lilia-san can’t keep up with the maids’ logic and their extremities, but since she was brought up in this world, it feels like she recognizes things like maids as strong as knights as common sense.","Even if the both of us couldn’t understand what was going on, there was a difference in the scope of our understanding, and if I don’t pay attention, we may find discrepancies in perception in strange places.","[Speaking of which, did you guys know? I heard that all four of the Super Maids are participating in this year’s competition.]","[Unnn? Don’t all of them usually participate?]","[Yes, because the Super Maids are very busy, there are many years when one or two of them have no choice but to not participate. The only one who got the perfect attendance is the Super Maid of Balance.]","[......She has been attending every year?]","[Yes. Perhaps because she’s personally acquainted with President Ein, she comes to attend with her every time......]","[......Is...... that so......]","I see, Camellia-san got perfect attendance huh...... I guess she’s called by Ein-san every time the event is happening and pushes her to attend. Even just hearing about this, I couldn’t help but pity her.","<Afterword>","? ? ? : [Incidentally, it seems like Camellia-san has the most wins.]","Serious-senpai : [A perfect attendance from an event that happened over 230 times...... You’re too easily pushed, Camellia.]"]},{"number":1369,"title":"Chapter 1369 - The Maids Challenge 8","paragraphs":["The opening ceremony of the Maid Olympia began with the entrance of the competitors. The general participants, or rather, those who aren’t so famous in the Maid World, such as Luna-san, are entering together, followed by those who have won top prizes.","[President, Miyama-sama, Duchess-sama, they’re about to arrive...... the Super Maids!]","As if in response to Frau-san’s excited words, the voltage around me seemed to rise. Of course, as we couldn’t keep up with the tension, we felt very left out......","“Now, she has come! The passionate Maid Seeker who has raised her Heart, Technique and Physique to the limit! The fierce Maidric Aura she was clad in becomes a burning flame in her heart, bringing forth the light to everyone! Symphonia Royal Castle’s Head Maid...... Super Maid of Heart, Beatrice makes her entrance!”","With an audible cheer, Beatrice calmly entered the venue, and her walking figure seemed to have the aura of a strong person.","As one would expect from one of the 4 Super Maids, she was extremely popular.","[The Super Maid of Heart, Beatrice-sama...... As expected, she’s amazing. Faced with the fierce Maidric Aura that symbolizes her, inexperienced maids would be heartbroken, unable to stand before it.]","[......I- Is that so...... Amazing.]","As Frau-san clenched her fists and passionately explained, Akane-san replied with an indescribable expression on her face. Immediately after that, a loud cheer resounded again.","“The next one to enter...... Her appearance is refined and elegant, and her skill, which has always been on the front line as a maid in the noble society of the Empire, which boasts a long history, has a beauty that fascinates those who watch her prowess! Archlesia Empire’s Head Maid...... Super Maid of Technique, Alexandra makes her entrance!”","The next to enter was a woman with a beautiful and elegant appearance that looked like a noble lady at first glance, and if she had been wearing a dress instead of a maid uniform, one could have mistaken her for a high-ranking noble.","[The Super Maid of Technique, Alexandra-sama...... According to one theory, she’s a former member of the royal family, and although she was born as a princess, she fell in love with the beings known as Maids and abandoned her position to become a maid. Her technique is one of the best in the Maid World, making her known as the Most Beautiful Battle Maid.]","[......Why the heck does that maid have “Battle” in her alias?]","I’m really glad Akane-san was here. She throws tsukkomis at things I wanted to retort at, so it was a little easier for me.","And if the Heart and Technique have appeared, then of course, the next one would be......","“Here she comes! Overwhelming stamina that is bottomless, does the concept of fatigue even apply to her!? Hydra Kingdom’s pride, the Unsinkable Ship sets sail once again, charging forth in this year’s Maid Olympia! Hydra Kingdom Royal Castle’s Head Maid...... Super Maid of Physique, Emily makes her entrance!”","The person who entered this time was a tall maid of nearly 190cm, with a smile that shows she’s a good person, giving the impression of a lively and cheerful woman.","[The Super Maid of Physique, Emily-sama...... Just like a never-setting sun, she has inexhaustible stamina, and it would be suicidal to challenge her to an endurance battle. She’s someone whose performance will not diminish even until the end of the match.]","[......No, what the heck do endurance battles have to do in a maid competition?]","With her entrance, the Super Maids of Heart, Technique and Physique have arrived, so the next to come out should be......","“And last but not the least, the final member of the Super Maids comes! She is the Ideal Maid, the role model for all maids! She is faithful to the basics, yet everything she does is baptized to a high level, and flashy she may not be, no one will doubt her strength! She’s one of the World King’s Executives, the Seven Princesses, and the former champion of the tournament! Super Maid of Balance, Camellia!!!”","There comes the loudest cheer of all. Camellia-san describes herself as unnoticeable even when she walks around the city, but it seems that she’s insanely famous in the Maid World.","I mean, Camellia-san is wearing a maid uniform...... She probably got forced by Ein-san to wear that. For some reason, it feels like her eyes are somewhat filled with resignation.","......Also, Camellia-san won in the last tournament huh......","[Kyaaaa! Camelia-samaaaa! Please give me your autograph!!!]","[No, you won’t even give out commentaries anymore!? You just ended up being one of her fans, oi......]","[I- I’m sorry, she’s the maid I look up to so..... Erhem. Starting over again, she’s the Super Maid of Balance, Camellia-sama. It should be said that she’s the being that has pushed the basics to the Ultimate Level. In any case, with behavior befitting to be everyone’s role model, she’s said to be the ideal form of a maid to aim for. Also, her combat power is definitely among the top among the participants!]","[......Is there even anyone with low combat power among them? They do exist right...... but if it’s maids in this world......]","It’s just my hunch, I felt like Akane-san had gotten tired. I know exactly how she feels. The atmosphere in the venue was so dense that it was already too much for me to handle.","With the start of the Maid Olympia already like this, I’m starting to get really anxious.","<Afterword>","“Super Maid of Heart” Beatrice","Maid Power: 120,000","She’s an excellent maid who combines charisma, a passionate desire to improve oneself and high command skills, and she possesses a burning, passionate spirit. It’s said that ordinary maids can’t even stand before her presence.","“Super Maid of Technique” Alexandra","Maid Power: 130,000","Her real name is Alexandra Lia Archlesia, a former member of the royal family, but she gave up her royal status in order to become a maid. Because of her mixed parentage, having Demon blood on her veins, she has been the Head Maid in Archlesia Empire for several hundred years.","“Super Maid of Physique” Emily","Maid Power: 110,000","Originally the daughter of a fisherman in Hydra Kingdom, she’s a cheerful and energetic woman. She’s a Quarter-blood Mermaid, and is known as the Unsinkable Ship because of her stamina.","“Super Maid of Balance” Camellia","She’s the basic standard for the Super Maids, and is considered a role maid for most maids. Despite her usual lacking presence, she’s quite the star in the Maid World. However, as to be expected, unless she’s wearing her maid uniform, the people around would usually not notice her. As per previous instances, the maid uniform she wears is one Ein has given her, and she wears it every time because she can’t refuse her persistence."]},{"number":1370,"title":"Chapter 1370 - The Maids Challenge 9","paragraphs":["Although I’m feeling left behind by the surrounding excitement, for the time being, the opening ceremony continues.","“Well then, before we begin, we would receive a few words from the President of the World Maid Federation and World Maid Association, Professor Emeritus of the Maid Research Association, Special Direction of the Maid Management Organization, and Head Jury for the Maid Olympia, Ein-sama.”","So many titles! World Maid Federation, World Maid Association, Maid Research Association, and Maid Management Organization...... Just with what had been mentioned, that’s already four organizations. In addition, she’s probably involved in the management of the Maid Olympia.","As I thought, the reason why the maids in this world are so strange is definitely Ein-san. No matter how you look at it, she’s leading the charge toward this situation...... My senses are really screaming at this one.","[Chairman, the person over there is the best maid in the world, Ein-san.]","[That’s Kuromu-sama’s maid, isn’t it? We haven’t talked much......]","[Yes, she has various titles, such as Maids of Maids, the Pinnacle of Maids, and so on. Her Maid Power is said to be 530,000.]","[That’s really impressive. The highest value among the Super Maids is 130,000, right? That’s 4 times as much.]","[Yes, moreover, it’s said that Ein-sama has never shown her full power in Maid Olympia, and it’s said that her true power is well over a million. It’s said that she won 10 consecutive victories at Maid Olympia with overwhelming strength, and because she had no opponents, she became the Judge of the Maid Olympia instead. However...... According to rumors, there has only been one person who could be considered as Ein-sama’s rival...... but all the details about them are unknown and shrouded in mystery.]","It’s no surprise that Ein-san is a very famous person in the Maid World. She is, after all, the pinnacle of the maids in the world and can be considered a kind of charismatic figure.","The enthusiasm of the audience was even greater than before, and even Frau-san was looking at Ein-san with admiration.","[......Seriously, I’d like it if they’d stop with that terrifying rumor......]","[Go tell that to Ein-san.]","[She won’t listen even if I told her that though.]","At that moment, I heard a voice whisper from behind that only I could hear, sounding as if she was really fed up with what was going on. Well, the rival that Ein-san is talking about is definitely Alice, so I can understand why Alice was astounded, and I genuinely sympathize with her on this matter.","“......I have no intention of telling all the determined maids who have gathered here about the basics of what maids are. Your presence at this event is proof that you must have devoted yourself to your daily training as a maid. Whether it’s technique, heart, or fighting power...... All of them are indispensable for first-class maids. Show off your skills as a maid today and compete with your rivals. However, let me just say this. Don’t settle for just winning. Even if you do win in this tournament, you’re still far from mastering what it takes to be a maid. The path of maids continues far ahead. At the same time, this also means you don’t have the time to wallow in defeat. All of you are explorers who continue to walk the endless path of a maid. With your gaze steadily looking forward, keep on walking...... I hope that this tournament will help you take one more step forward.]","Ein-san speaks with such enthusiasm...... but seriously, what is a maid? Such a question, which has been asked many times since I came to this world, came up once again. But unfortunately, it seems like I haven’t found the answer to that question this time either.","[......By the way, what kind of competition were they doing here?]","[The first competition is an orthodox one. Since there are many participants, the preliminary round will be held in a competition where a large number of people would be competing against each other.]","[......A large number of people competing against each other, this is supposed to be a maid competition, right?]","Hearing Frau-san’s explanation to the words Lilia-san murmured, Akane-san threw a tsukkomi. In the meantime, the opening ceremony ended and the competition was announced.","“Now then, for the qualifier competition...... would be about an essential for maids. It’s a competition of combat skills! Everyone will be divided into groups, and it will be a battle royale!”","[......Hey, Frau?]","[What is it?]","[Where’s the orthodox you were talking about?]","[This is the most standard of the standard. As a Maid, one must be capable of fighting.]","[......I see...... The heck is a maid......]","Even though it looked like she had given up thinking, I completely agree with Akane-san’s tsukkomi. A battle royale right from the start......","[Ahhh, by the way, the participants had already picked out lots to choose their groups...... I’m in Group 6, and Lunamaria-san is in group 2. Incidentally, the Super Maids and the Overall Top 8 participants are exempt from the qualifying rounds.]","[......But if they’re competing on the basis of combat power, Luna-san has a good chance of winning, right?]","[Right. If it’s Luna, she shouldn’t lose against most opponents...... However, some of the participants were on the level of Peerage-holders, so she has to be careful......]","There are also some of them with the strength on the level of Peerage-holders huh...... The more I hear about them, the scarier they become. Maids, I mean.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [......What in the world are maids......]"]},{"number":1371,"title":"Chapter 1371 - The Maids Challenge 10","paragraphs":["The group battle royale, the Maid Olympia qualifier, has begun. Each group will be filtered out twice, and it seemed like it will be a tournament with the addition of Super Maid and the Overall Top 8 Maids.","And Luna-san was overwhelmingly strong in the 2 groups she was assigned to.","“Whoa, First-Time Competitor Lunamaria shows great strength. She’s clearly head and shoulders above the rest in this group! From our Commentary, President Ein’s point of view, what do you think of Competitor Lunamaria?”","“She’s a good maid. She has only been a maid for less than 10 years, but even so, she has reached a Maid Power of over 50,000, which is probably due to her talent. She’s a maid with a promising future.”","It’s quite a unique battle royale, in which maids fight amongst themselves, but Luna-san is a former Top Adventurer. Adventurers, by their very nature, often work in small groups and are skilled at fighting against large numbers, so a battle like this would be right up Luna-san’s alley.","[She sure is overwhelming, isn’t she? Luna-san, I mean.]","[Yes, as far as I can see, there’s no one in the same group who can compete with Luna, so if she keeps her guard up, she should be able to qualify without any problems.]","Perhaps happy that her best friend is playing an active role in the event, Lilia-san had a slightly brighter expression on her face.","[......As expected of Lunamaria-san. Wonderful...... She possesses strength worthy to be called my rival. I too feel my blood boiling.]","[No, why the heck do you look like you’re long-time rivals...... You just met her for the first time earlier!]","While we were watching the game while talking about such things, Luna-san was successfully selected as one of the two representatives of each block and chosen to participate in the main competition.","I’m also happy to see Luna-san win the competition.","[......I can’t lose either. Well then, I’m heading to the waiting room too.]","[Ohh, well, you do reasonably well over there too.]","[Yes, allow me to show you my maid spirit!]","[......Nah, you go get defeated already. Better yet, why don’t we just go home?]","Frau-san, who seemed to be heated up after seeing Luna-san’s fight, stood up and resolutely headed to the waiting room.","The battle between Group 6 began a short while later, and I’m not sure if it’s to be expected of her, but Frau-san performed an active role in her battle.","[......What is that weapon Frau-san was using?]","[Hmmm, I don’t know much about it either. It looks like a Galient Sword, but I’m not really sure.]","(T/N: Galient Sword aka Snake/Whip Sword)","[It’s a weapon called Trick Sword. A sword made of a material that hardens when magic power is channeled through it, and could be a hidden weapon that can be worn like a ribbon without applying magic power into it.]","I was wondering why Frau-san was using a mysterious weapon that looked like a whip and yet cuts through its surroundings like a sword, and Lilia-san seemed to know what it was and gave us a light explanation.","[This is just a guess, but was Frau-san from Western Demon Realm?]","[Ahh~~ Speaking of which, I think Frau had mentioned something like that before. I heard she was from a tribe living in the desert.]","[The Trick Sword is mainly used by a species known as Bewitchers. However, I only heard about them from an acquaintance of mine a long time ago, so I’m not that familiar with them......]","Having that sort of tribal secret sounds kinda cool. It certainly looks like a pretty tricky weapon to use, but Frau-san, fighting with such a weapon, moves as if she’s in a ribbon performance in rhythmic gymnastics, defeating her rivals one after another.","Just like that, it was also decided that Frau-san would participate in the main competition without any problems.","“How do you feel about the battle in Group 6, President Ein?”","“Group 6’s current representative has made her appearance in the past and has shown us a good battle every time she has participated. Her Maid Power may have been at a middling level, but perhaps, having been a maid for a quite a long time, she has the skills that come from experience.”","While Ein-san makes such commentaries, Luna-san and Frau-san arrived in our spot once and before the main competition.","[Congratulations to the both of you for making it to the main competition.]","[Thank you very much. I’m very relieved to have made it to the main competition. Even though I had Milady and Miyama-sama come to support me, I wouldn’t look good if I couldn’t even make it past the qualifiers......]","[However, the matchups for Luna-san don’t look good...... No, well, that’s also the same case for me.]","Looking at the match-up table for the main competition, Frau-san muttered, which made everyone’s eyes gather on her.","[Is that so?]","[Yes, Lunamaria-san’s opponent is a talented competitor who won the 6th Place in all the tournaments and has a Maid Power of over 80,000. She’s going to have a tough fight.]","[I see, fighting against a superior opponent certainly would be rough...... What about you, Frau?]","[My first battle would be easy-peasy...... but after I win here, my second battle would be against Emily-sama. Fighting against a Super Maid in the second match is just......]","Incidentally, it seems that 28 people will be competing here in the main tournament, and each of the Super Maids will participate in seeded slots in the second round, so if you win a battle, you will be in the Top 16, and if you win twice, you will be in the Top 8, and will be exempt from the qualifiers for the next Maid Olympia.","The two would like to win at least twice, but Luna-san’s first-round match was against someone superior, while Frau-san’s second-round match would be against a Super Maid...... It seems like they would be having a tough battle.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [I wonder why? Even though this should have been a Tournament Arc where I could expect battles...... Thinking about how these battles would be between maids, the surrealism wins out......]"]},{"number":1372,"title":"Chapter 1372 - Maid Olympia Main Competition 1","paragraphs":["Lunamaria, who is participating in the main tournament of the Maid Olympia for the first time, faced her opponent in the hall with slight nervousness.","“Well then, let’s move on to the third match of the main tournament, the match between Competitor Lunamaria and Competitor Anne. Competitor Lunamaria has participated in this tournament for the first time, and even though she has only been a maid for less than 10 years, she has reached Maid Power of 52,000, so it can be said that she’s a promising rising star in the future. On the other hand, Competitor Anne is a talented maid who has the Super Maid of Technique, Competitor Alexandra as a teacher, and has a respectable 6th Place in the previous tournament. With a Maid Power of 81,000...... Competitor Anne is considerably superior in this match-up, isn’t she?”","“Yes, but a maid’s battle isn’t determined by their Maid Power alone. I’m expecting it will be a good match with both sides showing their full potential.”","The Live Commentary briefly introduces both competitors, while Ein, giving exposition to the events, concluded the commentary. The next step is to choose the match. In the main tournament of Maid Olympia, the content of matches is unknown until just before the match.","The competition will be held at random, and the participants will compete in a competition randomly selected through a magic tool.","“Well then, it’s time we decide the match with our magic tool. Today’s match will be...... <Confectionery Making>.”","As the method of competition was decided and the staff brought in a kitchen containing various cooking tools and a great number of ingredients, Lunamaria was thinking about the competition. Although this is her first time participating, she has watched past Maid Olympias and has some knowledge of how competitions are fought.","(If I’m not mistaken, when it comes to “Making-type” matches, there was some kind of restriction attached to it.)","As if to confirm her thoughts, a can of tea was placed in front of Lunamaria and Anne.","“Now then, I’m going to announce the subject for this match. You are to create a pastry that goes well with the tea placed in front of you. However, you are not allowed to brew the tea, but only to look at the tea leaves. Without further ado, let the third match...... begin!”","With that voice, Lunamaria opens the tea can and checks the color and smell of the tea leaves.","(......Highly distinct aroma, probably flavored tea. From its aroma...... A sweet type...... Its kind......)","A difficult task to determine the type of tea by relying on tea leaves and making sweets that would match it. While Lunamaria was narrowing down the answers as to what this tea could be, her opponent, Anne, was already starting to select her ingredients.","[Wha!? So fast!]","[......You are still inexperienced. Winning like this would leave a bad taste to the tongue...... It’s a sweet-flavored tea. This is a seasonal special from Symphonia Kingdom...... Explore the varieties for yourself.]","[ ! ? ]","[What are you surprised about? It’s true that the numbers of your Maid Power don’t determine the outcome of a match, but the higher one’s Maid Power is, the higher their skill as a maid was...... Understanding that I am overwhelmingly superior to you, desperately struggle for victory.]","After telling her words of advice to Lunamaria, Anne moved on to the selection of ingredients.","(......Season Special!? I see, a special blend made in honor of commemoratory events...... Indeed, if it’s among them...... I see! This was made to commemorate the completion of Symphonia Kingdom’s Trading City...... However, to have known that in just a moment!? S- She’s strong......)","It was a special blend that existed in Symphonia Kingdom, and Lunamaria, who lived in Symphonia Kingdom, would have had a greater information advantage. However, Anne had realized the identity of the tea leaves far earlier than Lunamaria, and on the contrary, she had also guessed Lunamaria’s misunderstandings.","Feeling a cold sweat running down her face, even though she was lagging behind, Lunamaria also began selecting her ingredients.","(The tea leaves have a strong sweetness. Then, the pastry to go with it should be less sweet. Baked sweets would have been the standard match-up with it...... but it’s hard to win with that. What should I do......)","As Anne is by far the better maid, Lunamaria’s defeat would be inevitable if she proceeds to make her pastries as usual. However, that doesn’t mean this would be a task that she can manage through just by doing something out of the ordinary.","Feeling helpless against the huge wall that stands in her path, Lunamaria moved her gaze to the audience and exchanged looks with Lilia, who was looking at her.","(......What in the world am I being so weak-minded about? The difference between our Maid Power is only about 30,000...... It’s not a difference that can’t be overturned!)","Lunamaria, with a smile on her face, looked at Anne with eyes filled with strength. Thereupon, Anne, who noticed her gaze, stopped her hand that was choosing ingredients and turned her curious gaze to Lunamaria.","[......Those are good eyes. It’s as if they’re completely different from how it was just before.]","[I can’t afford to lose. No matter how superior you are...... For Milady who came to the venue just to see me and who believed in my victory and cheered me on...... I can’t let myself look unsightly in front of my best friend!!!]","[That is......]","With a strong declaration, Lunamaria’s body emitted a pale glow, and witnessing this, her opponent, Anne’s eyes widened.","“Whoa there! Competitor Lunamaria’s body radiates light...... This is...... Could it be?”","“Yes, it’s the <Maid Burst>. I never expected that she, who has only been a maid for a short time, has grown up to be able to use Maid Burst......”","Seeing that the atmosphere around Lunamaria has completely changed, Anne fearlessly smiled. As if to say that the match has become one worth fighting......","Amidst the excited atmosphere in the venue though, Lilia, who was watching the match, muttered quietly with a distant look in her eyes.","[......If I remember correctly, it was more like I was made to watch this match after a threatening exchange......]","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [D*mn it...... This kind of seriousness isn’t something I would admit. Also, a new Maid-related word appeared again...... What the heck is a Maid Burst!?]"]},{"number":1373,"title":"Chapter 1373 - Maid Olympia Main Competition 2","paragraphs":["The Maid Burst triggered by Lunamaria raises the voltage in the stage, but of course, there are those who aren’t able to keep up with what’s going on.","With an indescribable expression on her face, Akane asked the nearby Frau for explanations.","[......Frau, what’s that Maid Burst? I can somehow feel the people around me getting excited.]","[The Maid Burst is a technique where one flares up their Maid Spirit, the foundations of the Maidric Aura, allowing its user to temporarily exert Maid Power that exceeds its limits. It’s said that Maid Burst is the very state of a maid seeking their ideal, and that the one who activates it sees the Ideal Maid Vision they should aim for and reproduces that ideal beyond its limits. Due to its nature, it’s said that Maid Bursts can’t be activated unless the maid has a strong image of their ideal, and above all, it’s a difficult technique that tests the depth of the Maid Memory cultivated every day as a maid. However, as it consumes a large amount of Maidric Aura, you can say Maid Burst is a double-edged sword, so it’s only unleashed at a decisive moment......]","[......The heck is that? Why the heck is it that when I ask for an explanation of a terminology I don’t know, the number of terminologies I don’t know just increases? Stop it, seriously, even though I can’t process the words that have just appeared...... Or rather, Maidric Aura is something you use up like magic power?]","[......Chairman, why in the world are you questioning something obvious...... I know you like jokes, but if you question that common sense, people will look at you weirdly, you know?]","[That’s just common sense in your world! We don’t belong in that world!!!]","Kaito and Lilia deeply nodded at Akane’s fierce tsukkomi...... Unfortunately, this place was mostly made up of people living in the Maid World, and the three of them could only feel like foreigners like never before.","For the time being, deciding to just give up on trying to understand and watch Lunamaria fight, they returned their gaze to the venue.","On the stage, seeing Lunamaria radiating a pale glow, Anne, her opponent, lets out a daring smile.","[I see...... but I’ll not let you underestimate me!]","“Whoa there, this is!? Competitor Anne has also activated her Maid Burst! She is a maid who has fought many battles in the past, and of course, she can use Maid Burst...... In that case, President Ein, do you think this match......?”","“Yes, their Maid Visions...... The reproductions of their Ideal Maids will make the difference between the two of them.”","While Lunamaria was clad in a silvery-white light, Anne was clad in a golden light. While Akane, in the audience seats, retorted “Why the heck are they glowing?” with a distant look in her eyes, but those words didn’t reach the ears of both the competitors.","Anne quickly arranges her ingredients on the kitchen table and starts cooking with movements that even look beautiful.","[......Unfortunately, you have no chance of winning. I have trained under Alexandra-sama for a long time. Of course, what I reproduce with my Maid Vision is Alexandra-sama’s techniques! The accuracy of the Maid Vision produced by one’s Maid Burst depends on how deeply you know your Ideal Maid. Even if you try to manifest Alexandra-sama as your Maid Vision just like me, that would still be far behind————!?]","Anne was about to speak with confidence, highly assured of her victory, but immediately afterward, she stopped speaking and her eyes widened in astonishment.","At the end of her line of sight, Lunamaria had also started cooking, and Anne felt a cold sweat dripping behind her back from her movements.","(T- That is...... an extraordinary pressure from her Maid Vision!? Also, what elegant movements...... That’s impossible! F- For her to exert such movements...... For me, who should be clad in an Almost-Perfect Maid Vision of Alexandra-sama...... to be this terrified!?)","Seeing Lunamaria’s cooking, Anne’s body unconsciously trembled. It was because she felt tremendous power in the target of the Maid Vision Lunamaria was clad in, from the Ideal Maid she was trying to reproduce.","While Anne’s comprehension was unable to catch up with what was going on, watching their battle at a different spot, a Super Maid...... Alexandra quietly muttered.","[......I see, it seems like she won’t be winning this time. After all, the Maid Vision that Lunamaria-san envisions is overwhelmingly stronger than me. With Lunamaria-san’s skill, even if she were to use Maid Burst, she can’t reproduce her target perfectly...... However, for even the imperfect state of her Maid Vision to convey such incomparable Maid Power...... Who in the world is the target of her Maid Vision?]","[Phew, let me tell you who it is. The person her Maid Vision envisions, just as she had taught her, is the one who taught me the basics of being a maid. She never appears in the Maid Olympia, so it’s no wonder you wouldn’t know her.]","[Beatrice-san? Come to think of it, you mentioned before how you call someone Teacher...... For such a being to exist that isn’t a Super Maid...... That was surprising, but that certainly makes the situation interesting, isn’t it?]","At Beatrice’s words, a ferocious smile creeps up Alexandra’s lips. If one excludes Ein, she can be said to have the greatest Maid Power in the Maid World. Knowing that there are still maids in the world who surpass her in Maid Power, she seems to be both surprised and happy.","Meanwhile, the nearby Beatrice smiled kindly as she observed Lunamaria’s growth.","(......You have grown well, Lunamaria. You still haven’t been able to replicate Teacher Illness’ techniques yet, but thinking about the time when Teacher Illness was still teaching you back in the royal castle, you have become beyond recognition. If it’s you, there may come a time...... when you’d eventually rise to the realm of Super Maids. Fufu, I’m looking forward to when such a day comes.)","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [The battle is described as a battle of wits for the past chapters or so, and the atmosphere in which the powerful people talk amongst each other seems serious...... but thinking about how this is all about maids, I really don’t want this. Also, I agree with Akane immensely. Stop increasing the number of Maid-related terminologies already......]"]},{"number":1374,"title":"Chapter 1374 - Maid Olympia Main Competition 3","paragraphs":["Incomprehensible development happened all around, with incomprehensible words like Maid Burst and Maid Vision getting brought up...... but at any rate, it seemed that Luna-san had won the match.","It’s just, once she returned to the audience area, Luna-san looked quite tired.","[......It isn’t that strange. The consumption requirement of Maid Burst is very significant. Right now, for the time being, you should concentrate on restoring your Maidric Aura. But even then, it would be good if you could recover half of it before the second rough......]","[Indeed. It does consume on me more than I expected.]","[It can’t be helped. It’s said that while Maid Burst is in effect, one’s Maid Power increases by up to 3 times. Making use of Maid Power that overwhelmingly surpasses Lunamaria’s current strength will inevitably consume you a lot of energy.]","[......It seems like the next one would be a rough battle.]","For the time being, what I do understand...... was that the technique she used is a short-time power-up technique which can be a factor in overturning the original ability difference between her and her opponent, but on the other hand, that techniques consume quite a lot of energy to use.","......But they were supposed to be making pastries, right? That explanation is clearly that of a battle manga though......","As I was thinking about this, I took a drink out of my magic box and handed it to Luna-san.","[......Here you go.]","[Eh? Thank you very much.]","Even though she curiously tilted, Luna-san obediently drank the contents of the cup I had given her, but upon seeing that cup, Lilia-san, who knew the identity of that drink, had an astounded look on her face.","Well, you see, I can’t just not do something while she’s exhausted, and I did say I’m here to support her......","[This is...... My Maidric Aura is recovering!?]","[Ah, I wondered if it might work, but it seems like it does recover with that too huh.]","[M- Miyama-sama!? What on earth is this drink......]","[A drink made from the Fruit of the World Tree.]","[Pfft!? Gehook..... Ghheook......]","I thought it might be possible, so I tried having her drink it, but it seems that Maidric Aura does recover in the same way as magic power.","With this, for the time being, I think Luna-san will be able to fight with all her might in the second round...... when Akane-san suddenly patted me on my shoulder.","[......Kaito, as expected, I really think you’re getting closer and closer to that World.]","[Please stop. Even if you think I’m abnormal, please lead my abnormality to other directions. I don’t want to be incorporated into the Maid World......]","I understand that this is a reaction to the fact that I just served someone a drink made from the Fruit of the World Tree, but I would really like it if she would stop treating me the same way as these maids. Seriously, that’s defamation of honor.","Perhaps inspired by Luna-san’s battle, Frau-san also put up an excellent fight and safely advanced to the second round. The second round was about to begin, and from this point on, the Super Maids would be joining the competition, so a fiercer battle was expected.","Looking at the tournament table, the first one among the Super Maids to fight...... seems to be Camellia-san.","“Now then, the second round’s first battle would be..... The Super Maid of Balance, Competitor Camellia makes her entrance!”","When Camellia-san appeared on the stage with an indescribable expression on her face, a loud cheer resounded in the arena. Her opponent was also a strong maid who had won in the first round, but as one would expect, fighting against a Super Maid made her evidently nervous.","Just as the battle was about to begin, Camellia-san’s opponent suddenly dropped to her knees and looked at Camellia-san with an entreating gaze.","“It has appeared! As is customary, it’s the Prayer Pose! It seems like she’s testing her luck.”","[......Unnn? What’s that? Why did she suddenly start praying?]","Akane-san, me and Lilia-san tilted our heads, but from the commentary’s words, it seems like this was customary practice...... Why though? As I was thinking that, Frau-san gave her usual explanation.","[It’s a scene that you can always see when Camellia-sama fights.]","[......Why?]","[It’s because the only thing they could do when fighting against her was pray. The match format of the Maid Olympia Main Competition is randomly determined by a magic tool each time. There are many varieties of match formats...... but there’s something that can be considered a Joker card only when you are fighting against Camellia-sama......]","[Joker card?]","Immediately after Akane-san tilted her head again, the magic tool determined the format of the match.","“The match has been decided! And that also ends the match...... for the match format is <Combat>!!! Oops, she has collapsed!!!”","[......A- Ahhh, so that’s what you mean...... That’s certainly convincing.]","[Yes, all of the maids are excellent in combat, but as expected, there’s no one other than President Ein who can compete with Camellia-sama, one of the Six Kings’ Executives...... Having Combat be chosen is equal to having your defeat be decided. The probability for Combat being drawn isn’t high due to the number of varieties of match formats but...... Even in the past, there have been cases in which her opponents directly gave up after a Combat match had been drawn against Camellia-sama in the final match.]","At this matter, even Akane-san was convinced as well. Well, of course, it’s understandable. In that regard, they would be facing an opponent in a match they can’t defeat her in. I see, so that’s why they’re praying huh...... They’re praying that a match format other than combat would be chosen...... How should I say this...... Camellia-san’s opponents are a bit pitiful.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Well, understandable. Even if the maids are a bunch of monsters, there’s no way they can win against the World King’s Strongest Subordinate...... Only against Camellia, if that low probability card was drawn, it would be an instant loss for them......]","T/N: LazyCat here. Daily chapters may be delayed, just like this one. I’m rather busy at around the latter half of December."]},{"number":1375,"title":"Chapter 1375 - Maid Olympia Main Competition 4","paragraphs":["With the battles heating up(?), the Maid Olympia continued...... and to our surprise, Luna-san won the second round as well and made it to the Top 8.","Unlike in the first round, it seems like she got lucky with her opponent, as Luna-san had apparently won because her opponent had less Maid Power than her, so Luna-san was generally much better.","[Luna-san, that’s amazing! You reached the Top 8. If you make it into the Top 8, you are exempt from the qualifiers for the next tournament, right?]","[You’re doing great. Seeing Luna doing well there makes me happy as well.]","Although there are many aspects of Maid Olympia that I don’t understand, I’m honestly happy that Luna-san is doing well, and when she came back to the audience area, Lilia-san and I congratulated her.","Luna-san scratched her head, looking a little embarrassed, and with a slight grin, she spoke.","[Thank you very much. I was quite lucky in this year’s tournament. This time’s qualifiers were also a Battle Royale, so it was easier for me to win.]","[......This time? Are the qualifiers different for each year?]","[Of course. The qualifiers and the number of people who advance to the main tournament are also different. In addition to Battle Royale, there were instances where maids are to take a written test, and there was also a pattern where the basic actions of the maid were judged using a demerit point system. That also goes for the main tournament, as when there are a lot of people, many of the matches selected are those that could be settled faster. This year, there were less than 30 people who got in the main tournament, so some of the matches, like my Confectionery Making match, could take a long time......]","[I see......]","Well, now that she mentioned it, if the qualifiers would always be a Battle Royale every time, maids who aren’t good at fighting, even if they’re highly skilled, won’t have a chance to enter the main tournament, so that part will change every time the tournament is held.","From what Luna-san says, it seems that there are many types of formats for the main tournament, so it’s difficult to prepare and take measures, but it allows people the chance to compete with their own strengths.","[The matches at the Maid Olympia are so diverse that maids really require all kinds of skills as a maid. So, I guess you could say that people like Camellia-sama, who have consistently high skills in everything, have an advantage.]","[I see. Of course, they must have a certain level of skill, but the one who is more versatile is stronger than those who just have strengths and weaknesses huh......]","Luna-san’s explanation was supplemented by Frau, and Akane-san nodded her head in understanding. Perhaps, the fact that Camellia-san has won the most tournaments was due to her versatility.","However...... Does this mean Camellia-san also understands Maidology and all that other stuff? Somehow, it kinda feels like Ein-san told her to study it and she couldn’t turn her down.","[......However, it seems that my pleasurable advance ends here huh......]","[Beatrice-sama would indeed be a tough opponent.]","[Yeah, putting aside hoping to surpass her in the future...... I still don’t have a chance to win now.]","Yes, Luna-san, who had won the first two rounds of the tournament, will be facing Beatrice-san in the quarterfinals. For Luna-san, she is like a Sister-Apprentice who also received Illness-san’s teachings, and it seems that she loses in every skill as a maid against her.","[......Arehh? You don’t stand a chance against her even in battle?]","[Beatrice-sama is a Baron-Class Demon, so my current strength is completely lacking.]","[Incidentally, regarding the other Super Maids, Alexandra-sama is said to have the strength equal to that of Peerage holders, and Emily-sama, who was once said to be Her Majesty Laguna’s rival, is a Viscount-Class Demon. As for Camellia-sama, her strength goes without saying.]","I thought that Luna-san, being a former Top Adventurer, might be able to win when it comes to combat, but as expected of Super Maids, their combat skills were super as well.","While nodding to Luna-san and Frau-san, I noticed something unusual with Frau-san’s explanation that I’m curious about, so I decided to ask about it.","[......Why is Alexandra-san the only one described as “having strength equal to that of Peerage holders”?]","[According to the person herself, Alexandra-sama is Half-Demon...... but at the time when Alexandra-sama became a maid, there had been no information of a Demon being part of Archlesia’s Royal Family. Furthermore, she erased all information about herself when she left the Royal Family, so she’s a person with many mysteries around her. However, as had been stated by the Emperor of that time, there is no mistake that she was indeed of the royal bloodline......]","Frau-san answered my question, but she herself doesn’t seem to be sure of her answer. I see, information about her was just things the person herself claimed and her even her species was still unclear, so I guess that way of describing her is reasonable, but indeed, if she’s Half-Demon, you’d wonder which one you should count her as.","As I was thinking about this, Luna-san suddenly muttered, seemingly as if she had just remembered something.","[......Come to think of it, regarding Alexandra-sama, there was a rumor that she might actually be the First Emperor who founded Archlesia Empire.]","[Is that so?]","[Yes, there is a theory that Archlesia Empire’s Capital was named after the First Emperor. However, the Archlesia Empire had a large-scale civil war 800 years ago, and at that time, the documents related to the 1st to the 3rd Emperors were lost, making information about them uncertain, so it seems that such a rumor spread.]","Speaking of which, they did say that Archlesia Empire has the oldest history among the Human Realm’s three countries, so I suppose various theories like that are being whispered around.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [......So, well-informed fellow, what was it really like?]","? ? ? : [She was indeed the First Emperor herself. Moreover, her being a Half is a lie and she was in fact a Demon. She was a Demon who drifted from the Demon Realm to the Human Realm in an accident, and through various connections, she founded the Archlesia Empire and became its First Emperor. However, thinking that the Head of a Human Country should be a Human, she handed over the Emperor’s seat to a trusted subordinate and supported the country as an adviser for a while. However, after seeing how they settled the Demon Lord incident, she discussed with the Emperor at that time that it was time for the Empire to get out of her own hands and as a result, she left politics.]"]},{"number":1376,"title":"Chapter 1376 - Maid Olympia Maid Competition 5","paragraphs":["The main tournament of the Maid Olympia continues underway. Frau-san’s second match will soon start, but Luna-san, who has finished her second round match, will also head to the venue for the quarter-finals that will start soon, so it was just me, Lilia-san and Akane-san who were watching the match in the audience seats.","[......Lilia-san, Akane-san, please have some fries if you like.]","[Thank you. I see they’re also selling stuff like this here.]","[It feels like we’re watching a baseball game.]","Just as Akane-san said, there’s some kind of mobile vendor going around the audience seats, just like those in baseball or soccer games, where I just bought french fries and a drink.","I also have my magic box, so it’s nice to have the fries and other items served freshly made.","As I was thinking this, Lilia muttered with an indescribable expression on her face as she elegantly ate the fries.","[......However, how should I say this...... Of course, there are many things I don’t understand concerning maids and such...... but as far as spectating is concerned...... The matches are interesting, aren’t they?]","[Ahh, that’s what I thought too. That’s right...... It does look quite interesting.]","Just as Lilia-san said, the Maid Olympia was honestly fun to watch. The content of the matchups is also elaborate, and the situation is easy to understand because of the presence of the live commentary and explanation.","Although there are some unknown maid-related words...... It was like watching a cooking showdown on TV, and the one-on-one competition of skills is quite interesting.","[Well, I do actually think it’s interesting. Just like the earlier table-setting competition, it was very well thought out. Like that explanation, looking at the information of the customer sitting in the seat and making a setting suitable for them.]","[Yeah, that was indeed interesting. The setting where 3 different species sat on a table simultaneously shows quite a bit of each person’s individuality.]","Just as Akane-san said, there are many interesting match formats, and in regards to the table setting match that Akane-san mentioned, it was a challenge to have different species with a height difference of several meters eating at the same table, so the maids’ individuality shows how they balance things, and the finished form was quite different between the two competitors.","The judges judged the competitors’ performance and the one with the higher score won, but Ein-san’s detailed explanations, so it was easy-to-understand and interesting.","[Well, Lilia-san is a very friendly person, and it’s a big deal that I was able to watch the games without being intimidated.]","Despite her social position as a Duchess, Lilia-san is basically gentle and easy to talk to. Since she’s a former member of the Knight Order, there are few scenes where her senses are out of sync with the common people, and even now, she was casually sharing french fries with us while watching the matches, showing how friendly of a person she is. Akane-san was also nervous at first, but now it seems like she’s completely opened up.","[......Speaking of which, I’m changing the subject, but Frau-san’s match will start soon, right?]","[Hmm~~ I wonder if she had a chance to win though? Of course, I’m rooting for Frau, but her opponent is a Super Maid, right?]","[I heard her opponent has great stamina.]","[It may be possible depending on the match format, but she seems like someone who has won many times, so she must be familiar with various fields...... It seemed like Frau-san would have a rough fight.]","It would soon be the final match of the second round, where Frau-san will be fighting against the Super Maid of Physique. However, just like Akane-san and Lilia-san, I also think it was going to be a tough fight.","In the second round, three of the Super Maids had fought so far, and although Camellia-san practically got an instant win, the other two Super Maids got their wins with their overwhelming strength, giving the impression that they were quite composed in their matches.","When Ein-san first met Illness-san before, everything seemed to be in a bit of a rut, which made her think that Illness-san could be the new breeze...... asking her to become the Fifth Super Maid in the Maid World.","Judging from that, the Super Maids are strong enough to be almost unbeatable outside of battles between fellow Super Maids, so the championships would be narrowed down to a battle between four people.","In fact, Beatrice-san and Alexandra-san’s battles were truly overwhelming victories.","[Well, for the time being, I guess we’ll just cheer for Frau-san without thinking too deeply then.]","[Indeed. Even if the chances are low, her chance of winning certainly isn’t zero.]","[Right...... ahh, Kaito, pass me more of those fries.]","At first, I wondered what would happen, but we somehow ended up enjoying the Maid Olympia.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [W- Well, indeed...... If you just put aside the fact that their concept of maids is abnormal, it might be fun to watch......]"]},{"number":1377,"title":"Chapter 1377 - Maid Olympia Main Competition 6","paragraphs":["In the main tournament of Maid Olympia, Frau-san...... Well, as we had expected, she was defeated by the Super Maid Emily-san.","The match wasn’t even related to the Super Maid of Physique’s specialty, her stamina, but about the taste of ingredients, and it seems that she was completely defeated in a competition of tasting 10 kinds of rare and hard-to-find ingredients.","And unfortunately, Luna-san, who had been making great progress, was also defeated by Beatrice-san in the quarter-finals. They fought in a Repairing match, a speed competition to see which one could repair an apron dress that was torn first, and Luna-san was defeated by a large margin because of a clearly visible difference in techniques.","[Luna-san, Frau-san, thank you for your hard work.]","[That was unfortunate, wasn’t it?]","[As expected, was fighting Super Maids tough?]","When I called out to them as they returned to the audience seats, the two of them didn’t seem that depressed as they had grins on their lips. Frau-san seemed a little disappointed but......","[Well, I’m extremely satisfied with my results. I’ve only been a maid for a short time, so I’m really happy just to get in the Top 8.]","[Lunamaria-san, you still have placement matches for rankings below 4th Place. If you do well, you can aim for 5th Place at best...... On the other hand, I lost in the second round for 3 consecutive terms...... It seems like reaching the third round is far away.]","[As expected, you just had bad luck with opponents. I had good luck with my matchups.]","[However, Lunamaria-san’s strength really is quite high...... I too would like to receive guidance from that Illness-sama.]","Frau-san’s maid experience is quite long...... Since she mentioned attending the tournament for 3 consecutive terms, she would have been a maid for at least 12 years, and comparing her to Luna-san’s 6 years of maid experience...... That’s less than half of Frau-san’s maid experience.","Luna-san herself was quite dexterous from the start, but it’s also true that Illness-san’s guiding capabilities are high. After all, Eta and Theta, who were terrible at first, rather than just having normal skills, were now at a level that could already be described as excellent, so if you think about it carefully, she’s amazing.","After that, in the placement matches for rankings below 4th Place, Luna-san worked hard and won 6th Place, which is a remarkable achievement for a first-time participant.","“Lunamaria, who participated for the first time this year, was very wonderful. Seeing a strong new competitor amidst our ranks is always a welcome one.”","“Yes, she’s been a maid for less than 10 years, so you could say she’s still a bud waiting to blossom as a maid. The direction of her Maidric Aura is still not completely set. If it solidifies and she rises to the next stage as a maid, she may become a new wind blowing in the Maid World.”","Ein-san also highly praised Luna-san. However, being a new wind blowing in the Maid World is probably meant as a compliment, and many of the people at the venue will see it as one. In this place, me, who thinks being complimented as a new wind blowing in the Maid World is something unpleasant, is the unusual one ...... and I could really feel the difference in our perspectives.","Anyway, Luna-san and Frau-san’s battles were over for the moment, and with the two of them joining the spectator group, us 5 will be watching the next matches.","And at the same time, it wouldn’t be an illusion that the voltage at the venue seemed to have risen further. After all, the four people left in the semi-finals...... All of them are Super Maids, so what would be occurring hereafter would be battles between Super Maids.","[Things are getting fired up! Having the four Super Maids together is a precious moment, and as the four Super Maids’ abilities are quite evenly matched, we can expect a heated battle.]","[As for the matchups in the semi-finals, Beatrice-sama will be fighting Camellia-sama, and Alexandra-sama will be fighting Emily-sama.]","[As for me, I will be rooting for Camellia-sama. I’m her fan after all......]","[Hmmm, as expected, I will be supporting my senior, Beatrice-sama.]","Me, Lilia-san and Akane-san were all having fun...... but as to be expected, the excitement of the two maids in our group was quite different.","And until just a little while ago, one person was explaining to us while the other was fighting in her match...... but as the both of them were eliminated, from here on out, they seemed to be enjoying themselves as part of the audience, and they seemed to be quite excited.","[Akane-san, who do you think will win? I think that Emily-san, who has a lot of stamina and can handle fatigue well, will be the stronger one when they’re competing in strength.]","[What I think? Hmmm, for me...... Since Alexandra-san has the highest Maid Power among them, I think it would be Alexandra-san......]","In response to Lilia-san’s words, Akane-san thought for a moment before answering. It was interesting how the predictions of the four people were coincidentally scattered.","Frau-san was cheering for Camellia-san, Luna-san for Beatrice-san, Lilia-san for Emily-san, and Akane-san for Alexandra-san.","[What do you think, Kaito-san?]","[Me? Hmmm, I don’t really have any basis for my thoughts, but I somehow feel like Beatrice-san will win.]","[......Somehow, when you say it, it sounds like that’s really gonna happen.]","[No, I’m really just noncommittally saying it, okay?]","It’s not like I predicted the future, it’s just my random guess...... but come to think of it, I don’t think I’ve ever missed in the random hunch guesses I made back in that Monster Race......","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [I see, Beatrice will win huh.]","? ? ? : [Beatrice-san winning is almost certain now huh. After all, Kaito-san predicted it......]"]},{"number":1378,"title":"Chapter 1378 - Maid Olympia Main Competition 7","paragraphs":["The battle between the Super Maids has finally come. First is the battle between Camellia-san and Beatrice-san. Although I’m acquainted with both of them, I’ve been on good terms for a long time with Camellia-san, so I emotionally want to support Camellia-san.","But to be honest, Camellia-san herself doesn’t look as if she really wants to win......She’s earnest by nature, so she won’t cut corners in the actual match...... I’m strangely feeling a sense of sorrow and resignation from the way she stands.","“For our first in the semi-finals, it will be a match between Competitor Camellia and Competitor Beatrice...... According to past results, wouldn’t you say Competitor Camellia has a slight advantage?”","“Indeed. As the Balance in her title suggests, Camellia is stable and strong in every field. Beatrice, of course, possesses the necessary skills as to be expected from a high-level maid, but she does have certain strengths and weaknesses. I suppose the result of the match would depend on the format drawn.”","Ein-san, the Analyst, explained to the Live Commentator. I see, that does make it easier to understand. Camellia-san may be stable and strong in any event, but she doesn’t have an event that she triumphs at, where she could exert explosive power...... Aside from Combat, which would basically be a Joker card for her.","“Whoa, it seems that Competitor Beatrice has kneeled on one knee, going for the customary prayer.”","It seems like it’s customary to pray that Combat is not chosen, even in the semi-finals. Well, regarding that matter, I suppose they don’t have any other choice but to pray, as they would definitely lose in that match format......","And thus, Beatrice-san’s prayers seemed to have been answered, as another event was chosen.","The chosen event was Party Venue Setting? When I tilted my head and wondered what they do in a match format like that...... when the appearance of the venue changed in an instant.","Probably done by Ein-san, a space that looks like a cutout dance hall is where Camellia-san and Beatrice-san are each standing.","“Now then, let me explain. This time’s subject is <glamorous and elegant standing party>...... Your task will be to create a party venue with such a subject in mind. There are sets of tools prepared, and it’s also possible to use materials you brought in from your magic box, like tableware and such.”","I see, so the competition is to decorate each of their spaces according to the task huh...... No, but the space seems quite large, so would this be a very time-consuming competition?","“The time limit is 45 minutes. Well then, start!”","The time limit is short! In a space of that size, I feel like you would normally reach that time limit just by arranging the tables and tableware...... but well, both competitors have considerable strength, and each space was decorated as if I’m watching a fast-forwarded video.","Camellia-san’s space, although simple in overall design, has an elegant and luxurious feel, giving the impression of a sophisticated upper-class party venue.","On the other hand, Beatrice-san’s space...... Just as stated in the subject, it was set in a way that could be described as luxurious and opulent, and although it had a very dazzling atmosphere, it didn’t have the unpleasant feeling a nouveau riche’s party would, but is set up in a way that gives a sense of calculated uniformity.","“Whoa, as expected of Super Maids, both of them are quite fast! With more than 20 minutes left in the time limit, both of them seemed to have finished setting up. Well then, the 5 Judges, including President Ein, will now score the competitors on a 10-point scale.”","I see, so the winner is judged through a scoring system huh...... Ein-san and 4 other maids each checked the tables and overall visibility of the space and wrote down what seemed to be their memos in their hands.","A little later, when the judging seemed to be over, the results were announced, and Camellia-san’s scores were 9, 10, 10, 9, and 9 for a total of 47 points. Meanwhile, Beatrice-san scored 10, 9, 9, 10, and 10 for a total of 48 points, earning her a victory by 1 point.","“The match has been decided. The winner is Competitor Beatrice! President Ein, could you tell what is the greatest key point of this match?”","“Both competitors had great settings that made the most of their individuality. There was no difference in their skills itself. However, there was a slight difference in the masters they serve. Camellia’s master is the World King Lillywood...... and she doesn’t like extravagance, so Camellia’s setting had as few decorations as possible and focused on elegance and calmness. Of course, her setting was wonderful, but I got the impression that its first-glance impact was slightly inferior to Beatrice’s setting. Since she’s the Head Maid of a royal castle, she’s also used to setting up extravagant parties, and it was a perfect setting for the subject in the Symphonia-style.”","“I see, so that was the factor that decided this match.”","“Yes, it’s just, if I dare say it...... the level of difference between them was just that much, but it was a good fight as both sides were evenly matched to the extent that there’s a possibility that Camellia would win if a match like this occurs again.”","I see. It’s true that Camellia-san’s setting is beautiful and elegant, and the more I look at it, the more I can see that she has taken care of even the smallest details, but judging from overall appearances, Beatrice-san’s setting is certainly superior in terms of luxury and opulence.","......It sure is deep...... Troubling it may be, watching it myself made me think that it really was interesting...... The Maid Olympia, I mean.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [I see, the direction of a maid could change to some extent depending on the master they serve huh...... Even so, isn’t that time limit too short?]","? ? ? : [For a maid who has advanced to the semi-finals, that amount of time is already considered long enough.]","Serious-senpai : [......I really hate myself that I’m not even questioning the formula that maids = superhumans.]"]},{"number":1379,"title":"Chapter 1379 - Maid Olympia Main Competition 8","paragraphs":["The second semi-final match was between Alexandra-san and Emily-san.","“In our second semi-final match will be a battle between Competitor Alexandra and Competitor Emily. The audience is very excited as this would be another match between fellow Super Maids, but President Ein, what is your opinion of this matchup?”","How should I say this...... I think the Live commentary is quite capable. I think that many of the maids present here...... the people who come to attend the Maid Olympia have already come multiple times and were well aware of the characteristics of the Super Maid, enough that such a thing could be considered common knowledge, but it’s great for first-time spectators like us who need those explanations.","And since the pass of the Live Commentary to the Analyst, Ein-san explains the key points well, which makes it quite easy to understand.","“Let’s see. Unlike the previous match-up, this match is between two maids who have clear areas of expertise. Alexandra is good at technical matches...... such as Setting matches like earlier, and will have an advantage in such things. On the other hand, Emily excels in matches that require one to use their stamina to do a lot of things. If it turned out to be a match where they would compete for numbers, such as Production matches where the competitors have to produce something as many as possible within a certain amount of time, you can say that she has an advantage.”","[I see, so it’s a battle of quality and quantity. If it’s a quality match, Alexandra would have the advantage, and if it’s a quantity match, Emily would have the advantage.]","[That’s certainly an easy explanation. I guess that is to be expected of Ein-sama huh.]","Listening to Ein-san’s explanation, Akane-san and Lilia-san nodded in agreement. Even with all these and that, it seemed like the two of them were enjoying Maid Olympia like the others around us.","In fact, it was indeed just as the two of them said, as both competitors clearly have their own forte, and it can be said that unlike the match between Camellia-san and Beatrice-san, this match would depend more on the match format.","“......Now then, the match format has been decided. The subject is...... Dressing! Both players will be responsible for coordinating the clothing of one person each. Assuming that they will be attending the commemorative party on the eve of the Festival of Heroes, and they are to wear clothing befitting a Viscount. Please check the board provided for the characteristics of each person and where they are from.”","Along with the match explanations, people who seemed to be nobles appeared in front of Alexandra-san and Emily-san, followed by a board with very detailed settings written on it. A box whose inside wasn’t visible from the outside was also provided for the participants and their model, prepared as an area for them to change clothes in.","“The time limit is 40 minutes. In addition, accessories are also available, and it’s also possible to tailor the dress itself. However, please do note that the time limit also includes the time for our models to wear the dress...... Well then, match start!”","This is also a very interesting match. If both of them are Super Maids, they are able to tailor a dress within 40 minutes, but they also have to consider dressing time within calculation.","It’s not simply a matter of making the models look gorgeous, as there’s a board provided with detailed information, such as them being a “Viscount”.","However, in terms of content, this seems to be a competition of quality, so in that sense, Alexandra-san may have a slight advantage.","“Whoa, it looks like both of them will be tailoring their dresses!”","“Such is inevitable. In this kind of match, the impression that the dress gives is extremely significant. Accessories were indeed important, but more emphasis was placed on the dress...... Thus, the decision to create a dress that suits their model rather than picking one of the prepared ones is natural.”","“I see...... By the way, President Ein. Can it be said that Competitor Alexandra has an advantage in this match?”","“Comprehensively speaking, that may be the case, but when you look at their specializations in clothing, the Hydra Kingdom is at the forefront of fashion, and in that sense, you could say that Emily has the advantage.”","Ahh, I see, the Hydra Kingdom certainly was so famous for their fashion that they were referred to as Hydra of Clothing. If that’s the case, you really can’t simply say that Alexandra-san has the advantage.","While I was thinking about that, both participants quickly finished tailoring their dresses.","[The atmospheres in the clothes they made sure are different......]","[Alexandra-san made a traditional Imperial Dress. Meanwhile, Emily-san seemed to have made a dress that was on the cutting edge of fashion.]","[It’s like a battle between good old traditional and modern fashion......]","Nodding to Akane-san and Lilia-san’s words, I watched the outcome of the match. Although the more eye-catching one seems to be the dress made by Emily-san...... As the coordination progresses, Emily-san looked as if she made some sort of blunder for a moment.","“......Oya? The expression on Competitor Emily’s face just now?”","“The dress she made was certainly a splendid piece that incorporates the cutting edge of fashion, but also shows the elegance of a noble. If this was simply a Dress Making match, Emily would have won...... but unfortunately, this was an Outfit Coordination match. Most of the ornaments available are orthodox, and few of them can be matched with that dress. Even she wouldn’t have enough time to make all of the ornaments matching such a dress from scratch.”","“I- I see! In contrast to that, Competitor Alexandra’s dress is a traditional design and can be easily matched with various ornaments!!!”","“I guess she has been too caught up in the idea that Hydra Kingdom is at the cutting edge of fashion, making her think that her dress should be cutting edge as well.”","That was an impressive way to explain that. No matter how cutting edge the dress is...... No, it’s precisely because it’s cutting edge that it was difficult for the designs of the ornaments to match with the dress, which ends up dragging the dress down. Meanwhile, Alexandra-san’s dress is a standard dress that can be easily matched with other accessories, so you could really feel the sense of incongruity from Emily-san’s dress when the models stand side by side...... Of course, it would still depend on who looks at it......","In the end, after the Judges gave their scores to the completed works, the winner was Alexandra-san, who, as Ein-san said, had put together a classic but beautiful outfit matchup.","Thus, the finals of the Maid Olympia were decided to be a match between Beatrice-san and Alexandra-san.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [What would have happened if Alice had appeared in that competition?]","? ? ? : [Of course, if it’s Alice-chan we’re talking about here, she would make everything herself, from a trendy dress to trendy accessories that match it, with plenty of time to spare, so there was no factor where she would lose.]","Serious-senpai : [As to be expected of Ein’s rival as a maid.]","? ? ? : [That’s one absurd slander you’re making there, you know? Seriously, please stop with that.]"]},{"number":1380,"title":"Chapter 1380 - Maid Olympia Main Competition 9","paragraphs":["The finals of the Maid Olympia are finally about to begin. The two finalists clashing for the championship are the Super Maid of Heart, Beatrice-san and Super Maid of Technique, Alexandra-san.","“Now, at last, the final match to determine this year’s champion is about to begin. Competitor Beatrice and Competitor Alexandra, in terms of their past performance, you could say that they are almost evenly matched.”","“Yes, the power of both sides is quite close. No, not only between the two of them, as there are also no big differences in ability between all the Super Maids. That’s why, when it comes to battles between Super Maids, the slightest strengths and weaknesses can be the difference between victory and defeat. What we should pay attention to would be the match format drawn.”","As the audience watched with bated breath, the match format selected by the lottery magic tool was......","“Annnnnd...... it’s out! Tea Showdown!!! Oh my, this certainly is a match befitting the finals of the Maid Olympia.”","“It’s a very simple match. Both sides will brew tea and the judges who will be drinking it will vote on which one is better...... It’s for this reason that it’s a competition that clearly shows the difference in techniques as a maid. Then, in such a match that gauges one’s techniques, Alexandra would be at an advantage.”","This may indeed be an appropriate competition to determine the superiority of a maid. However, in terms of technique, Alexandra, who is also known as the Super Maid of Technique, is probably stronger. If this is the case, as Ein-san said, Beatrice-san may be at a disadvantage.","While I was thinking about this, all the tools, including tea leaves, were prepared in front of the two, and just as the battle was about to begin, Alexandra calmly spoke.","The sound on the stage was made audible to us by Loudspeaker Magic.","[Let’s have a good fight, Beatrice-san.]","[Yes, let’s have a good fight...... Even so, you have a big smile on your face, don’t you?]","[No, it isn’t that I will be negligent. You are without a doubt an excellent top-notch maid...... However, I’m sure you know that I’ve never been defeated in a tea match in the Maid Olympia even back in the past. That’s why, I have confidence.]","Surprisingly, Alexandra-san seems to have been undefeated in tea matches in the past. Well, from what I heard from Alexandra-san, it seems that she became a maid after Ein-san entered the Hall of Fame and stopped participating in the Maid Olympia, so she probably never had a match against Ein-san...... Even so, the confidence of an overwhelmingly strong person drifts from her current appearance.","Confronted by such an Alexandra-san though, Beatrice-san fearlessly smiled.","[Yes, that certainly is the case. Your tea techniques are excellent. In a match like this, I would have lost...... the “past me”, that is......]","[Past? What do you———- Wha!?]","Immediately after that, Beatrice-san’s body emitted a dazzling light. This is...... the light of Maid Burst that Luna-san used earlier...... No, like I said, why the heck do you glow in that state?","“Whoa, Competitor Beatrice has activated her Maid Burst!”","“......How strange. It may indeed be useful for those with low Maid Power, but for her, who was already complete as a maid, the Maid Burst will not have a big effect. Especially when it comes to tea, is there really someone that her Maid Vision can envision...... “","In response to Beatrice-san’s Maid Burst, both the Live Commentator and Ein-san seemed a little perplexed. Certainly, there had never been a scene where a Maid Burst was used in the battles between the Super Maids. Judging from Ein-san’s commentary, it doesn’t seem like there’s much point in using that technique for maids that had mastered their craft at the level of a Super Maid.","[......Maid Burst? I don’t know what kind of Maid vision you’re pursuing here, but even if you pursue the same Maid Vision Lunamaria was pursuing, it won’t lead you to a good result, you know? Each completed maid has their own form. Using Maid Burst at our level would only break our form......]","[......Just the other day...... I had seen the God of Tea.]","[......God of Tea?]","[She...... has reminded me of what is most important in my heart as a maid. Having reached the position of Super Maid, I had been stagnant. Before I knew it, I had lost the passion to aim for the top that I should have had in the past. For this reason, I dedicate this match to Master, who reminded me of my Heart that Pursues an Endless Ideal, and above all, the essence of what it means to be a maid.]","Declaring so, Beatrice-san began to brew tea. And the moment she saw her movements, Alexandra-san’s eyes widened in astonishment.","[......This is!? A tea angel...... has manifested behind her back!?]","“Whoa, what could this development be!? A beautiful tea angel has appeared on Competitor Beatrice’s back!”","“......Now, this is quite a surprising turn of events. It seems like she has crossed one big bottleneck. The bottleneck called Super Maid...... Her gestures...... Fufu, it seems like she’s still unable to manifest that God of Tea she speaks of, but she was still able to bring about a technique to manifest a tea angel...... Wonderful. This is the moment of evolution for one maid.”","......No, the heck are you all even seeing!? I can’t see anything at all! What the heck is that tea angel you all are talking about!?","[W- What a beautiful angel...... Is this the truth Beatrice-sama has arrived in!?]","[By any chance, is that Nebula’s...... Fuuu, I guess that’s to be expected of her. What a magnificent angel.]","[......Kaito, you can see it?]","[No, not at all...... What about you, Lilia-san?]","[I don’t see it.]","Apparently, Frau and Luna...... and the maids around us can see some sort of tea angel. Are they seeing some collective hallucination? I mean, I’d really rather not be in the minority who couldn’t see something most people here could.","I didn’t think that, even just when the Maid Olympia was about to end, I would be reminded of how abnormal these maids are again.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Remembering the feeling which can be said to be their starting point as a maid, she regained her strong enthusiasm and broke out of the shell known as Super Maid. Just looking at those words, it looked like the awakening of a hot battle...... As expected, maids are dangerous, and it’s amazing how they’d come to that incomprehensible conclusion.]","? ? ? : [I can’t really describe how I feel, looking at all these extreme theories about maids on Christmas Eve......]","T/N: Nevermind, I couldn’t rest. Going back to the usual schedule. Posts might still be slightly delayed though."]},{"number":1381,"title":"Chapter 1381 - Maid Olympia Main Competition 10","paragraphs":["<Author’s Notes>","I didn’t have time to write, so today’s chapter is a little short.","In the midst of the tea match, the final match of the Maid Olympia, I could tell from the atmosphere in the venue and the expression on the face of her opponent, Alexandra-san, that Beatrice-san had done something amazing, although I couldn’t see whatever that tea angel was.","In that case, in a sense, it might be a natural conclusion but......","“The match has been decided. With a unanimous decision...... The 5 judges decided that the Champion of the 231st Maid Olympia is Competitor Beatrice!”","Yes, Beatrice-san won and became the Champion of this year’s Maid Olympia.","“Looking back on the finals match, what do you think, President Ein?”","“Let’s see. As expected, I’m greatly impressed by the potential that Beatrice has exhibited. With this step forward, the other maids present here must have understood it again. The Super Maids aren’t the goal, they’re just one point along your path...... The endless path of maids is never-ending, and we must always be making great strides. However, the more completely a maid is, the more difficult it becomes to take a big step forward to change her current self. The step that Beatrice took this time will be a big step not only for her, but also for the Maid World.”","W- Well, to summarize things, because the Super Maids had reached a top-class position in the Maid World, the Super Maids were also feeling stagnant in their growth.","As she had asked for from Illness-san before, Ein-san wanted a new wind in the stagnant Maid World...... and Beatrice-san’s movements this time could be that new wind.","It’s just, having gained a deeper understanding of maids in just this one day is something I really dislike.","While I was feeling a whirlwind of inexplicable emotions in my heart, back on the stage, Alexandra-san approached Beatrice-san and held out her hand, asking for a handshake.","[......Beatrice-san, that was splendid. Looking at your performance, I was reminded of the passion I had when I was young, to go higher and higher, which I had forgotten before I knew it. I will admit defeat this time, but please know that the result will be different next time.]","[Fuuu, yes, it’s a blessing to have a good rival with whom you can engage in friendly competition. Of course, I have no intention of losing either, as I will show you how I grew even further after the next 4 years.]","It was a scene that could be described as a conversation between rivals who had fought in a heated battle, and I think the atmosphere around them was very moving. In fact, it looked as if Frau-san and Luna-san’s eyes were getting moist...... Well, at any rate, the enthusiasm they have was extremely different from what me, Lilia-san and Akane-san have......","Well, in any case, as I was thinking that this ends the Maid Olympia, Alexandra-san continued talking to Beatrice-san.","[......Are you sure you’d be alright with your Maidric Aura reserves? The battle that awaits you after this will be tough, even if you’re in perfect shape.]","[There’s no problem. I’m sure I’ll feel a little better after a little rest. Since I have earned the right to challenge, I will make sure my performance won’t be unsightly.]","[Fufu, I’m looking forward to it then. Good luck......]","Leaving these words, Alexandra-san left Beatrice-san, and right after she left, the Live Commentator announced loudly.","“Well then, we will be having a 30-minute break. And in 30 minutes, we will have our annual exhibition match...... The Champion’s challenge to the Pinnacle of the Maid World...... President Ein!!!”","Whoa. It seems like the finals aren’t the end of the Maid Olympia, as the Champion, Beatrice-san, has earned the right to challenge Ein-san.","Ein-san, who can be said to be the absolute monarch of the Maid World, is challenged by the Champion who has grown greatly this time...... I see, this certainly is an exciting development.","......Well, even so...... I honestly can’t imagine a future in which Ein-san is beaten in maid-related matters though......","<Afterword>","【Beatrice】","Maid Power: 120000 ? 135000","Through an encounter with Nebula and reaching the finals, she has made a breakthrough and her Maid Power has risen. These numbers are only the result of the increase in the finals, and since she had already broken through a bottleneck at that time, she is expected to grow significantly in the future.","【Ein】","Maid Power: 530000 (Normal State)","The Absolute Pinnacle of the Maid World. It’s said that she has 530,000 Maid Power, but that is only for normal times when she isn’t even ready for battle, not at her full strength. As a maid, she’s always serious, but due to her excessive power, the only time she gave it her all was when fighting against Alice. An absolutely strong person who is rumored to have over 100 million Maid Power when she’s at her full power.","(T/N: Not sure if the 100 million is referring to Ein or Alice.)"]},{"number":1382,"title":"Chapter 1382 - Maid Olympia Main Competition 11","paragraphs":["After a 30-minute break, Beatrice-san appeared on the stage. Her expression is grim, and one can see the tension on her face.","“Now, the Pinnacle of the Maid World...... President Ein makes her entrance!”","Prompted by the words of the Live Commentator, Ein-san slowly entered the venue. Her overwhelming sense of strength and imposing appearance can be felt from the way she stands. I don’t know about all those things like Maid Power and Maidric Aura, but I could certainly feel the intimidation her presence was overflowing with.","[Kuh...... H- Her Maidric Aura really is overwhelming......]","[Just looking at her here makes me feel crushed. For her to emit such Maidric Aura while simply standing normally...... As expected of the Pinnacle Maid......]","For some reason, Frau-san and Luna-san looked as if they were withstanding some sort of pressure, and the maids in the audience seats around us were also like that.","Of course, Lilia-san, Akane-san and I aren’t feeling any sort of pressure, so we’re feeling left out again.","No, I understand their logic. I think they’re feeling pressured by the aura of an overwhelmingly strong person...... but to begin with, those of us who don’t even understand what a normal Maidric Aura was wouldn’t be able to sense Ein-san’s mighty Maidric Aura at all.","[......Well, I understand your reactions to some extent...... but is Ein-san really that amazing? As far as I’m concerned, I could only see her as Kuromu-sama’s maid......]","[Of course. President Ein is the Pinnacle of the Maid World. She has a Maid Power of 530,000...... However, that is only during normal times, and it’s said that if she gets serious, her Maid Power even exceeds 100 million.]","[......That inflation sure is quite a lot.]","As Akane-san said, in the Maid World where the Super Maids whose Maid Power was only 100,000 can only be counted on one hand, it’s surprising that figures such as 530,000 or 100 million will suddenly appear...... I guess that’s why they felt that Ein-san is so overwhelming.","[When one challenges President Ein, her strength as a maid will be tested. President Ein’s overwhelming Maidric Aura is so powerful that it nullifies all maid techniques. Standing before President Ein’s presence, even techniques such as the Maid Burst can’t be used.]","[......Errr, I see......]","Hearing Luna-san’s excited words, Lilia-san only nodded with an indescribable expression on her face. Nullifies all maid techniques huh...... That’s certainly an easy-to-understand strong ability that a strong Boss-type opponent would seem to possess.","In other words, if you fight against Ein-san, no tricks will work, and you have to compete purely on the basis of the skills you have cultivated as a maid...... or something along those lines.","[President Ein’s Maidric Aura is the Supreme Maidric Aura...... It’s superior to all Maidric Auras, and suppresses the Maidric Auras themselves...... However, as President Ein herself mentioned before, rumor has it that President Ein’s rival has the Phantom Maidric Aura. That Phantom Maidric Aura seems to be the only thing that can compete with her Supreme Maidric Aura...... As the name implies, it was indeed a phantom.]","[......Can you stop already? Adding even more technical terms, I mean......]","As Akane-san threw a tsukkomi at Frau-san, who muttered such with a solemn expression on her face, I whispered behind me in a way that won’t be heard by the others.","[......You have such an aura?]","[That’s an outrageous slander. Seriously, please stop that...... In short, what they’re all saying was that I’m just not intimidated by Ein-san’s spirit. I’d like it if they would stop treating me like a maid and making me look like I’m clad in some strange aura......]","A voice that sounded repulsed from the bottom of her heart responded. It seems like, or rather, it really looks like Ein-san was just saying all that on her own. How should I say this...... It seems like Alice was also having it rough.","“Now then, as is customary in the challenge to President Ein, the match format will be chosen by the challenger. We will give you a list of match formats registered in the latest version of the lottery magic tool, so please choose one from there.”","I see, in the challenge to Ein-san, the challenger chooses the match format...... In other words, they can challenge Ein-san with their own specialty.","[......By the way, has anyone won in the past?]","[No, not even close. No one has ever been able to beat President Ein, nor has anyone been able to have her bring out even half of what she is capable of.]","[......I guess that’s to be expected.]","Well, I honestly can’t imagine Ein-san losing. Even if Camellia-san challenges her in combat, I feel like it would be an instant defeat for Camellia-san, but her Maid-related techniques would be extremely advanced...... I can’t see how you can get a win against her.","[......Haahhh...... Thinking about what would happen after this is quite depressing...... I shouldn’t have thoughtlessly promised just because she stuffed me with a lot of money.]","[......Unnn?]","[No, well, I got irritated after she pestered me to make an appearance almost every time, and after we got into a quarrel when she provoked me and something like “I’ll pay you lots of money, so let’s go have a fight” was said...... Well, this ended up happening.]","[......I see, do your best.]","It seems like there will be one more exhibition match after this one. She herself really seemed to dislike it...... but from what I just heard, it seems that this woman got baited by money, so I think she’s just reaping what she sowed.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Eh? You’re making an appearance?]","? ? ? : [It’s not me, but Alice-chan...... Or rather, a disguised Alice-chan is scheduled to appear. She seemed to be seriously depressed about it...... but that was quite a lot of money...... Well...... If you consider that that amount was just for one battle...... Such an amount seemed to be quite the tasty deal......]","Serious-senpai : [You’ve been completely bought out.]"]},{"number":1383,"title":"Chapter 1383 - The Decisive Battle Between Supreme and Phantom 1","paragraphs":["The match format between Ein-san and Beatrice-san. What Beatrice-san decided in the end is......","[......Tea Showdown please.]","“Whoa, Competitor Beatrice has chosen Tea Showdown. Did she think it was the most likely to get her closest to President Ein? In any case, following the finals, it was decided that we would have Tea Showdown as the match format!”","In a sense, you could say this was a safe choice. Beatrice-san broke out of her shell in the Tea Showdown in the finals, she had grown past being a Super Maid...... or so I heard from the Live Commentary, and perhaps, the best weapon she has for the time being is the tea she showed in that battle.","It’s just, as expected, challenging Ein-san about tea...... feels a bit reckless.","[......I see, tea, is it?]","[Yes, I grasped that feeling back in the finals. If it’s the me right now, even if I don’t use Maid Burst......]","“Whoa, this is!? Behind Competitor Beatrice who is brewing tea is the tea angel that we witness in the finals!”","Unnn, I still can’t see it...... Anyway, it seems that that tea angel appeared again. That should mean that the tea that allowed her to win over Alexandra-san in the finals is now completely within her grasp.","Seeing Beatrice-san in such a state, even though I’m looking at her from a distance, I could see the smile rising from her lips.","And when Beatrice-san finished brewing her tea, Ein-san started to move.","[......What wonderful growth. By the way, that God of Tea you saw...... is this one, right?]","[Wha!?]","“T- This is!? Appearing behind President Ein’s back is the divine God of Tea!? W- What a tremendous atmosphere she has......”","Apparently, in contrast to Beatrice-san who manifested a tea angel, Ein-san managed to manifest the God of Tea. No, I can’t see either of them...... and I wish they would with this puzzling battle.","[The ultimate gestures have a Vision befitting them. However, as for showing the God to others, it’s impossible unless you are in a state where you can say that you have mastered tea. But looking at it in another way, one can manifest the God of Tea even if one isn’t a maid. That is technique, belief, and proficiency...... In any case, you have not yet reached this stage...... You must continue to work hard.]","[Kuh......]","“Competitor Beatrice has fallen to her knees! Has the match been decided?”","[......It’s my loss.]","How should I say this...... Ein-san really feels quite superior. Also, nonchalantly talking about how anyone can manifest that God of Tea, I would like it if you would stop with all that Maid logic talks.","Well, even if other people can really manifest that, that’s just something only maids can see......","[T- That was an amazing battle. As expected of President Ein...... She’s overwhelming.]","[Yes, Beatrice-sama also showed skills worthy of being a Super Maid, but as expected, President Ein was still composed even battling someone such as her...... The summit is just too high.]","As usual, Frau-san and Luna-san were roused, talking about the earlier match with excitement.","As for the match, Beatrice-san herself admitted defeat and surrendered, so Ein-san won.","“The challenge to President Ein ends once again with an overwhelming victory for President Ein. Will we ever get the chance to witness her serious mode...... In any case, this ends the match, so next up would be the awards ceremony...... Oya?”","The words of the Live Commentary that was about to move to the awards ceremony stopped. The reason is simple, for before I knew it, a new presence had appeared at the venue......","A woman with long black hair wearing a maid outfit, her face can’t be seen because it’s hidden behind a mask...... Well, it’s definitely Alice. It seems like she changed her appearance for this.","[Who is that? That maid...... isn’t she strange? I can’t...... feel her Maidric Aura?]","[Y- Yes, I don’t feel it at all either. A Maid without a Maidric Aura...... Does such a person exist?]","Frau-san and Luna-san and talking with serious expressions on their faces but...... unnn, I mean, that woman isn’t a maid...... so it’s inevitable that she has no Maidric Aura.","In any case, the mysterious maid who suddenly appeared filled the venue with an air of bewilderment, but upon seeing her, a ferocious smile appeared in Ein-san’s smile.","[......You have kept me waiting for a long time. However, at last, I can finally fight against you on this stage!]","[......................]","“T- This was!? President Ein’s Maidric Aura was tremendously increasing...... W- What...... powerful......”","I don’t really know what’s going on, but Ein-san’s Maidric Aura was apparently increasing, and seeing it, Frau-san and Luna-san...... along with other audience members looked pale.","And Frau-san and Luna-san, who seemed to be having a hard time over here, spoke with pained expressions on their faces.","[E- Even from this far away, I feel like my body is going to be crushed!? What a tremendous Maidric Aura......]","[Even Beatrice-sama is desperately enduring it with both hands on the ground. As expected, receiving such a Maidric Aura in a close vicinity———- No way!? T- That maid...... She’s calm while being exposed to that amount of Maidric Aura!?]","[T- That’s impossible! Despite being a maid, being exposed to the Supreme Maidric Aura and to still remain calm...... remain calm...... A- Ahhh, I see...... I don’t feel her Maidric Aura. No, we just couldn’t grasp her Maidric Aura! It’s like she’s a phantom......]","[A phantom...... C- Could it be——— The Phantom Maidric Aura!?]","Why did she remain unperturbed when exposed to that Supreme Maidric Aura? The answer is simple...... and I really wanna say it. Right now, my heart is really filled with the desire to scream...... “That’s because that woman is not a maid!!!”...... But as expected, there was no way I could just say that with the mood they have here, so I could only have an indescribable expression on her face.","<Afterword>","【Supreme Maidric Aura】","Known as the Ultimate Maidric Aura, it can only be clad by those who have attained true heights as a maid. This Maidric Aura shuts down other Maidric Auras, making it impossible to use any maid technique, and also puts a lot of pressure on lower-ranked maids, so Ein usually suppresses this Maidric Aura to its limits.","【Phantom Maidric Aura】","A mysterious Maidric Aura that is said to be the only one that can compete with the Supreme Maidric Aura. This Maidric Aura can’t even be felt in the slightest, and it’s described as a phantom because it seemed as if it didn’t exist. It’s said to be unaffected by any other Maidric Aura, and even the Supreme Maidric Aura can’t shut down or overwhelm this Phantom Maidric Aura...... or so Ein described it, but Alice just looked genuinely displeased about it."]},{"number":1384,"title":"Chapter 1384 - The Decisive Battle Between Supreme and Phantom 2","paragraphs":["While the audience was confused by the presence of Alice...... or rather, the mysterious masked maid who appeared at the Maid Olympia, Ein-san calmly declared.","[She is my rival as a maid, and I asked her to come here especially to have a match with me this year. She doesn’t like to show her face to the public, so it was difficult to negotiate with her......]","“W- What!? The mysterious maid who appeared was the rumored rival of President Ein and the owner of the Phantom Maidric Aura...... the Phantom Maid!!!”","[And so, we are now going to have a match but...... Some may be wondering. What is her ability...... Therefore, as a demonstration...... Would you mind brewing us a cup of tea? With just that one act, for the maids present here, that would make everyone understand your abilities.]","[....................]","At Ein-san’s words, Alice, or rather, the Phantom Maid moved without a word, and began to brew tea with familiar hands, and witnessing this, the venue was once again wrapped in astonishment.","“T- This is the God of Tea that President Ein showed us earlier...... As expected, she isn’t just an ordinary maid!!!”","Just as before, it seems like she has manifested the God of Tea that I can’t see.","Thereupon, Beatrice-san, who was on the stage, left, and Ein-san and the Phantom Maid faced each other in the center of the venue.","[......Now then, as for our match format, I have one suggestion. Do you remember when we had a Cooking Match back in the Six Kings Festival? At that time, a third-party interference made our match invalid but...... What do you think about having a Cooking Match as a redo of that time?]","[.........................]","What Ein-san is talking about is the cooking match that she had with Alice when we stayed in the Central Tower before the Six Kings Festival. At that time, when Isis-san served me food, the two of them were hampered, and they buried the hatchet at that time. In a sense, it was a settlement in which Isis-san won.","The maid nodded silently at Ein-san’s proposal to redo that match.","[It’s decided then. Well then, let’s prepare the ingredients and cooking utensils...... The preparation time is “5 minutes”, which I think is enough time for us. How about it?]","[....................]","[It doesn’t seem like you object. Let’s get ready then.]","The moment she said that, Ein-san and the Phantom Maid disappeared, and a few seconds later, they reappeared with a large amount of food and cooking utensils.","There are obviously freshly caught humongous fish, which they seem to have been procured in just a few seconds...... Those two can manipulate time, so me, who knew about their true identity, wasn’t particularly surprised.","[......W- What the heck was that!? In an instant...... How fast are they!?]","[That...... wasn’t just Super-speed, but Space-Time Magic...... It’s probably Time Manipulation. As expected of Ein-sama’s rival, that masked maid is also an extremely powerful person.]","Hearing Akane-san and Lilia-san’s words, I tilted my head. Leaving Akane-san aside, doesn’t Lilia-san know that that mysterious maid is actually Alice?","Ah, come to think of it, I tend to forget about it since I meet her often, but in the first place, Ein-san doesn’t really appear on the public stage, does she? Putting aside this Maid Olympia and Maid-related matters, even with Lilia-san’s social position, she doesn’t usually have the chance to talk to Ein-san, so she doesn’t know about it huh......","[All of those ingredients are top-notch, aren’t they?]","[Yes, and many of the ingredients are difficult to handle. Just by looking at that lineup, I can see how high their skills are.]","Frau-san and Luna-san are also looking at the venue, seemingly devoured by their excitement. No, well, I’m also looking forward to a match between Ein-san and Alice.","In fact, I would say that the two of them are almost evenly matched in terms of ability, and it’s hard to predict who will win.","Just as I was thinking that, Ein-san spoke again.","[Fuuu, my apologies. It seems like 5 minutes was too much. 1 minute was enough...... Well then, as for the match format, there’s no need to put too many conditions on the match. The winner is decided after the both of us make our best dish. However, if we make them too fast, the audience will feel left behind, so using Time Manipulation or excessive speed in cooking is forbidden...... What do you think of a 1-hour limit?]","[.......................]","Certainly, looking at it from the audience’s side, it would just end up being completed already before we knew it. Phantom Maid nodded at Ein-san’s proposal without any complaints.","After nodding in satisfaction at her reaction, Ein-san declared in a loud voice.","[And one more thing! Let’s add “Kaito-sama” as the Special Judge to this match!!!]","Wait a minute there. What the heck are you suddenly talking about!? Special Judge? In this situation? In front of all these audiences?","No, no, I want to refuse her with all my might...... but it would be difficult to escape from this situation when she declared that in front of this number of people, and the reason I refused to be a Special Judge in the first place, that I wanted to concentrate on cheering for Luna-san, is no longer available in this situation.","[......Kaito-san, would you like to have some stomach medicine?]","[......I don’t know if it will work, but I’ll have some.]","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [It’s a precious Kaito’s stomach ache scene.]"]},{"number":1385,"title":"Chapter 1385 - The Decisive Battle Between Supreme and Phantom 3","paragraphs":["Now then, the Cooking Showdown between Ein-san and the Phantom Maid abruptly started. The Judges who would decide the winner of this showdown are the Four Super Maids...... and me.","No, I understood their logic. If it was a match between these two, it wouldn’t be possible for people with half-baked skills to judge them, so it’s understandable that the Super Maids are chosen as judges.","I also understand that the number of Super Maids is even, and that they need to add one more person to make it an odd number. What I don’t understand...... and don’t want to understand is why they chose me.","“Now then, with the addition of the Official Maid Advisor Miyama Kaito-sama to the Four Super Maids, our lineup of judges are finally ready.”","Seriously, I’d like it if you would stop naturally introducing me like I’m some sort of heavyweight in the Maid World. I just took stomach medicine earlier, but I now feel like my stomach is starting to ache again.","I’m currently at the judges’ table specially set up at the venue...... and I’m sitting in the middle of the table, as if I’m the representative of all these judges.","[......You’ve got it rough, Kaito-san.]","[No, Camellia-san too......]","My only saving grace is that Camellia-san is sitting next to me on my right, and she’s the only one who can be considered a healing presence in this abnormal space.","Incidentally, the one sitting to my left is Alexandra-san. I had seen Alexandra-san when I visited Chris-san. I had never directly talked with her, but I remembered her as the person who prepared tea and meals for me.","Now that I think about it, I’m an important guest to Chris-san, so she probably had the most skilled maid service for me.","[......It’s the first time we’ve directly talked like this, Miyama Kaito-sama.]","[Ah, yes. This certainly is the first time we’ve talked with each other huh. As you probably know already, I’m Miyama Kaito.]","[Thank you for your courtesy. My name is Alexandra. Thank you for always taking care of our Emperor, her Majesty Chris.]","Alexandra-san, who had tied-up beautiful blonde hair and an elegant face, greeted me with a beautiful light bow.","Now that I think about it, speaking of Super Maids, Camellia-san was originally my acquaintance. I met Beatrice-san the other day. As for Alexandra-san, I had seen her several times at the Imperial Castle...... which means that only Emily-san is someone I had completely met for the first time.","No, I mean, I’ve never been to the castle in the Hydra Kingdom. Whenever I met Laguna-san, she would either visit me or we would meet at that harbor where we had fished together before, so I had never been to the castle.","Emily-san is an active-looking woman with chestnut-colored semi-short hair, and although this is only my quick impression, I get the impression that she has a cheerful personality.","While I was thinking about that, it seemed that the preparations were complete and the match was about to begin. Both sides then picked up a few ingredients and proceeded to cook with fluid movements.","As expected, both of them were so skillful that even though they weren’t accelerating their movements, it was still hard to follow them with my eyes...... No, I actually couldn’t follow them with my eyes, so I put on Shiro-san’s special glasses. These glasses really are useful.","“Both competitors are cooking with tremendous dexterity.”","[......What beautiful movements. Both of them are cooking without any wasted movements in their actions at all...... How hair-shuddering. Just watching them cook makes me understand that I’m not a match against them at all.]","Their cooking is so amazing that it took Alexandra-san’s breath away. The ingredients and utensils they were using seem to indicate that Ein-san was going to cook Western food and Alice was going to cook Japanese food.","However, the fact that they’re taking this much time at the speed those two are going at, I wonder if they are planning on making quite a large batch?","“T- This is!? Both of them took out 5 of the same utensils at the same time!?”","[......Fuuu, I guess that’s to be expected of maids of their skill. Just as I did in my match, they were intending to change the seasoning to suit each of the judges huh......]","[.....................]","“What an astonishing surprise! It seems that, within the time limit of 1 hour, both will prepare dishes with seasonings that will suit each of the five judges...... I see, as they all have different tastes, it is indeed important to match the tastes of each of the judges.”","Honestly, I think I’m getting what she means. As I was not the only judge, unlike that showdown back at the Six Kings Festival, it isn’t enough to make a dish that suits my liking.","It’s best to make a dish that suits each person’s taste. Of course, doing it like that would normally be difficult and time-consuming, but if it’s those two, they could easily do it.","[......It’s understandable that Ein-sama would know, but does that mysterious maid also know our taste? However, even so...... Even though she’s a maid of such talents, I just can’t think of who she could be. For her to possess that much control over her body movements...... I think she’s a Count-rank or higher......]","When I heard Camellia-san tilt her head curiously, muttering that, I realized something. Alice’s Recognition Inhibition Magic is of an extremely high rank, that even the members of the Six Kings couldn’t easily see through it. So, even Camellia-san would be unaware of the identity of the Phantom Maid.","This is something I learned quite recently...... It seems like the reason why her identity is unknown to everyone, even though I could clearly see that it was Alice, was because of her Recognition Inhibition Magic.","In my case, Shiro-san’s blessing automatically nullifies her Recognition Inhibition Magic, so that would be why I could perceive her true identity.","......I suppose that’s also the reason why people don’t perceive the incredibly obvious identities of some people like a certain Baby Castella Mask huh......","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [So, do you think you can win?]","? ? ? : [I dunno, I wonder about that? It’s not like I...... Alice-chan cares about the outcome of the match, and I think it’s alright with her even if she loses...... Well, when it comes to Kaito-san’s vote, I think Alice-chan plans on winning that. As long as she can win that vote, the other people’s evaluations don’t matter......]"]},{"number":1386,"title":"Chapter 1386 - The Decisive Battle Between Supreme and Phantom 4","paragraphs":["With occasional live commentaries, the Cooking Showdown between Ein-san and the Phantom Maid proceeded, and both completed their dishes in plenty of time.","Both weren’t serving a course meal, but rather a set meal. Ein-san’s menu was centered on elegant meat dishes, and my impression was that it was a Western-style plate that you would see at a family restaurant.","Alice, or rather, the Phantom Maid has organized exactly what you would find in a Set Meal restaurant...... The meat was deep-fried, so I guess this would be a Tonkatsu Set Meal? It could also be a Gyuukatsu Set Meal though...... In any case, both of their dishes look delicious.","“With both competitors having finished cooking their dishes, we will now enter the judging process. From what I have seen, both sides seemed to have opted to keep their dishes simple.”","As the Live Commentator said, both sides could certainly choose to keep their dishes simple...... This is just my hunch, but I think they’re being conscious that I will be judging their dishes.","I’m not good with high-class cuisine like those served in French restaurants, which seems to be difficult to eat, and I prefer home-style cooking. Naturally, both Alice and Ein-san know this, so they have made the food easy to eat.","At any rate, let’s start with Ein-san’s Western dish...... Delicious! The overall balance is wonderful, and the other ingredients are centered on meat, with the taste of the other ingredients complementing and harmonizing with it. Because of the wonderful balance of the whole dish, I couldn’t stop eating and before I knew it, I finished it all up.","It was so delicious...... It was so delicious that my vocabulary died. It’s like, the only words that come to mind after eating it is that it was extremely delicious.","I don’t know if I should say it’s to be expected of Ein-san, but her dish truly is on a different dimension.","Next up would be Alice’s Japanese food. It was also delicious to the point of being dangerous. The rice, miso soup, and cutlet were all exactly to my liking, and I can only describe them as the best I’ve ever tasted.","If I had to describe it, it was as if this dish had been adjusted to the utmost limit for me, and it was so delicious that I thought that there was nothing better than this. Even though I had just eaten Ein-san’s dish, I finished eating Alice’s dish in no time.","Well, both of them are really great. Their cooking skills are of a different dimension...... Unnn...... And as the Judge...... I need to judge who is better between them but......","...... I- I don’t know. It’s too difficult to say which one is better! If this was a competition between two competitors serving the same cuisine, I might have been able to judge that a bit better, but this was a confrontation between Japanese and Western cuisine, and both of them were delicious. It’s too difficult to judge which is better than the other.","“It seems that all of our Judges have finished eating, so we will now move on to giving out the scores. Please bring forward the dish that you think was more delicious to you.”","Eh? Wait, I haven’t decided yet. In my mind, both are 100-pointers, and there’s no factor between them that determines which one is better. In the first place, I don’t have a very sharp sense of taste, so I wouldn’t be able to tell the difference between the two.","“Oh my, it seems that Judge Emily has brought forward the Phantom Maid’s dish.”","[I was impressed by her ability to prepare a rice dish, which isn’t common in this world, so beautifully. Eating this dish allowed me to see new possibilities.]","“I see, following her, Judge Alexandra brought forward President Ein’s dish.”","[Both of them are among the best in the world, and it’s very difficult to decide which is better than the other. I don’t have any choice but to pick according to my preference. For me, the appearance of the whole dish was reflected more beautifully by President Ein......]","While I’m worried about this, the judging progressed, making me really flustered...... but seriously, both dishes were scoring a perfect tie for me, and even if I add in preferences to the calculation, there was not even the slightest difference between them. This is troubling...... What should I do?","“Afterward, Judge Beatrice put forward President Ein’s dish.”","[Judging between these two dishes is extremely difficult. I’m still wavering at the moment, but for my personal taste...... I recognize that President Ein’s dish was slightly better.]","“And then, Judge Camellia has put forward the Phantom Maid’s dish.”","[This is also a matter of taste, but since I slightly preferred the vegetables in Phantom Maid-san’s dish, I will give my vote to Phantom Maid-san’s dish.]","“The votes so far are completely even, 2 for each competitor. This being the case, the decision will be decided by the Maid Advisor, Judge Kaito!!!”","Eeehhhhh!? Wait, stop for a moment! The one I choose will win? That’s too much responsibility you’re placing on me here! I mean, when you consider the viewpoint of those residing in the Maid World, this could be the moment when the curtain comes down on the legend of Ein-san’s unbeaten streak! W- What should I do?","The only way to end this nicely is with Ein-san’s victory. We could settle this as the result being to be expected from the Pinnacle of the Maid World. On the other hand, if Alice wins, this could become a major event that changes history.","No, even if that’s so, making Ein-san win for that reason, I could just feel bad for Alice. What should I do? What could I do...... No, seriously...... Someone help me!!!","<Afterword>","Airhead God : [......I see you’re calling for help. It seems like I have no choice but to help you.]","Serious-senpai : [No, wait, you, what are you planning to do...... You’ll just end up giving Kaito more stomach ache......]"]},{"number":1387,"title":"Chapter 1387 - The Decisive Battle Between Supreme and Phantom 5","paragraphs":["The answer to the question of which to choose, Ein-san’s or Alice’s dish, was still unanswered, but as I was having a very difficult time thinking that it would be bad if I made everyone wait for my judgment any longer...... the scenery around us suddenly changed.","The place was the familiar flower garden in the God Realm, and I was sitting not in the Judges’ table, but across from Shiro-san.","[......Arehh?]","[You seemed to be in trouble.]","[Ah, no, but the judging......]","[I’ve shifted the time here in the Sanctuary so that no matter how much time you spend here, no time actually passed outside. This being the case, you can take your time and think about it.]","Listening to Shiro-san’s words while drinking tea, I took a deep breath and stroked my chest. This really helped. I’m really grateful that I had the time to think about this.","[Thank you...... This really helped. It’s just that I still didn’t have an answer.]","[Fumu...... Answer for what?]","[Errr, the answer to which one is better, Ein-san’s or Alice’s dish.]","When I thanked her, Shiro-san tilted her head without any expression on her face, then listening to my explanation, she tilted her head again.","[Do you absolutely have to decide which one of them is better?]","[Eh? Of course, as the Judge......]","[Couldn’t you just call it a tie?]","[...........................Eh?]","The words that were spoken to me as if it were a matter of course, shocked me so much that my mind went blank for a moment. How should I say this...... That thought never occurred to me.","[In Kaito-san’s mind, their dishes were evenly matched, weren’t they? Then, doesn’t that make it a draw?]","[......Indeed.]","Now that she mentioned it, that was a blind spot. I thought that Ein-san would settle things harmoniously, but if you think about it, wouldn’t a draw be the most beautiful end here?","In fact, in my opinion, both of their dishes were the greatest and were quite delicious, and that their dishes were totally even. If I had to give my honest opinion, I would say they were a tie.","[I’m sure the two of them wouldn’t forcibly want you to choose which between them is greater, right?]","[I can’t argue with that at all. Now, if only I had the courage to say it in that atmosphere......]","[It’s alright. If you just think “I’m the rule”, you’ll do great.]","[A- Ahaha...... How should I say this...... That certainly sounds like Shiro-san.]","Shiro-san completely helped me out this time. Yes, it would be great if I could just say my honest opinion without worrying about it. Just as Shiro-san said, neither Ein-san nor Alice would want to force a settlement. As for Alice, it seems she doesn’t care whether she wins or loses......","[Thank you, Shiro-san.]","[I’m glad you got your answer. Well then, I’ll bring you back.]","[Yes!]","As I responded, the scenery switched again and I’m back at the Maid Olympia venue. In front of Ein-san and Alice looking at me, before the other Judges and the audience, I put both plates in front.","“Whoa, this is? Judge Kaito had held out both plates in front.”","[As for my opinion of the food, I would say they were both totally even and there was no difference between them. And so, the result of my judgment...... is that it was a tie.]","When I declared this, the audience was in a commotion, seemingly puzzled. I guess it’s understandable. Me judging it as a tie in a 2-2 match where this would be the decisive vote, so it was inevitable that the atmosphere would be a bit delicate.","But in my mind, it’s really a perfect tie...... so this is fine. As I was thinking this, a smile appeared on Ein-san’s lips and she spoke.","[......As expected of Kaito-sama. To be honest, when I saw her finished dish...... I also felt that we were exactly equal. Perhaps, that’s what she thinks so as well.]","[...................]","Alice nodded silently after hearing Ein-san’s words. Perhaps, she may be following up with me, but either way, both of them seemed to have no disagreement with the results of my judgment.","“Then?”","[Yes, this match is a draw...... Fufu, I guess this is to be expected. Among the 5 dishes I made to suit the Judges’ tastes, I was particularly proud of the dish I served to Kaito-sama but...... I’m just happy. I’m just grateful that even when I stand in this realm, there’s still someone who can fight evenly with me.]","[...................]","“I understand! Well then, this exhibition match...... ends with a draw! Everyone, a hearty round of applause for these two great maids who fought evenly!”","As the Live Commentary brought the event to a conclusion, the venue was filled with thunderous applause. Thanks to Ein-san’s neatly organized speech, I was relieved that there were no criticisms of my judgment.","However, well...... I would really like to ask for a situation like this not to happen when the next opportunity comes. I mean, seriously, I really don’t wanna be a Judge in the Maid Olympia anymore.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai: [......Airhead God gave quite decent advice there.]","Airhead God: [Doya.]","Serious-senpai : [.......Also, it’s probably not just Ein, but Alice too had put all her effort in the plate she gave Kaito.]","T/N: Shiro got the last doya. In any case, Happy New Year. See you in 2023."]},{"number":1388,"title":"Chapter 1388 - The Decisive Battle Between Supreme and Maid 6","paragraphs":["<Author’s Notes>","Happy New Year. I and the series are in your care again this year.","As the sudden Special Judge role had finally ended, I returned to the audience seats. As the awarding ceremony is about to start, including the Champion Beatrice-san, Luna-san also headed to the stage because the competitors who apparently made it to the Top 8 would also receive extra prizes.","[Is it the end after the awarding ceremony?]","[Ahh, no, we’re going to have an afterparty.]","[Afterparty?]","[The Top 8 will prepare dishes and pastries, which everyone can partake in at their leisure. It’s more like a showcase of the Top Maids’ skills.]","[Hmmm, that sounds like a lot of fun.]","I see, there’s still such an event huh...... Luna-san is also a member of the Top 8, so she’d be among those who would cook dishes and pastries. I guess Lilia-san and I also can’t go home until that afterparty ends.","Well, I had already eaten 2 sets of dishes at the judging table earlier, so my stomach is already sufficiently filled. I guess I’ll just have some snacks at that afterparty.","[Kaito-san, thank you for your hard work.]","[Ahaha, things got a little weird at the end...... but for the time being, this ends the Maid Olympia. The end was a bit of a mess, but it was a lot of fun, wasn’t it?]","[Yes, the competition was well thought out, and it was fun to watch...... Well, to be honest though, I’d rather not come back again......]","[I get you. I feel so out of place here.]","The Maid Olympia was actually kinda fun. I was made to be a Special Judge at the end, but other than that, while throwing some tsukkomis here and there, I was able to enjoy myself.","However, as there were many times when I couldn’t follow the maids’ mysterious logic that was often deployed in this place filled with maids, I don’t think I would want to come back again.","[......However, Luna-san has reached the Top 8, right? Wouldn’t this mean she’s exempted from next Maid Olympia’s qualifiers?]","[......I’m going to decline next time.]","[Hmmm. This may be a rude way to say this, but to be honest, I can’t see a future where Lilia-san can refuse......]","[What a coincidence. I also feel like I’d also be cajoled into attending again...... At that time, please be prepared to be caught up again, Kaito-san.]","[Eeeehhh......]","[Fufufu.]","Lilia-san laughed mischievously. Lilia-san’s words just now sounded like it’s spoken in jest, but in fact, I wonder how it would actually turn out? In the Maid Olympia...... If I don’t participate intending to support Luna-san, there’s a high possibility that I will be asked to be a Special Judge just like Ein-san did this time.","I wish I could be firm and refuse her...... but I feel really weak to earnest requests, or rather, I feel like I would somehow end up getting swept along.","In that case, I even think that it would be safer to participate as a supporter.","[Are you going to be at the afterparty as well, Akane-san? We will be going back home with Luna-san, so we inevitably have to stay until the end......]","[Hmm~~ I’d be happy to go home already, but Frau looked like she wanna join, and since we can eat for free, I’ll stay a little bit. However, I’m not going to stay until the end, and find a good time to go home.]","[Ehh~~ We’re not gonna stay until the end, Chairman? Let’s participate in a heated Maid Debate!]","[If you’re gonna involve me in such a thing, I’ll leave you behind.]","[If you leave me here, will teleportation costs be included in the work expenses?]","[It’s not included!]","[......How unfortunate.]","It doesn’t seem like Frau-san can use Teleportation Magic, and due to the fact that she will return with Akane-san’s Teleportation Magic, she will inevitably leave at the time Akane-san leaves.","It seems like she doesn’t have the option of just staying behind. Well, I understand how she feels. There were a lot of audiences that had attended this event, so the Teleportation Gate would definitely be crowded and would take her a long time before she could go home. That especially goes with teleporting from the Demon Realm to the Human Realm, as it would require a fairly excellent Teleportation Magic User or an expensive Teleportation Magic Tool.","Me, Lilia-san and Luna-san will return home with my Teleportation Magic Tool, so we don’t have such a problem. Lilia-san had also received a state-of-the-art Teleportation Magic Tool as memorabilia from the Six Kings Festival, so she can use it to return home.","[Speaking of which, the Phantom Maid disappeared before I knew it. She was someone filled with mystery, wasn’t she?]","Alice disappeared as soon as the exhibition match was over. Well, she is still behind me now, but I guess her disappearance gave the impression of being mysterious to the maids.","......Well, for the time being, as the Maid Olympia has been concluded, let’s just enjoy ourselves at the afterparty.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [I guess this ends the Maid Olympia Arc?]","? ? ? : [Right. Since there have been consecutive chapters filled with serious battles, I guess the next arc would be something sweet?]","Serious-senpai : [......Can you please stop that? No, I’m not talking about you jinxing the coming of a sweet arc, but you tagging those maid battles as something serious......]"]},{"number":1389,"title":"Chapter 1389 - Connection Event 1","paragraphs":["<Author’s Notes>","I don’t have much time to write today, so today’s chapter is a little short.","It had been a few days since the intense Maid Olympia event, and I spent the last few days relaxing and not going out much, perhaps because the Maid Olympia had been too intense, or perhaps, to relieve the mental fatigue I suffered that day.","I spent most of my time playing with Bell and Lynn. Sela, Sieg-san’s pet, was also usually with Bell and Lynn.","Sieg-san would also come to take care of Sela during breaks, so I had many opportunities to talk with Sieg-san, and at such a time, Sieg-san made a certain suggestion.","[Kaito-san, would you like to go out on my upcoming day off?]","[Ahh, that sounds great. Where should we go?]","[Errr, actually, there’s this event......]","I immediately nodded to Sieg-san’s suggestion to go out together. There’s no reason for me to refuse in the first place, and since you could call this a date invitation, it makes me happy instead.","When I asked back while thinking so, Sieg-san took out a flier and handed it to me. When I checked it out......","“A Large Gathering of Rare Monsters! Limited Time Only Connection Event”","The flier had this as its headline, and when I checked the contents, I found that it was an event held in Archlesia Empire, where you can directly interact with monsters that are popular as pets and those that usually participate in Monster Races.","I see, I could see why Sieg-san, who loves animals, would like this event, and this would be a unique event in the Archlesia Empire, which had close ties with Magnawell-san.","[Heehhh...... That sounds interesting. I’m interested in the monsters in the Monster Race, but I’m also interested in the monsters that are popular as pets. I’ve heard that Slimes are popular pets to keep......]","[Slimes are easy to keep because they only need water and are very friendly. Speaking of popularity, the popular ones would be the Animal-type monsters, and other than that, there are the Dragons. Well, the Dragons are indeed very popular, but they’re also very expensive, so they’re only for the wealthy.]","[I see, I certainly do see some Animal-shaped monsters on the streets sometimes. I almost never see people with a Dragon pets around though......]","In fact, the difference between monsters and animals is whether or not they had magic power, so there are many monsters that look like ordinary dogs and cats.","Of course, there are some monsters that are clearly deformed and some that are impossibly huge......","[Anyway, it sounds like fun, so let’s go there on your next day off, Sieg-san.]","[Yes.]","[Gruaa!]","[Unfortunately, it looks like pets aren’t allowed here, so you can’t come along, Bell. The same goes for the others too.]","[Guuu......]","Bell was looking so adorable as she was clearly disappointed by my answer, and just consoling her like made me feel sorry for her, so I decided to go a little farther for our stroll today.","I have some time to kill, and I think there’s a hill with a great view just outside the South Gate, so I guess we’ll extend our stroll up there.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Kuh...... Next up is Sieg huh.]","? ? ? : [Seems like it would be a Sieg Arc.]"]},{"number":1390,"title":"Chapter 1390 - Connection Event 2","paragraphs":["The location of the event wasn’t the Capital but another city in the Archlesia Empire, a city where Monster Races are so popular that it stands equal with the Capital, and where a number of famous races have been held.","Well, this time though, I didn’t come to see a Monster Race, but a monster connection event. The event is held at a facility that is usually used as a Monster Race field, and the venue is large enough for large monsters to race.","[It’s pretty crowded.]","[It’s a fairly famous event. Some of the people who want to keep monsters as pets come to this event and actually try out touching the monsters. I’m really looking forward to it!]","[Ahaha, Sieg-san does love animals after all.]","[Yes! The Six Kings Festival was great, but I’m looking forward to this event because the main attraction is the monsters that are popular as pets. I’m also looking forward to seeing Funny Rabbits.]","[When you say Funny Rabbits, you’re talking about that Rabbit-type monster that runs seriously only when hunting prey?]","The monster that Sieg-san happily mentioned sounded familiar. Back in the Monster Race I went with Alice, there was a rabbit-shaped monster that I bet on, that monster which turned serious only once every 100 years like Fate-san.","Come to think of it, when I brought Bell home, I think Sieg-san had mentioned something about “wanting to keep something like a Funny Rabbit as a pet”.","[Funny Rabbits are quite popular monsters. The fact that they look like large rabbits is a factor, but they tend to be laid-back and quiet, making them good monsters to keep indoors.]","[Fumu fumu.]","Now that she mentioned it, Funny Rabbits does look almost like a rabbit except for its horn, with about a meter in size. It has a laid-back personality which makes them uneager to run seriously when not hunting for prey, and from the way Sieg-san talks, it’s probably friendly as well.","Considering all that, it certainly wouldn’t be surprising that they’re so popular.","[Are there any other monsters typically kept as pets?]","[There are many different kinds, but the most popular are small-sized ones that can be kept indoors, and large-sized ones that can be ridden. Horse-type monsters can be raised and ridden just like normal horses, but they are stronger and faster than normal horses, so they are especially popular with knights and adventurers.]","[Seems like that aspect would be useful for Monster Races. Does that mean Bell is also considered a large-sized monster?]","[Bell-chan is considered as one. Behemoths are technically counted as large-sized monsters, but in terms of size, they can exceed 100m, so they could also be considered as colossal-sized monsters......]","After receiving various explanations from Sieg-san, we got in line and purchased admission tickets to enter the Monster Race track. Inside the racetrack with a considerable size, there were temporary fences and buildings here and there, and even at a quick glance, I could see quite a few different types of monsters.","From the looks of it, they seem to be sorted by type. As for how you enjoy the place, if you want to just look at them like in the zoo, you can just buy the admission ticket, but if you want close contact with the monsters, you would need to purchase a special ticket for each respective area. If anyone freely touched them, it would be stressful for the monsters, so the number of people who could touch them was limited.","In that case, there seems to be a limit on the number of monster contact tickets, so it’s necessary to go to the monsters you want to be in contact with as soon as possible.","[Fwaahhh, this is indeed a huge event! There are all kinds of monsters and even some rare species that I have never seen before...... Kaito-san! Let’s take a look around right away, where would you like to start?]","[Ahaha, sounds like fun. Errr, first, let’s go to the monsters that Sieg-san wants to see. There’s a restriction on monsters we can have contact with after all...... Looking at the pamphlet, it seems that the areas are divided by size.......]","[H- How troubling...... The small-sized ones are too precious, and the large-sized ones too..... but let’s go to the area for medium-sized species, which have more animal-type monsters.]","As I smiled at the considerably excited Sieg-san, we decided to go where Sieg-san wanted to go first.","The place Sieg-san chose was the area for medium-sized species......","[Medium-sized species would be those more than 5m and less than 10 m, right?]","[Ahh, no, that is the classification for Dragons. For general monsters, monsters less than 1m are referred to as small-sized, more than 1m but less than 5m are medium-sized, and those more than 5m are called large-sized species. As for the colossal-sized monsters, they are classified the same way as the Dragons, being those over 100m long...... but since the Dragons are generally larger in size to begin with, they are classified differently from the other species.]","[Heehhh...... So that’s how it is.]","I see. Come to think of it, there are monsters that are palm-sized like Slimes, so it might be natural that they would have a different classification method from Dragons.","At least none of the Dragons I’ve seen in the past were less than 1m in size. Even Lynn, who was still just a child, and Sela, when she had just been born from an egg, are over 1m long.","[Should we start out by looking for the Funny Rabbits Sieg-san mentioned?]","[That sounds great! Funny Rabbits are cute, and they’re so fluffy...... I’d like to touch their fur. I’ve never touched one because they are monsters that don’t live very often in the vicinity of Symphonia Kingdom.]","When I saw Sieg-san pulling my hand with a happy smile, a smile also naturally formed on my lips as I started to move along with her. Somehow, I have a feeling that we would have a good time today......","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Fuuuu...... I’m starting to feel like this is a date. It’s New Years’ Day, so I’m gonna go visit my parents back home.]","? ? ? : [This is your parents’ house.]","Serious-senpai : [......Move yourself out of the door.]","? ? ? : [If you want to pass through this door, you must defeat me first.]","Serious-senpai : [Stop with that impossible game......]"]},{"number":1391,"title":"Chapter 1391 - Connection Event 3","paragraphs":["After arriving at the area with medium-sized monsters, we walked around the area looking around a little and found the aforementioned Funny Rabbits.","Rather, Funny Rabbits seem to be popular, as so many people have gathered in their area. It also seemed like they’ve secured a good place for them, so the Funny Rabbits could be the centerpiece of the medium-sized area.","[There are quite a lot of people.]","[The Funny Rabbits really are popular huh. They don’t mind people touching them after all.]","[I mean, looking at them slacking around like that sure are cute.]","[Yes. Unlike the speed of their feet when they’re chasing prey, they’re monsters that normally don’t move around much and often lie down.]","These rabbits are really looking more and more like Fate-san. Even so, it certainly makes sense why they’re popular...... Seeing these big rabbits with their fluffy fur laying down lazily is quite cute.","While looking at the Funny Rabbits lying here and there, I bought interaction tickets for the both of us. It seems that the numbered areas are divided within the fence, and me and Sieg-san were in the 8th Area.","Basically, the keepers make adjustments so that there’s at least one Funny Rabbit in each area, but even if the Funny Rabbit moves out of the area, we were cautioned not to leave the area as we entered the fence.","Perhaps because Funny Rabbits are popular, it could be a problem if the guests were allowed to just move around as they pleased, so they divide areas and adjust how crowded each area is.","[Kaito-san! There’s a Funny Rabbit here already!]","[Ah, then, let’s go there———- Wait, you’re already there!?]","By the time I heard Sieg-san’s voice and moved my gaze, she had already moved to the Funny Rabbit. Smiling at her speed, I also approached the Funny Rabbit.","The Funny Rabbit was lying on the grassy ground and looked relaxed, not averse to Sieg-san’s petting.","Squatting down next to Sieg-san, I gently reached out my hand to the Funny Rabbit. As Sieg-san was stroking its body, I stroked the head, being careful not to touch its horn.","The fur on the rabbit’s body is quite fluffy and warm, with its body temperature high. Its horn is quite sharp, but it’s covered to prevent injuring the guests, so there seems to be no danger.","[It’s so cute.]","[Yes! Touching it feels so moving. No wonder they’re so popular...... It’s so soft to the touch, and its behavior is adorable.]","[Ahaha, it looks like you’re having fun. Sieg-san seems to be having fun, so I’m happy too...... Unnn?]","[Oya?]","When my hand that was stroking the Funny Rabbit’s head stopped while I’m enjoying Sieg-san’s appearance, Funny Rabbit rubbed her head against my hand.","It felt as if it was insisting on “more petting”, so when I stroked its head again, the Funny Rabbit narrowed its eyes and returned to its relaxed posture.","[How unusual. For the Funny Rabbit to behave like a spoiled child...... Speaking of which, this was the same with Lynn-chan and when we went on a trip before, but animals and monsters easily get emotionally attached to Kaito-san.]","[Come to think of it, I think I heard that it was due to the influence of Shiro-san’s blessing.]","[I think that’s an enviable ability. In any case, the Funny Rabbit is cute.]","[Looking at it being that carefree feels nice. However, it runs very fast. I also saw it back in the Monster Race, and it had swiftly won the race.]","[They are famous for their swiftness when chasing prey after all. Well, the Funny Rabbits here are all raised kits, so it’s almost impossible for them to run...... It made it so that the scene of them running became precious though, and I myself had never seen it before.]","Indeed, considering the fact that it only really runs when hunting prey, it may almost never run if it’s in an environment where it can be fed.","When you think about this, it was an extremely rare occurrence for them to run in the Monster Race, so it’s understandable why it got a very high multiplier back then.","[Indeed, seeing them running quickly would be quite cool. I’d also like to see it run again...... Arehh?]","Just after I muttered that, the Funny Rabbit we were patting slowly got up. After glancing at me, with a snap, it started running.","Then, after circling around the big fence at a tremendous speed, it came back in front of us and laid down again.","[......Did it perhaps listen to what we said and ran?]","[Monsters seem to understand human language to some extent, so it’s not impossible. Normally though, they still wouldn’t run......]","[I see...... Thanks for showing us how you look while running.]","I called out to Funny Rabbit and patted it on the head again, to which Funny Rabbit comfortably squinted its eyes. Thanks to the Funny Rabbit’s thoughtfulness, I was glad to see something nice.","[......Ummm, excuse me. Are you by any chance a famous breeder?]","[You’re mistaken, I’m not.]","Well, hearing the keeper in charge of the area approach me and ask me that right after feels slightly perplexing......","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [A Special Individual Behemoth child who is already stronger than an adult, a White Dragon child who is undergoing Special Evolution...... No, even though this was just not known to the world, isn’t he already a breeder of a sufficiently abnormal level?]"]},{"number":1392,"title":"Chapter 1392 - Connection Event 4","paragraphs":["After interacting with the Funny Rabbits, we decided to continue looking around the medium-sized monster area. It seems that there are many Animal-shaped monsters among the medium-sized monsters, including monsters that looked like horses, which looked indistinguishable from ordinary horses if I weren’t told. There were also monsters like Funny Rabbits, which were animals that were supposed to be small in size but had become huge.","[Look over there, Kaito-san, that monster......]","Sieg-san seems to be having a lot of fun, as she looked around at monsters here and there while pulling my hand. As for close interaction with them, since we wouldn’t have enough time to interact with all the monsters, we just planned to interact with the small-sized monsters next time, so we’re currently focused on observing them.","It’s somewhat like having a date at an amusement park. Perhaps, because there are so many animal-type monsters......","[This monster, from this angle......]","[Ahh......]","[Unnn? Is something the matter?]","[Ahh, no, you were just too sudden, so I was a little surprised.]","We were holding hands until a few minutes ago, but when we were looking at a monster in front of a fence, Sieg-san was hugging my arm so tightly.","It was soft to the touch and I could feel the warmth from her body, but as I hadn’t expected it, I was a little surprised.","[I- I’m sorry. I got a little too excited.","[Ahh, no, don’t worry about it. Seeing Sieg-san having fun makes me happy too...... There’s also the fact that I was happy being hugged.]","[Fufufu, I see...... In that case, I don’t need to be reserved about this, right?]","After hearing my words, Sieg-san happily smiled and hugged me again. Perhaps because there are lots of animal-type monsters that she likes, Sieg-san looks a little more childish than usual today, which made me feel her cuteness again.","It’s rare for her to act spoiled like she was now, so I suppose it’s a privilege of a lover to be able to see her like that.","[That’s quite a lot of fur.]","[This monster lives in a cold region, so it has a lot of fur to protect itself from the cold.]","[I see, it looks pleasant to the touch.]","[Uuuu, I- I’d certainly also like to touch it...... but if we were to buy interaction tickets to touch it now and waited for our turn, the small-sized monsters...... Uuuu, this is troubling.]","[In that case, would you like to go check out the small-sized monsters first and come back for them later? And then, if the tickets haven’t sold out yet, we could try touching their fur.]","[I see...... Let’s do that!]","It’s not that we had to go redeem the tickets immediately as soon as we bought them. The number of monsters is limited, so if many people approach at once, they will get scared.","As for the monsters which are few in numbers, it’s necessary to wait for a certain amount of time as they set a time limit, so we will have to wait a certain amount of time. That being the case, we will have to consider that when choosing our movements.","[Is there a small-sized monster that you want to touch?]","[There is a monster called Petite Devi, a cute little black goat-like monster that is very popular but...... it’s a considerably rare monster, so the chance to touch one is quite precious.]","[Petite Devi...... Does it have anything to do with Daemons?]","[It’s not directly related, but it’s called that because it has a tail that resembles that of Daemons......]","While listening to Sieg-san’s explanation, we went to the small-sized monster area anded headed to the fence where the Petite Devi was. It seems that there were still a number of interaction tickets available, so we were able to buy them, but at the time we bought them, there was already a “Sold Out Soon” signpost, so I could see that they were quite popular.","[There’s quite a line formed here.]","[Petite Devis are so popular that they are featured in magazines after all.]","[Heehhh......]","When I look at the fence while lining up with Sieg-san in the fairly long line...... Even though she said it looked like a black goat, I could see a cute, chibified fluffball of a monster, about 30 cm tall.","Ah~~ I see, I understand now that I’ve seen them. That monster certainly looks cute, so it won’t be strange that it will be popular.","[Are Petite Devis really that rare?]","[One of the reasons is that they basically live only in the Demon Realm, so there aren’t many opportunities to see them in the Human Realm...... Most of all, they aren’t the kind that gives birth to children, and since they’re monsters that are born from magic power, it’s not possible to especially increase their numbers. They’re also monsters that don’t form swarms and act alone......]","[Ah~~ They’re small in size, hard to find, cute, and popular as pets...... so it’s certainly no wonder there’s such a line for them.]","It seems to be a fairly rare monster, and with the location of this fence, it seemed like they are the main centerpiece of the small-monster area, so I can see how popular they are.","Well, I’m really glad we came here early...... If we had come all this way only to find that the tickets were sold out, Sieg-san would have been sad.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [The sugar content has increased...... Well, it was still within acceptable range...... b- but..... at this rate......]","? ? ? : [Well, they are in a venue with lots of people after all. The main event would start after they’re all alone, right? If that event lasts until night, wouldn’t it also be possible that they would stay the night?]","Serious-senpai : [Can you not say stupid stuff!? What the heck do you think Teleportation Magic Tools are for!? Just for show!? Listen here, okay, you two...... Go home properly!!!]"]},{"number":1393,"title":"Chapter 1393 - Connection Event 5","paragraphs":["The line for the Petite Devis took quite a long time, but as they had prepared a good number of Petite Devis themselves, it took about an hour for our turn to come around.","Incidentally, we were told that we had 15 minutes to interact with it, and when Sieg-san and I moved to the fence with our designated number, there was one Petite Devi just like when we went to visit the Funny Rabbit.","Its overall round silhouette was covered with fuzzy fur...... Its image does look similar to that of a furball. With its round body, small Japanese curly horns, big, round and cute eyes, and Daemon-like tail...... I see, this certainly is cute.","[Devi?]","[C- Cute......]","It mewled “Devi”. Maybe its name “Petite Devi” comes not from its tail but from its mewls. In any case, Sieg-san’s eyes twinkled as she reached out for the cute Petite Devi, whose cuteness was commensurate with her popularity.","[Devi, devi!]","[Ohh, it climbed up Sieg-san’s hand. It seems to be quite friendly.]","[Petite Devis are very popular as pets because they tend to be very friendly and sweet to people. Haahhh...... It’s so cute.]","The Petite Devi seemed to have quite a friendly disposition and was extremely adorable as it happily jumped and bounced on top of Sieg-san’s outstretched hand.","I reached out and touched it too, and it was fluffy to the touch, almost like I was touching a cloud...... no, more like cotton candy.","[Deviii!]","Perhaps, as it was happy to be touched, it stretched out its long and thin tail and happily wrapped it around my hand. How should I say this...... all of its gestures are so cute...... With them being like this, it certainly wouldn’t be strange for them to be popular.","[It’s no wonder they’re popular.]","[Yes. Moreover, this one looked like it’s groomed well, as its fur looks nice and shiny.]","[Ahh, I get what you mean. It would be difficult to achieve this feeling unless they took really good care of it. It has persistently curly fur, so the breeder must be considerably skilled for its fur to be so beautifully arranged.]","I know this because I’m also very attentive about Bell’s fur and am confident about my brushing skills. The shine of this Petite Devi’s fur is something that can only be produced with very careful grooming.","The brushes used for the large Bell and the small Petite Devi may be different...... but I’d love to know what kind of shampoo they use for its fur.","I also use the pretty good stuff for Bell, but if I’m allowed to be a bit greedy, I’d like her fur to be a little softer. The gloss and texture of her fur is already enough...... but if it’s possible, it might be better to make several new special shampoos by special order. I guess I’ll ask Alice about this next time.","[Kaito-san, would you like to try carrying it?]","[Well, since we’re at it...... Ah, it’s a lot lighter than it looks. Is it because it has a lot of fur? Moreover, it feels good to the touch. You’re quite loved, aren’t you~~]","[Devi, devi.]","I don’t know if it understood what I meant when I spoke to it, but the Petite Devi happily waved its body. Hmmm, it really is quite cute. It’s just, how should I say this...... Monsters that can fit in your hand seem to have this cuteness that other monsters don’t.","After admiring the Petite Devi’s cuteness in my hand for a little while, I moved it back to Sieg-san’s hand. Sieg-san frolicking with the Petite Devi was quite cute, as she enjoyed herself with a smile.","[......Sieg-san, wouldn’t it be alright if we could keep a Petite Devi?]","[That’s a fascinating idea, but they’re hard to come by.]","[Ahh~~ You did mention how they’re rare.]","[Yes, you would need quite the connections to...... connections to...... Errr......]","[......Ummm, it might just be me...... but I feel like if I ask someone...... I think I could somehow manage to do it.]","[What a coincidence. I was just thinking the same thing.]","Indeed, it would normally be something difficult to obtain one but...... Unnn, I think I could work something out. I mean, it feels like if I ask Chris-san or someone connected with her for one, they’d give it to us.","[......Well, if you want to keep one, let me know. I’ll go consult someone I know.]","[That’s a fascinating idea...... so I’ll carefully consider it.]","As for me, I’d be willing to cooperate if it were for Sieg-san’s sake, but Sieg-san herself seemed to be having second thoughts about this. I think she’s probably thinking that she’s causing trouble for me or something like that.","However, she had been glancing at the Petite Devi, and had mentioned that the idea was fascinating, so perhaps the day when she actually asks me to do that may be sooner rather than later.","Well, since it’s Sieg-san we’re talking about here, there are probably many other monsters that she would want to keep, and even if she does want to keep something, it’s possible that she’ll have second thoughts about which monster to keep as a pet...... Whatever the case, I think I would be able to get us most of the monsters somehow, so if I get the chance, I will help her.","With these thoughts in mind, I enjoyed the company of the Petite Devi along with Sieg-san for a short while.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [He certainly can work something out about it huh. Rather, if he just says a few words to that guy in the Sanctuary, she might even create a new one for them.]"]},{"number":1394,"title":"Chapter 1394 - Connection Event 6","paragraphs":["After playing with the Petite Devi in the small-sized monsters area, we decided to move to the large-sized monsters area next. In the large-sized monsters area, there are monsters over 5m in size, which means that each and every one of them would be huge.","The Red Dragon and Fenrir I saw in the Monster Race were also here. Rather, this Fenrir has a scar on its chest that looks like a hole has been sealed up, so couldn’t this be the same Fenrir Bell had shot with her Breath?","[Here in the large-sized monsters area, there aren’t many monsters you can directly interact with huh?]","[There are a lot of them with rough temperaments after all. Because of the magic casted on them, they aren’t able to harm people, but even so, many people are scared of them when beings of that size threaten them.]","Incidentally, even if the fences surrounding them are broken, the monsters here aren’t allowed to go outside because there’s a Barrier Magic surrounding them in place, but even if that were the case, many of the monsters couldn’t be directly interacted with because of the possibility of a panic occurring.","However, the guests are allowed to touch the quieter monsters.","[Understandable, I guess. Not everyone is as docile and nice as Bell.]","[......Rather, Behemoths were originally monsters with a considerably rough temper...... It was just that Bell-chan is deeply attached to Kaito-san, so she follows Kaito-san’s instructions properly.]","Now that Sieg-san mentioned it, that certainly was the case. To me, Bell is a docile and cute monster, but Behemoths...... Even though that one I met before seemed to have felt despair, they were originally beings who would attack even Lillywood-san, who was overwhelmingly superior to them, so if you think about it, they might have a rough temperament.","[As expected, there are no colossal-sized monsters here huh.]","[They do have to consider the space of the venue for them after all. Besides, when it comes to colossal-sized monsters, most of them would be Dragons. Unlike the large-sized Red Dragons that are recognized as monsters, capturing a Dragon that is recognized as a Demon is like picking a fight with Dragon King-sama, so it’s basically illegal to catch colossal-sized monsters. Well, colossal-sized monsters are quite strong in the first place, so even if someone tries, they won’t be able to capture them easily. Incidentally, there are a few colossal-sized monsters that aren’t recognized as Demons...... monsters with low intelligence, but they’re under the protection of Dragon King-sama.]","Come to think of it, putting aside those with several tens of meters in size, I don’t think I’ve ever seen monsters exceeding 100m that aren’t Dragons or Demons. After all, Dragons that grow to that size are highly intelligent, so they probably won’t go on a rampage recklessly.","[I see...... Unfortunately, it seems that the interaction tickets for this area are sold out. I suppose we can just take a look around, but what should we do after that? It would be boring to go home right after finishing the tour, and it will be evening by the time we finish the tour, so would you like to have dinner somewhere?]","We had to line up to interact with the monsters along the way, so some time had passed, and since the venue itself was so large, it felt like it would be evening by the time we finished looking around.","When I asked her what we were going to do after we finished the tour, Sieg-san looked at me a little hesitantly and then slowly opened her mouth.","[......A- Actually, you see, there’s also an evening session at this event, and there are some monsters I would like to see at that session as well......]","[An evening session?]","[Yes, there are a lot of nocturnal monsters there......]","[Ahh, now that you mentioned it, there would certainly be something like that huh. Well then, after dinner, let’s go back and look around the evening session. Even if we get late here, we can just go home quickly with the Teleportation Magic Tool anyway.]","[......A- About that!]","[Yes?]","Convinced that there would certainly be an evening session for the nocturnal monsters, just as I thought it was decided that we would be touring the evening session as well, Sieg-san looked as if she had made up her mind about something. Her face also seemed to be blushing a bit.","[Umm, we went out of our way to go on a distant trip, so wouldn’t it be rather bland for it to just be a day trip? Why don’t we stay the night before going home?]","[We certainly don’t have to rush going home, and since I haven’t seen any other places other than this venue, that does sound like a good idea...... but do you think we can just find a place to stay right away?]","[Actually...... Errr, I’ve already made reservations in advance.]","[Eh? Is that right...... For me too?]","[Yes. I’m sorry it took me so long to tell you.]","[Ah, no, that’s no problem, but here, for the lodging fees......]","It seems that Sieg-san had already booked an inn. Naturally, there are no online reservations in this world, so Sieg-san must have come to this city once and made the reservation beforehand.","Most of the inn fees are basically paid in advance, and the fact that my room is also reserved means that Sieg-san has already paid for me, so I took out my wallet to hand over the money. However, Sieg-san stopped me.","[No, I was always indebted to Kaito-san, and this was something I did of my own volition, so I’ll pay for this myself.]","[......I- I see, I understand.]","Sieg-san’s expression is filled with strong will, so it seemed like it would be better to just obediently accept her kindness. When I nodded, thinking that I would pay for our dinner instead, Sieg-san softly whispered something.","[......Since I’ve reserved a room for us......]","[Eh? Did you say something?]","[I didn’t say anything! Now, let’s go!]","I couldn’t hear her because her voice was too quiet, so I asked her back, but Sieg-san just shook her head, pulled my hand, and started to walk forward, looking a bit flustered.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [A- Aaahhh...... Uwaaahhhh!?]","? ? ? : [Whoa, Sieg-san’s coming in with a strong offensive. It seems like sugar production would soon be increasing.]"]},{"number":1395,"title":"Chapter 1395 - Connection Event 7","paragraphs":["Leaving the venue of the event, we headed for the city. Since the nighttime session was supposed to be a separate event, we bought a separate ticket for us as well.","I heard that the event site will be closed from 7:00 to 8:00 pm, and the daytime session will be replaced by the nighttime session, so we plan to come back around 8:00 pm.","As for what we should eat here in this city, I checked out Kuro’s Eating Tour in its Entirety Guide. As always, this Eating Tour Guide is very useful.","Incidentally, this guide is updated by Kuro every now and then, so it usually includes new restaurants that have just opened recently.","[Sieg-san, is there anything you want to eat?]","[Hmmm, since we’re here, I’d like to try some of the famous dishes around here.]","[Ahh, I’d certainly also like to try some of the local specialties......]","As I flipped through the pages, one page caught my eye. Kuro has given it a rather high 8 stars, and in the remarks column, she described it as a rare dish that is hard to find in other cities.","Looking at its descriptions...... It looks like okonomiyaki. The restaurant was opened by a past Hero representative who stayed in this world and it now has a history of 400 years.","[Sieg-san, how would you like this restaurant? I read that you can eat something similar to okonomiyaki from the world I was in.]","[That’s the first time I’ve heard of that dish. I’m interested in it, so let’s go there.]","[Yes.]","After deciding on okonomiyaki, I looked at the restaurant’s location in the Eating Tour Guide...... and found that unlike what I had imagined, it looked like a very upscale restaurant.","We went there to confirm if it would be alright to come without reservation, we got the okay and were immediately guided inside. It was a completely private room, and there was a table with a griddle in the center of the spacious room.","[This place feels more upscale than I imagined.]","[Was it different in the world you were in, Kaito-san?]","[Okonomiyaki is more like commoner food......]","[I suppose it’s because it’s very rare to find otherworld dishes. In this world, things like the ingredients for them tend to be expensive. Rice, for example, is comparatively expensive.]","[I see.]","I guess that difference is something that can’t be helped huh...... Kaori-san also said that the purchase price of rice here is high, and that there are ingredients that are hard to come by, so it’s possible that even dishes that I considered cheap can be expensive in this world.","A little while after we sat down, a waiter came to ask for our order. It seems that you can choose whether to bake them yourself or be served with already-baked okonomiyaki...... I decided to just have something already baked brought to us.","Well...... I’m not really confident I can turn it over cleanly, and in the first place, I’m not sure if they follow the same procedure as the okonomiyaki I know......","[Come to think of it, we still have time until 8:00 pm after we eat our meal, don’t we?]","[Do you want to go shopping somewhere nearby after we finish eating?]","[Ahh, that sounds great. It looks like a good way to pass the time. Is there anything you would like to buy, Sieg-san?]","[Let’s see...... How about clothes? It gets a little chilly at night, so I brought a jacket, but since we’re at it, let’s check out if we can get other options to wear.]","I have Shiro-san’s blessing, so the cold doesn’t really bother me, but it’s true that Archlesia Empire is a land with cooler temperatures. As Sieg-san is wearing a sleeveless outfit, I guess she would feel chilly.","[Rather, aren’t you feeling chilly, Sieg-san? I think it would be pretty cold for the season......]","[Ahh, even if I’m wearing thin clothes, since I’m protecting myself with magic power, it isn’t really too cold.]","[Ahh, I see.]","[It’s one of the compulsory magic for knights. The problem is that the performance of the magic degrades with temperature changes...... Well, there’s a limit to the temperature that can be adjusted...... Well, there’s a limit to the temperature change you can adjust, so I still feel chilly...... Kaito-san, you’re under the effect of Shallow Vernal-sama’s blessing, right?]","[Yes, I’m alright even with temperatures as low as those in the Land of Death.]","The Land of Death is a place plunged in ice and snow, so it should be a considerably cold place, but I don’t feel chilly there at all. As for heat, according to Shiro-san, it’s even possible for me to swim in lava. This effect alone is more than enough to make Shiro-san’s Blessing quite outrageous.","[As expected of Shallow Vernal-sama’s Blessing. By the way, Kaito-san. I’m changing the subject....... Or rather, I’m returning to our earlier subject, but do you have any favorite clothes?]","[We’re talking about what I would wear? If so, it would have to be a parka like I’m wearing. To be honest, I don’t really care much about my other clothing, but I just can’t calm myself unless I’m wearing a parka.]","I have a lot of various pants and shirts, but only this parka is my favorite that I bought multiples of them. I suppose it’s kind of like my trademark, so not wearing this just doesn’t feel right.","[I understand how you feel. I also don’t feel comfortable unless I have a scarf around my neck......]","[By the way, Sieg-san, do you have any favorite clothes?]","[Let’s see...... I guess it really would have to be clothes that are easy to move around in in the forest.]","[Ahh, that really has to be important huh.]","Come to think of it, I feel like she also said something like that at the store when we went shopping for clothes for the Six Kings Festival, and feeling somewhat nostalgic, I smiled.","Just like that, I enjoyed the time chatting with Sieg-san until our food arrived.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Considering the previous chapters, the suffix numbers after the titles is up to ?...... So there would be at least 5 more chapters before that night ☆connection☆ event starts...... I’m scared.","? ? ? : [The heck is with that ☆...... Not only is that old-school, but don’t you think it’s lame?]","Serious-senpai : [Whoa there, can you not do any more damage to my psyche? I’ll cry here, you know?]"]},{"number":1396,"title":"Chapter 1396 - Connection Event 8","paragraphs":["<Author’s Notes>","I didn’t have much time to write today, so today’s chapter is short.","The okonomiyaki they served here was just normal okonomiyaki. There was nothing strange or luxurious about it, nor did it seem to have any otherworld-like arrangements added.","To me, it was just ordinary tasty okonomiyaki, but it seems like Sieg-san has never had this before and was tasting it with great interest.","After finishing our meal, we decided to go shopping for clothes as we had talked about earlier. Though I say that, this was the first time for both Sieg-san and I to visit this city, so we looked for clothing stores along the way.","This city was apparently famous for its Monster Races, so it seems to be a city that puts a lot of effort into tourism, so not just stores selling souvenirs, there was a fairly large number of stores around.","[The place is quite lively. I guess it’s because this place is famous as a tourist spot?]","[The Monster Races here are famous, so there are lots of souvenirs...... or rather, monster-related items being sold.]","After listening to Sieg-san’s words and looking around, there are certainly many monster-related items. They even have monster plushies here.","I wonder if there are any Bell or Lynn plushies here...... No, I know there’s no way that’s possible, but I would like to have them if I see something close to that.","While I was thinking about that, we found a clothing store and went inside.","[......Hmmm, this is troubling.]","[Can’t find a design you like?]","[No, that’s not it. I don’t get the chance to wear jackets very often, so I’m not sure which one I should buy...... Kaito-san, which one would you think is best?]","[What I think? Errr......]","Certainly, Sieg-san doesn’t have many chances to wear a jacket, so it would be difficult for her to say what kind of clothes look good on her. Sieg-san asked me to check out the clothes with her, but I can’t find any of these that makes me feel “That’s it”.","No, I mean, I think all of them would look good on Sieg-san but...... choosing between all these is troubling.","[......I certainly can’t find anything that stands out over the others. Since Sieg-san was the one wearing it, I think something with a slightly brighter color would be nice......]","[It’s true that most of these had an overall dark color scheme...... Ahh, this one.]","[Did you find an outfit you like?]","[No, I just thought it resembles the clothing Kaito-san is wearing.]","Saying that, Sieg-san showed me a hooded parka, which certainly looked a lot like the one I was wearing.","Since this one seems to be oriented for women, wearing it feels a little refreshing, but the color and the feel of the hood do resemble my parka.","[It certainly looks very similar.]","[......I think I’ll try this one out. Look, I thought it would be nice to have a pair look with Kaito-san.]","[I see...... That sounds great.]","Certainly, her wearing that looks like we’re getting pair outfits, something that feels lover-like. I do feel a bit embarrassed, but I think that’s a great idea.","There were no other clothes like this, so it seems that she decided to buy that parka, and Sieg-san immediately bought that clothing and wore it.","[What do you think?]","[It looks good on you. When you have it in your hand, it doesn’t really feel that special, but when you actually put it on, it really suits you. You look beautiful.]","[T- Thank you. Hearing you say that makes me happy.]","Sieg-san, wearing a parka with a matching shade to mine, looked quite good in it, adding a lovely vibe to her mature look.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Come to think of it, I suppose this would be the first time Kaito would have pairing outfits with his lovers?]","? ? ? : [Well, you can say that Anima-san had that first time since they kinda did have matching looks back in the Six Kings Festival, but since that was the result of a minor change between Web Novel and Light Novel, I also feel like that would be something slightly different.]"]},{"number":1397,"title":"Chapter 1397 - Connection Event 9","paragraphs":["After we finished shopping for clothes, we visited a few stores and came back to the venue just as the event was about to start. Buying evening session tickets for the both of us, we entered the venue, which looked very different from the daytime session.","The overall atmosphere was dark and fantastical, and although there was a certain amount of brightness, I had the impression that many of the lights were darker.","[The atmosphere certainly feels like nighttime.]","[Among nocturnal monsters, there are many species that don’t like light, so they’re being particularly careful about the lighting in the area.]","[......At a glance, there seemed to be many bird-shaped monsters.]","[Unlike the daytime session, the evening session is divided not by size, but by species, so this area would be for the bird-type monsters.]","[Ahhh, I see, so that’s why they’re all birds here.]","Now that she mentioned it, when I looked around, there were certainly only birds. There are monsters that look like huge owls, and there are many birds that look a little creepy.","I’m confident that I would scream if I unexpectedly encountered one of these on the street at night.","[......Come to think of it, which monster do you want to see, Sieg-san? Considering the limited number of interaction tickets, it’s better if we go check them early on, right?]","[ahh, you’re right. It’s a very popular monster and there are only a few of them, so heading there first might be better.]","[What kind of monster is it?]","[It’s a monster called Blue Ear, known for its large ears, and it’s called that because its ears glow blue when it’s ready for battle. As for its appearance...... It looks like a bear.]","[......Fumu.]","When she says it looks like a bear, it doesn’t feel like she’s talking about the cute type of bear...... Well, there are also other kinds of bears like pandas, and since they’re popular, they might be surprisingly cute.","With this in mind, I moved along with Sieg-san and arrived at the fence we were looking for. Perhaps because we came early, there weren’t many people yet, so it seemed like we could buy interaction tickets and directly interact with them right away.","[Ahh, look over there, Kaito-san! Over there. It’s so cute!]","[Eh? ......That is...... Ahh, I see......]","After we bought the interaction ticket and got in line, Sieg-san excitedly pointed inside the fence, and when I turned to look, I saw the Blue Ear.","How should I say this...... Unnn. I’ll just say this clearly...... It’s a “big koala”. A koala the size of a bear...... This certainly would be popular.","It was soon our turn to directly interact with the koala, so Sieg-san and I approached the Blue Ear. The Blue Ear looked quite precious in its docile state, sitting on the ground in a teddy bear-like posture, staring at us as we approached.","[Haahhh...... It’s so cute. They’re rare monsters, so the chance to touch them directly is rare.]","[It’s very docile.]","[Blue Ears are herbivorous and mild-mannered. Even if they aren’t bound by magic, they don’t usually attack people. However, when their ears are shining blue, they are ready for battle, so you need to be careful at moments like those...... Haahhh, it’s so soft......]","[The feel of its ear is interesting. It’s squishy, and touching it feels like it’s going to become a habit.]","Even when Sieg-san and I reached out to touch it, the Blue Ear was relaxed, and although it sometimes moved its body, seemingly feeling ticklish, it basically let us do as we wanted.","[Ahh, Kaito-san, please wait. We can feed the Blue Ears here, so I’ll go buy some food from the keeper.]","[Eh? Ah, yes.]","Sieg-san went to buy some food, so I had a one-on-one with the Blue Ear for a little while. However, as it has the size of a bear, it’s quite big. I would normally have been scared of something like this, but it’s currently really docile and isn’t showing any hostility toward me at all.","When I patted its head, the comfortable expression it makes looks so cute, and although it’s quite docile, its reactions are friendly, so I feel like I understand why it’s popular just by interacting with it for a little while.","While doing so, Sieg-san came back after buying food.","[Arehh? Are those ripples?]","[Yes. Blue Ears like fruits so...... Here you go.]","When Sieg-san held the ripple in her hand and held it out, the Blue Ear held it between its hands and began munching it.","[It’s so cute and comforting isn’t it?]","[Yes. It looks very cute. Ahh, Kaito-san, please try to feed it too. I heard each person can feed it once.]","[Then, when it finished eating the current one......]","I received a ripple from Sieg-san, and seeing that the Blue Ear had finished eating the ripple in its hand, I held the ripple I had in my hand.","Thereupon, the Blue Ear grabbed the ripple with both hands, just like it did with Sieg-san. In doing so, I could feel its plump paw pads, which was quite pleasant.","[Even so, it sure like ripples just as much as I do...... Unnn?]","[Fufu, I think it heard what Kaito-san said just now.]","[Ahaha, thanks. However, I’m alright, so you can eat it all.]","The reason why the Blue Ear, hearing my murmurs, presented the half-eaten ripple to me was probably that it heard I also like ripples and tried to share it with me.","While being soothed by its charming behavior, Sieg-san and I enjoyed petting it for a while.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Tell me! How many more chapters until the transition from the Connection Event to that lovey-dovey accommodation event!? Three chapters?]","? ? ? : [I think this Connection Event arc lasts until the next chapter.]","Serious-senpai : [Wait, isn’t that too fast!?]"]},{"number":1398,"title":"Chapter 1398 - A Night Spent with Sieg 1","paragraphs":["The nighttime monsters were quite enjoyable as they were different from the daytime monsters. Many of the nocturnal monsters had darker colors, like the NIght Dragons which were mysterious and beautiful.","Although she isn’t nocturnal, I think that Sieg-san’s pet Sela is also a monster that looks good at night. With its black body and wings shining like an aurora, she’s very attractive-looking.","Also, although she isn’t a monster, Nebula also looked like she’d look good at night. Perhaps it’s because of her unique starry sky-like hair that makes me think so.","In any case, when we fully enjoyed the evening interaction event, it was already late. It was now 10:00 pm, and it was time for us to go to our inn.","The nighttime event is supposed to last until 2:00 am, but there were fewer people around compared to the daytime event, so we were able to look around and meet several monsters in 2 hours.","[......Sieg-san, are there any other monsters you are interested in?]","[No, we’ve already seen everything, and it’s getting late, so let’s move on to the inn.]","[Alright.]","I was wondering if there were other monsters Sieg-san wanted to directly interact with, but it seems like Sieg-san was also thinking about moving back to the inn already.","After walking for a while, we arrived at a...... very high-class inn.","[Eh? Sieg-san, we’re staying here?]","[Yes. This way.]","[......It’s a rather expensive inn, isn’t it?]","[I heard nobles and the like were staying here.]","[Eh? Then, this place must be quite expensive...... As expected, shouldn’t I take out money for this?]","This city seems to be famous as a tourist destination, so it’s not surprising that there are luxury inns here. However, if this is an inn that was even used by nobles, the price for a night here should be quite expensive.","Thinking this, I suggested compensating her for the fees, but Sieg-san shook her head with a wry smile.","[It’s alright. It’s true that in the past, it would have been financially difficult for me to stay in a place like this....... but I now have a lot of savings, so I was able to get us a good inn. I’m going to be staying here with Kaito-san, so I think it would be nice to have a good place for us.]","[I see...... Well, I’ve decided I’ll be presuming upon your kindness this time, so if that’s what Sieg-san says, I’ll obediently accept it. However, the next time we’re in a situation like this, Sieg-san, then it will be my treat.]","[Fufufu, yes. I’m looking forward to our next outing.]","As we were having such an exchange, we entered the inn and received the key from the receptionist...... a single key...... arehh?","[Ummm, Sieg-san? The receptionist only gave us one key though?]","[That, she did.]","[What about the key to my room?]","[It’s this key.]","[......The key for Sieg-san’s room then?]","[It’s this key. Ahh, it’s alright! I- I reserved a twin room for us, so there are two beds there.]","No, I’m not really talking about that...... but looking at Sieg-san, it seems that she reserved a twin room for us on purpose, not because of a reservation mistake or because there were no rooms available.","And although this is just my hunch, Sieg-san...... feels like she’s trying to force this through.","[W- Well, talking about this at the reception would trouble the others so let’s go to our room.]","[Eh? Ah, yes.]","We could also get a new room for us since we’re here at the reception, but I didn’t opt to do that, as I started to move as urged by Sieg-san.","While Sieg-san walked forward holding my hand in front of me, her face was blushing so red that I could tell from behind...... though it would be uncouth to point that out here.","After lightly exhaling, I decided to follow Sieg-san’s intentions for the time being.","When I arrived at our room and went inside, I found that the room was quite spacious and there was a large table by the window. It looked like a really nice room, with a fairly large bath and several magic tools provided for us.","[This is...... a pretty nice room.]","[It’s spacious, isn’t it? I had heard about this before so I had somewhat expected it, but I was still surprised when I saw it in person.]","[We’ve walked quite a lot, so why don’t we sit down and take some rest?]","[Good idea. By the way, do you want to drink some alcohol? I thought something like this might happen, so I brought the fruit wine I drank with Kaito-san before.]","[That one we drank in Rigforeshia? It was quite delicious, so I’m looking forward to it.","The fruit wine that Sieg-san is referring to is the alcohol that we drank together in that area of her parents’ house that resembled a porch back when I came along to visit Sieg-san’s hometown, Rigforeshia.","It was sweet fruit wine made with ripples, and I remembered how it was quite delicious. Since we’re at it, I decided to serve a variety of snacks as well. I think something simple like nuts would be good to go with the sweet drink.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Hyiiiihhhh...... S- She’s on quite the offensive......]","T/N: Mistranslation on c1397, me thinking that there was still one more chapter before the title change, changed."]},{"number":1399,"title":"Chapter 1399 - A Night Spent with Sieg 2","paragraphs":["Taking out two glasses and our snacks, I sat down facing Sieg-san at the table provided in our room in the inn. The clear, slightly yellowish fruit wine had a sweet scent that made me feel relaxed.","[Speaking of which, I don’t often see you drinking, Sieg-san?]","[I could only drink alcohol as strong as fruit wines, and I don’t even like alcohol that much...... or so I decided]","[You decided?]","[Yes, my body had been a wreck here and there before it was healed, and the doctor had told me not to drink alcoholic beverages in the first place, so I don’t drink. And so, the alcohol we drank together back in Rigforeshia was the first alcohol I’ve drank for several years.]","[I see......]","Come to think of it, Sieg-san herself had mentioned that Sieg-san had a rather tattered body until she recovered from eating the Fruit of the World Tree, and that she had been glossing it over by constantly using Body Strengthening Magic.","And about this matter, Sieg-san had been hiding it from Lilia-san and the others in order not to make them feel responsible, keeping it to herself......","Certainly, if she had an injury as serious as that, it wouldn’t be strange if she got an alcohol ban from at least one doctor.","[However, after drinking for the first time in a long while, as expected, it was easy for me to get drunk. After that, I didn’t have a chance to drink, so I didn’t drink...... this alcohol we would be drinking today would also be my first time in a long while.]","[Then, we’d better keep the pace down then. There’s also water, so we can drink slowly......]","[......Well, as far as today is concerned, I want things to go with the momentum...... so I’d rather get drunk......]","[Unnn?]","[Ahh, no, it’s nothing!]","Just now, she said it rather softly...... but she wanted to get drunk? With her personality, I thought Sieg-san would be the kind of person who wouldn’t want to be seen by others drunk......","In the first place, Sieg-san had been acting a bit strange here and there today. Rather than anxious, it felt like Sieg-san was feeling kinda restless....... I thought that was because she was having a lot of fun at the interaction event, but there are some instances where that reasoning can’t explain.","In the first place, both of us have Teleportation Magic Tools, and even though we haven’t talked about this in advance, it was strange that she booked an inn and assumed we would be staying the night.","If it had been the usual Sieg-san, she would have consulted with me in advance if she planned to stay the night but...... such a thing didn’t happen this time.","On the contrary, there was also her current state, seemingly trying to force her way forward with the momentum, in a way that isn’t like her......","This is just my guess, but perhaps, for example, she had some goal in mind, but she had been hesitating and couldn’t bring it up until today. However, as she had a great opportunity and had already prepared herself, it seemed like she was determined to put it into action.","And then, there were also those few instances...... That statement she made earlier...... Her eyes moving restlessly from time to time, and the complex emotions conveyed by my Sympathy Magic...... The answer I can draw out from those...... Errr, in other words, was she thinking about doing that?","[......Sieg-san, your pace is a little too fast. Please drink some water for a moment.]","[Eh, errr...... Yes.]","[Also, ummm...... You don’t have to try to get drunk.]","[......Eh? Errr......]","This is just a guess, but I don’t really think I was mistaken here. It’s just, as expected, Sieg-san flinching quite a bit, getting us a twin room, trying to get drunk on purpose, and her occasional mutters of trying to gather courage here and there......","I could certainly pretend as if I didn’t know what was going on, but it would be quite shameless of me as a man to just wait for Sieg-san to lead in everything.","[Since we have a great opportunity, I want to have a drink while leisurely and happily talking with you.]","[Uuuu, errr...... Kaito-san, I- I was trying to get drunk on purpose......]","[I’m sorry, I heard what you were just mumbling earlier......]","[Auuu...... Errr, you see, about this......]","[Sieg-san, why did you go to the trouble of getting us a twin room...... Errr, why don’t we sleep like we did back in Rigforeshia?]","[ ! ? ......Ah, y- yes.]","In the unlikely event that this really was just my misunderstanding, I would be so embarrassed that I would wanna die, so I tried to make a slightly roundabout suggestion...... but it seems like my prediction wasn’t wrong, as Sieg-san, her blush reaching to her ears, nodded.","When she gives me that kind of reaction, I also get strangely nervous but...... well, I could never get drunk, so I can’t really try escaping from these emotions with alcohol.","[F- For the time being, let’s just relax and enjoy the alcohol!]","[Y- Y- You’re right! Let’s do that!]","Both of us flustered, we started drinking...... but needless to say, it took us some time before we composed ourselves.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [S- Stooooooop! Go turn back to being deaf and slow like you were back in Rigforeshia! Stop trying to show off how much of a protagonist you are, actually exhibiting that seldomly shown ability to guess things right!!!]"]},{"number":1400,"title":"Chapter 1400 - A Night Spent with Sieg 3","paragraphs":["I continued chatting with Sieg-san while enjoying the fruit wine leisurely. At first, we were both a little nervous, but after a little while, the tension eased and we were able to enjoy our conversation in a relaxed manner.","As to be expected, the main topic of conversation was about the event we had been in today and which monsters we liked the best.","[As expected, the popular monsters were those cute enough to become popular.]","[Yes. All of them were so cute, and watching them makes me really happy.]","[I think you’d be able to afford it, so isn’t it fine if you get yourself a second pet?]","[You’re right. Unlike at that time in the Six Kings Festival, I don’t have to depend on Kaito-san to buy the centerpiece monsters, so that’s a very fascinating idea.]","It’s true that Sieg-san has a lot of money nowadays, so if it’s not something like the Petite Devis that one can’t get without connections, she should be able to buy it without any problems.","As expected, it would be rough for her to buy monsters of Bell’s level...... Well, Bell costs more than 2 billion, and if you take into account the fact that she’s a Special Individual, it wouldn’t be surprising if the price was more than double the purchase price, so Bell’s case was special but......","[If you were to get a second pet, what kind of monster would it be?]","[......That’s it. That’s what I’m most troubled with. There are too many monsters I want to keep as a pet, and it’s hard to narrow down...... But since I have Sela, I would prefer a more mature one in terms of personality. Sela is a pretty docile girl after all.]","[Certainly, Sela has this quiet and elegant image on her. She also seemed to go along with things at her pace.]","[She does feel rather laid-back. Recently though, it seemed like she had taken a liking to napping on Bell-chan’s back......]","Sela almost never cries and is very calm, and just as Sieg-san said, she feels quite laid-back and follows things through her pace.","[However, she gets along well with Lynn, so with her bright personality, wouldn’t she be alright?]","Lynn, who is also a Dragon just like Sela, has an energetic personality, so their personalities seemed to be in contrast with each other, but the two of them get along quite well and would usually hang out with each other like sisters, so I guess they have good personality compatibility.","[It’s true that she and Lynn-chan get along very well, but I think that’s because they have more than just personality chemistry...... I think it’s because Sela thinks of Lynn-chan as her older sister. Lynn-chan is also a Dragon and is older than her after all.]","[I see......]","[Well, if I were to keep a pet, it would be nice to have something other than a Dragon. Lili may be disappointed, but if I were to keep another Dragon in our place, Bell-chan would feel left out and she’d be pitiful.]","[Ahh, indeed...... If you want to match Bell, it might be good to have a Demonic Beast...... Bell is rather prideful though, so I don’t know what will happen if you get a pet of a species similar or close to hers.]","[I guess they’re going to be very hierarchical huh.]","Bell is quite prideful and responds completely differently to those who she was emotionally attached to than those she doesn’t, and in the first place, there are very few she was very emotionally attached to.","If I tell her to do something, she obediently listens, but if it’s not me or someone she’s not emotionally attached to, she basically ignores them.","She often growls at Luna-san, but I think she actually has a high degree of favorability for her compared to those she doesn’t even feel emotionally attached to. However, since Luna-san often teases me, it seems like Bell considers her as a ruffian.","And so, if I were to keep the same Demonic Beast-type monster as Sieg-san said, there’s a good chance that she will drive the hierarchy down on the new pet.","[In that case, it would seem that something other than Dragons or Demonic Beast-type monsters would be better.]","[A special-type monster like Slimes might be better. Slimes are also monsters with quite a lot of variety. Well, they’re not as good as Dragons, but various types of Slimes have been confirmed depending on the environment they live in, so it seems that some academic societies are discussing if there’s a need to create a classification for Slime types.]","[Heehhh...... Are all Slime-types friendly?]","[All Slime-types are basically docile and don’t harm people, but there are some that are inherently poisonous, so even if the Slime themselves doesn’t intend to attack, people who unintentionally touch them may be harmed.]","There are different varieties of Slimes huh...... Is there something like a Metal Slime too? That does sound interesting, so if I have the chance, I would like to see the various types of Slimes.","Just like that, we continued chatting, talking about what kind of monsters are compatible with our current pets and other matters, and after a certain amount of time had passed, the bottle of fruit wine was empty.","Since we drank one bottle together, Sieg-san hardly felt drunk, and as usual, I wasn’t drunk at all. However, this seemed like a good time to put an end to drinking.","[I guess it’s about time we put this to an end?]","[You’re right. I also don’t want to drink too much, so let’s call it a night.]","[Sieg-san, please go ahead and take a bath.]","[Thank you. Well then......]","Sieg-san nodded at my words and was about to move to the bathroom...... but she stopped along the way. It doesn’t seem like she forgot a change of clothes or her towel. Those things would probably be in her magic box, and there’s no way an inn as luxurious as this wouldn’t have towels in their dressing room.","As I was wondering about this, Sieg-san turned around and timidly looking at me, she softly spoke.","[......Ummm...... Since we’re at it...... How about we take a bath together?]","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [This is bad...... This is freaking bad...... This is clearly heading to a dangerous development. L- Like hell I will stay here like this! I’m gonna go back to my room......]","? ? ? : [Now, now, calm down. Isn’t this the part where the main event was about to start......]","Serious-senpai : [LET☆ME☆GO!]"]}]);
